<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p21> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itȟó iyápi waŋží onáȟ’uŋčhiyiŋ kta wačhíŋ na hé uŋ, wówapi čhič’ú weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=21;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p21> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I suppose that I want to notify you, and for that reason, I’m writing you this letter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=21;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p22> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋží awáčhaŋmi yuŋkȟáŋ hé uŋ, hepȟé ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=22;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p22> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I have been thinking about something, and for that reason, I’m saying it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=22;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p23> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta makȟá akáŋl wóopȟe kiŋ lé ičháǧe čiŋ héhaŋ, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka oyáte kiŋ táku waŋží iwáhowičhaye k’uŋ hé weksúye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=23;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p23> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back when customs were coming to being on earth, I remember that Creator warned the people about something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=23;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p24> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ makȟá kiŋ huŋhúŋzahaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, hé Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka oyáte makȟá akáŋl úŋpi kiŋ wičháyunini wahókuŋwičhakhiya seéčheča walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=24;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p24> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there was an earthquake, and so I ask that Creator do something like warning the people that live on the earth by nudging them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=24;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p25> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ wičháȟpi waŋžígži tȟókeča waŋúŋyaŋkapi yuŋkȟáŋ, hé nakúŋ waŋží walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=25;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p25> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We also saw some strange stars, and so I asked for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=25;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p26> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ tȟaté waŋžígži theȟíka waŋúŋyaŋkapi yuŋkȟáŋ, hé nakúŋ waŋží walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=26;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p26> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We also saw some really bad wind, and so I asked for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=26;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p27> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ nakúŋ makȟá kiŋ blebléčahaŋ čhaŋkhé, leháŋn mayá óta yuŋkȟáŋ, nakúŋ hé waŋží walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=27;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p27> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then the earth also cracked open, and so nowadays there are many cliffs, and so I asked for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=27;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p28> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ wičháša kiŋ óta oyáte tȟókeča iyápi, hé nakúŋ waŋží walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=28;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p28> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then many people spoke a different language, I also asked for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=28;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p29> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ nakúŋ leháŋn wíŋyaŋ kiŋ tuwéna zaŋníyaŋ čhiŋčátȟuŋ šni yuŋkȟáŋ, hé nakúŋ waŋží walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=29;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p29> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then no women were also healthy in childbirth, and so I also asked for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=29;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p30> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé uŋ, mitákuyepi, wówapi kiŋ lé tóna waŋlákapi kiŋ, nitákuyepi tóna wóopȟe awáčhiŋ šni kiŋ hená, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka wičháša wičháyunini wahókuŋwičhakhiya seéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=30;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p30> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so for that reason, my relatives, those of you who see this letter, those relatives of yours who aren’t paying attention to the laws, it’s like Creator is warning them through nudging them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=30;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p31> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé iyéčhel nitákuyepi kiŋ wóopȟe kiŋ líla ečhúŋwičhakhiyapi iyéčheča walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=31;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p31> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason I request that they really should let your relatives follow the rules."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=31;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p32> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná makȟá akáŋl wičhóičhaǧe kiŋ khiyéla seéčheča walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=32;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p32> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then I request that the people living on be close."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=32;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p33> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé uŋ hepȟé ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=33;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p33> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And for that reason I say that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=33;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p35> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wild West Oškáte kiŋ"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=35;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p35> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The Wild West Show"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=35;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p37> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wild West oškáte kiŋ lé él tókhel waúŋ kiŋ leháŋl owáglakiŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=37;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p37> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ll tell you about how I was part of this Wild West show."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=37;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p38> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitȟáwačhiŋ úŋ óhiŋniyaŋ wóopȟe bluhá na óhiŋniyaŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka kiksúya waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=38;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p38> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I always have the customs in mind and I always remember back to Creator."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=38;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p39> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá oškáte kiŋ aŋpétu na haŋhépi kȟó íŋyaŋke čhaŋkhé, mázaškaŋškaŋ óapȟe núŋpa heháŋyela owáŋžila uŋyáŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=39;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p39> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the show runs day and night, so we’re up until two in the morning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=39;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p40> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá óhiŋniyaŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka kiksúya waúŋ kiŋ héčhel táku oyás’iŋ okíhi-makhiye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=40;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p40> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But always remembering back to Creator lets me be able to do everything that needs to be done."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=40;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p41> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó po, Mitákuye Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ, leháŋl wašíču tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ kiŋ táŋyaŋ slolwáye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=41;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p41> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now, my Lakota relatives, I know white people’s way of doing things very well these days."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=41;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p42> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka awáčhiŋ kiŋ táku wičhóȟ’aŋ wašté iyéyiŋ kte ló, hé wakȟé ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=42;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p42> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If someone always has Creator in mind, their ways of doing things are good, that’s what I mean."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=42;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p43> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na táku wičhóȟ’aŋ wašíču ečhúŋpi kiŋ óta theȟíke ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=43;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p43> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And a lot of the white people’s way of doing things are awful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=43;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p44> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá makȟóčhe ničá hená thiwókhitȟahena t’é ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=44;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p44> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Somebody who doesn’t have any land dies between the houses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=44;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p45> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na makȟóčhe kiŋ otȟáŋkaya k’éyaš óhiŋniyaŋ wašíču ožúlaye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=45;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p45> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the land is expansive, but it is filled with white men."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=45;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p46> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl makȟá óhiŋni táku ičháŋtewašteya waúŋ weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=46;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p46> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then I always live happily because of the land."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=46;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p47> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Miyé waŋná ómakȟa yamní léčhi waúŋ weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=47;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p47> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I have lived here for three years now myself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=47;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p48> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wašíčuiyapi waŋžígži owákihi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=48;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p48> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I succeeded with some English language."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=48;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p49> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ mitȟákȟola wótȟaŋiŋ iyéska wówapi waŋží lečhála iwáču, na líla iblúškiŋ yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=49;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p49> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so recently I took my friend’s newspaper article written in that language, and I was very happy about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=49;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p50> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta wašíču iyéska okíhipi kte kiŋ héčhiyataŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=50;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p50> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On account of Lakota people soon being able to understand English."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=50;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p51> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhi makȟóčhe kiŋ tȟókeča, aŋpétu oyás’iŋ oíyokpaze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=51;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p51> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Here the land is very different, it’s dark every day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=51;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p52> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óhiŋniyaŋ ošóta čhaŋkhé tóhiŋni wí kiŋ táŋyaŋ waúŋyaŋkapi šni yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=52;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p52> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s always full of smoke so we can never see the moon well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=52;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p53> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋl lečhála lé wí Feb. 7, 1888 heháŋl wíŋyaŋ waŋ čhiŋčátȟuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=53;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p53> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recently, on February 7th, 1888, a woman had a child."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=53;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p54> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ Kimími ečíyapi na atkuku kiŋ Načá Čík’ala ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=54;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p54> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The woman’s name is Kimími (Butterfly) and the father’s name is Načá Čík’ala (Little Chief)."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=54;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p55> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na lé aŋpétu kiŋ waŋná mniákaštaŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=55;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p55> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And today they will baptize the baby."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=55;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p56> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feb. 15, heháŋl, mázaškaŋškaŋ šákpe kiŋ heháŋl wóopȟe yuhá kte hokší yuhá kiŋ hé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=56;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p56> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On February 15th, at 6 o’ clock, the child that she had will have taken part in that custom."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=56;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p57> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=57;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p57> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well, that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=57;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p58> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówašte uŋ wanáȟ’uŋ-čhičhíyape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=58;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p58> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hear well what I have to tell you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=58;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p61> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heȟáka Sápa Wóglaka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=61;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p61> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Black Elk Speaks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=61;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p62> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maȟpíya Lúta etáŋ mitákuye Lakȟóta oyáte, tókhel iyéska wówapi uŋspépi kiŋ hé lé wówapi kiŋ čhíčaǧapi ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=62;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p62> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My Lakota relatives from Red Cloud Agency, I wrote this letter for those of you who know how to read in this language that I’m writing in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=62;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p63> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuye, maLakȟóta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=63;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p63> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, I’m Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=63;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p64> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta ómakȟa 1885 henákeča k’uŋháŋ, New York él waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=64;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p64> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Last year, when it was 1885, I was in New York."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=64;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p65> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka óhiŋniyaŋ weksúye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=65;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p65> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I always kept Creator in mind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=65;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p66> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mniwáŋča ópta England ečíyapi ektá waí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=66;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p66> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I arrived at a place across the ocean called England."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=66;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p67> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ómakȟa waŋží waúŋ heháŋl, akhé mniwáŋča waŋ aŋpétu tópa oíyuweǧe čha ektá waí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=67;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p67> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I stayed there for one year, then again I crossed the ocean for four days and then I arrived here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=67;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p68> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyášiča ewíčhakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=68;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p68> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They call them German."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=68;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p69> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ómakȟa waŋží hél waúŋ heháŋl, akhé mniwáŋča aŋpétu wikčémnna šákpe oíyuweǧe čha ektá waí na, ómakȟa waŋží waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=69;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p69> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I stayed there for a year, and then I crossed the ocean for 60 days, and I arrived there, and I lived there for a year."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=69;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p70> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, héčhel wašíču kiŋ óhiŋniyaŋ awáčhiŋpi kiŋ hečéla wičhóȟ’aŋ óta kiŋháŋ, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka hená tȟawáčhiŋ wašíču kiŋ tokhéškhe awáčhiŋ kiŋ na, tókhel škáŋpi kiŋ slolwáyiŋ kte ȟčiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=70;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p70> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well, the only thing that white people always think about, which they have many events about, is Creator. I really wanted to know how white people think about Creator, and how they interact with Creator."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=70;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p71> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Otȟúŋwe iyáza omáwani yuŋkȟáŋ, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka tȟawáčhiŋ ókšaŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ óta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=71;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p71> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I travelled from town to town, and there were many traditions around Creator’s will."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=71;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p72> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, wičháša akáŋtu maȟpíya oglígle čhežípi isáŋpȟa ešá wačháŋtwakiye šni eháŋtaŋhaŋ, mázaša snásna na táku itúya sná kiŋ hé iyémačheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=72;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p72> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, if I wasn’t kind like the angels, I was like money just jingling around for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=72;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p73> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wówiyukčaŋ bluhá čha, táku anákiȟmeya kiŋ oyás’iŋ wóokaȟniǧe kȟó slolwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=73;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p73> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I had that thought, so now I understand every little thing that I hide."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=73;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p74> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wówačhiŋye oyás’iŋ bluhá uŋ hé kiŋ yutȟókȟaŋl iyéwayiŋ kta owákihi ešá, wačháŋtwakiye šni eháŋtaŋhaŋ, matáku šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=74;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p74> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, for example, I can move mountains on account of my faith. If I am not kind, that is not me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=74;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p75> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na táku mitȟáwa kiŋ oyás’iŋ wówičhayapi kiŋ él waglúsote čha, mitȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ hé é ȟuȟnáǧiŋ kta é wak’u ešá, wačháŋtwakiye šni eháŋtaŋhaŋ, tákula íčhiyopteya waúŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=75;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p75> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I give away every single thing that is mine in order to feed people, I give my body to be burned, and if I’m not kind, I’m not living the cross."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=75;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p76> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel Lakȟóta oyáte, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka óhiŋniyaŋ awáčhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=76;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p76> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In this way, Lakota people, always think of Creator."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=76;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p77> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl miyé óhiŋniyaŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka awáčhaŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=77;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p77> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I myself am always thinking of Creator."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=77;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p78> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ókšaŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ ečhámuŋ awíčakȟehaŋ líla wašté hé iyéčhel oyáte kiŋ hečháŋnipi ní ečháŋmi yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=78;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p78> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The things that I do are very good, and I think you should think to live like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=78;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p79> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuye, heháŋl, itȟó táku waŋžígži wómaǧaǧa owáglake kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=79;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p79> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, next, I will tell you some entertaining things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=79;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p80> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟolá, Mexican Joe ečíyapi, oškáte yuŋkȟáŋ, Lakȟóta ópȟa él, Matȟó Waŋkátuya ečíyapi, na uŋmá Heȟáka Núŋpa ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=80;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p80> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My friend, called Mexican Joe, participates in the show."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=80;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p81> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "England, Manchester ečíyapi waŋ él úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=81;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p81> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The are in what’s called Manchester, England."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=81;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p82> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋwíčhablake ȟčiŋ naháŋ, thípi oškáte kiŋ hél hípi kiŋ eháŋl, él waí ȟčiŋ eháŋl, thípi kiŋ ilé na, šúŋkawakȟáŋ šákpe t’ápi na, táku óta ilé waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=82;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p82> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I really saw them, and when they came to the tent for cames, when they really arrived here, the tent was on fire, and six horses died, and I saw many things on fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=82;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p83> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mniwáŋča tȟáŋka kȟowákataŋhaŋ héčhiya Jesus ktépi akhé waŋblákiŋ kta wačhíŋ tkȟá, aŋpétu tópa mniwáŋča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=83;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p83> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I wanted to see where they killed Jesus on the other side of the ocean, but it takes four days by sea."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=83;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p84> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ mázačhaŋku waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=84;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p84> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also there isn’t a railroad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=84;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p85> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šúŋkawakȟáŋ awíčhayapi k’éyaš čhiŋ ípuza t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=85;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p85> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They bring horses with them but they die of thirst."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=85;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p86> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku tȟahú háŋskapi na hená ečé é ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=86;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p86> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They have a sort of long neck and they are just that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=86;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p87> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ektá ípi okíhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=87;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p87> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They can get there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=87;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p88> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla mázaska óta čha ektá mníŋ kta owákihi héčhe kta owáglakiŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=88;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p88> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s a lot of money so I’ll say that about me being able to go there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=88;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p94> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi, Šinásapa ówaŋčaya úŋpi kiŋ, lé aŋpétu kiŋ yuónihaŋyaŋ mníčiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=94;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p94> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, Catholics from all around, today a meeting was held in a good way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=94;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p95> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ úŋ, ikčé wičháša wóčhekiye yuhápi kiŋ líla iyótiyekiyapi, ičhíŋ líla waȟpáničapi kiŋ hé uŋ thípi wakȟáŋ yuhápi kta okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=95;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p95> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In regards to this meeting, Natives who are religious are having a really difficult time, because, as you know, due to their severe poverty, they can’t have a church."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=95;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p96> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ úŋ, ówaŋčaya Catholic yaúŋpi kiŋ ektá ahíuŋtuŋwaŋpi kta iyéničhečapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=96;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p96> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On account of this, those of you who are Catholics ought to cast your eyes on us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=96;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p97> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiwáhe waŋžíla heúŋčhapi na wówičala waŋžíla uŋyúhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=97;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p97> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We are just one family and have just one faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=97;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p98> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ úŋ, thisáŋpȟataŋhaŋ uŋkákižapi čha slolyáyapi, ičhíŋ Jesus léčhel uŋkókiyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=98;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p98> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all know that we suffer from beyond the walls of the church, because Jesus speaks to us in this way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=98;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p99> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ehákeȟčiŋ wóopȟe tȟéča waŋží uŋk’úpi; oyás’iŋla waštékičhilaka po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=99;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p99> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally, He gave us one new law; that every single person love one another."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=99;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wičhóiye waŋží naúŋȟ’uŋpi hé uŋ wičháša waštépi kiŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka ečhíyataŋhaŋ wóphila ečhíčiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Due to us hearing a saying like that I express my gratitude in God to you good men."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ úŋ, mitákuyepi, šiná oyás’iŋ ešá na wápaȟlate hé ikȟáŋ tȟaŋní ešá hiyúmakhiyapi kiŋ mázašala ešá iyópȟewayiŋ kte, na héčhiyataŋhaŋ úŋ, ikčé wičháša thípi wakȟáŋ waŋží ȟčiŋ wičháwečaǧiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because of this, my relatives, I will exchange all your shawls and that old string of your ribbons that you send to me for at least some pennies, and thanks to that, I’ll make at least one church for Native people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ tȟokátakiya wičhóuŋčhaǧe yuhá yápi kte kiŋ heháŋyaŋ, okȟólakičhiye wakȟáŋ k’él kakížapi kte, ičhíŋ Jesus tȟaókȟolakičhiye él toná wičálapi kiŋ hená makȟá akáŋl naháŋȟčiŋ ní úŋpi kiŋ hená."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For as you see, as long as the future generations continue to carry on with it, the holy societies will suffer, such as some of them still living on this land who are believers in Jesus’s society."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋkákižapi kiŋ tȟáŋka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Our suffering is great."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ úŋ takúŋl úŋyaŋ yápi kiŋ ektá ahíuŋtuŋwaŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason, cast your eyes on us, we who go without anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Atéyapi kiŋ na Čhíŋhiŋtku kiŋ na Wóniya Wakȟáŋ čhažé níčipi úŋ nuŋwé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the name of the Father, and the Son, and the Holy Ghost, amen."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nitákuyepi waŋží miyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am one of your relatives."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta Congress héhaŋ, na leháŋyaŋ, tȟokáheya Nov. 12 héhaŋ Sičháŋǧu Makȟóčhe ektá waí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "During the last congress, and up to today, I visited Rosebud reservation for the first time on November 12th."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku uŋ waí kiŋ, thípi wakȟáŋ yuhápi čhíŋpi, naháŋ uŋ etáŋhaŋ, oyáte kiŋ wóphila ewíčhawakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The reason that I had gone there, is that they wanted to have a church, and for that reason, I expressed my gratitude to the people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na héčhel, wičháša waštépi kiŋ líla iyúškiŋyaŋ ómakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And because of this, the good men were delighted about me helping."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá naháŋȟčiŋ wičháčhaže kiŋ óta mak’úpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But I still wasn’t given many names."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Francis Mission etáŋhaŋ St. Joseph na St. Mary úŋpi kiŋ:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From St. Francis Mission, those who live like St. Joseph and St. Mary:"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla taŋyáŋ ečhámičuŋpi, hé uŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka ečhíyataŋ wóphila ewíčhawakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They treated me well, for this reason I expressed my gratitude in God to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wičhóiye waŋ léčheȟčiŋ epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I said something just like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sutáya nážiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Stand strong."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na akhé kiŋháŋ taŋyáŋ iwáŋyaŋka po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And again when you’re like that, examine them carefully."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jesus wičhóiye waŋží iyéčhel eyá:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jesus said something like this:"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Miyé kayéš kakíšmayapi na makápsiŋpsiŋtapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“They even made me suffer and whipped me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Atȟámašošapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They spit on me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íčhipaweȟ omákataŋpi, na t’emáyaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They hung me crosswise, and they brought about my death."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šeháŋl éš makȟá kiŋ hé enítaŋhaŋpi čha yačhéyapi kte čha oyákit’api kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You will all be obliged to weep for it is your chance to be of this earth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tȟáȟčašuŋkala waŋží šuŋgmánitu óta égna uŋ kiŋ hé iyéčhel yaúŋpi kta čhe.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You will all live like a sheep lives among wolves.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča ešáš wačhíŋtȟaŋka po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Be patient as regards that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owíhaŋketa táku wašté níčiyaŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At the end there’s something good for you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel Waníkiya uŋkítȟawapi kiŋ uŋ uŋkókiyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is in that way that we speak to our Savior."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, mitákuyepi, wówačhiŋtȟaŋka, na táku wašté ečhúŋpi kiŋ, na wóowotȟaŋla hená makȟá akáŋl uŋ naúŋkižiŋpi uŋkókihipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason, my relatives, on earth we can stand for Him with patience, and by doing good things, and with integrity."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé héčhiyataŋ uŋ, wówičala nitȟáwapi kiŋ {…}."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And on account of that, keep steadfast to your faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is how things are."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl lé makȟóčhe k’él léčheȟčiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ ečhúŋk’uŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then at this place we did our duties in this exact way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé oyáte kiŋ naháŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka yuhápi kta čhíŋpi, na héčhel úŋ, ečhála wawókiye eyá wičháyuhapi iyé hená wičhákičičažužupi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These people want to have God, and because of this, soon they are going to pay to have some catechists."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená épi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These are them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Porcupine Tail Creek él James Grass hé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At Porcupine Tail Creek it’s James Grass."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Holy Rosary Mission él Paul Catcher hé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And at Holy Rosary Mission it’s Paul Catcher."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Mníwaniča okášpe él Joan Star hé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At No Water district it’s Joan Star."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ihó, lená iyéčhiŋkala wičháyuhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, of their own volition they have them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu Wakȟáŋ waŋží wičháša iyóhi na wíŋyaŋ iyóhi mázaša waŋží wičhák’upi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One Sunday every man and woman will give them a penny."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋ, mitákuyepi, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka uŋyúhapi kte ȟčiŋ, na hé úŋšiuŋȟ’aŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, my relatives, we thoroughly try to keep God close to us, and for that reason we are destitute."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óhiŋniyaŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka uŋkíčipi úŋ kta uŋčhíŋpi ičhíŋ, uŋkákižapi kiŋ tȟáŋka kiŋ hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We always want to live for God, because of our great suffering."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ, toná wačhíŋtȟaŋkapi kiŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka waŋúŋyaŋkapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As you know, God will see those of us who are patient."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makȟá akáŋl uŋk’úŋpi kiŋ lé tȟéhaŋ šni na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka táku eníčiyapi kiŋ nignáyaŋpi šni, na ič’ígnaye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is not a long time that we live on this Earth, and God doesn’t deceive you when telling you something, and he doesn’t deceive himself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Níš-eyá yagnáyaŋpi kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all won’t deceive him either."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitȟákȟolapi, mitákuyepi, ówaŋčaya Šinásapa yaúŋpi kiŋ, na ošpášpaye Wóniya Wakȟáŋ uŋ awáŋiglakapi kta iníčhaǧapi kiŋ, óhiŋniyaŋ waktáya úŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My friends, my relatives, Catholics all around, and those of you who grow in groups so that you may care for yourselves by means of the Holy Spirit, always keep prudent."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iglúwiŋyeya úŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Stay ready."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka tȟókičhuŋze kiŋ taŋyáŋ yuhá po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hold God’s Kingdom close."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówičala nitȟáwa kiŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka wówasukiye ogná yaúŋpi kiŋ na wówakȟaŋ iyáčupi kiŋ óhiŋni awákičhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Always think about living your faith through God’s rules and taking the sacraments."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋyaŋ wówičala iyáčupi kiŋ heháŋyaŋ, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka čhiŋčá heníčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So long as you all take up faith, you are God’s children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p154> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, toná Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka čhiŋčá héčhapi hená oyás’iŋ maȟpíya ektá ípi kta líla čhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=154;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p154> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason, God really wants every one of his children to arrive in Heaven."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=154;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p155> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka wówasukiye taŋyáŋ oyápȟapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=155;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p155> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason, you all should follow God’s rules well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=155;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p156> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ uŋ óhiŋniyaŋ táku wašté kiŋ awáčhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=156;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p156> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On account of this, always think about good things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=156;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ šíče kiŋ iȟéyab iglúza po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=157;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And distance yourself from evil."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=157;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p158> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé uŋ, wówakȟaŋ hé wówačhiŋye ȟčiŋ ičú po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=158;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p158> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And because of that, faithfully take the sacraments."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=158;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wóokiye níčipi uŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=159;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In this way you will all live in peace."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=159;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p160> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka líla wačháŋtkiya čhe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=160;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p160> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is known that God is loving."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=160;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka atéuŋyaŋpi iyótaŋ ksápe, iyótaŋ wakȟáŋ, iyótaŋ wašté, iyótaŋ waš’áke, iyótaŋ owótȟaŋla, na iyótaŋ išnála líla tȟáŋka, na ée atéuŋyaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "God our Father is ever-knowing, ever-holy, ever-good, ever-powerful, ever-just, and He alone is great, and it is Him who is our Father."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, oíye kiŋ taŋyáŋ anáǧoptaŋ po, na oíye kiŋ óta yuhá-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, listen well to His words, and try to keep many of His words with you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča kiŋnáhaŋ niwáš’akapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When things are like that, you all will be strong."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka Čhiŋhíŋtku, Waníkiya uŋkítȟawapi, makȟá akáŋl hí, na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka čhiŋčá wičhákaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For as you know, the Son of God, our Savior, came to Earth, and God made his children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená tȟokátakiya wičhóičhaǧe yíŋ kte kiŋ heháŋyaŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ šíče kiŋ awígnuniyaŋpi kte na táku wašté kiŋ ečhúŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As long as the future generations go on, bad actions will be done away with and good things will be done."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, uŋkíš leháŋl waŋná lél naúŋžiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And for that reason, we ourselves have come this far."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ Niyáte anákiǧoptaŋ po, na ohóla po, na áwičakȟeya Atéya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is for that reason that you should listen to your Father, and respect Him, and truly have Him as a Father."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na aŋpétu otóiyohi wačhíŋyaŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And keep your faith in Him every day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku uŋ hepȟé čiŋ na lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is the reason why I’m saying these things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "April 23 Edward Janis t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Edward Janis died on April 23rd."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša t’íŋ kta iyéčhečašniyaŋ úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The man lived in a way unlike how he died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋnáhaŋ líla tȟáŋka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This man was very large."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkeútȟapi 260 na síyutȟapi šakówiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He weighed 260 pounds and was seven feet tall."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša líla waš’áke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was a strong man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča ešáš t’íŋ kta, yuŋkȟáŋ tókȟa šni t’eyíŋ, na hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, wičháša toháŋl t’íŋ kte, tuwéni slolyé šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He would die just like that, and so he died peacefully, and for that reason, whenever it was that he died, nobody knew."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋ Makhízita opȟáya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This man [lived] along the White River."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟošká wačhíŋyephiča héčha tkȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was a reliable young man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "April 16 héhaŋ George Charging, kȟošká wačhíŋyephiča, uŋkít’api."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "George Charging, a reliable young man, died on April 16th."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋš-eyá kȟoškálaka kiŋ líla háŋske."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was a very tall young man, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Síyutȟapi šakówiŋ sáŋm okhíse."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was seven and a half feet tall."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčhel kȟoškálaka kiŋ lená t’ápi kta iyéčheča šni s’e úŋpi, yuŋkȟáŋ t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In this way these young men lived as if they wouldn’t ever die, but then they died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Chaŋkpé Ópi etáŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was from Wounded Knee."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, mitákuyepi, wičhóiye epȟé kiŋ lená óhiŋniyaŋ awáčhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well, my relatives, always keep in mind these words that I say."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Joseph na St. Mary okȟólakičhiye yaúŋpi kiŋ, óhiŋniyaŋ wówapi etáŋ táku uŋspénič’iyapi kiŋ sutáya yuhá po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those who are a part of St. Joseph and St. Mary’s societies, keep right there with you what you learn from these letters."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku kiŋ lé waníyetu yámni aŋpétu otóiyohi naháŋ hípi otóiyohi uŋ očhíčiyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For the last three years, they’ve come, and I’ve told every one of you something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka oíye kiŋháŋ óta luhápi kiŋ wačhíŋnitȟaŋkapi kte, na tákuni niyúhohopi kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In this way, when you all keep many of the words of God with yourselves, you all will persevere, and nothing will loosen you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Joseph Okȟólakičhiye letáŋhaŋ tȟokátakiya wí akénuŋp, wóitȟaŋčhaŋyaŋ káǧapi kiŋ lená épi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From today up until 12 months from now, these will be those that are put into a position of authority."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p193> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Joseph átaya wičhókhuže awáŋyaŋkapi: Charles Hollow Horn, John Plenty Wolf, Alfred Blackbear, William Black Tail, Frank Kicking Bear na Leonard Foolish Woman, Wígliglapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=193;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p193> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those who look over all of St. Joseph’s sick: Charles Hollow Horn, John Plenty Wolf, Alfred Blackbear, William Black Tail, Frank Kicking Bear, Leonard Foolish Woman, and Messanger."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=193;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p194> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi, lená tȟokátakiya Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka okȟólakičhiye tȟáwa kiŋ na lé waš’ágyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=194;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p194> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, in the future those people will strengthen God’s society."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=194;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel uŋ, onáwičhayaȟ’uŋpi kte, na wóčhekiye ewíčhaye čiŋ yápi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=195;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, you all will hear about them, and they will go on saying prayers for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=195;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta May wíyawapi yámni uŋ héhaŋ, Edward White Crow tȟawíču t’íŋ kta yuŋkȟáŋ, wičhóiye lenákeča eyíŋ, na t’é ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=196;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Last May, three months ago, Edward White Crow’s wife would die, and he said it would happen, and she died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=196;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thítakuye owás’iŋ kičhó, na St. Joseph na St. Mary okȟólakičhiye nakúŋ hípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=197;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He invited every single member of her family, and St. Joseph and St. Mary’s societies also came."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=197;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p198> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla wičhóta ȟče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=198;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p198> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was really quite a crowd of people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=198;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p199> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ léčhel ewíčhakiya:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=199;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p199> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said something like this to them:"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=199;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Waŋná lé mat’íŋ kta čha maŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“My time is coming."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mat’é ešáš yačhéyapi kte šni, éyaš taŋyéȟčiŋ wačhémiyečičhiyapi kte, na mičhíŋča kiŋ oyás’iŋ waŋná maȟpíya ektá taŋyéȟčiŋ wókažužu gluhá yaŋkápi na hó míš iyéčhel waŋná wókažužu iwékču kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Let’s say that I die, you all won’t cry, but instead you all will pray for me to the very best of your ability, and every one of my children will sit well in Heaven with forgiveness and, so, in that way, I myself will have my own forgiveness then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p202> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaščhiŋ wíŋyaŋ waŋžígži okȟólakičhiye lé wičháwakamna, na hé uŋ, taŋyéȟčiŋ maȟpíya ektá wagníŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=202;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p202> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But, of course, I will collect each of the women in this society, and for that reason, I’ll travel very well on my way back to Heaven."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=202;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p203> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel tókša wóčhekiye ečhíčiyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=203;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p203> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In this way, I’ll certainly pray for all of you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=203;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p204> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, mitákuyepi, wičhóȟ’aŋ wakȟáŋ lé líla ȟče éwačhaŋnipi kte.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=204;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p204> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, my relatives, you all should set your mind towards these especially holy ways.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=204;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheȟčiŋ wičhóiye eyíŋ na, ehákeȟčiŋ oyás’iŋ napé wičháyuziŋ na, t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=205;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said it just like that, and finally he shook every one of their hands, and she was dead."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=205;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé Julia White Crow ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=206;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This woman was named Julia White Crow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=206;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wagméza Wakpá etáŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was from Corn River."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, mitákuyepi, lé iyúkčaŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, my relatives, think about this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka Čhiŋhíŋtku táku eyé kiŋ, naháŋ áwičakȟeya wówičakȟe St. Joseph na St. Mary yaúŋpi kiŋ, léčheȟčiŋ lé wóawačhiŋ kiŋ awáčhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What God’s son said, and those who honestly live with the truthes of St. Joseph and St. Mary’s societies, think of your concerns like them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka taŋyáŋ wówaši ečhákičuŋ-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And try to do good work that benefits God."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku tóna maȟpíya él úŋ kiŋ iglámnapi kiŋ hená tóhaŋni oíhaŋke waníčiŋ kta, wičhóȟ’aŋ wašté ečhúŋk’uŋpi kiŋ hé maȟpíya ektá uŋkíčignakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those things that are in Heaven that are earned are eternal. We put the good deeds we do away there in Heaven."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, okȟólakičhiye oyás’iŋ wičákȟeya  ȟčiŋ awáčhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason, earnestly keep every society in mind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ptáya nážiŋ-wačhíŋ po na, wičhóȟ’aŋ wašté akíčhiyuha po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Try to stand together, and hold each other to doing good deeds."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi, lé makȟá lé wičhóȟ’aŋ núŋp waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, I saw two traditions on this land."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta July 14 héhaŋ, Indianapolis, Indiana héčhiya, wašíčuŋ omníčiye tȟáŋka ečhúŋpi ektá waí, na wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋblákiŋ na, líla tȟaŋság mat’á."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back on July 14, at Indianapolis, Indiana, I arrived at a large meeting of whites, and I saw ceremonies, and I was left speechless."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áwičakȟeha tókhel okíhika Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka wačhíŋyaŋpi kiŋ waŋbláka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I saw that, with all of their being, they truly have faith in God."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičákȟeye ȟčiŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka kičhí úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They earnestly live with God."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟáš wóokhiye kiŋ wičhákičiuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The law certainly works for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, mitákuyepi, wičháša wakȟáŋ ób yaúŋpi kiŋ wičákȟeya wičháyuonihaŋ po, na anáwičhaǧoptaŋ po, na táku uŋspénič’iyapi kiŋ hená t’iŋsyáhaŋ yuhá po, na sutá nážiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason, my relatives, really honor the priests that you live with, and listen to them, and hold on tightly to what you all learn, and stand strong."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča kiŋ wóokhiye kiŋ níčipi úŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way the law will work for you all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl hékta September 20 héhaŋ, Íŋyaŋ Čhúŋkaškela, Lakȟóta šinásapa omníčiye tȟáŋka yuhápi, na ektá waí, na wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ waŋblákiŋ na, héčhel wičhóȟ’aŋ wašté ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then back on September 20, they had a large Lakota Catholic meeting, at Bullhead, and I arrived there, and I saw ceremonies, and in this way they did good ceremonies."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ ečhíyataŋhaŋ, mitákuyepi, okȟólakičhiye wakȟáŋ uŋ táku tóna ečhúŋpi kiŋ hená taŋyéȟčiŋ uŋkíksuyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On account of this, my relatives, we will remember very well several things they did through the holy societies."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča kiŋnáhaŋ waš’ág’uŋkičhiyapi kte na wóokhiye kiŋ uŋkíčipi úŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "While things are like that, we will strenghten each other and the law will work for us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyás’iŋ napéčhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet each and every one of you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nitȟákȟolapi waŋží."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You are all one of my friends."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu lé Christmas énala yuhápi na hená ečhél mass wóšnapi ečhúŋpi, na oyáte ól’ota ópȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They held a Christmas ceremony back there until they held mass, and many people took part in it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "White Cley él, Dec. 20, omníčiye thípi waŋ kaȟwíčhawakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At Whiteclay, on December 20th, I had them hold a town hall meeting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dec. 22, Holy Angel Church, wóčhekiye ečhámuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On December 22nd, at Holy Angel Church, I prayed. Rev. Father Westropp came that day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé aŋpétu kiŋ él Rev. Father Westropp hí. 111 wótapi na, haŋhépi Christmas tree yuhápi na, Father Westropp tókhel okíhipi ókiyapi, na míš $1.88 ómakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "111 people ate, and they had a Christmas tree that night, and they helped Father Westropp as much as they could, and as for me, they helped me with $1.88."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wawáhokuŋwakhiyiŋ na híŋhaŋna k’él Father Westropp mass wóšnapi ečhúŋ na, wičhóta yuhápi wakȟáŋ ičúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I preached and that morning Father Westropp held mass, and a crowd of people received the Eucharist."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "$66.60 yusótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They spent $66.60."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dec. 23, Pahá Čhaŋwégna yaŋká hél waí na, wóyuonihaŋ tȟáŋka ečhámičuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On December 23rd, I arrived here to Oglala, and they awarded me with a great honor."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mázaškaŋškaŋ tópa heháŋl Father Westropp ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then at 4 o’ clock, Father Westropp arrived."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel tȟaŋkál nážiŋpi na lowáŋpi na ečhél hihúŋni, na líla yuónihaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, they stood outside and sung until arrived here, and they honored him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu hé Christmas wótapi 173 henákečapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A total of 173 people ate on that day, which was Christmas."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "$148.75 yusótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They spent $148.75."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš $2.00 uŋ ómakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As for me, they gave me $2.00."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋhépi kiŋ él Christmas tree yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That night they had a Christmas tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečhúŋhaŋ Julia Holy Bird waníyetu 15, Mary Maká Čhiŋčála waníyetu 18, Alice Redhedge waníyetu 18 henákeča mniáwičhakaštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Meanwhile, Julia Holy Bird turned 15, Mary Maká Čhiŋčála turned 18, and Alice Redhedge turned 18, all of whom were baptized."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Híŋhaŋna él mass wóšnapi Father Westropp ečhúŋ na wičhóta Yútapi Wakȟáŋ ičúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the morning, Father Westropp held mass, and a crowd of people received the Eucharist."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dec. 24 St. Agnes Church haŋhépi kiŋ él Waníkiya líla uŋyúonihaŋpi na, híŋhaŋna él Christmas wótapi 130 ópȟapi na, Christmas tree yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That night of Dec. 24th at St. Agnes Church, we really honored the Savior, and the next morning 130 participated in the Christmas feast, and they had a Christmas tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél wahókuŋwičhawakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I preached to them here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "$40.04 yusótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They spent $40.04."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš 30¢ uŋ ómakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As for me, they gave me 30¢."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Peter’s Church Dec. 27 él Father Westropp mass wóšna ečhúŋ na hél Christmas tree na wótapi yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On Dec. 28th, at St. Peter’s Church, Father Westropp held mass, and they had a Christmas tree and feast here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahókuŋwičhawakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I preached to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Híŋhaŋna Mass wóšnapi ečhúŋpi na wičhóta Yútapi Wakȟáŋ ičúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That next morning they held mass and a crowd of people received the Eucharist."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wolf Creek Dec. 29 Christmas tree na wótapi, 95 ópȟapi na, wahókuŋwičhawakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On Dec. 29th, at Wolf Creek, they had a Christmas tree, and 95 people ate, and I preached to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Father Westropp él hí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Father Westropp came."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "$57.25 yusótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They spent $57.25."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš thípi wakȟáŋ uŋ $4.36 uŋ ómakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As for me, they gave me $4.36 for a church."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "White River Dec. 30 Father Westropp kičhí waí na, 85 henákeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On Dec. 30th, I arrived at White River with Father Westropp, and there was a total of 85 people there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Christmas tree na wótapi yuhápi na, wahókuŋwičhawakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They had a Christmas tree and a feast, and I preached to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "$29.10 yusótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They spent $29.10."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mass wóšnapi ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They held mass."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jan. 1 St. Paul’s Church él Father Westropp kičhí waí na, Mass wóšnapi ečhúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On Jan. 1st, I arrived at St. Paul’s Church with Father Westropp, and they held mass."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Louis Mousseau Alice Iron Cloud kičhí wakȟáŋkičhiyuze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Louis Mousseau and Alice Iron Cloud got married."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé aŋpétu kiŋ St. Agnes Church ektá Father Westropp kičhí waglí na, Ómakȟa Tȟéča wičhóȟ’aŋ yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That day I arrived back at St. Agnes Church with Father Westropp, and we had a ceremony for the New Year."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Frank Kicking Bear waníyetu 20 na, Agnes Big Road waníyetu 18 na, George Big Road waníyetu 10 na, Mike Big Road waníyetu 4 na, Moses Spotted Owl waníyetu 3 henákeča mniáwičhakaštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Frank Kicking Bear turned 20 years old, and Agnes Big Road turned 18, and George Big Road turned 10, and Mike Big Road turned 4, and Moses Spotted Owl turned 3, all of whom were baptized."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglála Oyáŋke šinásapa úŋpi kiŋ lé waníyetu kiŋ tókhel okíhi Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka yuónihaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those Catholics who live on Pine Ridge, honor God as much as you can this winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi, sutáya awáčhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, think strongly about this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča kiŋ wóokhiye luhápi kte ičhíŋ, tuktél Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka úŋ kiŋ táku wašté ičháǧiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In this way, you will keep with God’s rules, because wherever God is, good things grow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglála Oyáŋke Čhaŋkpé Ópi él thípi wakȟáŋ waŋží káǧapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They will make a church at Wounded Knee, Pine Ridge."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná omníčiye thípi waŋ iyótaŋ wašté káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They made the best city hall."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thípi wakȟáŋ kiŋ St. Emma ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The church will be called St. Emma’s."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Úŋšiuŋla po na, mázašala ešá óuŋkiya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Have compassion for us, and perhaps give us some money."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokáta lé tókhetu kte akhé blaótȟaŋiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whatever happens with this in the future, I’ll publish information about it again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Willie Blacktail Deer čhiŋčá, Moses, mniákaštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They baptized Willie Blacktail Deer’s child, Moses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "William Thunder Horse waníyetu tópa kiŋ héhaŋ čhaŋkȟáhu kapšúŋ na, waníyetu núŋpa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When William Thunder Horse was four years old, his spine was dislocated, and he was nine years old."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lečhála akhé khúžiŋ na hoȟpá yuŋkȟáŋ, “iná, wačhéwakiyiŋ kte ló,” eyíŋ na čhékiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recently he’s become sick again, and is coughing, so he said, “my mother, I will pray,” and he prays to her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Moses ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "His name is Moses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówačhiŋye yuhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He’s dependable."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wótȟaŋiŋ wašté uŋ oíčhimani waŋží wagláotȟaŋiŋ kta wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I wanted to publish my trip to spread the Gospel."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta Feb. 20 kiŋ hé eháŋ Wyoming Makȟóčhe ektá Maȟpíya Tȟó Oyáŋke él wótȟaŋiŋ wašté uŋkáipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back on Feb. 20, we arrived with the Gospel at the Arapaho Reservation in Wyoming."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Joe Čhaŋšáša kičhí na oyáte kiŋ ób omníčiye tȟáŋka uŋkáǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I went with Joe Čhaŋšáša and we held a large meeting with the people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka okȟólakičhiye tȟáwa ópȟa-wičhúŋšipi tkȟá tákuni eyápi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We told them to join God’s society, but they didn’t say anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóčhekiye wičhóȟ’aŋ tákuni héčheča slolyápi šni, he úŋ etáŋhaŋ oyáte kiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ óta ȟčiŋ ičákižapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They didn’t know of any of those spiritual traditions, and for this reason the people suffered from the lack of those traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhel uŋkókinipi wóčhekiye wičhóȟ’aŋ uŋspéwičhuŋkiyapi na waŋná oyáte kiŋ okhíseya wičálapi na St. Joseph okȟólakičhiye waŋží tȟáŋka ȟčiŋ uŋkáǧapi, na omníčiye waŋží wašté wičhákičaǧapi, na wičháša na wíŋyaŋ kȟó óta mniáwičhakaštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We tried as hard as we could to teach them these spiritual traditions and now half of them believe, and they made quite a large Society of St. Joseph, and we held a good meeting for them, and a lot of men and women were baptized."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená omníčiye itȟáŋčhaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These are the leaders of the society."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó mitákuyepi, oyáte kiŋ lená theȟíya kakížapi tkȟá waŋná Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka okȟólakičhiye opȟápi, he úŋ wóčhekiye uŋ wičhúŋyeksuyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, my relatives, those people really suffered badly, but now they joined God’s society, and for that reason you all will remember us for those prayers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokáta Rosebud Agency omníčiye tȟáŋka yuhápi kte čiŋ hípi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the future I would arrive here to Rosebud Agency where they were holding a large meeting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p290> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó hé héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=290;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p290> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s what things are like."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=290;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p291> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makȟá akáŋl wičháša ní uŋk’úŋpi kiŋ naháŋ táku uŋkíkakižapi kiŋ hená uŋkíčiyapi-uŋšípi, na thiwáhe waŋžíla uŋkíčhaǧapi na wówičala waŋžíla uŋyúhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=291;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p291> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They asked us to go there to represent the men on this earth and those of us who suffer, and we grow as but one family, and we have but one faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=291;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ itȟó mitákuyepi tuwéke éyaš ičákižapi kiŋ ektá wičhúŋtuŋwaŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So for this reason, my relatives, let us open our eyes to all those who suffer from lack of those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhéwičhuŋkičičhiyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We will pray for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ Waníkiya uŋkítȟawapi makȟá akáŋl ní na wičháša úŋšikapi oyás’iŋ ówičhakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As you know, our Savior lived on Earth and he helped every single needy person."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé iyéčhel wičháša wakȟáŋ waŋží uŋyúhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because of that, we have a priest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná waníyetu núŋpa hé Father Westropp ečé wičháša úŋšika uŋk’úŋpi kiŋ átaya étuŋwe s’eléčheča, na wičhóȟ’aŋ óta ȟčiŋ okíhi uŋyáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For two years it is as if Father Westropp looks upon us as poor men, and we practice very many ceremonies to the best of our ability."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ Maȟpíya Tȟó Oyáŋke héčhiya omníčiye waŋží káǧa, nakúŋ thípi waŋží wašté káǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There at the Arapaho reservation he held a big meeting, and also he made a good church."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáŋke uŋkítȟawapi él nakúŋ omníčiye thípi 6 waštéšte yuíčhaǧa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At our reservation he also raised up 6 meeting halls."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na aŋpétu kiŋ heháŋyaŋ tukténi owáŋžila yaŋká okíhi šni s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And now it seems as though nobody is able to rest anymore."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Niyowin (?) škalakese (?) oyáte kiŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka tȟokíčhuŋze yuhá-uŋkhiyapi kta líla čhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He really wants {…} to consider holding God’s kingdom close to us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel waŋná wičháša waŋžígži Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka tȟowáuŋšila kiŋ eháŋ awíčhai s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=301;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way it feels as if he got there bringing God’s mercy to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=301;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p302> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wawókiya wičháša óta wičháyuha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=302;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p302> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He has a lot of catechists."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=302;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Easter héhaŋ wawókiye omníčiye waŋží káǧapi, na hé St. Paul omníčiye ečíyapi, na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka okȟólakičhiye nakíčižiŋpi kta héčhapi na wí akénuŋpa kiŋ mázaska tób égnakapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=303;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They established a catechist council on Easter, and they call it St. Paul’s Council, and it is their job to defend God’s society and next December they’ll lay aside four dollars."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=303;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p304> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená nayáȟ’uŋpi kta wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=304;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p304> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I wanted you all to hear these things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=304;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p305> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyás’iŋ čhaŋtéwašteya napéčhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=305;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p305> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I happily greet all of you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=305;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p308> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ikčé Wičháša makȟá akáŋ uŋk’úŋpi kiŋ ečhíyataŋhaŋ oyáte lenákiya waŋwíčhablakiŋ, na hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ Maȟpíya Tȟó, na Susúni, Hotȟáŋke, Omáha mašté makȟóčhe ektá oyáte úŋpi kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=308;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p308> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From these places where we Native people live, I saw these peoples who live on sunny land, and they were the Cheyenne, Shoshone, Ho-Chunk, and Omaha."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=308;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p309> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sičháŋǧu, Hoȟwóžu, Íŋyaŋ Woslál Háŋ Oyáte, Oglála Oyáte na Wašíčuŋ Oyáte kiŋ lenákiya wóčhekiye wičhóȟ’aŋ uŋ omáwani."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=309;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p309> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve travelled with spiritual ways to where Sichangu, Miniconjou, Standing Rock peoples, Oglala people, and white people live."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=309;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó hé uŋ, táku waŋžígži epȟíŋ kta wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So for that reason, I want to say some things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte ówaŋčaya oyáte congress luhápi kte él wičhóiye tonákeča eyápi kta hečhíŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka ečhíyataŋhaŋ hená sutáya uŋyúhapi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Us peoples from all around should keep with ourselves the words that we are thinking of saying about God at the People’s Congress which will be held."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "United States él Ikčé Wičháša líla ótapi tkȟá, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka okȟólakičhiye ópȟapi kiŋ líla čónalapi na, óta ȟčiŋ makȟóčhe kiŋ él kakíšya yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are quite a lot of Native people in the United States, but those who are part of God’s society are very few, and very many on this Earth are suffering."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p313> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, wičháša wakȟáŋ táku uŋkókiyakapi kiŋ naháŋ sutáya uŋkíčuŋpi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=313;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p313> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, the priests should thoroughly use what they tell us for us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=313;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p314> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka oíye kiŋ hé uŋ na wičháša uúŋkhiyapi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=314;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p314> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They should send men to us with God’s word."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=314;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníkiya uŋkítȟawapi čhažé kiŋ úŋ hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because he lives our Savior’s name."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toná wóčhekiye oyápȟapi makȟóčhe kiŋ lél yaúŋpi hečhíŋ hená sutáya nažíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Stand strong those of you who think to join this religion on this land."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka čhiŋhíŋtku themní na watúkȟa kiŋ hé kiksúya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Remember that God’s son was sweating and exhausted."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka čhiŋčá táku uŋk’úpi kiŋ hená wičháša akáŋtu táku kičhíč’upi kiŋ héčha šni tkȟá hená owíhaŋke waníl uŋyúhapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What God’s Son gives us isn’t something that common men give each other, instead we have those things eternally."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel makȟóčhe kiŋ lé akáŋ íȟaŋhaŋ uŋhípi na tuwá owótȟaŋla lé mní kiŋ na owótȟaŋla watúkȟa kiŋ wóozikiye kiŋ él yaŋkíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way we came on this earth temporarily, and someone will sit honestly in this water, and sit honestly in exhaustion, in rest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toná Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka Čhiŋhíŋtku wé kiŋ otúya yusótapi kiŋ naháŋ otúyačhiŋ watúkȟapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those who consume the blood of God’s son in vain will be exhausted for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wókakiže kiŋ él yaŋkápi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they will sit suffering."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi, hé theȟíke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, that’s terrible."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená iyúkčaŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Think about those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta March 17, Johnie Black Elk, hokšíla waŋží é čha ȟwáya makít’e ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On March 17, Johnie Black Elk, who was just a boy, died quietly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu tópa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was four."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "May 18, Sam Big Road tȟawíču kičhí mniáwičhakaštaŋpi na wakȟáŋkičhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On May 18, Sam Big Road was baptized with his wife and they were married."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟolá ówaŋčaya úŋšimalapi na wóčhekiye emíčiya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Friends everywhere, keep me in your thoughts and pray for me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Napéčhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet you all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋží tȟéhaŋ ȟčiŋ awáčhiŋ waúŋ kiŋ waŋná leháŋl iyéyawapaha kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now I will announce something that I have been thinking about for a very long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ tuwé k’éyaš éyapaha iyápi kiŋ hé ilúkčaŋpi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, every one of you should think about going and announcing this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ikčé wičháša wóčhekiye oúŋpȟapi kiŋ hená tókhel okíhi Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka čhéuŋkiyapi waštéka, tkȟá ečhúŋ-uŋkápiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It would be good for us Natives who are part of this religion to pray to God as much as we can, but we don’t feel like doing that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, okȟólakičhiye oyás’iŋ húŋkešni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, all of the societies are weak."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ uŋ, uŋkítȟawakȟaŋyežapi kiŋ hená tókhel waštépi kta héčiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋží etáŋhaŋ waštépi kta iyéčhetu kiŋ hé lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On account of that, if those children of ours are going to be good somehow, this is the one tradition from which they should be good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Washington D.C. etáŋhaŋ Wičháša Wakȟáŋ Ikčé Wičháša awáŋwičhayaŋke kiŋ, Father Ketcham ečíyapi kiŋ, omníčiye waŋ tȟáŋka yuhá na wičhóȟ’aŋ tȟáŋka ȟča él kȟoyágya yuhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The priest from Washington D.C. who looks over Natives, called Father Ketcham, he held a big meeting and he held a very big mass."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ uŋ, Ikčé Wičháša wakȟáŋyeža wičhóuŋ yuhápi kiŋ hél ópȟewičhauŋkhiyapi kta iyéčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On account of this, us Native people should let the kids take part in having their own way of life."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hečéla tȟokáta wakȟáŋyeža waŋží wašté ičháȟ úŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the future with that alone will the kids grow up well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋčhíŋ hél líla wóčhekiye tȟáŋka wičhákičaǧapi kiŋ hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, tuwéni otúyačhiŋ táku wašté ičháȟya okíhi šni na tuwéni otúyačhiŋ thiwáhe wašté yuhá kta okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For you see, because a church is being built for them there, nobody can produce good things without a reason for it and nobody can have a good family without a reason for it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋčhíŋ tuktél Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka oíye kiŋ yaŋké háŋtaŋš ečéla él táku wašté ičháǧa okíhi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For you see, wherever God’s word is, only in that is one able to grow up with good things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, mitákuyepi, ničhíŋčapi kiŋ hél opȟéwičhayakhiyapi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, my relatives, you should let your children participate in it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ómakȟa waŋžíča kiŋ hé ¢25."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One year is 25¢."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋ wóčhekiye tȟáŋka wičhákičaǧapi kte lakȟáš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "How else could a church be built for them but with that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáheȟčiŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka wówaš’ake uŋk’úpi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe then it will be proper that God’s strength is given to us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lé mitákuyepi, iyúkčaŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then my relatives, think about that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ikčé Wičháša óta naháŋȟčiŋ kakížapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A lot of Native people are suffering."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s how it is."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóna táku čhiŋyápi uŋ hená wóčhekiye wičhóȟ’aŋ uŋ čhiksúyape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those of you who have been made to want things, I remember you all in my prayers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhát’a"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Deaths"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oct. 11, Jennie C. Face, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé thiwáhe yuhá ȟča héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "October 11th, Jennie C. Face, this was a woman with a great family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Okȟólakičhiye wakȟáŋ nakíčižiŋ ečé, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka itȟókab táku oyás’iŋ taŋyáŋ gluštáŋ na iyókiphiya wičhóni uŋmá ektá iyáye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just by defending the holy society, she completed all of those things well in front of God and she passed away happily."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oct. 9, Joseph Čhaŋkpé t’é ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On October 9th, Joseph Knee died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháȟčala kiŋ lé Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka él iglúhomni kiŋ hetáŋ áwičakȟeya Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka waštélake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This older man truly loved God owing to his conversion to God."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ečhél táku oyás’iŋ yuónihaŋyaŋ ečhúŋ na héčhel waŋná iglúštaŋ na wičhóni uŋmá ektá iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he did all things honoring him and then he completed it like that and he passed away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oct. 29, Mary Eagle Elk t’é ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On October 29th, Mary Eagle Elk died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ lé thiwáhe yuhá ȟča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This was a woman with a great family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Okȟólakičhiye nakíčižiŋ ȟče, na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka él táku oyás’iŋ yuónihaŋyaŋ ečhúŋ ȟče, na waŋná wičhóni uŋmá ektá iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She defended the societies, and she did all things honoring God, and she passed away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nov. 25, Mary Napé Wašíču Wiŋ, iná, winúȟčala waŋ t’é ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "November 25th, Mary White Man’s Hand, her mother, an older woman died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Taŋyáŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka ohóla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She respected God well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ wakȟáŋ oyás’iŋ taŋyáŋ ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She took all the sacraments well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wókakiže oyás’iŋ ayúštaŋ na wičhóni ektá iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way she left behind her suffering and she passed away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi, lená wóokhiye wašté él ohíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, they won eternal life."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owáčhekiye nitȟáwapi kiŋ él wičháyeksuyapi-wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Try to remember them in your prayers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ theȟíka waŋží él wówaši ečhámuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m working in a difficult matter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówašte na wičhúŋt’e iyágleya héčhiyataŋ uŋ, wičhóȟ’aŋ tȟaŋníla kiŋ hená wóilagyapi šni po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As concerns goodness and death, don’t make use of those old traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wičhóȟ’aŋ tȟéča Waníkiya nič’úpi kiŋ hé wóilagye-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Try to make use of the new tradition that the Savior gave you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča kiŋ wóokhiye yukȟíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There will be peace in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ wówauŋšila yukȟíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And also there will be compassion."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó hé héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋl tóna éyaŋpaha yakáǧapi k’uŋ hená wičhóiye nitȟáwapi kíksuya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then, those of you who have made announcements remember your words."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóiye kiŋ ečéla ehápi na nitȟáŋčhaŋpi kiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ tȟaŋníla kiŋ ektá úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all speak only these things and you live with your old traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, mitákuyepi, iglúwaŋžila po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, my relatives, unite together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "{Okni} {iklasle} yaúŋpi kta oyákihipi šni, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka héčhel iyókiphi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=377;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all cannot live trying to divide it up, God isn’t happy with that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=377;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Okȟólakičhiye waŋžíla, Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka waŋžíla, Čhiŋhíŋtku waŋžíla na Wóniya Wakȟáŋ waŋžíla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=378;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There is one Church, one God, one Son, and one Holy Ghost."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=378;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wówičala waŋžíla uŋyúhapi, wičhátȟaŋčhaŋ waŋžíla uŋyúhapi, wičhóni na wóniya waŋžíla úŋhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=379;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We have just one faith like that, we have just one body, we have just one life and one soul."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=379;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčhel hená yamní tkȟá waŋžíla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=380;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are three of them like that but there’s just one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=380;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=381;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s how it is."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=381;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Taŋyáŋ yawá po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=382;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Read well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=382;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ówaŋčaya kȟolákičhiyapi k’uŋ hená oyás’iŋ taŋyáŋ čhíksuyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=383;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I remember all of you who I’ve had as my friends everywhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=383;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyás’iŋ napéčhiyúzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=384;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet all of you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=384;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nitȟákȟolapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=385;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You’re all my friends."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=385;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaŋpaha"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=391;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Crier"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=391;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Joseph na St. Mary okȟólakičhiye úŋpi kiŋ átaya 150 henákečapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=392;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are 150 people that live in the way of St. Joseph’s society and St. Mary’s society."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=392;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé waníyetu kiŋ él Mr. na Mrs. Sleeping Bear mniáwičhakaštaŋpi na wakȟáŋkičhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=393;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "During this winter, Mr. and Mrs. Sleeping Bear were baptized and were married."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=393;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eliza Rocking Bear na Joe Elk Boy čhiŋčá na James Black Bear čhiŋčá na Joshua Spotted Owl čhiŋčá waŋ mniáwičhakaštaŋpi na heháŋl t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eliza Rocking Bear and Joe Elk Boy’s child, and James Black Bear’s child, and Joshua Spotted Bear’s child, they were all baptized and then they died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jan. 9 hé óštaŋ Tȟáȟča Lúta wiŋ t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=395;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On January 9th, Red Deer Woman died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=395;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jan. 14 hé óštaŋ C. Little Elk t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On January 14th, C. Little Elk died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Feb. 24 hé óštaŋ Alfred Black Bear čhiŋčá t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On February 24th, Alfred Black Bear’s son died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóčhekiye nitȟáwapi él kíksuya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Remember it in your prayers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé waníyetu kiŋ él wótȟaŋiŋ wašté ečhíyataŋhaŋ Kȟaŋǧí Okhúte ektá waí na Father Ambrose kičhí wówaši ečhámuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "During this winter, I arrived at Crow Creek with the Gospels, and I worked with Father Ambrose."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ wóčhekiye ečhíyataŋhaŋ ičákižapi, hé uŋ wičhákiksuyapi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The people were suffering as regards prayer, that’s why they should be remembered."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wí waŋží hél waúŋ na wóokhiye wašté míčaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was there for one month and they had me feel at peace."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ómakiyapi kiŋ lená éepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These are the ones who helped me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel omákiyapi hé uŋ philámayaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m thankful that they helped me like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl Khúlwičhaša Thípi él waglí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then I arrived back at Lower Brule Reservation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé hél months wówaši ečhámuŋ na akhé ómakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again I worked there for months and again they helped me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta blokéhaŋ congress héhaŋ wačhážeblate."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Last summer during the Congress, I put forward a motion."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiwáhe ečhíyataŋhaŋ wóčhekiye yuhápi kta čhažéblate."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I addressed them with prayer as regards families."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Okȟólakičhiye wakȟáŋ etáŋhaŋ wakȟáŋkičhiyuzapi uŋyúhapi na é wówiyukčaŋ líla tȟaŋkíŋkiŋyaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We have the sacrament of marriage from the holy societies and it’s something to really think hard about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Paul heyá, “tkȟá tákowe čha él éuŋtuŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Paul said, “but why is it that we don’t pay attention to it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na otȟókahe ektá Adam na Eva kičhí iwáŋwičhayaŋka po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Look over Adam and Eve in the beginning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Mary na Joseph kičhí iwáŋyaŋka po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And look at Mary with Joseph.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ tȟáŋka kiŋ waŋží ȟčiŋ ikčé wičháša uŋyúhapi waštéke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It would be good for us Native people to have one of the most important rites."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na eyá táku tóna waŋná slol’úŋyaŋpi: mniákaštaŋpi, wakȟáŋ woglákapi, wičháyusutapi, Yútapiwakȟáŋ ičúpi, wičhókhuže čhewíčhakičičhiyapi na wičhát’a čhewíčhakičiyapi na, kȟaŋǧí káǧapi čhewíčhakičičhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so now we know several things: baptism, confession, confirmation, holy communion, annointing of the sick and annointing of the dead, and holy orders."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lená héčhetu na Waníkiya uŋkítȟawapi kiŋ léčhel eyá: “Miyé čhóla tákuni oyákihipi kte šni.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So those things are like that and our Savior said, “without me, you all won’t be able to succeed in doing anything.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku tóna Waníkiya uŋyáwaštepi kiŋ hená wóokiye él úŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Our Blessed Savior will be present in several things with peace."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lé tȟokáta Sisítȟuŋwaŋ omníčiye tȟáŋka yuhápi kte él lé wóokiye yaŋkíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So He will be there in peace at the big conference that Sisítȟuŋwaŋ people are going to have."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Taŋyáŋ abléza po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Look out well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋtéwašteya napéčhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet you all with all my heart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaŋpaha"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Crier"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thípi wakȟáŋ waŋží iyótaŋ wašté ȟča uŋyúhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We have the best of churches."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé tȟokáheya wóphila tȟáŋka uŋyúhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We were very thankful for that at first."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, léčhel epȟíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, I’ll say it like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p437> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thípi wakȟáŋ uŋkítȟawapi hé líla tȟáŋka na, líla waŋkátuya na, imáhel pȟetížaŋžaŋ zí waŋží líla tȟáŋka iyóyaŋbyiŋ na, aŋpétu iyóhila ȟláȟla waŋží kaȟlápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=437;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p437> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Our church is very big, and it reaches up high, and inside a very large lamp shines yellow, and every day the bell is rung."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=437;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p438> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčhel, mitákuyepi, tókhiya yaípi na yakúpi čháŋna, thípi kiŋ hé ayátuŋwaŋpi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=438;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p438> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in that way, my relatives, whenever you go to somewhere or come back, you all should look to that building."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=438;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p439> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ oíyokpaza ešáš pȟetížaŋžaŋye kiŋ hé ayátuŋwaŋpi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=439;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p439> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also, if it’s dark for example, you all should see that lamp."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=439;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p440> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ kȟáta oíyokišiče ešáš ȟláȟla kiŋ hé anáyaǧoptaŋpi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=440;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p440> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also, if it’s awfully hot for example, you all should be able to hear that bell."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=440;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p441> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋčhíŋ Šinásapa Wóčhekiye hé išnála líla tȟáŋka, imáhel Itȟáŋčhaŋ uŋkítȟawapi hé Oíye yaŋká na, iyóyaŋpa kiŋ hé é na ȟláȟla kiŋ hé íŋš wičháša wakȟáŋ hé épi héčhel tókhiyataŋ hó tȟaŋíŋpi kiŋ étkiya uŋyáŋpi iyéčheča na, anáwičhaǧoptaŋpi kta iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=441;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p441> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As you know, that Catholic Church alone is really important, our Lord’s Word sits inside, and we should go to where it is that the light, bell, and priest appear, and we should listen to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=441;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p442> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, mitákuyepi, lená léčhetu čha slolyáyapi na, waŋlákapi na, nayáȟ’uŋpi na, uŋspénič’iyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=442;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p442> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, my relatives, you all know that things are like this, and you see them, and you hear them, and you learn them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=442;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p443> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheče ešáš, South Dakota imáhel Šinásapa yaúŋpi kiŋ makȟá wówitaŋ kiŋ hečéla akhítapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=443;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p443> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then at the least, those who are Catholics in South Dakota, the only thing for you all to watch out for is earthly pride."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=443;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka tȟówitaŋ kiŋ eyátuŋwaŋpi šni hé uŋ táku waŋ uŋslólyapi kte kiŋ hé lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=444;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is what we will learn from you all not looking towards God’s glory."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=444;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "United States wičháša kiŋ wáta waŋží tȟáŋka wašté káǧapi na nakúŋ líla lúza, hé líla mázaska wóyawa tȟáŋka óta uŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "People from the United States made a very big and beautiful boat and also it was very fast, they made it with a whole lot of money written down for it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p446> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ haŋhépi čónala mniwáŋča ópta oámani."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=446;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p446> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, it went along crossing the ocean in a couple nights."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=446;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p447> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wičháša wížiča tȟáŋka kiŋ hená ečéla él yaŋkápi okíhipi na, wičhaša waȟpániča kiŋ hená tuwéni él yaŋká okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=447;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p447> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, only the very wealthy people were able to be there, and none of the poor people were able to be there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=447;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel hé wówitaŋ tȟáŋka uŋ ománipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they travelled with their intense pride."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wáta kiŋ tóhaŋni mnít’iŋ kte šni kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said that the boat would never sink."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčhel wičháša wižíča kiŋ hená oyás’iŋ wičálapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So all of those wealthy people believed that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku khušéya úŋ kiŋ hé slolyápi šni kiŋ hé úŋ tkȟá, waŋná aŋpétu waŋ él táku khušéya úŋ kiŋ akhípȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They didn’t know that something was blocking the way, but then one day, they came across something that was blocking the way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wáta k’uŋ hé čháǧa waŋ [ibóto] na [woǧúŋǧe]."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, that ship bumped against a piece of ice and the impact blinded it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel waŋná wótheȟike uŋ íyaglepi na, líla wónihiŋčiye tȟáŋka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then in that way, a terrible event happened to them, and it was an awfully horrifying event."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečhúŋhaŋ wičháša wakȟáŋ núŋp él úŋpi na, wičháša uŋǧé maȟpíya él niwíčhakhiyapi na, íŋš ečhúŋhaŋ wátala eyá čikčístila él mahél úŋ na, hená íŋš-eyá wičhánuŋǧe niwíčhakhiya waŋná mahé táku iyáyapi k’él léčhel eyápi:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meanwhile two priests were there, and some men in Heaven saved them, and in the meanwhile there were some tiny boats there, and they said something like this right then into their ears while saving them:"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Mitȟá-Wakáŋka mičáhda úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My God is near to me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nikhíyela waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am near to you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mičáhda úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He is near to me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nitȟá-čhaŋsúsbeča kiŋ él ináwažiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I stand at your cross."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitȟálowaŋ kiŋ hé mičáhla.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My song is near to me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyápi kiŋ ečhúŋhaŋ mahél iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They left while saying that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, mitákuyepi, waŋyáŋka po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, my relatives, see that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wówitaŋ tȟáŋka uŋ léčhel waákhipȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They experienced that misfortune due to their great pride."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wótheȟike kiŋ, makȟá wówitaŋ kiŋ hé iwáŋkab othéȟikiŋ na, héčhel makȟá wówitaŋ k’él naŋkápi na, waŋkátuya yaglážužupi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This tragedy, it was a tragedy above their earthly pride, and you all sit in your earthly pride, and you pay it back up above."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku khušéya úŋ kiŋ waŋlákapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You don’t see what’s in the way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋl hé ayákhipȟapi kiŋháŋ táku tȟáŋka yagnúŋnpi kte kiŋ he lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When that unfortunate thing happens to you, this is the big thing that you all will lose."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhánaǧi waŋ yagnúnipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all will lose your soul."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na táku ibonitopi kiŋ hé wówaȟtani tȟáŋka kiŋ hé é yeló kiŋ héhaŋl lehápi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And you all will then say that the thing that you ran into was a grave sin."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Itȟáŋčhaŋ, Itȟáŋčhaŋ,” ehápi kte na hé líla theȟíke, mitákuyepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You will say, “Lord, Lord,” and that is really hard, my relatives."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel Waníkiya uŋkítȟawapi ikhíyela uŋ-wáčhiŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, try to be close to our Savior."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wáta uŋkítȟawapi ektá naŋké-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all try to sit in our boat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel Waníkiya léčhel eyáče, “wičháša waȟpániča na wičháša waȟtánipi uŋ wahí čhe.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The Savior said it kind of like this, “I have come for the poor and the sinner.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel owíčhakiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He told it to them like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel ničháŋtepi kiŋ él Waníkiya níčitȟuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, in your hearts, the Savior will be born for you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wówaš’ake tȟáŋka yuhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He has great strength."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena táku nič’úpi kta kéye kiŋ hé áwičakȟehaŋ wówičakȟe na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka oníčiyapi kiŋ hé táku kta héčiŋ waŋyáŋg-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it is fully true that it is said that he will still give you something, and if God helps you in whatever it might be, try to look out for it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé táku kta héčiŋ, héčhel, mitákuyepi, ówaŋčaya yaúŋpi kiŋ lé éyawapaha kiŋ lé taŋyáŋ abléza po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whatever it is, in that way, my relatives, all of you notice what I have announced."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitȟákȟolapi oyás’iŋ, wówašte uŋ napéčhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All my friends, I shake your hands with goodness."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nitȟákȟolapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Your friend."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaŋpaha"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Crier"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakpá Wašté él, omníčiye thípi waŋ Salis Opáǧila awáŋyaŋke kiŋ hél, oyáte úŋpi kiŋ hél, wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ waŋ úŋ, John Opáwiŋǧe Kté na, Šúŋka Lúta ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At Cheyenne River, at the town hall that Salis Fills The Pipe watched over, a Chief was where the people were, John Kills One Hundred, and they call him Red Dog."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu 62."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was 62 years old."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé mniákaštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They baptized him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Jan 14, nakúŋ tȟawíču kiŋ, Susie, waníyetu 52."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On January 14th, his wife Susie was 52 years old."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhiŋčá waŋ, Elias Opáwiŋǧe Kté, tȟawíču kiŋ, Elizabeth, na čhuŋwíŋtku waŋ, Annie, nakúŋ čhuŋwíŋtku waŋ hiŋgnáku kičhí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And his child, Elias Kills One Hundred, his wife, Elizabeth, and his daughter, Annie, with his daughter’s husband."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lenard Foolish Woman tȟawíču kiŋ, Nancy, na čhuŋwíŋtkupi núŋp Bessie na Ledia Eagle Shirt, lená oyás’iŋ mniáwičhakaštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lenard Foolish Woman’s wife, Nancy, and their two daughters Bessie and Ledia Eagle shirt were all baptized."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "John na Susie Opáwiŋǧe Kté, na Elias na Elizabeth Opáwiŋǧe Kté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "John and Susie Kill One Hundred, and Elias and Elizabeth Kill One Hundred."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lenard na Nancy Foolish Woman Rev. Father Henry S. J. wakȟáŋkičhiyuswičhakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lenard and Nancy Foolish Woman were married by Rev. Father Henry S.J."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyás’iŋ taŋyáŋ wóglakapi na Yútapiwakȟáŋ ičúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They all spoke well and received the Eucharist."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wičhóȟ’aŋ wašté tȟáŋka waŋ yuéčhetupi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they fulfilled a very good and important ceremony."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé uŋ, John Opáwiŋǧe Kté líla wówiyuškiŋ tȟáŋka yuhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And for that reason, John Kills One Hundred was very joyful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na léčhel eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Mičhíŋča tȟokápȟa kiŋ lé waštéuŋkilapi, na theúŋȟilapi, na thiwáhe k’él itȟáŋčhaŋ uŋyúhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“We love our oldest son, and he loves us, and we have him as the leader in the family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná míčikhuže, na waŋná t’íŋ kta ikhíyela, na Šináska wačhékiye wičháša wakȟáŋ wičháwečo tkȟá, nuŋphíŋ okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so now he is sick on me, and he is close to dying, and I invited priests of the Episcopal Church, but neither of them were able to do it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Šinásapa wačhékiye wičháša kiŋ ektá hípi na, taŋyáŋ wóčhekiye káǧapi na ečhél waŋná t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the priests of the Catholic Church came, and they prayed well until he died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋȟčiŋ heháŋyaŋ Šináska wačhékiye opȟá waŋžíni él hí šni, na héčhena ečhél šinásapa wačhékiye wičháša kiŋ wóokhiye wašté míčaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And still from then on no member of the Episcopal Church came, and still the priests of the Catholic Church made things very peaceful for me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thípi wakȟáŋ tȟawápi kiŋ ektá aípi, yuónihaŋyaŋ, naháŋ héhaŋ owíčhaȟapi ektá yuónihaŋyaŋ míčiȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I brought him to their church, respectfully, and back then they respectfully burried him for me in the graveyard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na waŋná taŋyáŋ míčiyuštaŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ léčheȟčiŋ awáčhaŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they arranged things well for me and so I think about these very things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋke uŋ Šinásapa wóčhekiye kiŋ hečéla wówičakȟe leháŋl slolwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eventually I knew that the Catholic Church was the only true thing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ mitákuyepi wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, my relatives, remember a ceremony."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta até wičhúŋyaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My father went back to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Washington D.C. él lé yuštáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They finished this in Washington D.C."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šinásapa kilá Ikčé wičhašapi kiŋ ób úŋpi kta yuštáŋpi na hé wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those Catholics who lived with Native people finished it and I remember that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ léhaŋl ogná waúŋ kta čha miglúštaŋ.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason I’ve decided to live that way nowadays.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčheȟčiŋ wičhóiye eyé ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said something just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lená wičháša ektá ípi na wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ kíčiyuštaŋpi: Rev. Fr. Henry, S. J. James E. Grass na Nicholas Black Elk."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These men arrived there and they finished the ceremony for him: Rev. Fr. Henry, S.J., James E. Grass, and Nicholas Black Elk."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka táku yaótȟaŋiŋ kiŋ hé tuwéni nignáyaŋpi okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "God can’t trick any of you with what he’s announced."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tuwéni yagnáyaŋpi oyákihipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And you all can’t trick anybody."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša oyás’iŋ aŋpétu nitȟáwapi kte kiŋ slolyákiyapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Every one of you know when it will be your day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, aŋpétu iyóhila, iglúwiŋyeya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, be read,y every day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋtéwašteya napéčhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet you all with all my heart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nitȟákȟolapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Your friend."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaŋpaha"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Crier"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šinásapa omníčiye tȟáŋka ečhíyataŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As regards the big Catholic Congress."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta blokétu kiŋháŋ Iháŋktȟuŋwaŋ thípi él omníčiye tȟáŋka yuhápi kte čiŋ hél omníčiye itȟáŋčhaŋ yaŋkápi kte čiŋ hé lená éepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When it’s summer for Lakota people, these are the people who will act as leaders during the big Congress they’re going to hold on Yankton Reservation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átaya omníčiye awáŋyaŋkiŋ kte čiŋ hé Father Westropp."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Father Westropp will be the one who looks over the whole Congress."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nicholas Black Elk, Pine Ridge etáŋhaŋ kiŋ, ókhihe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nicholas Black Elk, the one from Pine Ridge, joins him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyámni kte čiŋ hé Yellowbird, Iháŋtȟuŋwaŋ thípi etáŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The third one is Yellowbird, from Yankton Reservation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhetáŋ Wičhóta ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They call him Many Hawks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "John W. Howard thiyópa awáŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "John W. Howard is the greeter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wm. Fine Eyes, John L. Little Owl oglíglepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "William Fine Eyes and John L. Little Owl wear robes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mm. Zephier lowáŋ itȟáŋčhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mm. (Malcolm?) Zephier is the musical director."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lená wičhóȟ’aŋ tȟáŋka kiŋ hé awáŋyaŋkapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So these ones will look over the big service."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ, Iháŋktȟuŋwaŋ thípi kiŋ él, wičháša kiŋ lená šinásapa owíčhoȟ’aŋ yuhá nážiŋpi:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the past, at Yankton Reservation, these men followed Catholic traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wm. Bean, Sr (Maȟpíya Tȟó), David Zephier, Jacob Little Owl, Amos Sí Tȟoká, Chas Cordier, Wakíŋyaŋ Tȟašúŋke, Red Lightning."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "William Bean Sr. (Arapaho), David Zephier, Jacob Little Owl, Amos First Foot, Chas Cordier, Thunderbird Horse, and Red Lightning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená wičháša tȟáŋkapi na wašté héčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These men are important and good people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "South Dakota Šinásapa yaúŋpi kiŋ na North Dakota, Montana, na Nebraska šinásapa yaúŋpi kiŋ, hená oyás’iŋ tȟokáta lé oyáŋke kiŋ él omníčiye yuhápi kte čiŋ yaúŋpi uŋčhíŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Catholics of South Dakota, North Dakota, Montana, and Nebraska, we want you all to be at the future meeting that’s being held on this reservation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋží uŋ lé léčhel uŋčhíŋpi kiŋ lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is us wanting something like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋ hékta šinásapa wičháša wakȟáŋ waŋží, Father DeSmet, lél oyáŋke él hí yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some time back in the past a Catholic priest, Father DeSmet, came to this reservation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋpi (chiefs) kiŋ hená hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ Tȟuŋkáŋšila kičhí wólakȟota káǧape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=541;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they made peace with God because of the presence of the Chiefs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=541;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟaláni Apȟápi Tȟaóyate kiŋ lé átaya mniáwičhakaštaŋ yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They baptized all of the people in Struck by the Ree’s band."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na iyópteya wazíyatakiya oyáte watȟógla úŋpi kiŋ iyáza wičhóȟ’aŋ wašté oyág áye čiŋ hé slolyáyape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And you all know about him going from band to band of non-agency Natives in the north, telling about the good tradition"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ečhél leháŋtu kiŋ waŋná Ikčé Wičháša kiŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka Tȟaóyate héčha ičháǧapi kiŋ leháŋ slolyáyape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nowadays you all know about Native people being raised as one of God’s people up to this day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, wókiksuye waŋ tȟáŋka čha ékičihdepi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, they will keep this significant memory of him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, Šinásapa ówaŋčaya yaúŋpi kiŋ hé iyóniwažape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, all of you that are Catholics have an interest in it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lé uŋ, tȟokáta waéuŋkiyapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So for this reason, they will talk to him in the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha kiksúya po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So remember!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ letáŋ tȟokátakiya, wí otóiyohi, omníčiye tȟáŋka kte čiŋ uŋ naȟ’úŋ walápi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From then to now and onwards, every month, they will need to ask for things while listening during the big meetings."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ tókheša, aŋpétu waŋ él, tóhaŋ omníčiye tȟáŋka kiŋ hé íŋyaŋke kte čiŋ hé nayáȟ’uŋpi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sooner or later, one day, you all will hear about a big meeting that will be ran."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó hé uŋ héčhel epȟíŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s why I’ll say this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáŋke iyóhi lé oyáte {kiŋ] táku iwáštepi kta iyéčheča kiŋ hená theȟíŋla {ogná} iyúkčaŋpi na yuhá ú po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Think it lovely for every reservation to do something good for these people and come here with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta omníčiye tȟáŋka k’uŋháŋ, táku yuštáŋ k’uŋ hená kiksúya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "During the last big Congress, remember what they finished doing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi, Waníkiya čhaŋíčhipaweǧa tȟáwa kiŋ él tóna niwíčhakhiyapi k’uŋ hená wóphila ečhíčiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives, I tell you all to be thankful for the Savior having saved them on his cross."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iháŋktȟuŋwaŋ oyáŋke él omníčiye tȟáŋka yuhápi kte čiŋ ečhíyataŋhaŋ uŋ hékta aŋpétu kaȟníǧapi k’uŋ hé lečhála yutȟókečapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As regards the big meeting that they had on Yankton Reservation, recently they changed the day that they had chosen back then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟuŋkášilayapi ečhíyataŋ lečhála wówapi uŋk’úpi na waŋ uŋkíčiyuštaŋpi; Aug. 7, 8, 9, 10."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As regards the leaders, they recently gave us a letter and decided this; August 7, 8, 9, 10."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel uŋ lé ówaŋčaya slolyáyapi wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I want you all of you everywhere to know in this way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóna omníčiye tȟáŋka ektá yaúpi kte k’uŋ hená, thiwáhe él táku ečhánuŋpi kta iyéčhetu k’uŋ hená taŋyáŋ iglúštaŋ-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those of you who were coming to the big meeting, try to decide well what you should be doing with your family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owáwaši oéčhuŋ čha wakȟé ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m talking about the work that is done."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá omníčiye tȟáŋka ektá ú-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So try to come to the big meeting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku iyótaŋ tȟáŋka kiŋ hé waŋlákapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all will see especially good things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋtéwašteya napéčhiyuzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet you all with all my heart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nitȟákȟolapi"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Your friend"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitákuyepi"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My relatives"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníkiya uŋkítȟawapi kiŋ otúyačhiŋ makȟá akáŋ ní šni tkȟá, táku oyás’iŋ yuštáŋ kte kiŋ hé uŋ aŋpétu wikčémna tóp él táku oyás’iŋ awáčhiŋ kakíže."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Our Savior didn’t live on the earth for no reason, but since he would complete everything, he suffered in thinking about everything for fourty days."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Hé wičáuŋlapi na waŋná iyéhaŋtu k’uŋháŋ wóčhekiye waŋží uŋkíčaǧapi, uŋnáǧipi ečhíyataŋ uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And we believe in Him, and when the time comes He will pray for us, as regards our souls."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na okȟólakičhiye waŋží uŋkíčaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And He made a society for us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋtȟáŋčhaŋpi taŋyáŋ úŋ kte kiŋ hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Our bodies will be able to live well because of this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wówičala iču-úŋšipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he asks to take faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku owíhaŋke waníče kiŋ hé wičála-uŋšípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He asks us to believe in something everlasting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša akénuŋp wičhákaȟniǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He chose twelve men."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte oyás’iŋ yewíčhaši na Itȟáŋčhaŋ uŋkítȟawapi kiŋ tókhel ečhúŋ-wičháši kiŋ oyás’iŋ ečhél ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He sent them to every people and they did it in all the ways in which our Savior asked them to do it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ohnáyaŋ oyás’iŋ uŋt’ápi na, etáŋ waŋžíla ikčé t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "According to that we all die, and from that only one died normally."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé St. John ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he is called St. John."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ehákeȟčiŋ wówahokuŋkhiye waŋží wičhákičaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And finally he made one of them into a preacher."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Oyás’iŋ waštékičhila po,” eyé s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Love everyone,” he often said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óta akhígle wičhóiye kiŋ hé oyáte kiŋ owíčhakiyake s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He would tell those words to the people many times over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóiye kiŋ hé aŋpétu leháŋyaŋ wičháša wakȟáŋpi kiŋ yuhá nažíŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The priests keep those words up to this day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋčhíŋ Jesus akénuŋpapi kiŋ sihá wičhákičiyužaža na héčhel éwičhakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because Jesus washed the soul’s of twelve of their feet and he told them that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, mitákuyepi, tóna Christian heníčhapi héči, hená tȟokáheya máni utȟá po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, my relatives, if there are those of you who are Christians, try to walk first."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Túwena wičháša kiŋ kaȟáb awíčhaya okíhi šni tkȟá, waníyetu óta wičháša kiŋ kaȟáb áwičhalapi yačhíŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nobody can drive people into it, but you all wanted to drive people for many years."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé héčhetu šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s not how it goes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá niyépi tȟokáheya mayánipi kiŋ, oyáte kiŋ taŋyáŋ ablézapi kta okíhipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But those of you who walk first, the people will be able to notice it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p595> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá wičhóiye ečéla yuhá na yačhíŋpi kiŋ ablésphiča šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=595;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p595> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But you all wanting and having just these words isn’t noticeable."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=595;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lé héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=596;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s how it goes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=596;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p597> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na táku waŋží yéksuyapi kta wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=597;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p597> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I want you all to remember something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=597;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p598> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta Iháŋktȟuŋwaŋ thípi él omníčiye tȟáŋka uŋyúhapi na, wóyuštaŋ waŋží káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=598;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p598> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A little ago we had a big meeting on Yankton Reservation, and we held a vote."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=598;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p599> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owáyawa waŋží yuhápi wičhákičiyuštaŋpi na, hé ówaŋčaya owíčhakhuwapi kta kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=599;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p599> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They decided that they want a school for them, and they said that they would pursue them all around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=599;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p600> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó hé kiksúya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=600;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p600> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Remember that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=600;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p601> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋtéwašteya napéčhiyuzapi"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=601;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p601> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet you all with all my heart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=601;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heȟáka Sápa Akhé Wóglaka – Eháke Wóeye kiŋ"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=607;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Black Elk Speaks Again – Final Words"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=607;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitȟákȟola, wašíču napéčhiyuzape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=608;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My friends, I greet you white people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=608;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p609> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyápi wówičakȟe uŋ táku epȟíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=609;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p609> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will say something using the true language."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=609;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p610> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anáǧoptaŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=610;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p610> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Listen."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=610;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni oyáte tȟóuŋyaŋpi obláka waŋ etáŋ wašíču waŋ wówapi waŋ káǧe tkȟá, leháŋl oúŋye kiŋ é oyáke šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A white man made a book out of something I said about old ways of life, but he didn’t speak of today’s way of life."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, akhé epȟíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, I will say something again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháke wóeye héčha kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These will be some final words."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná wimáčhaȟčala."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am an old man now."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša wakȟáŋ mitȟáwa kiŋ wéčho wačhémičičhiyiŋ na, Isláye Wakȟáŋ na Yútapi Wakȟáŋ mak’ú kte kiŋ hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I invited my priest to pray for me, and this is why he gave me Holy Oil and the Eucharist."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ wówičakȟe čha očhíčiyakapi kte., it’s the truth that I will be telling you all."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitȟákȟola, naȟ’úŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My friends, listen."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta waníyetu wikčémna yámni héhaŋ na etáŋ wašíču waŋ omáyake kiŋ lé, leháŋl líla itȟógye waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I live very differently today, compared to the white man talking about me living thirty years ago."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówičala yuhá kiŋ hemáčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am a person with faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šinásapa wičháša wakȟáŋ, Até Ptéčela, mniámakaštaŋ na heháŋtaŋ waníyetu wikčémna yámni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A Catholic priest, Little Father, baptized me, and it’s been that way ever since for 30 years."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋ tȟahénakiya Nick Heȟáka Sápa emákiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From then on they call me Nick Black Elk."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ óta ȟči slolmáyaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A whole lot of Lakota people know me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó na leháŋl Wówičala wówičakȟe kiŋ él, Atéyapi Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka, Čhiŋčá na, Wóniya Wakȟáŋ kiŋ étkiya miglúhomni waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So and nowadays I live as converted towards God the Father, his Son, and the Holy Spirit, in the true faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta Sioux iyápi mitȟáwa kiŋ ognáyaŋ léčhel epȟé; Atéuŋyaŋpi maȟpíya ektá naŋké čiŋ, ničháže wakȟáŋlapi ní."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In my Lakota Sioux language I say it like this; Our Father who sits in Heaven, may they consider your name holy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Christ héčhel uŋspéuŋkhiyapi na eyé-uŋšípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They taught us about Christ like that, and they asked us to say it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahóšiyapi Tȟawówičala kiŋ epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I say the Apostles’ Creed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na iyúha wičáwala."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I believe all of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šinásapa Wóčhekiye kiŋ él Wówakȟaŋ šakówiŋ hená wičáwala."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I believe in the seven sacraments in the Catholic Church."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé etáŋ leháŋl šákpe iwáču: Mniáwičahkaštaŋpi, Wičháyusutapi, Wakȟáŋ-Wóglakapi, Yútapi-Wakȟáŋ, Wakȟáŋkičhiyuzapi na, Isláye Wakȟáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From then to today I’ve taken six of them: Baptism, Confirmation, Reconciliation, the Eucharist, Marriage, and Annointing of the Sick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte mitȟáwa étkiya líla waníyetu óta wičháša wakáŋ tóna ób omáwani na, hé Christ tȟaózuye kiŋ ogná héčhuŋk’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I travelled around to my people with several priests for many years, and we did that through Christ’s church militant."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu wikčémna núŋpa séča wičháša wakȟáŋ ówičhawakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I helped the priests for maybe twenty years."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tuktéktel oyáŋke waŋžígži Wawókiya maŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And sometimes I was a catechist at some reservations."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhe Šinásapa Wóčhekiye kiŋ wašíču óta wičhísaŋmbya slolwáya awákibleze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, I’ve realized that I know more about the Catholic Church than many white people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša wakȟáŋ kiŋ Wawókiyapi kiŋ haŋbléčheyewičhakhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The priests had the Catechists go on retreats."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ómakȟa šaglóǧaŋ ówapȟa na, etáŋ wówičala kiŋ tȟáŋkaya {uŋmáspe} wakíla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I participated in them for eight years, and I asked him to have me learn a lot about the faith from that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówičala mitȟáwa kiŋ uŋ wóableze epȟá owákihi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I can say facts due to my faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówičala kiŋ etáŋ tuwá wičáwala hé slolwákiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I know who I believe in with my faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha otúyačhiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ héčha šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So there aren’t acts for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiwáhe mitȟáwa iyúha mniáwičhakaštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They baptized all of my family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mičhíŋča, mitȟákoža iyúha šinásapa wóčhekiye ópȟapi na, hé iblúškiŋ na, “tókhe óhiŋniyaŋ očháŋku wakȟáŋ kiŋ ogná yápi ní,” ečháŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of my children and grandchildren are part of the Catholic Church, and I’m happy about that, and I think, “oh, I hope that they may go along the holy road.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóopȟe wakȟáŋ etáŋ wičháša eyá iȟpéič’iyapi čha hená St. Peter waéwičhakiya čha hé slolwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some men fall away from the holy commandments so I know that St. Peter talked about them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíču mitȟákȟolapi, hé lawápi waštéke 2 Peter: 2-20, 22."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My white friends, it would be good for you all to read 2 Peter: 2-20, 22."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Christ owáčhekiye tȟáwa uŋspéuŋkhiyapi kiŋ etáŋ oyáte mitȟáwa kiŋ čhaŋkú owótȟaŋla ogná yéwičhawaši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I ask my people to go along the right path, taught to us by Christ’s Church."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Christ tȟawówičala etáŋ tóhaŋni mahíŋȟpayiŋ kte šni waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I live without ever faltering thanks to Christ’s faith."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta waníyetu wikčémna yámni hená Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka uŋkéyapi uŋ hé etáŋ čisčíla slolwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thirty years ago I knew little about what we call “Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ wačhí wayúphike lakȟáš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then I was evidently a really good dancer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "England él uŋčíyapi Queen Victoria itȟókab wawáčhi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I danced in front of their grandmother Queen Victoria in England."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ khúžapi hená pȟežúta wičháwak’u."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then I gave medicine to those who were sick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ímataŋ, tokȟáš omáhitike séče, akhéš Lakȟóta wašté hemáčha séče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was proud, maybe I was daring, again I might have been a good Lakota man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá leháŋl owámahečheča wakíla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays I’ve asked to be better."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Paul íŋš-eyá owáhečheča, yuhómnipi uŋ héhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "St. Paul also got better, when they converted him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šinásapa tȟawóčhekiye kiŋ wašté kiŋ slolwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=652;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I know that the Catholic Church is good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=652;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé Wíwaŋyaŋg-wačhípi kiŋ isáŋmbya, na nakúŋ Wanáǧi-wačhípi kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=653;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Moreso than the Sundance, and also the Ghostdance."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=653;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋk’ehaŋ Lakȟóta kiŋ héčha wačhípi kiŋ hená wóitaŋ ečéla uŋ héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=654;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Long ago the sort of Lakota people who danced did that only with pride."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=654;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waíč’ihuŋpi na wé kiŋ imnítaŋ kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=655;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They gashed themselves and the blood ran out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=655;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá Christ iyé wówaȟta ní tȟáŋtaŋhaŋ uŋ, čhaŋíčhipaweǧe akáŋl okátaŋpi wówaȟtani ȟeyáb ičú kta uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=656;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But because of Christ living due to sin, through that he would take away sin by being nailed on the cross."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=656;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋk’ehaŋ Lakȟóta tȟówačhekiyapi wičháša iyúwašte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=657;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Long ago Lakota pays of prayer didn’t make it better."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=657;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waphíya wičháša hená wóitaŋ na wóȟeyaka ečéla akhítaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=658;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Medicine men were proud and they were just on the lookout for gift fees."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=658;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p659> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Christ úŋši ič’íčhaȟ-uŋšípi na wówaȟtani kiŋ inážiŋkhiye uŋspéuŋkhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=659;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p659> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Christ asked us to be humble and he taught us to stop sinning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=659;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p660> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta waphíya wičhášapi kiŋ wówaȟtani kiŋ inážiŋkhiyapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=660;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p660> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota medicine men don’t stop sinning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=660;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná leháŋyaŋ wówaȟtani kiŋ waȟthéwalašni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=661;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve hated sin up to this day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=661;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na owótȟaŋla blá wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=662;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I want to go honestly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=662;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p663> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šinásapa wóowotȟaŋla uŋspéuŋkhiyapi kiŋ hé ognáyaŋ na, mináǧi kiŋ maȟpíya ektá ní ihúŋni kta hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=663;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p663> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Using the Catholic honesty that they taught us, that’s why my soul will reach Heaven."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=663;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhel ečhámuŋ kta wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=664;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I want to do it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=664;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋtéwašteya iyúha napéčhiyuzape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=665;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I greet all of you with all of my heart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=665;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ikȟópȟe šni Hótȟaŋiŋ po"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Voice Your Opinion Without Fear"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ liglíla iyápi na, úŋtȟuŋkičhiye-wačhíŋpi éyaš, waŋná tóktuka chaŋná, hótȟaŋkapi k’uŋ hená tukténi tȟaŋíŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "People speak on and on, and they try to hurt each other, but whenever something happens, those with loud voice are nowhere to be found."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ešéš hólazataŋhaŋ waktá úŋpi na, tuwá waŋná wóakhiniče waŋží ohíyiŋ kte s’eléčheča čháŋna, hé kičhíčaič’iyapi na, akhéšna líla ohítikapi.Anyways,"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "they wait in the background, and whenever it seems like someone will win an argument, they join in with them, and they’re really brave again and again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makȟásaŋ Oyáŋke kiŋ leháŋl wókičhuŋze oítȟaŋčhaŋ waŋ wóakhiniče héčha na, waníyetu óta héčhel íŋyaŋke yuŋkȟáŋ oyáte kiŋ él héčheȟčiŋ škáŋpi čha waŋwíčhablake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays there is a White Clay District government fight, and it’s been going on for many years like that and so I’ve seen that they’ve been acting just like that in the community."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p708> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte ókšaŋ waŋúŋyaŋkapi čhaŋké héčhel uŋkáblezapi na waŋná inágna uŋkíȟaȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=708;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p708> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "People around us look at us and so they notice us like that and then sometimes they laugh at us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=708;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyéš tuwá tókhel wówičakȟela héči, héčhel t’íŋsya khinážiŋ na, aíyačhiŋyaŋ wawókiye kiŋháŋ, oyáte kiŋ épi čha ewáštepi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=709;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If at least someone believes it to be true somehow, then when they stand firm, and when they help people in that same way, it is the people who will benefit from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=709;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p710> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéni išnála él áye-phiča šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=710;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p710> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s impossible to blame anybody at all for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=710;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p711> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ešéš héčhuŋ-haŋpi čha, átaš tákuni uŋkókihipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=711;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p711> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They’re doing it anyways, so nobody can do anything at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=711;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p712> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ niyépi čha wówaš’ake kiŋ yuhá naŋkápi éyaš tuwé čha tȟokáheič’iyiŋ kta waktá yaúŋpi s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=712;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p712> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all are the people so you sit with strength, but it’s as if you all are waiting for someone to act first."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=712;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p713> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lená tókhel wówičakȟeyalapi héči tákuni kȟokípȟe šni [hohan] ilálapi na honítȟaŋiŋpi kta héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=713;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p713> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they believe these actions to be true somehow, you need to go without fear of anything and make yourself heard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=713;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wayášiče šni ée, wawókiye-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Instead of speaking negatively, try to be helpful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aléčhalake s’e mitȟáwiču kiŋ kičhí uŋkíčhiŋčapi kiŋ otȟúŋwahe-ta wól-wičhúŋgloipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Fairly recently my wife and I brought our kids to a restaurant to eat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá íŋš-eyá watóhaŋl šna wóyute waštéšte čhíŋpila čháŋna, owóte thípi waŋží él ób uŋkípi na, aíkpažužuwičhuŋkhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So sometimes whenever they want good food too,  we get to a restaurant with them, and we let them do what they want."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku čha čhíŋpi héči hená ečhá wahóyapi na š’a s’e šna oíyokiphiya waúŋtapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Of course they order whatever it is that they want and we eat happily and excitedly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ íŋš wówaši ečhúŋ čha héčhetu čháŋna, íŋš-eyá asníkiyakel tákuni ináǧiyeič’iye šni imáǧaǧaič’iye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever the woman who’s working is like that, she enjoys herself by not getting bothered with anything and being relaxed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na míš-eyá okó waŋží áta kiníl thiwáhe mitȟáwa kiŋ waŋwíčhablake šni wawákamna čhaŋké léčhel ptáyela waútapi naíŋš uŋkómanipi čha iyómakiphi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I work not seeing my family almost all week, too, and so I’m happy with us eating like this for a little or with us walking around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhel iná na até uŋspéuŋkhiyapi čhaŋké tókhel uŋkókihipi kiŋ ečhél ečhúŋk’uŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My mom and dad taught us like that and so we do it the best that we can."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla núŋpapi na wiŋčhíŋčala kiŋ íŋš yámnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are two boys and three girls, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla kiŋ épi na wiŋčhíŋčala kiŋ waŋží héčhel hakáktapi čhaŋké, líla waslólya čhíŋpi na, wówiŋyuŋǧe ožúlapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those are the boys and one of the girls that are the youngest, and so they really want to learn things, and they are full of questions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená yámni líla ič’íkhiyela wičhátȟuŋpi naháŋ, toháŋl ištíŋmapi šni háŋtaŋš, áta hónisko šna uŋkómanipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These three were born really close to teach other, and if they aren’t sleeping, we usually travel around really loud."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wiŋčhíŋčala tȟokápȟa kiŋ waŋná waníyetu akézaptaŋ na, Maȟpíya Lúta tȟówayawa hél wayáwa yuŋkȟáŋ, waŋná wóuŋspe waŋkátuya waŋ étkiya étuŋwaŋ inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The oldest young girl is fifteen years old now, and she studies at Red Cloud school, and so now she is standing looking a university education."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wiŋčhíŋčala íyokhihe kiŋ íŋš-eyá naháŋȟči wayáwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The next oldest girl is still studying, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíčala k’uŋ heháŋtaŋ, uŋkítȟawapi kiŋ iyéčhel ičháȟ’uŋyaŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, leháŋl tókhiyab thiléhaŋl úŋ čhaŋké, iyóuŋkišičapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ever since she was a girl, we raised her like our own, and so nowadays she lives with someone else somewhere else, and so we are sad about that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó hé é ȟči waúŋtapi kta čha, owóte thípi waŋ él thimá uŋkíyapi yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel wašíčuŋ kiŋ tákuni istéče šni hakíktapi na, uŋkáyutapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was like that that we would eat, so we arrived inside the restaurant, and so the white peopled turned around shamelessly, and they looked at us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhinaš nážiŋžiŋ hiyápi na kte khinápȟe uŋyáŋpi kta kéčhaŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "WellI thought that they would get up and approach us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Él éwičhatuŋwe šni uŋhíyapi na, wáglewotapi waŋ él uŋkíyutakapi yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhena uŋkáyuta yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We went not paying attention to them, and we sat at a table, and so they sat looking at us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋȟ iyótaŋš hiŋháŋ makȟóčhela s’e pȟá ečéla uŋhíyapi kiŋ itkób uŋkáuytapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They stared in our direction while we passed by, only some of their heads were even like burrowing owls."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋkíš-eyá héktakiya awíčhuŋkayutapi čháŋna, líla oȟ’áŋkȟoya ipáweȟ étuŋwaŋpi éyaš, akhéšna naȟmáȟmala s’e uŋkáyutapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever we also stared back at them, they looked somewhere else quickly, but they often looked at us again, trying to hide it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mitȟáwiču kiŋ haŋkéya čhaŋzéke šna waéwičhakiyiŋ naíŋš, héktakiya šna ité ožúha [šáke] kiŋ hé é ȟči awíčhayuta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My wife finally said things to them all angry, or she looked back at them […]"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋčíwaye kiŋháŋ eháŋni ní úŋ k’uŋ héhaŋ, omákiyakiŋ na, leyé, “waáyuta-he šni yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back when my grandma was alive, she told me something, and she said, “don’t stare at people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋpi čháŋna, gluglúkapi kštó.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever they do that, they’re obnoxious.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋčí, wóuŋspe kiŋ ičínuŋpa kiŋ hé k’éyaš, gluštáŋ šni tkȟá, wahéhaŋyaŋ waúŋspe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My grandma, that was second grade, but she didn’t finish it, but she learned that much."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóyuonihaŋ uŋspé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She learned politeness."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówiyuŋǧe eyá wakáǧe kiŋ lená é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These are the questions that I’m asking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuŋ kiŋ lená, tákuwe čha eyášna héčhuŋpi he?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These white people, why is it that they often do that?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku čha iyúkčaŋpi na uŋ héčhuŋpi he?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What is it that they’re thinking and for what reason do they do that?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgná tuwá lé yawá naháŋ amíčiyupte kiŋ líla philámayiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe I will be very thankful for somebody who reads this and answers it for me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋheža kiŋ lená héčhel waŋyáŋg ičháǧapi wačhíŋ šni éyaš, iyéna otȟúŋwahe-ta uŋkípi čháŋna, lé uŋkákhipȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I don’t want these kids to grow up seeing like that, but every time we get to the city, things like this happen to us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgná takúku slolyápi čhíŋpi séče škȟá, tákuni eyápi šni ečéla waáyuta úŋpi čha šíče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In spite of them maybe wanting to learn things, it’s bad that they look at us just without saying anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wayátkaŋpi kiŋ lé waŋyáŋg imáčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I grew up seeing them drinking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na waŋná omíč’ihi-ke k’uŋ hetáŋ, ečhéȟči wablátke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then from the point when I could somewhat take care of myself, I drank just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ tuwéni anápte-wachíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then nobody tried to stop."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuktél éwatuŋwiŋ naíŋš wahíyaye kiŋ hená, oyáte kiŋ wayátkaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "With me looking or going somewhere, the people drink."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟuŋwíŋwaye waŋ ečéla šna onáwakižiŋ k’éyaš íŋš-eyá itómni kȟowíčhakiphi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I often looked for shelter with just one of my aunts, but she was afraid of drunks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Misúŋkala na čhiyéwičhawaye kiŋ épi na tȟuŋwíŋ hená ptáyečaska šna haŋíyačhiŋšni owíŋža uŋkpéhaŋpi na naúŋpȟapi s’a ka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was my younger brothers and aunts, and my aunt folded up our blankets together in the middle of the night, and often we ran away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p751> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wablátke s’a uŋ, haŋkéya tȟuŋwíŋ éna šna napȟéwakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=751;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p751> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Being a drinker, finally I made my aunt run away from me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=751;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p752> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋl oyáte kiŋ wayátkaŋpi čháŋna, wičhóȟ’aŋ šikšíča owé tónakeča héči, iyúha íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=752;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p752> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wheenver the people drink, if there are several types of bad actions, all of them happen."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=752;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená iyúha kiníl waŋbláke s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it’s like I’ve seen almost all of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu záptaŋ imáhel, mithítakuye napčíŋyuŋka henákeča theȟíya t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In five years, as many as nine relatives of mine died tragically."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iníhaŋšni blatké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I drank paying no attention to that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho, yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él, waníyetu wikčémna yámni henámakča héhaŋ, wamáphi-ka wayátkaŋpi kiŋ lé itóhewaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day, when I was thirty years old, I luckily confronted drinking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋtaŋ wayátke šni waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I’ve been living without drinking since then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé lečhála wókȟikipȟeya osní k’uŋ hé ečhúŋhaŋ, oyáte eyá theȟíya škáŋpi na, léčhel wakíksuye [mayápiča] owáglake-he ečhúŋhaŋ uŋčíšiwaye kiŋ thiáwaŋyaŋg-uŋšípi naíŋš thiyúslohaŋpi waŋ líla čík’ala čha él čháŋ čhóla uŋkóthipi na wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ čhuwítapi-wačhíŋ šni čha iyówiŋuŋyaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "While there was a dangerous cold spell recently, some people acted badly, and while I was talking about [a memory], my mother-in-law asked us to watch over her house or we lived in a small trailer home without any wood and the kids were trying to not freeze so we were willing to do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglála él oyáte kiŋ ptáyečaške thiólol yaŋkápi čha hél onáuŋkipȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was the rented housing for the people at Pine Ridge together, so we ran in there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tókheȟči osní éyaš, húŋȟ mnišá opȟétȟuŋpi kta čha, thiíyaza wawíyopȟekhiya ománipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was snowing really bad, but some people would buy wine, so they walked around selling some from house to house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ešéš líla úŋšikapi s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=761;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anyways, it was like they were really miserable."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=761;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p762> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋhépi kiŋ ópta šna tȟaŋkál hótȟaŋiŋpi naíŋš, tuktél honískosko kičhízapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=762;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p762> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They often spoke outside throughout the night, or they fought and were noisy somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=762;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p763> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋȟ iyótaŋš čhaŋksáyuha kiŋ nawíčhakipȟapi na thikátoto šni thiónapȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=763;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p763> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some even fled from the police and they took shelter in the house without knocking on the door."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=763;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋl ȟtayétu waŋ él, sémni núm theȟíya tókhiyataŋhaŋ itómni glihúŋnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=764;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One time in the evening, two young drunk men came back here bad from somewhere else."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=764;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiyópa kiŋ paǧáŋ yeyápi na uŋmá thiókaslohaŋ gliȟáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=765;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They threw the door open and one of them fell into the door breaking it open."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=765;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená wáŋčagna ištíŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=766;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he fell asleep on the floor immediately."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=766;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋmá kiŋ kačégčeg hiyáyiŋ na, oákaŋyaŋke waŋ él kaót’iŋs iyútakiŋ na, íŋš-eyá ištíŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=767;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The other one suddenly reeled away, and he sat down firmly on the chair, and he fell asleep, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=767;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p768> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhuwíta t’ápi éyaš šlokhíyapi níš s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=768;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p768> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They froze to death but it’s like they melted."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=768;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p769> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu kiŋ álata šna wawíyopȟekiye kiŋ ománipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=769;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p769> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They usually walked around selling things all day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=769;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p770> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku kakhéš haŋkéya wíyopȟeye-wačhíŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=770;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p770> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They eventually tried to sell anything at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=770;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟaló yukpáŋpi na aǧúyapi kȟó wíyopȟeyapi čha waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=771;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I saw them selling hamburger meat and bread too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=771;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋȟ íŋš mnišá opȟétȟuŋ yačhíŋpi čha awíchabla owákihi kte kiŋ imáyuŋȟ hípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=772;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of you all wanted to buy wine so they came up to me asking me about me being able to take them there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=772;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičáwala šni yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋzégzekapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=773;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I refused and so they got angry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=773;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená líla osní k’uŋ héhaŋ waŋyáŋg uŋyáŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=774;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When it was really cold we sat seeing these things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=774;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ watóhaŋl hokšíla tȟokápȟa kiŋ leyé, “até, tákuwe níš mnišá latké šni he?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=775;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one time my oldest son said, “dad, why don’t you drink wine?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=775;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhela ablág mahíŋgle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=776;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that and so all of a sudden I went quiet."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=776;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wablátke šni kiŋ hé uŋ imáǧuŋǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I was proud since I don’t drink."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóiyukčaŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s something to think about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Oglála Lakȟóta kiŋ éna uŋkíčhizapi čha, akhé wašíčuŋ waŋ Roger Tellinghuisen ečíyapi čha hená waŋyáŋkiŋ na, wáŋčagna iȟát’iŋ kte séča nážiŋ hiyáhiŋ na, ahítȟauŋkpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays Oglala Lakota people fight between each other back there, so a white man named Roger Tellinghuisen saw them again, and all of the sudden he came and stood up there maybe laughing, and he came and attacked us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé wašíčuŋ kiŋ toháŋtaŋ léčhiya hípi heháŋtaŋ, uŋkásote-wačhíŋpi s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again, ever since white people came to this area, it has been like they have been trying to eliminate us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makȟóčhe kiŋ wakȟáŋ uŋkílapi k’uŋ hé é čha Mílahaŋska kiŋ amáuŋnuŋpi na aŋpétu leháŋyaŋ naháŋȟči anáȟmala škáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They stole that land which it was that they asked us its sacred powers, and they’ve acted secretly since this point in time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ tókheȟči uŋpážužu-wačhíŋpi éyaš, ohítikapi na, ksápapi na, wačhíŋtȟaŋkapi uŋ, naháŋȟči ní uŋk’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They tried very hard to erase Lakota people, but we lived on, because they were courageous, smart, and patient."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuŋ óta táku waŋ éktuŋžapi naíŋš ablézapi šni naíŋš átaš iyúkčaŋpi šni séče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many white people forgot something, or they didn’t realize it, or they didn’t think about it at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyéna okíčhize tȟáŋka čháŋna Lakȟóta hokšíla kiŋ wašíčuŋ kiŋ ób šna zuyá éyayiŋ na óta t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Every time there was a big battle, many Lakota boys have left to war with white people and many have died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku uŋ héčhuŋpi kiŋ hé lé é kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is the reason why they do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ épi na Mílahaŋska kiŋ waníyetu óta kičhízapi na haŋkéya wólakȟota waŋ uŋ [kisota] kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were the Lakota and Americans that fought each other for many years, and eventually it went away with a peace treaty."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ Lakȟóta kiŋ heháŋyela Mílahaŋska kiŋ wičhákhizapi kte šni kéyapi na heháŋtaŋ héčhel úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then Lakota people said that they wouldn’t fight Americans again and they’ve lived like that since then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuŋ húŋȟ íŋš aŋpétu leháŋyaŋ héčhena tȟóka uŋyáŋpi naháŋ, anákiȟmaŋpi khéš, léčheča čháŋna, hená tȟaŋíŋ hiŋglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some white people go with us as enemies up to this day and whenever they hide that fact, whenever things are like this, they suddenly show it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wólakȟota kiŋ atȟáŋuŋg theȟíya wé kpapsúŋyaŋ kigléǧapi k’uŋ hé ečhá tákuni šni s’e kpažúžu-wačhíŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They try to annul the peace treaties achieved through horrifically spilling blood on both sides on purpose, as if they were nothing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakáŋ kiŋ hená slolyápi čhaŋké hótȟaŋiŋpi éyaš tuwéni anáwičhaǧoptaŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The elders know those things, and so they are talking, but nobody is listening to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tellinghuisen ečíyapi kiŋ lé líla waúŋspe na ksápa igláwa čhaŋké, íŋš-eyá táku uŋkéyapi éyaš, naȟ’úŋ kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=792;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The one who’s called Tellinghuisen considers himself very educated and smart, and so we tell him things, but he won’t listen to it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=792;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p793> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčheȟči Tellinghuisen kiŋ lé makȟókašpe uŋkítȟawapi kiŋ él ígle yuŋkȟáŋ tókheškhe eháŋni akíčhita itȟáŋčhaŋ eyá wičháweksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=793;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p793> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tellinghuisen opposes our reservations just like this and so somehow I am reminded of some army leaders from way back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=793;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p794> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋží Chivington ečíyapi-ka na uŋmá kiŋ íŋš Custer ečíyapi-ka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=794;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p794> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One was called something like Chivington and the other was called something like Custer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=794;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p795> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nuphíŋ Lakȟóta wičhákasote-wačhíŋpi-ka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=795;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p795> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They both tried to do something like eliminating Lakota people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=795;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p797> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ eháŋni wakáŋ kiŋ líla wičhágluonihaŋpi čhaŋké wawáhokuŋkhiyapi čháŋna táku káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=797;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p797> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people really respected elders a long time ago and so whenever they gave advice on things, they made something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=797;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋblí Ȟóta okȟólakičhiye waŋ leháŋl íŋyaŋke yuŋkȟáŋ, etáŋ wakáŋ eyá hiyúpi na, itȟáŋčhaŋkhiyapi Maȟpíya Máza tȟaówoglake kiŋ ób wahókuŋwičhakhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=798;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays Grey Eagle Society is ran, and so some elders come from it, and they gave some advice to Paul Iron Cloud, who they elected as president."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=798;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé waŋná héčhetu yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl él núŋǧe wičháyuzapi naíŋš wačhíŋkȟopi kta héči hená naháŋȟči waŋúŋyaŋkapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=799;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Things are like that, and so then we will still see if they will listen to them or if they will pout."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=799;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p800> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá wóȟiŋyaŋ čháŋna, hé waŋná itȟáŋčhaŋ ikíphi šni čha, ayúštaŋpi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=800;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p800> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that whenever someone pouted because they were dissatisfied, they weren’t fit to be leader, so they quit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=800;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni nakúŋ ečéla wówičhakhiyakapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=801;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago they didn’t just talk about them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=801;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟó wičháglasaksakapi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said they also whipped them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋyeža s’e tuwé waŋ wanáȟ’uŋ šni čha ičápsiŋte iyágleyapi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Someone didn’t listen to people like a child so they say that they whipped them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá wačhíŋkȟo eháŋtaŋš takómniš ičínuŋpa íŋyaŋke kiŋ oyáte kiŋ čhažé k’úpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If someone was pouting, the people will surely vote for someone running for the second time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p805> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋȟ íŋš wayúonihaŋpi na, wakáŋ kiŋ tȟawóiye nawíčhaȟ’uŋpi s’eléčheča k’uŋ hená íŋš philáič’iyapi kte na, isáŋm oyáte íŋš-eyá ówičhakiyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=805;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p805> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some are respectful, and those who look like they hear the elders’ words will do themselves a favor, and they will help the people more too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=805;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p806> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maȟpíya Máza tȟoká íyotake k’uŋ héhaŋ wačháŋteognakiŋ na oyáte kiŋ ób ówaŋžila s’e wówaši ečhúŋ na tȟokátakiya phiyá uŋkíyapi kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=806;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p806> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When Paul Iron Cloud was first running, he was generous and he said that he would work together with the people into the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=806;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p807> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé naháŋȟči wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=807;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p807> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I still remember those words."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=807;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p808> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhel škáŋpi éyaš takómni awáŋyaŋg wičháwakhuwa kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=808;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p808> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They move however but I will definitely follow them with my eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=808;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p810> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟúŋpi heháŋtaŋ, Makȟá Sáŋ oyáŋke hél waúŋ na hél imáčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=810;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p810> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Since I was born, I have lived here in White Clay district and I grew up here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=810;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p811> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Takómni hél wathí na waŋná mičhíŋča eyá íŋš-eyá ičháǧapi na lé íŋš-eyá hetáŋhaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=811;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p811> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I definitely live here and now some of my children grew up here too and they are from there too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=811;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná waníyetu wikčémna tób henámakeča na hetáŋ waníyetu yámni akíčhita waúŋ na akhé waníyetu yámni Ȟé Sápa kiŋ égna, Hočhápȟe eyápi héčhiya, wóuŋspe waŋkátuya wabláwa naháŋ waníyetu núŋp ská wičháša ób wathí na iyéčhiŋka íŋyaŋke aphíyapi waúŋspemič’ičhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=812;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now I’m fourty years old and I was a soldier for three years and I studied for three years in the Black Hills, at Spearfish, at college, and I lived with white people for two years, and I learned about car repair."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=812;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p813> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, Oglála Oyáŋke él líla tȟéhaŋl čhiyéwičhawaye kiŋ épi na misúŋkala kiŋ wawókiyapi na oyáte tȟawókičhuŋze iyóȟogya nawíčhakižiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=813;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p813> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well, my older brothers, being at Pine Ridge for a long time, and my younger brother, they help people, and they defend them through the tribal government."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=813;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p814> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš-eyá aŋpétu waŋ él wawókiye-wačháŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=814;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p814> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I tried to help one day, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=814;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta thiwáhe tȟáŋka čha ówaŋžila uŋk’úŋpi kéčhaŋmi yuŋkȟáŋ átaš héčhetu šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=815;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I thought that it was a really big family so we lived together and so things aren’t like that at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=815;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sápa Úŋ owáčhekiye owáyawa waŋ él imáčhaǧa čhaŋké héčheȟči wíblukčaŋ s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=816;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I grew up in a Catholic Church school and so it feels like I thought things just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=816;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p817> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Agná tȟéhaŋl owákaȟniǧe šni čha tuktél blé-ka nuŋ kȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=817;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p817> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Moreover I didn’t understand it far away so I had no idea what to do."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=817;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p818> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte eyá tókheša makhípažiŋ s’e [táku ke éyaš] etáŋ paȟéyab mayúzapi s’eléča éyaš tákuwe héčhuŋpi kiŋ slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=818;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p818> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like some people held me away from anything like they held a grudge against me before long but I didn’t know why they did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=818;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p819> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tákuniš uŋ héčhuŋpi kta waníče, čhíŋ tákuni šiča ečhámuŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=819;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p819> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was no reason why they should do that, because I didn’t do anything bad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=819;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p820> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho iwáŋblakiŋ na, kpasíkel waúŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, haŋkéya takúku yuákaŋl ičú waú na, haŋkéya owákaȟniǧe yuŋkȟáŋ, waŋná léčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=820;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p820> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I looked into it, and I researched it, and so finally I brought it to light, and finally I understood it, now things are like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=820;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni Tȟatȟáŋka Íyotaka-ka Uŋčí Makȟóčhe kiŋ héčhetkiya nakípȟapi k’uŋ eháŋ Mní Waníča ečíyapi waŋ thiyóšpaye kiŋ áta éna Oglála kiŋ ób t’íŋ kta ič’íčhuŋziŋ na éna iglóniča kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=821;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago back when Sitting Bull and them fled into Canada, someone named No Water promised to die with the all of the Oglala thiyóšpaye back there and they say he insisted on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=821;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé waŋná héčhetu na, owákpamni kiŋ éna híyotakiŋ na, waŋná wičháyawapi yuŋkȟáŋ, Mní Waníča tȟóyate kiŋ kȟó Oglála owá éwičhagnakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=822;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Things were like that, and he came and stayed at the agency, and then they counted them in a census, and so they wrote down the names of No Water’s band of Oglala people, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=822;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lená eháŋni héčhetu na hená slolyé šni imáčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=823;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So things were like that back then and I grew up without knowing those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=823;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha [ohaŋhehaŋš] Oglála migláwa-ke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I kind of consider myself [fully] Oglala."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naš líla wawókiyiŋ kte ȟčiŋ waškáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I go around really trying to help people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tuwéweka waŋná Oglála él mačhíŋpi šni škáŋpi kiŋ ótȟaŋiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s clear that certain people go around not wanting me in Oglala."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená Oglála ȟča igláwapi na héčhel škáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They consider themselves really Oglala and they move around like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lemátaŋhaŋ šni kéyapi na tákuni iyómawaža šni kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=828;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that I’m not from here and they say that it’s none of my business."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=828;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p829> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋží iyótaŋš Oglála él áta išnála wičháša kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=829;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p829> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One man said that he was the only man in Oglala."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=829;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku-ke kiŋ, hé išnála táku ke éyaš iyówaža na, išnála táku ke éyaš íŋyaŋgkhiyiŋ kta iyéčheča kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=830;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The kind of thing, he was the only one with any concern with it, and he said that he would run whatever it was on his own."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=830;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená tuwépi kiŋ čhažé wičháblatiŋ kte éyaš, Sápa Úŋ kiŋ waúŋšilapi waŋ yuhá ičháȟmayaŋpi čha, héčhel owákihi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=831;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I would name who these people are, but the Catholics raised me to have compassion, so I can’t do it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=831;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p832> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éšeš wóčhekiye wakáǧa čháŋna, wičháweksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=832;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p832> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anyways, whenever I pray, I remember them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=832;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p833> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ wičhábluȟeyapȟa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=833;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p833> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I keep my distance from them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=833;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p834> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhetuke éyaš tȟokátakiya takómni uŋyáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=834;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p834> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whatever happens we definitely go on forward."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=834;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p835> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋkókičhiyusiŋkapi na, onáblel uŋkíčhiyapi naíŋš, očhíŋuŋwaštepi na, napé uŋkíyuzapi éyaš, takómni tȟokátakiya uŋyáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=835;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p835> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We hold grudges against each other, and we can go to each other, or we can be easy-going, and we can take our hands, but we definitely walk forward."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=835;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglála él ptáyela oyáte óta híyotakapi yuŋkȟáŋ, lená íŋš-eyá thiléhaŋl úŋpi kéyapi na, héčhel owíčhakhuwapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=836;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The people come and sit down together in Oglala, and so they say that they are outsiders, and they treat them like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=836;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p837> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená iblúkčaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, leyá-haŋpi kiŋ lená wičákȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=837;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p837> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I think those things, and so they are right in what they are saying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=837;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p838> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá taŋyékel iyápi šni éyaš héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=838;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p838> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they don’t speak well but things are like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=838;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p839> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Miyéčuȟčikel othíwota waŋ ektá wakíyutakiŋ kta čha míčiškaŋ čhíčičhiŋpe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=839;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p839> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As for myself I will go back to the old camp grounds so I wish for you all to be active for me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=839;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p840> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš niyépi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=840;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p840> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But that is up to you all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=840;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p841> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčha uŋ Oglála kiŋ čhašúŋtȟuŋpi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=841;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p841> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For this reason they call us Oglala."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=841;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p842> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éna makȟá ité okíčičala uŋk’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=842;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p842> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We live throwing dirt in each other’s faces back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=842;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p843> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá kitáŋla owáŋyaŋg šíče éyaš, ičhíŋ héčhetu na, etáŋ takúŋl uŋkúŋspepi kta waŋ yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=843;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p843> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s a bit ugly but it’s true and we should learn something from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=843;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu kitéčhiŋyaŋ šákpe henámakeča k’uŋ héhaŋ otȟókaheya waŋná owáyawa waŋ ektá éiȟpemayaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When I was barely six years old, they first dropped me off at a school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wéksuye-ke čiŋ, átaš wašíčuŋiyapi waŋžíni uŋmáspe šni ka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As I remember it, I didn’t learn one bit of English."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá wičhóiye nuŋblála owákaȟniǧe kiŋ hená, “háŋ,” eyápi na uŋmá kiŋ, “hiyá,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The twowords that I did understand were, “yes,” and the other was, “no.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ hiŋyéte waŋkáyewakiya čháŋna, hé takúŋl owákaȟniǧe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever I raised my shoulders, I didn’t understand something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta iyá ičháȟmayaŋpi čha héčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They raised me in Lakota so it was like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owáyawa kiŋ hél Lakȟóta uŋkíyapi kte šni wasúuŋkhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They made it so that we couldn’t speak Lakota there at school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ watóhaŋl Lakȟóta iwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so around that time I spoke Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha íyašlalmayaŋpi na makásaksakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they caught me doing something against the rules and they whipped me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhel tónakhigle awákhipȟa čha líla iyómakiphi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This happened to me several times so I was very sad about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p854> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu wikčémna wahéčhetuya wabláwa naháŋ haŋkéya ináwakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=854;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p854> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I went to school there when I was about ten and finally I quit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=854;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahéhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ Lakȟóta wičhóiye óta éwaktuŋže."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=855;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Around that time I forgot a lot of Lakota words."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=855;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl theȟíke s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seems like things are really difficult nowadays."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuŋ na Lakȟóta iwáye éyaš, nuphíŋ yat’íŋsya iwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I learned English and Lakota, but I don’t speak either carefully."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóiȟake s’eléčheča éyaš Lakȟóta iyápi owápi kiŋ lé lečhála uŋmáspe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seems like it’s a joke but I just recently learned about Lakota writing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lečhála kȟolá Reggie Cedar Face ečhá léčheȟči wóglaka yuŋkȟáŋ wáŋčagna óweháŋhaŋ wóyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recently my friend Reggie Cedar Face naturally said something just like this and so instantly he told something funny."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheȟči hokšíla waŋ owáyawa waŋ él í yuŋkȟáŋ ȟléte waŋ él hí na wašíčuŋiya, “mayákhiza yačhíŋ hwo?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A boy went to a school just like this and so a careless kid came up to him and said, “you wanna fight?” in English."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla kiŋ iš’óš’oya “háŋ,” eyá čha išta osábya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The boy enthusiastically said, “yes,” so it’s said he painted his eye black [gave him a black eye]."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hokšíla kiŋ thiyáta khí na ogláka čha atkúku kiŋ léčhel iwáhoya kéye, “akhé él nihí na tág eníčiye k’éyaš, ‘hiyá,’ eyá yo.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the boy got back home and he told it so his father warned him, “if he approaches you again and says something to you, then say ‘no.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla kiŋ waŋná owáyawa él khí yuŋkȟáŋ akhé ȟléte waŋ hé él hí na ȟčeháŋl, “heháŋyela kta hwo?” eyá čha iš’óš’oya, “hiyá!” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ eyášna šni háŋni kaúŋka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The boy came back to school then and so the careless kid came up to him again and just then he said, “will you have had enough?” so he enthousiastically said, “no!” and so he knocked him down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Takómni kȟolá Reggie é čha héčhe akhípȟa éyaš él amáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was definitely Reggie who experienced that but he blamed me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ óta na iyúha oyáte iwáštepi kta čha uŋ hená íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are many Lakota traditions and all of them wwill serve a good purpose for the people so they take place."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl wičhóičhaǧe kiŋ oúŋ núŋpakiya maúŋnipi čha theȟíke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Us, the generations nowadays, we walk in two ways of life so it’s difficult."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lená é naháŋ ská wičháša tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ kiŋ nuphíŋyaŋ aŋpétu iyóhila íčhiženayaŋ naíŋš uŋmá tȟógtȟog úŋ-waúŋčhiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Every day we try to take turns with both those Lakota traditions and the white traditions or we try to live confused."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋl tuwá oítȟaŋčhaŋ ič’íčhuwa na óhiye háŋtaŋš hél yuǧátiŋ na wóič’ičhuŋze waŋ káǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If somebody runs for office and wins, they swear and take an oath."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé waŋná ská wičháša tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ kiŋ nawíčhakičižiŋ kta čha héčhuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they will have defended white people’s traditions so they do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó létu čha eyášna íčhiženayaŋ šna uŋkíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it is here that we often speak mixed-up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ thiwáhe naíŋš, thiyóšpaye eyá thitákuyepi wičhágluonihaŋpi waŋ líla š’agyá íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota traditions go on very strongly with respect towards family, thiyóšpaye, or relatives."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wašté éyaš toháŋl ská wičháša tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ kiŋ ektá mahél iyáye čháŋna, áta oyáte kiŋ okíčhiyusiŋka na, kičhízapi na, haŋkéya šna onáblekičhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is good, but whenever white people’s traditions are put into it, all the people hold grudges against each other, and they fight each other, and eventually they often scatter around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ská wičháša tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ kiŋ lé iyóȟlate, tuwé ke éyaš akhílehaŋyaŋ wóiyowaža yuhápi yuŋkȟáŋ íŋš-eyá hé wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Under the white man’s tradition [constitutional system], everybody has the same rights and so that’s good, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟól ikčéya [el?] tuwé waŋ thítakuye kiŋ ečéla wóiyowaža yuhápi na hená ečéla tȟokáheya wičhágluzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Only someone who is a relative has rights in traditional Lakota ways and they hold only them in the highest esteem"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená uŋkókaȟniǧapi eháŋtaŋ, ečéla oyáte kiŋ tȟokátakiya ówaŋžila uŋyáŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If we understand those things, then we the people will go together into the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oéčhuŋ wašté kéčhaŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I think that it’s easy to do."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋše iwáŋblaka-he éyaš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I just have been examening it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Inágna leyápi čha óta akhígle nawáȟ’uŋ, “toháŋl oyáte tȟomníčiye waŋ íŋyaŋkiŋ na él ómapȟa eháŋtaŋš takómni mithítakuye waníčape ló.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say this here and there so I heard it many times, “if a tribal council meeting is taking place and I’m part of it, I definitely don’t have any relatives."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oítȟaŋčhaŋ yuhápi k’uŋ hená léčhel okhíkaȟniǧapi ní."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I wish for the people who hold public office to understand this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wakáŋ waŋží wóglake eháŋtaŋ, taŋyáŋ anáǧoptaŋ yo,” toháŋtaŋ kiŋ léčhel oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“If an elder speaks, listen closely,” they’ve told it like this since the beginning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá héčhel eyápi na wanáuŋȟ’uŋpi-ka čha, uŋkíyapi na wóglakapi čháŋna, él nakpá eyála s’e uŋyáŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say it like that and we sort of listen, so whenever we go and we talk, we sat like we were nothing but ears."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Otȟókahe kiŋ él lé wašté s’eléčheča éyaš óta wičhóiye kiŋ lená taŋyékel naúŋȟ’uŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This seemed to be good at first, but many of us didn’t listen closely to these words."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋglúšnapi kiŋ óta na akhé lél uŋglúšnapi waŋ tȟaŋíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We had a lot of mistakes and one of our mistakes appears again here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéča-ke čiŋ leháŋl tȟogyé uŋkíčhaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays us young people have grown up differently."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl wakáŋ kiŋ wičhísaŋmya waslól’uŋyaŋpi na líla iúŋwašičuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays we know more than our elders and we’re really rambunctious."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl ská wičháša tȟawóuŋspe waŋ etáŋhaŋ čha héuŋčhečapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays it is from white people’s education so we are like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl wakáŋ waŋží wóiyaksape káǧe eháŋtaŋ anáuŋǧoptaŋpi éyaš táku-ke k’uŋ hená uŋkáblezapi šni ée, haŋkékela uŋkíwaštepi kta waŋ hená ečél uŋkíčupi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then we listen to an elder from their advice given, but instead of us not understanding those sort of things, we take only those things that are portions of it that benefit us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl iyótaŋ wakáŋ kiŋ tuktéktel [iwíčhaȟaȟapi] čha waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then sometimes I’ve seen the elders laugh at them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lená wóiyaksape kiŋ uŋyúhapi na thiyóšpaye uŋkítȟawapi tókhel oyáte él tȟokáheya nážiŋpi kta waŋ ogná [uŋk’úŋpi]."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we have these pieces of advice and somehow our thiyóšpaye or people live using them to have them be in first place for things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhel wóiyaksape naíŋš eháŋni wóyakapi k’uŋ hená yutȟókeča uŋkáupi na waŋná Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ hená tuktógna tȟaŋíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We continue to change these pieces of advice or the old stories, and then somehow Lakota traditions aren’t clear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá čha wičákȟiŋ kta tȟaŋíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s not clear that somebody is speaking the truth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčheča éyaš ečháŋleš él étuŋwe šni anákičhigwag uŋk’úŋpi – oíyokšilyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nevertheless, on the contary, we live criticizing each other, not looking towards it – sadly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "MaLákȟota kte ȟčiŋ waŋ hé waŋná theȟíke s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seems that it’s hard now to try to be a Lakota person."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówiyuŋǧe óta bluhá [s’élye] tuktél yé-ka nuŋ kȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seems like I have a lot of questions not knowing what to do with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówiyuŋǧe waŋžíla wikčémnakiya wawímuŋǧe eháŋtaŋš, wóayupte kiŋ wikčémna naháŋ, hená iyúha íčhitȟokeča kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If I ask one question in ten different places, there are ten responses, and they will all be different."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá waŋná tuktógna čhaŋté iyómakiphi eháŋtaŋš hél ogná kta waŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it will be however my heart likes it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Okíčhize waŋ Vietnam eyápi čha ektá hokšíla óta zuyá aí na óta glípi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many boys went to the vietnam war and many didn’t return."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé okíčhize kiŋ líla háŋske na tȟókeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This war was a really long and different."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p902> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Glípi k’uŋ hená aŋpétu leháŋyaŋ kakížapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=902;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p902> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those who came back suffer up to this day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=902;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p903> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte eyá nawíčhakižiŋpi k’uŋ hená okhíkaȟniǧapi šni čha Lakȟóta hokšíla kiŋ onúniyaŋ k’él úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=903;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p903> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some people don’t understand the people who defended them so the boys live lost."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=903;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p904> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akíčhita kiŋ lená iyúha thiyáta ȟči glípi šni háŋni, na waŋná gliyúweǧapi na, Mílahaŋska Tȟamákȟočhe ektá glípi waŋ héhaŋ, waéwičhakiyapi na úŋtȟuŋwičhayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=904;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p904> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Before all the soldiers returned to their homes, and then they crossed back across the ocean, and when they got back to the United States, they said things to them and hurt them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=904;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Thíwičhakte heníčhape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said, “you’re a murderer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíčala na oyáte eyá tákuni oníwažapi šni škȟá ektá yaípi na wičháyaktepe ló,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You had no interest with any of those people or children, but you all got there and you killed them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akíčhita kiŋ húŋȟ iyótaŋš naȟmá awíčhaglipi waéyapi k’uŋ hená ináȟmewičhakhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some soldiers really came back hiding to hide from the protestors."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl iyótaŋ Mílahaŋska oyáte kiŋ áta tȟogmúŋšniyaŋ škáŋpi – héhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then back then the American people acted really inappropriately."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋkéya enána kičhíktepi, owáyawa waŋkátuya waŋ Kent State eyápi čha él."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eventually they killed each other here and there, at a university called Kent State."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ thiyáta glípi ektá íŋš lená akíčhita kiŋ owíčhakaȟniǧapi šni čha, óta wayátkaŋpi wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lé onákipȟapi na, héčhel ináȟmeyakel úŋpi na, óta mázaǧaǧeča aónawičhatȟakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they didn’t understand those soldiers who returned home, so they retreated into this habit of drinking, and they hid like that in a way, and they locked up many of them in jail."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋȟči hokšílapi éyaš, wičháša tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ waŋ iníla iyápi na, ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were still boys, but they left silently and did it without complaints."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla oȟ’áŋkȟoya kiwíčhašapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They became men very quickly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óta awíčhapȟapi na eyá tákuni šni s’e owíčhakhuwapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They beat many of them and so they treated them as if they were nothing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená wičháša kiŋ akíčhita wóohiye owé tónakeča k’uŋ hená iyúha kiníl óhiyapi na glípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These men won almost all of the several types of awards there are and they came back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená épi cha waŋná inágna nážiŋžiŋ hiyápi na hótȟaŋiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They are these ones who are standing up and speaking out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ akíčhita kiŋ lé waŋží slolyápi eháŋtaŋš, gluónihaŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If the people know one of these soldiers, honor them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel líla philáyakhiyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all should really thank them like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋȟči húŋȟ ináȟma yaúŋpi k’uŋ hená léčhel wónaȟ’uŋ waŋ čhičíyuhape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I write this message to some of those of you who are still hiding out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Nišnála šni yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“You aren’t alone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyúkčaŋ na waŋná kú wo.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Think about it and come home now.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta na wašíčuŋ kiŋ tuktétu ke éyaš ówaŋžila wówaši ečhúŋpi khéš takómni Lakȟóta kiŋ čónalapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people and white people work together everywhere but there are definitely fewer Lakota people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčheča čháŋna waékičhiyapi na okíčhiyušičapi yukȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever things are like this, they talk about each other and they get angry at each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋ awábleze kiŋ hé, wašíčuŋ kiŋ Lakȟóta taŋyékel owíčhakaȟniǧapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Something that I’m realizing, white people don’t understand Lakota people very well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuŋ kiŋ toháŋtaŋ ičháǧapi kiŋ hé tókhel íŋš-eyá uŋspépi čha tȟawóiyukčaŋpi kiŋ íŋš-eyá hél ognáyaŋ iyápi na íŋš-eyá sáŋm čhiŋčápi kiŋ uŋspéwičhakhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ever since white people have been raised, somehow they learn things too, so they go along with those ideas too, and they teach more of them to their children, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čiŋ héhaŋ wašíčuŋ na Lakȟóta kiŋ otȟókaheyeya átakičhiyapi čha taŋyékel okíčhičaȟniǧapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Since white people and Lakota people met each other for the first time, they didn’t understand each other very well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuŋ líla óta leyápi, “Lakȟóta kiŋ iyúha wí iyóhila mázaska ičúpi čha wówaši ečhúŋpi šni otúyačhiŋ úŋpi.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many white people said, “All Lakota people get a check every month so they sit around for no reason not working."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋtaŋ imáčhaǧe kiŋ lé wówaši ečhámuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve worked ever since I was being raised."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Atéwaye kiŋ héčhel uŋspémakhiya čha eyášna hená wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My father taught me like that so I often remember those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Homákšila héhaŋni wówaši ečhúpi uŋmáspe ičhíŋ, até na iná wí iyóhila mázaska ičúpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ever since I was a boy, I learned to work, because my father and mother didn’t get money every month."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tohátaŋ kiŋ waúŋȟpaničapi s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like we were poor from the beginning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nebraska ektá aŋpétu kiŋ álata šna pȟeží pȟaȟtápi tȟoúŋkšupi na bloúŋpahipi naíŋš maȟ’úŋkašlapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In Nebraska we baled hay every day, and we picked potatoes, or we hoed the fields."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋl wíyawapi iyóhila šna thiwáhe óta šna watȟókšu tȟáŋka uŋkópaot’iŋzapi našná Colorado-takiya šna uŋkákhiyaglapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At some point, they stuffed many families into semi-trucks every weekend and usually we left to go back to Colorado."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhiya toháŋyaŋ wí tȟaŋíŋ heháŋyaŋ omníča uŋpáhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So there we picked beans for as long as the sun was visible."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Híŋhaŋniȟči šna áŋpó wičháȟpi kiŋ naháŋȟči tȟaŋíŋyaŋ yaŋké wahéhaŋl šna, até mayúȟiča khéš wékta owákihi šni čháŋna, owíŋža makhí na, yukíkta ímagnake s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At around the time that the morning star was still visible, usually my dad woke me up, whenever I couldn’t wake up, he took the cover away from me, and he would pull me up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla osní čha čhéya nuŋs’é wówaši éyaye kiŋ él ómapȟa s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was really cold, so I joined the work crews almost crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíčažužu uŋkíkikčupi čháŋna waúŋyawapi k’uŋ hená hayápi opȟéuŋkitȟúŋpi na héčhiyataŋ ptaŋyétu čháŋ wayáwa uŋglípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever we got our pay, those of us who went to school bought our own clothes, and whenever it was around spring, we went back to school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wéksuye-ke čiŋ, wáŋčala mázaska wí iyóhila ičúpi ómapȟa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As I remember it, I was of the first to receive money once a month."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋčála iwáču na iyómakiphi [gni] čha ablúštaŋ na watóhaŋl wówaši waŋ iyéwaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I took it one time, and I was happy with it, so I cancelled them, and at some point I found a job."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhamuŋ k’uŋ héhaŋ óta wimátkotkoka kéčhiŋpi éyaš takómni hé imáwašte kte šni slolwáya čha ée wówaši iwágni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When I did that, many thought that I was crazy, but I know that that one definitely wouldn’t do me well, so instead I looked for a job."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta tuktél nišnála wašíčuŋ óhaŋ wówaši ečhánuŋpi ečhíŋ waúspewičhakhiye-wačhíŋ po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All you Lakota people who work somewhere alone among white people, the way things are, try to educate them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuŋ óta wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ okáȟniǧapi šni éyaš nake wawíyuŋǧapi kte kiŋ hé kȟó kȟókipȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many white people don’t undešstand the tšaditions but now they are afraid to ask questions, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ eyá theȟíya makhúwapi wáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Look at these women giving me a bad time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋ k’éya!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s ridiculous!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ogná iyé óweháŋhaŋpi séče éyaš, miyé imášteče-ke s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe they were joking around but it was like I was kind of embarrassed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Leháŋl wakȟáŋyeža na, wíŋyaŋ na, wakáŋ kiŋ épi čha oyáte nawíčhakižiŋpi,” eyé waŋží."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One said, “nowadays it’s the kids, women, and elders that are defending the people.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋmá kiŋ íŋš iȟát’iŋ na leyé, “akíčhita waníčapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Another one laughed and said, “there are no warriors."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋ tókhel iyápi he?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Where did the men go?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyápi na, áta iȟá áptaŋpi na, aíkpažužupi čha, líla úŋšiya namíč’ižiŋ na, óweháŋhaŋ wóyakapi waŋ obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said that, and they rolled over laughing, and they were unrestrained, so I humbly defended myself, and I told a funny story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakpápte s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It felt like I survived it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éšeš miyé íyatayela tókȟa šni ičhíŋ, wablátke šni na, thiwáhe waŋ bluhá éyaš, waéyapi kiŋ hé wóiyukčaŋ tȟáŋka héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anyways, for me it doesn’t matter personally, because I don’t drink, and I have a family, but there is an important truth behind what they said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl thiwáhe waŋ uŋ sutáya naúŋžiŋpi na, uŋkíčhaǧapi kta yuŋkȟáŋ, wayátkaŋpi waŋ uŋ Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ uŋkóžužuwahaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays we should stand strong and grow according to family concepts, and so the Lakota people have fallen to pieces due to drinking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Oglála kiŋ theȟíya uŋhínažiŋpi čha, áta khiwítayapi tȟáŋka waŋží waŋblákiŋ kta kéčhaŋmi yuŋkȟáŋ, oíyokšiča waŋ eháŋ tȟaŋíč’iye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays we Oglala have gotten to a hard time, so I thought that I would see a great unity, and so then saddening things have shown themselves."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋȟči kitáŋla maȟléteka čha theȟíka oȟ’áŋ mišnála khéš úŋšiwaȟ’aŋ kta wóinapȟeke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve still been a little careless, so I may bad things on my own, but it’s dangerous for me to act hopelessly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋše čhignáyaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m just kidding."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš akhé iyúkčaŋpi yetȟó!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ okȟólakičhiye waŋží ómapȟa kte éyaš mawíŋyaŋ šni na wamákȟaŋyeža šni na naháŋȟči homákšila čha tuktél wahíyayiŋ kta tȟaŋíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I would join a woman’s society, but I’m not a woman, and I’m not a child, and I’m still a boy, so it’s not clear where I would go by."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hehe!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gosh!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta akíčhita na wičháša kiŋ tókhiyab iyápi hwo?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Where have the Lakota warriors and men gone to?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p962> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni wóyakapi waŋ leháŋl léčhel šna oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=962;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p962> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays they usually tell an old story like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=962;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p963> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka núŋp wakhúl ománipi yuŋkȟáŋ, wíŋyaŋ waŋ líla wašté čha átayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=963;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p963> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Two young men walked along hunting, and so they came across a very pretty woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=963;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wíŋyaŋ kiŋháŋ ptehíŋčala čhaŋnúŋpa waŋ Lakȟóta kiŋ úŋ nípi kta čha wičhákahi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=964;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This woman brought the buffalo calf pipe to Lakota people for them to live."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=964;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka kiŋ uŋmá šilwíyukčaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ op’ó waŋ waŋkátaŋhaŋ ahíŋȟpayiŋ na huhú kiŋ ečéla iȟéya škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=965;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One of the young boys thought bad things, and so a cloud of smoke fell over him and he was left as just bones."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=965;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké kȟoškálaka uŋmá kiŋ íŋyaŋg khihúŋni na oyáte wičháyuwita."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=966;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the other young man ran back home and he called the people together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=966;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ tókhel ečhúŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, nípi kte kiŋ yúsyus iwáhowičhayiŋ naháŋ, akhé khiglá škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=967;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She told Lakota people what to do, and so she warned them very thoroughly, and she left back again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=967;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíyaŋ kiŋ lé waŋná khiglé k’uŋ héhaŋ, šóta čha, holyéla híŋ na, kaškíyaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=968;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When this woman then left back, there was smoke, so she stood in the grey smoke, and it cleared up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=968;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p969> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Ptesáŋ Wiŋ akȟókiya íŋyaŋka kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=969;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p969> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that a Buffalo Calf Woman ran away in the other direction."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=969;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p970> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ waŋ wóyake k’uŋ óta éyaš, etáŋ waŋžíla itȟó iwówaglakiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=970;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p970> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The woman said many things, but from them I guess I will talk about just one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=970;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p971> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé léčhel eyá kéyapi, “tuwé waŋ waŋná táku čhíŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, čhaŋnúpa kiŋ lé yuwákȟaŋyaŋ yuhá čhékiye kiŋ iyéčhetu kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=971;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p971> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say it like this, “then someone wants something, and so they should pray in a sacred way with this pipe."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=971;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuwáktaya ečhúŋpi šni kiŋ wayáȟtanipi kte.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=972;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all will cause terrible hardships by not doing it carefully."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=972;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lél tuwé čha kakížapi kte kiŋ taŋyékel oyákapi šni éyaš, leyápi, “nithítakuye kiŋ ípi čha, héktakiya aníhiŋȟpayapi kte ló.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=973;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So here they say that someone will suffer from it, but they say, “your relatives will get here, so it will fall back on you [you will suffer because of it].”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=973;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋl iŋšé wičhóičhaǧe kiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ líla ečhúŋpi kiŋ hé tuwé waŋ išnála naíŋš thiwáhe tȟáwa kiŋ iwáštepi kta uŋ šna čhékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=974;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At that time they prayed so that the mass of people doing that tradition would benefit someone all alone or their family from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=974;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p975> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋnúŋpa wakȟáŋ kiŋ yuhá oínikaǧe él yápi naíŋš, yuwípi káǧapi na, awáčhekičhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=975;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p975> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They went with the sacred pipe to sweat, or they did yuwípi, and they prayed over each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=975;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p976> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óta wókamna waŋ gnúnipi čhíŋpi šni čha, uŋ šna čhékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=976;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p976> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many don’t want to lose a job, so they pray using it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=976;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p977> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhetu čháŋna, tuwé eyá iyótiyekiya wóanapte káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=977;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p977> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever it’s like this, they pray for an end to hard suffering."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=977;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p978> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená iyé waúŋšilapi čha, šičáya waéčhuŋpi kiŋ lená wóčhekiye waštéšte wičhákičaǧapi na, wóableze čhiŋwíčhakhiyapi héčhel aŋpétu waŋ él čhaŋtéwaštepi na, íŋš-eyá iyókiphipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=978;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p978> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These people are compassionate, so they make good prayers for those who do bad things, and they are nice by wanting them to have understanding like this one day, and they will be happy, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=978;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená epȟíŋ kte šni éyaš, takómni léčhel uŋk’úŋpi na, hená héčhetu šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=979;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I wouldn’t say these things, but we are definitely living like this, and it isn’t right."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=979;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhel waépȟa yuŋkȟáŋ ogná héčheȟči etáŋ wóableze wašté waŋží hiyú kte kiŋháŋ tȟokáta wičhóuŋčhaǧe kiŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi kte séče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I say things like this, and so when a good understanding comes from something like this, maybe the future generations will live well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáheȟči."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟaŋháŋši Irving Tail waéya yuŋkȟáŋ héčhetu s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My cousin Irving Tail says some things and so it seems like things are like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Leháŋl íŋyaŋ eyá inágnagna wókiksuye uŋ pawóslal églepi,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “nowadays they are erecting monuments from time to time.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Héčhuŋ-haŋpi kiŋ waŋží ȟči lowáŋ wičháša naíŋš wačhí wičháša kiŋ lená wičhákiksuyapi kiŋ wašte kte.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“It would be good for one of the people doing that to remember the singers or the dancers.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyúha kiníl t’ápi éyaš, naháŋȟči olówaŋ na Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lená íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Almost all of them have died, but these songs and traditions still go on."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená héčhuŋpi šni kiŋ hená uŋgnúnipi-ka načhéče.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Them not doing that might have lost us those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leyá yuŋkȟáŋ iŋšé-ka Oglála Oyáŋke kiŋ hél wawéksuye, éyaščhiŋ hemátaŋhaŋ čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I remember things being this way just on Pine Ridge, of course with me being from there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éšeš oyáŋke tȟáŋka kiŋ lé ópta líla ótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anyways there are a whole lot of people across the big reservation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl hél áta okíčhisya kél otúyačhiŋ čhiŋyáŋkel uŋk’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays we live on wanting to fight each other there for no good reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni omákiyakapi na, wónawizi waŋ uŋ héčheča kéyapi éyaš, čhet’úŋwagla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They told me something a long time ago, and it was like that with jealousy, but I doubted that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéni héčhel wíyukčaŋ okíhi šni képȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said that nobody could think like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yus’óla s’e waŋná héčheča kiŋ awábleze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I realize that it’s like that now with great difficulty."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni hél oyáte kiŋ úŋšikičhilapi načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "People in the old times might have had compassion for each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lowáŋ wičháša eyá wičháweksuya yuŋkȟáŋ, lená épi: Joe One Feather, Harry Jumping Bull, atéwaye kiŋ, Steven Star Comes Out."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I remember some singers, and so those ones are Joe One Feather, Harry Jumping Bull, and my father, Steven Star Comes Out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená Lakȟóta lowáŋpi čha waŋwíčhablakiŋ na nawíčhawaȟ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve seen and heard those Lakota singers"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni wónawizi na wókhipažiŋ kiŋ lená íŋyaŋke séče, eyášičhiŋ slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago maybe jealousy and hatred, but of course I don’t know that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená wičháša kiŋ oíyokiphi káǧapi s’a čha, hečéla wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=998;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those men often made people happy, so I only remember that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=998;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl hé wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ mahíyagle yuŋkȟáŋ, líla oíyokišiče walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays I’m afflicted by that action jealousy and hatred, and so I consider it saddening."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl héčhuŋ-haŋpi kiŋ lená tákuni uŋ makhípažiŋpi kta waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays those who are doing that have nothing to dislike me for."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tákuni uŋ anámawizipi kta waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they have nothing to be jealous of me for."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháže wičháblate kiŋ lená oyáte tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ kiŋ uŋ wičháyuwitapi na, héčhel wičhákiksuyapi kta walá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those people that I’ve named have gathered the people together using the old customs, and I consider them memorable for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟaŋháŋši Irving waéye kiŋ hé iwéčiyawašte na, tuktél ȟčiŋ íŋyaŋ waŋží wókiksuye uŋ pawóslal iyéyapi kiŋ lená epȟíŋ na, nakúŋ óta leháŋl wičháweksuye šni k’uŋ hená čhážepi kiŋháŋ patȟókaheya yewíčhawayiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I praise Cousin Irving’s suggestion, and I say that with them raising a memorial stone wherever, and also I will push forward those whose names I didn’t remember."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówiyuŋǧe waŋ leyápi čha nawaȟ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve heard them say a question like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókhiyataŋhaŋ yahí hwo?” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say, “where are you from?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lé táku kȟápi kiŋ léčhel awábleze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I realize that they mean something like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Oglála oyáte kiŋ othéȟika waŋ él uŋhíhuŋnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays Oglala people have arrived here at a difficult time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ókšaŋ étuŋwe šni ečéla kičhípažiŋpi na, anákičhiwizipi na, sáŋm okíčhiyusiŋkapi na, tuktéktel napé akíčhipahapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They oppose each other just not paying attention, and they are jealous of each other, and they hold grudges against each other, and sometimes they threaten each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoháŋ ókšaŋ wašíčuŋ eyá tȟóka uŋyáŋpi na, natáŋ hiyúpi kta čha, wíŋyeya nážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Meanwhile, enemy groups of white people go around and they will charge here so they stand ready."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóakhiniče waŋ oyáte kiŋ uŋ [paléhaŋl] kičhíyuzapi kiŋ hé lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A disagreement with the people is the thing pushing them apart from each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ éna okíčhyusiŋkapi uŋ oíč’ihipi okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people can’t take care of themselves with these grudges held against each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mílahaŋska oyáte kiŋ íŋš-eyá wawóyusiŋkapi kiŋ lé yuhá mánipi éyaš, čhíŋpi šni kiŋ tȟaŋíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The American people walk along with grudges, too, but it is clear that they don’t want it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena húŋȟ wawóyusiŋkapi éyaš, wóopȟe kakséya héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of them are still prejudiced, but they are doing that breaking the law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ íŋš yámnikiya nážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people stand in three different ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ožúla Lakȟótapi na haŋké Lakȟótapi k’uŋ hená okíčhiyusiŋkapi kiŋ lé él oyátȟakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "People who are full Lakota and part Lakota are stuck holding grudges against each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Isáŋm Lakȟóta kiŋ húŋȟ Oglála igláwapi na, Šahíyela na Húŋkpapȟa eyá lél híyotakapi k’uŋ hená owíčhayuškapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1017;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some Lakota consider themselves more Oglala than someone else, and they turn loose on those who settled as Cheyenne people or as Húŋkpapȟa."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1017;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta eyá [paléhaŋl] wičháyuzapi kiŋ hél ómapȟa yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1018;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am in the group of some Lakota that have been pushed away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1018;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋkpapȟa hemáčha kéyapi na omáyusiŋkapi na [paléhaŋl] mayúzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1019;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that I’m Húŋkpapȟa, and they hold a grudge against me, and they push me away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1019;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1020> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éšeš tákuni iyómawaža šni kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1020;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1020> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anyways, they say I don’t have any rights to anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1020;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1021;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s how it is."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1021;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni tȟuŋkášilawaye kiŋ ožúla Húŋkpapȟa héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1022;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One of my old grandfathers was completely Húŋkpapȟa."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1022;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mni Čhóla ečíyapi čha Oglála kiŋ ób t’íŋ kta ič’íčhuŋziŋ na, lená iglóniče, waŋná Tȟatȟáŋka Íyotaka-ka Uŋčí Makȟóčhe kiŋ hétkiya iyáyiŋ k’uŋ héhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1023;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The one who was named No Water promised to die with Oglala people, and when Sitting Bull went back to Canada, he refused [to go]."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1023;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na waŋná makíyutapi k’uŋ héhaŋ, Oglála owá ígnakapi na, makȟóčhe kȟó k’úpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1024;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then during the Allotment Act, they recorded him as Oglala, and they gave him land too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1024;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1025> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Oglála na Húŋkpapȟa wé haŋkéke emátaŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1025;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1025> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays I’m part Oglala and part Húŋkpapȟa by blood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1025;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋké Lakȟóta naíŋš, Iyéska ewíčhakiyapi eyá, nakúŋ [paléhaŋl] wičháyuzapi éyaš, iyéš líla ótapi čha, naíč’ižiŋpi na, leháŋl Oglála oyáŋke iyókhise héčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1026;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those who are part Lakota, or “interpreters,” they also push them away, but there are many of them, so they defend themselves, and nowadays they’re half of Oglala people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1026;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itȟó lená iyúha tuktétaŋhaŋ uŋkúpi naíŋš, uŋhípi k’uŋ héhaŋ, [icegce] uŋkpásipi yuŋkȟáŋ, wóableze waŋ líla wašté čha etáŋ waŋúŋyaŋkapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1027;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I guess when we all were coming from somewhere, or came from somewhere, we could research it, and so we would see some good understanding from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1027;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyúha Oglála Lakȟóta heúŋčhape ló epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1028;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I say that we all are Oglala Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1028;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟótapi kiŋ lé tókhel tȟawáčhiŋpi čha kȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1029;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Being Lakota is meant by a state of mind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1029;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1030> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟehíŋ kiŋ uŋháŋskapi naíŋš ištá kiŋ uŋsábsapapi kiŋ hená é šni yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1030;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1030> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is not having long hair or having black eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1030;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1031> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl theȟíyakel uŋhínažiŋpi éyaš ȟaŋȟáŋ uŋhíŋglapi na wawóyusiŋke šni ptayéčaska uŋkhínažiŋpi kta waŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1031;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1031> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays we have come upon a somewhat difficult time, but sores have come upon us suddenly, and we have tp recpver together by not holding grudges against each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1031;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ iyúha Oglála Lakȟóta heúŋčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1032;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so we all are Oglala Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1032;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówiyukčaŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1033;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is something to think about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1033;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1034;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1034;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟó Nasúla miyé ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1035;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m Bear Brain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1035;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni Lakȟóta kiŋ óweháŋhaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1037;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Old-time Lakota people joked around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1037;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líglila kičhíyuškehaŋpi khéš, tuwéni čhaŋzéke šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1038;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever they really teased each other, nobody got mad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1038;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋ uŋ héčhel úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1039;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There is a reason why they lived like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1039;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lená táku kȟápi čha héčhel ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that refering to these Lakota traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋká lowáŋpi čháŋna, waŋná táku kȟápi čha léčhel owákaȟniǧe yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever they have someone as a huŋká, I understand what they mean to do."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋká eyápi kiŋ lé tȟuŋkášilawičhuŋyaŋpi hená sáŋm tȟuŋkášilawičhayapi k’uŋ hená épi čha wičhákȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋká refers to what were our grandfathers’ grandfathers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho leháŋl wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lé eyášna wówakkiniče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1043;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays there is often an argument over this tradition."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1043;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hóȟ, léčhel ečhúŋpi kta škȟá, hená ipáyeȟ ečhúŋpe ló,” eyápi s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They often say, “absolutely not, they are supposed to do it like this, they’re doing it wrong.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš hé tókȟa šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But that’s not a big deal."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečhéȟči kiŋ hé lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is that thing that is really it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ gluhá mánipi, eyá sipȟákašešepi éyaš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They walk along with this tradition, even if they stumble."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lé áwičakȟeyakel ečhúŋpi čháŋna, waŋná hetáŋ tȟokátakiya kičhíyuonihaŋyaŋ mánipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever they do this tradition honerably, then from there they walk forward with respect for each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nithítakuye eyá tókhel oyáuŋye k’uŋ héčhel waŋná huŋkániyaŋpi hetáŋ wičháyečiluha kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You will hold some of your relatives live in a certain way akin to that from them being your huŋká."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíyaka waŋ wakȟáŋ čha wakȟáŋyeža waŋ tȟapȟéhiŋ kiŋ él iyáyečičaške kiŋ hé waŋná nithíwahe kiŋ hél yuthímahel iyáču héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You pull into your family a child to whom’s hair you attach a sacred feather."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé waŋná Lakȟóta wóopȟe héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is now a Lakota law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéni hé glaksíŋ kte šni héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nobody should break that one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá héčhuŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, iyé čha išnála kakížiŋ kte na, sáŋm Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ tȟaŋkál iȟpéye kiŋ iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Someonedoes that, and so it is them who will suffer, and throws Lakota traditions outside in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ leháŋl wakáŋ kiŋ huŋkáwičhayapi čháŋna, eyášna leyápi, “wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ othéȟika čha mahíyagle yeló.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1054;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, nowadays, whenever they make the elders huŋká, they say, “a difficult traditions had befallen me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1054;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋȟ eyášna čhéyapi ičhíŋ, eyé okhíkaȟniǧapi čhaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1055;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some often cry, because they understand it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1055;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho óweháŋhaŋ kiŋ lé íŋš-eyá wóopȟe čha etáŋhaŋ ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1056;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So things being joked about come from a law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1056;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1057> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋ tȟaŋháŋkičhiyapi čháŋna hé wóopȟe waŋ aíkȟoyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1057;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1057> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever men take each other as brothers-in-law, the law is complied with."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1057;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1058> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟaŋháŋkičhiyapi kiŋ hená kičhíyuškehaŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, tókheškhe oyáte kiŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1058;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1058> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The people who take each other as brothers-in-law tease each other, and so the people live well like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1058;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1059> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ hé otúyačhiŋ šni yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1059;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1059> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That tradition isn’t to be taken lightly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1059;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1060> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóopȟe kiŋ hená líla óta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1060;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1060> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are a lot of those traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1060;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1061> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wiwóȟapi na wičháwoȟapi k’uŋ hená tókhel ophíič’iyapi kta waŋ yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1061;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1061> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Daughers-in-law and sons-in-law must behave in a set out way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1061;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1062> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhówe k’uŋ hená íŋš-eyá tókhel úŋpi kta čha wóopȟe yukȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1062;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1062> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are rules of how siblings should live, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1062;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl ská wičháša kiŋ otȟúŋwahe waŋ él ptáyečaska yaŋkápi kiŋ hél íŋš-eyá wóopȟe eyá owápi na otȟákipȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1063;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays white people who are together in a city write laws down and they follow them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1063;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta wóopȟe kiŋ lená ée owápi šni čha óta okhíuŋkaȟniǧapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1064;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Instead they didn’t write down Lakota laws so many people don’t understand them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1064;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyákaȟniǧapi k’uŋ hená, wawíyopȟeye šni iyéš, čhaŋlwášteya waúŋspewičhayakhiyapi kiŋ wašté kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1065;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It would be good that those who understand those things, instead of scolding us, they teach us things nicely."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1065;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1066> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1066;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1066> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1066;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟó Nasúla miyé yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1067;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am Bear Brain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1067;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1069> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhinaš Oglála oyáte kiŋ khiwítayapi kta kéčhaŋmi yuŋkȟáŋ, átaš tuwéni ítokȟa šni s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1069;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1069> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was wrong in thinking that Oglala people would gather together, and so it seems like nobody cares."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1069;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1070> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Suŋkáwaye kiŋ eháŋni léčhel eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, hé wéksuye, “takúŋl líla othéȟika waŋží uŋgnáhela uŋhíyaglepi eháŋtaŋ, šéčela ptáyečaska uŋkhínažiŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1070;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1070> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My younger brother said it like this a while ago, and so I remember, he said, “if really tough things suddenly happen to us, we would recover together against it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1070;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1071> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ská wičháša kiŋ Lakȟóta iglúhapi kiŋ lé wičhákhi-wačhíŋpi kiŋ líla š’agyá khiwítayapi kte,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1071;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1071> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We would unite together strongly with white people trying to take away Lakota tribal sovereignty."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1071;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1072> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá yuŋkȟáŋ, iblúkčaŋ naháŋ, míš-eyá héčhetuwala."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1072;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1072> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that, and so I thought about it, and I am in agreement with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1072;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1073> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho, waŋyáŋka yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1073;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1073> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, look out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1073;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1074> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋ ke k’uŋ hé waŋná uŋhíyaglepi yuŋkȟáŋ, tuwéni ítokȟa šni s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1074;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1074> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Something like that is happening ot us, and so it seems like nobody cares."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1074;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1075> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéniš él iwáčhiŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1075;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1075> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I don’t ask anything from anyone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1075;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla iyómakšiče ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m very sad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ oíyokšiča waŋ waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because I see something to be sad about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lečhála tuwé eyá él hótȟaŋiŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ mayúblihečapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recently some people have spoken out against it and so they’re encouraging me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglála kiŋ tȟokáheya šna táku ke éyaš él škáŋpi naíŋš ečhúŋpi-ka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglala people often acted on everything first or they did it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Sičháŋǧu othéȟika waŋ hiyáglepi yuŋkȟáŋ, tȟokáheya nážiŋpi na, š’agyákel wóglakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays bad things are happening to Sičháŋǧu people, and so they stand first, and they talk about things strongly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá hená ohítikape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of them are courageous."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglála oítȟaŋčhaŋ kiŋ íŋš iyáyapi na, ówičhakiyapi yuŋkȟáŋ, taŋyáŋ s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oglala leaders have left, and they helped them, and so it seems like it’s going well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mílahaŋska oyáte kiŋ táku ke éyaš kiŋ uŋkáupi éyaš Lakȟól wóčhekiye kiŋ hé uŋkhípi okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "American people are taking everything from us, but they can’t take our Lakota beliefs from us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éčuȟčikel wóčhekiye kiŋ lé gluhá uŋkhínažiŋpi uŋkókihipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At any rate, we can defend the prayer that we have."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na akhéš ok’ókiŋ kte eháŋtaŋš, ok’ókiŋ kte tókheni ȟ’aŋphíča šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if there will be trouble again, nothing can eb done about the trouble."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwé eyá léčhuŋpi k’uŋ hená ečéla lé inážiŋkhiyapi okíhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Only the people who are doing it can stop it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟó Nasúla miyé yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am Bear Brain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóȟ’aŋ šíča waŋ oyáte kiŋ theȟíya uŋkhúwapi éyaš iníhaŋšni uŋglóničapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A bad habit chases us, the people, in a difficult way, but we carelessly refuse to leave it be."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ thitákuye naíŋš kȟoláwičhayapi tȟokáhewičhákiyapi kiŋ hé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That habit is relatives or friends going first [nepotism]."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl tuktétu ke éyaš wókamna íŋyaŋke eháŋtaŋš él lé nakúŋ š’agyá íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays if there is a job going on, this [nepotism] goes on strongly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oítȟaŋčhaŋ kiŋ tȟakȟólaku naíŋš thitákuyepi k’uŋ hená wókamna waŋ hená iyóžula éwičhakignakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The leaders fill those jobs with their friends or their relatives."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuktéktel thiwáhe waŋží naíŋš otákuye k’uŋ hená iyúha šna átaya wówaši ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sometimes a family or all their relatives all work."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená oyáte tȟamázaska éyaš, tȟáwaič’iyapi na héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is the people’s money, but they claim it for themselves and they do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Oglála oyáŋke kiŋ hél owáyawa waŋ háŋ yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná waníyetu óta wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lé íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays on Pine Ridge there is a school, and so now for many years this custom is going on there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná onážužuwičhawayiŋ kte s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so now it feels like they’re making them fall apart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóopȟe eyá yaŋké éyaš, thitákuye thewíčhakiȟilapi uŋ hená iyé tókhel iwáštepi kta waŋ ogná yuktáŋpi na ečhél, oyáte tȟawóiyowaža wičhákhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are rules, but they bend them through them somehow benefiting the relatives that they love until they rob the people of their rights."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčheča čháŋna, thiwáhe waŋ ečéla iwáštepi na, oyáte kiŋ íŋš haŋkéyaš ítokȟapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever it is like this, they benefit only the family, and eventually the people don’t care."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhel íŋyaŋkapi kiŋ lená oyáte kiŋ wičháyuhuŋkapišni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those who run things weaken the people like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owáyawa waŋ wakȟáŋyeža eyá waúspewičhakhiyapi kta čha nažíŋ yuŋkȟáŋ haŋkéya éktuŋžapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A school exists to teach some children, and so they forget that eventually."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋksáyuha eyá wawókiyapi na awáŋyaŋkapi kta yuŋkȟáŋ hená haŋkéya éktuŋžapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some police officers would serve people and protect them and so eventually they forget those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ lená isáŋm tȟokákičhiyapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They don’t put the people further ahead."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena yuŋkȟáŋ, mázaska waŋ ečéla ayúhel úŋpi na táku kiŋ hená otúyačhiŋ íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is like that, and so they live waiting on just money, and things go along for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá wíčažužu ičúpi na héčhegla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They take a pay and that is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋl šna tuwá taŋyáŋ ečhúŋ-wačhíŋ khéš [tonawicakiptanpi] na líla oȟ’áŋkȟoya wówaši etáŋ éȟpewičhayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sometimes whenever someone tries to do something well, they railroad them and they throw them away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokáta aŋpétu waŋží él oyáte kiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lé yuónihaŋkel gluhápi kta waŋ wičháwakičhiŋ yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One day in the future, I want the people to have some sort of respect for this tradition."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thitákuye kȟolápila thewíčhakiȟilapi kiŋ hé wašté éyaš, óta saŋm iyéič’iyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1108;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is good that they love their relatives and friends, but they overtoo it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1108;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nithítakuye nitȟákȟola tȟokáhewičhayayapi na, wóopȟe khiyákaksapi kiŋ hená iyépi čha ečéla inážiŋyakhiyapi oyákihipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all put your relatives and friends first, and it is you all who break the law so only you are able to stop it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ištániǧuŋǧapi šni čhaŋké ókšaŋkšaŋ étuŋwaŋpi na waúŋšila po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all aren’t blind and so look around and be compassionate."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waúŋšilapi kiŋ hé tȟuŋkášila wóyuha čha uŋk’úpe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is a gift from Grandfather for us to have compassion."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Othéȟike-ka waŋ uŋhíyaglepe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hard times have befallen us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟó Nasúla miyé yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m Bear Brain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋpi kiŋ oyáte kiŋ čhaŋté él wičhágluzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Old-time Chiefs held the people in their hearts."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waúŋšilapi na oyáte kiŋ tȟokáhewičhayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were compassionate and they put the people first."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl hená iyé išnála tȟakȟólakupi ób tȟokáheič’iyapi na, oyáte kiŋ woyáptapi hiŋȟpéuŋyaŋkhiyapi čha, íŋš uŋmá-ke čiŋ hená owéuŋkičhizapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays it’s them alone that they put ahead first with their friends, and they throw what’s left over to the people, so they fight over those other things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ eyá wičhúŋglaȟniǧapi čha, hená ksápapi na, wóuŋspe gluhápi na, tȟaŋčháŋ kȟó kič’úŋyaŋ oyáte kiŋ wičháglutitaŋpi na, táku waštépi kta čha hená él škáŋpi-ka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We chose some of our leaders, so they were wise, and they had an education, and they pulled the people with their own bodies, and they were involved in things that were good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ húŋȟ taŋyékel wablézapi šni čha, kaǧíšnišniyaŋ waéyapi éyaš, héčhena wóič’ičhuŋze káǧapi k’uŋ hená gluhá nážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of the people didn’t notice those things, so they spoke without thinking, but they still stood up for that promise that they made."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl hená él úŋpi šni na íŋš waŋná wakáŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ oyáte kiŋ theȟíya uŋk’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays they aren’t around, and now they’re older, and so we, the people, we’re living hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená wičháša kiŋ itȟáŋčhaŋ wašté héčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were good leaders."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokátakiya tuŋwéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They scouted into the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ská wičháša na Lakȟóta tȟawóopȟe hená ohólapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They respect white people’s and Lakota people’s laws."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Makȟá Saŋ oyáŋke kiŋ él itȟáŋčhaŋ wičhúŋyuhapi kiŋ óta oyáte kiŋ tȟawíčhoȟ’aŋ na tȟawóiyowaža k’uŋ hená wičhákhipi na tȟogmúŋšniyaŋ wičhóškaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays, at White Clay district, many of those that we have as leaders take traditions and rights away from the people, and they misbehave in general."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokáhe kiŋ hé hená oítȟaŋčhaŋ éič’ignakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They appointed themselves as leaders at first."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla zomípi na agná lílakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There were really shrewd and moreover they were good at it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lená íŋš itȟáŋčhaŋ šíča héčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They are bad leaders."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte wičhágnapi na tȟamázaskapi kiŋ ičúpi na aíglusotapi éyaš nakúŋ lílakapi čhaŋké tuwéni anáwičhapta okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They set the people to the side, and they took their money, and they use it on themselves, but they are good at it, and so nobody can stop them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ óta iyókiphipi šni éyaš, tókhel háŋpi kte kiŋ tuwéni slolyé šni čha, itȟáŋčhaŋ šíča kiŋ lená áta tákuni kȟokípȟe šni aíkpažužupi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A lot of people aren’t happy, but nobody knows how they will be, so the bad leaders make fools of themselves not being afraid of anything at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éšeš oyáte kiŋ éna kičhíš uŋkíyapi na, iyé oháŋhaŋhaŋš čhaŋlí yugmúpi tȟáŋka ióyagmigmiya yaŋkápi na, iȟát’a-haŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anyways, we, the people, go with them back there, and they sit there rolling up their big cigars, and they are laughing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lél hékta Pȟeží Šá Yahínapȟa Wí k’uŋ héhaŋ, waŋná hená wičháyutȟokčapi kta tkȟá tuwéni él íwičhatuŋwe šni čha, lehúŋhuŋniyaŋ yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This past April they were supposed to change them, but nobody paid attention to that, so they’ve sat in that position up to this day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháčhaže iyóȟpeyapi wičhóȟ’aŋ waŋ hél yaŋké éyaš, leháŋl yaŋkápi kiŋ hená anáȟmapi na, oítȟaŋčhaŋ akšíš yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is an election tradition, but nowadays they hide that they’re sitting there [on council], and they’re refusing to give it up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ lená waŋyáŋg ičháȟyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The children grow up seeing these things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówiyuŋǧe waŋ uŋkáyuptapi kte kiŋ lé é, “íŋš-eyá tȟokáta héčheȟči úŋpi kta he?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The questions we will ask ourselves is this, “will they live in that way in the future?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟó Nasúla miyé yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am Bear Brain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyapaha wówaši ečhámuŋ k’uŋ héhaŋtaŋ, nakpá kiŋ líla matȟáŋkiŋyaŋ čha, omáwani s’a kiŋ ičhúŋhaŋ, iyápi óta nawáȟ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ever since I’ve been working as a reporter, my ears have been really big, so while I walk around, I hear many things being said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho wakáŋ kiŋ épi na tȟéča kiŋ nuphíŋyaŋ táku waŋ él hótȟaŋiŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ lé é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they are both the elders and the younger ones who speak about about something, and so this is it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakáŋ kiŋ tuktél úŋpi k’éyaš, kakížapi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The elders live somewhere, but they say that they suffer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyúha kiníŋl mázaska wí íyohila ičúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Almost all of them get money every month."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ éna tȟakóžakpakupi naíŋš čhiŋčápi kiŋ mázaska wičhákhipi naíŋš, awíčhayusotapi naíŋš, wóyute atȟébwičhayapi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so their grandchildren or their children take their money from them, or they use it up, or they say that they eat their food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakáŋ kiŋ óta wí iyóhila wákhipȟapi kiŋ hená iyókiphipi šni čha wóglakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many elders who experience that every month aren’t happy, so they talk on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéča kiŋ íŋš héčheȟči naȟ’úŋpi na, čhaŋzékapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The younger ones hear it just like that, and they get angry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčheȟči Lakȟóta kiŋ uŋkóuŋyaŋpi čha, waŋná wóopȟe sutá waŋ uŋkáigluhapai."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We live just like this, so now we have for ourselves a hard law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakáŋ kiŋ waŋná onáič’ižiŋ yuhápi na, wíŋyaŋ eyá apȟá šna wičhákhuwapi k’uŋ hená nakúŋ onáič’ižiŋ wičhákiuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now the elders have a way to defend themselves, and some of the women that are beaten regularly have something to use against them to defend themselves."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéča eyá ničháŋzegzekapi k’uŋ hená wóopȟe kiŋ hé uŋspéič’ičhiyapi na uŋ wakáŋ kiŋ épi na wíŋyaŋ eyá okáileleya úŋpi k’uŋ hená owíčhakiyapi oyákihipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of you young people who are angry learn the law, and you all can help the elders and women who had been beaten."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá takómni waŋná očháŋku waŋ uŋkíč’ičhaǧapi čha ogná manúŋhipi kta waŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we built a path ourselves, so we need to walk along it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟó Nasúla miyé yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I am Bear Brain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋl Iktómi ománi yuŋkȟáŋ, pahá waŋ alí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At one point, Iktómi was walking around, and so he climbed up a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋmá ečhíyataŋhaŋ Íya waŋ waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He saw an Íya on the other side of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé Iktó heyé, “haúŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “gosh!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makté kte sél?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I wonder if he’s going to kill me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nihíŋčiye éyaš, Íya kiŋ ektá yíŋ na, heyé, “hó misúŋ, naíŋš čhiyé, tókhiya lá hwo?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was scared, but the Íya was going to him, and he said, “hey little brother, or big brother, where are you going?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya kiŋ ayúpte šni čha, Iktó heháŋl heyé, “misúŋ, naíŋš čhiyé, tóhaŋ nitȟúŋpi hwo?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The Íya didn’t respond, so then Iktó said, “little brother, or big brother, when were you born?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Íya, “maȟpíya na makȟá kiŋ káǧapi k’uŋ héhaŋ matȟúŋpe ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Íya said, “I was born when they made the sky and the earth.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktó léčhel ayúpte, “wáŋ, witkóla!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó responded like this, saying, “gosh, that’s wild!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maȟpíya na makȟá kiŋ miyé wakáǧe ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1192;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was me who made the sky and the earth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1192;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1193> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čhiyémayaye ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1193;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1193> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So you’re my little brother.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1193;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1194> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl Iktó, “hó misúŋ, tákuwe omáyani hwo?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ Íya, “kákhiya oyáte waŋ wičhóthi čha ektá blé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1194;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1194> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then Iktó said, “well, little brother, why are you walking along?” and so Íya said, “there’s a people living in a village over there so I’m going to it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1194;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená wičháwatiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1195;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m going to eat them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1195;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “wašté yeló, misúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1196;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “that sounds good, little brother."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1196;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš-eyá héčhiya blá čha, nuphíŋ uŋyíŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1197;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was going there too, so let’s go together.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1197;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1198> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ektá yápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1198;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1198> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they went there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1198;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1199> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóthi kiŋ khiyéla ihúŋnipi yuŋkȟáŋ, Íya líla yuǧó kéyiŋ na, ištíŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1199;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1199> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They arrived near the campsite, and so it’s said that Íya was really tired, and he slept."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1199;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktó í kiŋ él waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó looked into his mouth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ thezí mahél oyáte óta waŋwíčhayaŋke, hená Íya tȟebwíčhaya čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he saw lots of people in his stomach, Íya had eaten them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1202> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyókiphiya škátapi na, wačhípi na, lowáŋpi, na Íya thezí kiŋ imáhel úŋpi kiŋ slolyápi šni s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1202;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1202> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They played happily, and they danced, and they sang, and it was like they didn’t know that they were living inside Íya’s stomach."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1202;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1203> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná Iktó líla nihíŋčiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1203;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1203> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now Iktó was really scared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1203;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Iktó hekíye, “misúŋ, takúku kȟoyákipȟa hwo?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “ȟláȟla kaȟlápi na čháŋčheǧa apȟápi na hiŋháŋ hotȟúŋpi naháŋ akíš’api kiŋ kȟowákipȟe ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1206;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And Iktó said, “little brother, are you scared of things?” and so he said, “I’m scared of shaking rattles, and beaten drums, and owl hooting, and people yelling.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1206;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “wáŋ misúŋ, hená iyúha míš-eyá kȟowákipȟe ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “gosh, little brother, I’m scared of all those things, too!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Oháŋ, misúŋ, lél yaŋká yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Okay, little brother, sit here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóthi ekta mníŋ na, thípi waŋ čhokáta hé kiŋ hé ektá waí na, waglíhuŋni kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ll go to the campsite, and I will go there to the center of the campsite, and I’ll come back here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl nuphíŋ ektá uŋyíŋ na, oyáte kiŋ iyúha wičhúŋyutiŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then both of us will go, and you and I will eat up all the people!” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Íya “Oháŋ!” eyíŋ na akhé ištíŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Íya said, “okay!” and he went to sleep again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hetáŋhaŋ Iktó áta íŋyaŋkiŋ na, wičhóthi ektá ihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ, líla páŋ, “Oyáte, anáǧoptaŋ po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó really ran from there, and he arrived to the village, and so he yelled out, “People, listen up!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Namáȟ’uŋ po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Listen to me!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya waŋ wókȟokpȟeka čha ú weló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There is a really terrifying Íya that is coming!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na takúku kȟokípȟe kiŋ omákiyake: Ȟláȟla na, čháŋčheǧa na, hiŋháŋ hotȟúŋpi na, akíš’api kȟokípȟa kéye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He told me the things that he’s scared of: he said he’s scared of rattles, and drums, and owl hoots, and people yelling."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ináȟni iglúwiŋyeya po!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So get ready quick!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé: “Na ištíŋma čha í kiŋ mahél waŋbláka yuŋkȟáŋ, imáhel oyáte tȟáŋka úŋpe ló!” eyá čha, líla ináȟni iglúwiŋyeyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “and he was sleeping, so I looked into his mouth, and so a large band of people were living inside!” so they really hurried up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl Iktó iyáyiŋ na, tuktél Íya kiŋ ištíŋma ȟpáye kiŋ ektá khihúŋni, na yukíkta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then Iktó left, and he arrived back where Íya had been lying down sleeping, and he woke him up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáhelaka oyáte kiŋ áta ȟláȟla kaȟlápi na, hiŋháŋ hotȟúŋpi na, čháŋčheǧa apȟápi na, akíš’api."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Suddenly all the people shook their rattles, and hooted like owls, and they beat their drums, and they gave off war-whoops."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya kiŋ woslá íyotake éyaš, oyáte kiŋ áta natáŋ úpi na, kat’ápi na ečhél ktépi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya sat up real quick, but all the people came charging, and they beat him uncouncious until they killed him"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl thezí kiŋ waȟléčapi na, yuǧáŋpi na, oyáte líla óta Íya thezí etáŋhaŋ glinápȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they tore open his stomach, and they opened it, and a whole lot of people came out of Íya’s stomach."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu waŋ átaya héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that all day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ líla oíyokiphi tȟáŋka, na hetáŋhaŋ oyáte líla óta yukȟáŋpi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were really happy, and from then on there have been a lot of people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi wíŋyaŋ waŋ líla wíŋyaŋ wašté čha yúze, na kičhí úŋ, na líla taŋyáŋ thípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi had taken a really beautiful woman, and he lived with her, and they live well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ watóhaŋl, aŋpétu waŋ él, Iktó thiyáta glí na, líla iyókphi šni s’eléčheča"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> ".And so once, one day, Iktó came back home, and it seemed like he was really unhappy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iníla yaŋkíŋ na líla tȟašóše."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He sat quietly and spat about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟawíču kiŋ níhiŋčiyiŋ na líla ayúta"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> ".So his wife was worried and she really looked at him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leyé, “Tókȟa he?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said, “what’s wrong?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyónikphi šni he?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ ayúpte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aren’t you sad?” she said, and so he didn’t answer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla čhaŋtéšiče s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seemed like he was really sad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ nakéš Iktó, “Huŋhuŋhé, onáyaȟ’uŋ šni itéke,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so finally Iktó said, “goodness, it’s like you didn’t hear about it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟawíču kiŋ iyúŋǧe, yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Wičháša kiŋ iyúha kȟúŋku ob zuyá yápi kte héčha kéyapi čha othéȟike ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So his wife asked him, and so she said, “They said that all men have to go on the warpath with their mother-in-law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhe tȟawíču kiŋ, “Oháŋ čha nikȟúŋ tȟokáhe kičhí níŋ kta he?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his wife said, “okay, so are you going to go with your first mother-in-law?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó čhíŋ šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said he didn’t want that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha “nikȟúŋ ičínuŋpa kiŋ íŋš tók?” eyá čha, “Wáŋ éya, áta heyópuza načhéče!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she said, “what about your second mother-in-law?” so “absolutely not, she might be good for nothing!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl “Nikȟúŋ tȟéča ȟče kiŋ kičhí lá yačhíŋ he?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ Iktómi áta iníla yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then she said, “do you want to go with your youngest mother-in-law?” and so Iktómi sat silently."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ líla ȟ’aŋhíya heyé, “Hóȟ…Eyá…Oháŋ!” eyé"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> ". It was a long while and so he said really slowly, “ugh… well… okay!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná kȟúŋku tȟéča ȟče kiŋ kičhí zuyá iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then he went on the warpath with his youngest mother-in-law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé áta líla wíŋyaŋ wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she was a really beautiful woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla tȟéhaŋ glípi šni na etáŋhaŋ waníyetu óta yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhela tuwé waŋ, “Iktó waná kú weló! Iktó waná kú weló!” eyá íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They didn’t come back for a long time, and many years from then, suddenly someone ran saying, “Iktó is coming back right now! Iktó is coming back right now!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyáte kiŋ waŋyáŋkapi na itéšniyaŋ waná tȟawíču kičhí tókhiyataŋhaŋ šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋg kú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The people saw him and he was definitely coming with his wife then from somewhere on horseback."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ wakȟáŋyeža óta wičháyuhapi na ób kúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they had a lot of children and they were coming with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na waná wičhóthi kiŋ čhokáta glihúŋnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they arrived to the middle of the camp circle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Iktó hótȟaŋkaya heyé, “Wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ lená mitȟáwa šni éyaš ’Até’ emákiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And Iktó said very loudly, “these aren’t my children, but they are calling me ‘dad.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš wičháyaktepi oyákihipi!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But you al can kill them!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ áta čhéya oíŋyaŋkapi"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> ".So the children ran around crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha húŋkupi kiŋ iwíčhakikču na íŋš-eyá líla čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So their mother took them, and she was really crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó ówakȟaŋkȟaŋ éyaš oyáte kiŋ taŋyáŋ slolyápi na wičákȟelapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó had lied, but the people know that well, and they didn’t consider him truthful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyápi, “Iktó kȟúŋku glúze ló – Tuwéni héčhuŋ šni!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said, “Iktó took his mother-in-law – nobody does that!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oyúspa po!” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Catch him!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋksáyuha kiŋ oyúspapi kta líla khuwápi éyaš tóškhe niíč’iya škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the police would chase him trying to catch him, but he escaped."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi čhiŋčá kiŋ ótapi čha áta oyáte tȟáŋka iyéčhel ȟeyáta thípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi had many childfren so they lived as a big group in the hills."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokápȟa kiŋ hé wikȟóškalaka héčha na líla wíŋyaŋ wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young one was a young girl, and she was very pretty."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él Iktó tȟawíču kiŋ léčhel wókiyake: “Hó, winúȟča, táku očhíčiyakiŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day, Iktó said things like this to his wife, “well, my wife, I will tell you something.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lečhála wičhóthi kiŋ ektá waí yuŋkȟáŋ hél kȟoškálaka waŋ atáwaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recently I arrived at the campsite and so I met a young man there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Omákiyakiŋ na čhuŋkšíuŋye kiŋ tȟawíčutȟuŋ čhíŋ kéye, na tókša hiyóu kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He told me something and he said that he wanted to marry you and I’s daughter, and he said that he would surely be coming for her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha hé toháŋl hí kiŋháŋ, takómni hiŋgnáyiŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So when he has arrived, she will surely marry him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tákuwe hé očhíčiyake kiŋ hé; toháŋl mat’íŋ kte kiŋ slolwákiye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And for a reason I say this to you, I don’t know when I will die."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na nakúŋ lé očhíčiyaka wačhíŋ: Uŋgnáš čhaŋkáksa omáyani na čháŋ waŋží čhoǧíŋ šá čha yakákse háŋtaŋš, hé aŋpétu kiŋ takómni mat’íŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And also I want to tell you this: maybe if you go to chop wood and you cut into a red pith of a tree, that day I will die."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(Haŋhépi hé iwáhaŋbla čha hé uŋ hé slolwákiye.)"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(I had a dream that night so for that reason I know that.)"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hó čha mat’íŋ na kȟoškálaka uŋ hé čhuŋkší hiyóhi háŋtaŋš, wáŋčagna k’ú wo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So if I die and that young man comes for my daughter, immediately give her to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé é čha wakhúwa na ečhél uŋkíčhiŋča kiŋ wówičhak’u kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is him who will hunt until he provides food for our children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó nakúŋ mat’é kiŋháŋ, ečháš šuŋȟpála waŋží kté na taŋyáŋ iȟ’áŋ na mitȟáŋčhaŋ isákhib égnaka yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And again when I die, surely kill a puppy, and cook it well, and lay it down next to my body.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóglag iglúštaŋ kiŋ heháŋl tȟawíču kiŋ čhaŋóle iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When he finished talking, his wife left to look for wood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Glí eháŋl heyé, “Wičháȟča, šičáya ečhámuŋ kštó!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When she arrived back, and said, “husband, I did something bad!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lečhála čháŋ waŋ čhoǧíŋ šá čha wakákse ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Recently I cut into a red pith of a tree.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wáŋčagna Iktó ištógmuziŋ na “Waná mat’íŋ kte,” eyíŋ na sniyáŋ t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so suddenly Iktó covered his mout, and he said, “then I will die,” and he passed out and died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhiŋčá kiŋ iyúha áta čhéya oíŋyaŋkapi; “Até! Até!” eyáya čhéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all the children ran around crying, “father! father!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ húŋkupi kiŋ wasé ičú na čhéya heyé, “Mihíŋgna, líla wičháša ítaŋ k’uŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so their mother took her facepaint, and she cried, “my husband, he was a really proud man!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhel wasé kiŋ lé iwéčiyuŋ kte sél?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ héčhena Iktó, lečháš t’é éyaš ištá gluǧáŋ na “Ité kiŋ ohómni” eyíŋ na akhé t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seems like I will need to put facepaint on him somehow” and so then Iktó died then, but he opened his eye, and he said, “around the face” and he died again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čhiŋčá kiŋ áta, “Iná, até kiní!” eyápi yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó akhé tuŋwíŋ na “Waná!” eyíŋ na akhé t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So all they children said, “mother, father’s alive,” and so Iktó looked around again and said, “now!” and again he died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha tȟawíču kiŋ wasé kiŋ ičú na ité kiŋ ikíčiyuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So his wife took the facepaint and she put it on his face."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟaŋčháŋ kiŋ átaya taŋyáŋ yuwí na ȟeyáta éuŋpe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she wrapped up all his body, and they laid him down in the hills."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl šuŋȟpála waŋ kté na iȟ’áŋ na Iktó kiŋ isákhib égnake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then she killed a puppy, and she cooked it, and she laid it down next to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu tóna yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó tȟawíču kiŋ tuktél ȟpáye kiŋ él í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was some days after and so Iktó’s wife went to where he was laying down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Glí yuŋkȟáŋ čhuŋwítku tȟokápȟa kiŋ hekíye, “Čhuŋkší, waŋnáš niyáte huhú kiŋ makȟáta okálalaya hiyéye,” eyá čha wikȟóškalaka kiŋ áta čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She came back and so she said to her eldest daughter, “my daughter, now your father’s bones are scattered about in the earth,” so the young woman cried a lot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(Hó éyaš itéšniyaŋ hená šuŋȟpála huhú čha Iktómi makȟáta iȟpéye, éyaš slolyápi šni.)"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(But they were really the puppy’s bones, so Iktómi left the ground, but they didn’t know.)"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla-hakáktala waŋ špúkešni kiŋ hé é čha húŋku ektá hí na heyé, “Iná, wičháša waŋ pahá-ta nážiŋ čha ektá waí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then at some time the young son who was very lively went up to his mother, and he told her, “mother, I went up to a man who was standing at the hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟaŋké hiyóu kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said that he was coming to get my older sister."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš nakúŋ até t’á čha líla čhaŋtéšiča kéye ló,” eyá okíyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But also father died so he said he was very sad.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha húŋku kiŋ, “Hó, čhúŋkš, niyáte lé eháŋni omákiyake kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So his mother said, “well, daughter, your father already told me this"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka uŋ hé hiyóniu čha hí kiŋ hiŋgnáyayiŋ kte, niyáte heyá čha,” eyíŋ na wáŋčag lol’íȟ’aŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That young man came to take you so came in order to marry you, your father said,” and at once she cooked things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuštáŋ eháŋl hokšíla-hakáktala uŋ hé hekíye, “Hó čhíŋkš, iyáyiŋ na kičhó we.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When she finished, she told her youngest son, “well, son, go and invite him.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1287> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hokšílala kiŋ iyáyiŋ na heyé, “Tȟaŋháŋ, iná níčho weló, tȟaŋké kičhí yaúŋ kta čha,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ “Háu!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1287;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1287> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the little boy left and he said, “brother-in-law, my mom invited you, so you can be with my older sister,” and so he said, “okay!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1287;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heyé, “Tȟoéyaš tȟuŋkáŋ – niyáte kiŋ – t’á čha ožúla čhaŋtémašiča čha héčhena wačhéyiŋ kte ló,” eyá čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said, “But wait my father-in-law – your father – he died so I’m full of sadness, so I will have to cry,” he said crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ áta čhéyaya thípi ektá ú čha Iktó tȟawíču kiŋ heyé, “Wičháša waŋ líla wičháša wašté čha lél thí kȟá k’uŋ…waná él úŋ šni čha oíyokšiče lé,” eyá čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was coming to where they were living just crying, so Iktó’s wife said, “a man would live here who is really good-looking… now he isn’t here so it’s so sad.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1290> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhéya iglúštaŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ kȟoškálaka kiŋ čhuŋkšítku kiŋ yúze, na oyáte kiŋ áta yuphíya wówičhak’upi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1290;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1290> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They finished mourning and so the young man took his daughter, and all the people gave them food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1290;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1291> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla špúkešni uŋ hé tȟaŋháŋku kiŋ ayúta s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1291;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1291> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the lively boy often looked at his brother-in-law"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1291;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋl húŋku kiŋ ektá glí na heyé, “Iná, tȟaŋké hiŋgnáku kiŋ líla até iyéčheča yeló.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Once he went up to his mother and said, “mom, my older sister’s husband looks a lot like my dad.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá čha húŋku kiŋ čhaŋzékiŋ na líla iyópȟeye; “Niyáte t’íŋ na waná huhú kiŋ okálalaya hiyéye…táku yakȟá čha!” ekíyiŋ na tȟaŋkál škál iyáye-ší."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that, so his mother got angry and she scolded him saying, “your father is dead and his bones are scattered in the earth… that’s what you’re talking about,” and she made him go outside to play."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš akhéšna glí na heyá-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he came back again and again and he was saying that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋkéya yaéčheča čha húŋku kiŋ híŋhaŋni láȟčiŋ kiktá na čhuŋwítku thí ektá í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally he talked her into believing it so his mother woke up early in the morning and she went to her daughter’s lodge."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Él éyokas’iŋ yuŋkȟáŋ Iktómi hé é čha sičháŋ zizíyela yuŋká čha waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She peered in and so she saw his yellow thighs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ áta itómni s’e čhaŋzéke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she got so made her head spun."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Waȟtéšni šíče kiŋ!” eyíŋ na čháŋ tȟáŋka waŋ ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“You piece of trash!” she said, and she grabbed a big stick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuhá thimá iyáyiŋ na áta kablóblo škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She went outside with it and lashed him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi wakpála opȟáya ománi yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhela tuktél wačhípi čha naȟ’úŋ čha inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi was walking along a creek, and so suddenly he heard where a dance was going on, so he stopped."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anáǧoptaŋ na  wačhípi s’eléčheča čha étkiya yá yuŋkȟáŋ šiyó héčhapi čha yuphíya wačhípi-la."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kálHe listened to it, and it seemed like they were dancing over there, so he went there, and so it was prairie chickens that were having a good time just dancing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čhaŋmáhel iyáyiŋ na ináȟni čháŋ waŋ ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he left into the woods, and he hurriedly took a stick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟeží šašá eyá ikȟóyagyiŋ na k’íŋ na ektá glé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He stuck some red grass to it, and he carried it on his shoulders, and he went on his way back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ šiyó kiŋ waŋyáŋkapi na, “Wáŋ, kákhiya Iktó táku k’íŋ hiyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the prairie chickens saw him, and they said, “hey, there’s Iktó going by carrying something on his shoulders."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋkíčhopi kte ló!” eyápi na “Iktó!” eyá páŋpí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Let’s invite him!” they said, and they yelled out, “Iktó!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš Iktó átaš naȟ’úŋ šni-kúŋs hiyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Iktó went by pretending not to hear them at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akhé kipáŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ éna inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they called out to him again, and so he stopped back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Iktó, táku čha yak’íŋ hwo?” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “Iktó, what is it that you’re carrying?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “Íŋše lená olówaŋ čha wak’íŋ ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “these are just some songs that I’m carrying.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Léčhiya wačhípi kta kéyapi čha ináwaȟni yeló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“They said that there would be a dance, so I’m hurrying along.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha šiyó kiŋ heyápi, “Čhiyé, hiyú na waŋží uŋkáhiyaya po!” eyápi yuŋkȟáŋ, “Hóȟ, líla ináȟni waúŋ képȟe,” eyíŋ na akhé iyáyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they prairie chickens said, “big brother, come on and sing us one!” and so he said, “oh no, I said I need to get along,” and he was going to leave again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš líla kitáŋpi čha Iktó iyówiŋye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they really yelled at him so Iktó agreed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyé, “Oháŋ, éyaš olówaŋ kiŋ lé wóopȟe waŋ aíkȟoyake,” eyá čha “Tó” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “okay, but this song is tied to a rules,” so they said, “sure.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Awáhiyaye kiŋháŋ, ištógmus wayáčhipi na tuwéni ištá yaglúǧaŋpi kte šni yeló,” eyá čha héčhetu kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “when I sing it, you need to dance with your eyes closed and nobody can open their eyes.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, čháŋčheǧa ikíkču na waná áta lowáŋ na kabúbu čha šiyó kiŋ iyúha wačhí iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he took his drum, and then he really sang, and he beat it, so all the prairie chickens went dancing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta oíyokiphiya wačhípi, wíŋyela kȟóya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They danced really happily, including the females."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó léčhel ahíyaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó sang it like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ištógmus wačhí po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dance with your eyes closed!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ištógmus wačhí po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dance with your eyes closed!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá yatúŋwaŋpi kiŋháŋ ištá niȟčápi kta čha ištógmus wačhí po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When someone opens their eyes, they will have a sty, so dance with your eyes closed!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel lowáŋ čha ištógmus wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He sang like that so they danced with their eyes closed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na kȟoháŋ tóna makhú tȟaŋktȟáŋkapi kiŋ áta wičhákat’e, wičháyutiŋ kta čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And in the meanwhile he struck dead the ones with a big breast, so he would eat them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáhelaka waŋží tuŋwáŋ yuŋkȟáŋ líla óta wičhákte čha abléze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of a sudden one opened its eyes, and so it realized that he had killed many."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé “Háŋta po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “look out!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó ničásotapi kte ló!” eyíŋ na kiŋyáŋ iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó will kill all of you!” and it flew away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha uŋmápi kiŋ iyúha ihákab kiŋyáŋ iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So all of the others flew away behind it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena Iktó iȟát’at’a wičhápahi na “Taŋyáŋ wawáte šni čháŋna léčhamuŋ weló!” eyíŋ na wičhák’iŋ iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó picked them up and kept laughing, and he said, “whenever I’m not eating well, I do this,” and he left carrying them on his shoulders."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ owáštečaka waŋ él íyotakiŋ na čhethí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he sat in a clear spot and built a fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ naháŋ šiyó kiŋ špaŋwíčhaya yuŋkȟáŋ iwáŋkab čháŋ eyá íčhikhiyela hé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that, and he cooked them, and so the sticks stood near to each other above it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na alétka núm íčhičameya yaŋká čha tȟaté hiyú čháŋšna kískiza-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And two branches sat close next to each other, so whenever the wind blew, they would be squeaking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó heyé, “Misúŋ, héčhuŋpi šni yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “little brothers, don’t do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Onáȟ’uŋ nišíčape ló,” eyé, éyaš héčhena héčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You two sound bad,” he said, but it was still going on like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋkéya Iktó áta líla kȟáŋt’a čha čháŋ kiŋ uŋmá alí na alétka kiŋ yukhínuŋkȟaŋ yúze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally Iktó got really frustrated, so he climbed up another tree, and he took the branches separating them apart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš ečháŋl tȟaté kiŋ akísni čha napé kiŋ iyókogna anáǧipe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But just then the wind calmbed down so his hand was pinned between the two of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heyá páŋ: “Misúŋ, misúŋ, amáyuštaŋ po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he yelled out, “little brother, little brother, let me go!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná lol’íwaȟ’aŋ čha khúl wagníŋ na khičháŋwayiŋ kte héčha yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I cooked just now so I need to go back down and look over it!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš héčhena tȟaté waníča čha éna oyátȟake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But there stayed being no wind, so he was stuck back up there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl šuŋgmánitu waŋ čháŋ oȟláthe máni hiyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then, a coyote walked by under the tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktó kipáŋ na, “Wáŋ, misúŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó yelled out, “hey, little brother!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóyute mitȟáwa kiŋ ayúštaŋ yo…"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leave my food alone…"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Atȟébmayayiŋ kte séče ’uŋ!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Don’t eat it up on me!” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šuŋgmánitu kiŋ “Háŋ, wičákȟe – héčhamuŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The coyote said, “yeah, that’s right – I will do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Witkó kiŋ!” ečhíŋ na kawíŋȟ iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Crazy!” he though, and he turned around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Očhéthi kiŋ hél í yuŋkȟáŋ waná šiyó kiŋ áta tȟebwíčhayiŋ na heháŋl iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It went to the fire, and so then he ate up all the prairie chickens, and then he left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šuŋgmánitu kiŋ iyáyiŋ na ečháŋl akhé tȟaté hiyú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The coyote left, and then the wind blew again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋáletka kiŋ kakhínuŋkȟaŋ iyéya čha Iktó napé ikíkču na khúl hiŋȟpáyiŋ na áta makhíyapȟa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It separated the branches apart, so Iktó took his hand, and he fell down, and he really hit the ground."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Očhéthi ektá khí éyaš waná wóyute k’uŋ átaya henála škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He got back to the fire, but none of the food was left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé Iktó  ománi-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kákhiyaIktó was walking around to somewhere again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟáȟča-hokšíla waŋ itázipa na wahíŋkpe líla waštéšte yuhá čha waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he saw that a Deer Boy had a really good bow and arrows."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó hekíye, “Huŋhuŋhé, Misúŋkala, hé niyé so?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó said, “woooow, my little brother, is that you?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahíŋkpe waštéšte luhá yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You have nice arrows."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makípazo uŋtȟó, Misúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Show them to me, little brother."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋbláka wačhíŋ ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You know I want to see them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Oháŋ,” eyá čha Iktó wahíŋkpe na itázipa k’uŋ hená ičú na yuhá yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “okay,” so Iktó took his arrows and his bow and he sat with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáhela inážiŋ na áta ówehaŋhaŋ s’e wahíŋkpe waŋ ektá égle na apáha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of the sudden he shot up, and joking around he place an arrow in it and he aimed it at him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Tóškhe ilúkčaŋ hwo, Misúŋ?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “what do you think, little brother?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáš tuktél niwáŋkȟala séče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe you’re weak somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša iyúha tuktél wáŋkȟalapi,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All men are weak somewhere.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá yuŋkȟáŋ tȟáȟča-hokšíla kiŋ, “Háŋ, pȟaȟté kiŋ lél mawákȟala” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that and so the Deer Boy said, “yeah, I’m weak right between the eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha Iktó wahíŋkpe kiŋ pȟaȟté kiŋ aglé yúziŋ na khuté, čha tȟáȟča-hokšíla kiŋ t’á iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó placed the arrow between his eyes, and he shot it, so the Deer Boy died instantly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktómi pahí na k’íŋ na owáštečaka waŋží olé ománi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1377;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktómi picked him up and threw him over his shoulder and he walked looking for a clear spot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1377;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl tȟáȟča-hokšíla kiŋ pȟátiŋ na tȟaló kiŋ haŋké čheúŋpe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1379;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1379> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he butchered the Deer Boy and he fried part of the meat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1379;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhúŋhaŋ iwáŋkab čháŋ núŋm tȟaté čhaŋna íčhičakiŋza-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1380;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1380> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meanwhile, whenever the wind blew, two trees two trees squeaked together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1380;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča čha Iktó lowáŋ-wačhíŋ khéš onáȟ’uŋ šíče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1381;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1381> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like that so whenever Iktó tried to sing it sounded bad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1381;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha éeye ištíŋmiŋ kta khúl iyúŋke éyaš akhéš héyeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1382;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1382> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So instead, he laid down to go to sleep, but it was like that again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1382;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha óhaŋketa heyé, “Misúŋ, iníla yaŋkápi ye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1383;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1383> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So finally, he said, “little brothers, be quiet!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1383;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhanuŋpi kiŋ uŋ úŋtȟuŋnič’iyapi kta načhéče ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1384;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You all might hurt yourselves through doing that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1384;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyé éyaš naháŋȟči héčheča čha haŋkéya čháŋ uŋmá kiŋ alí na yukhínuŋkȟaŋ wičháyus wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1385;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that, but it still happened like that, so finally he climbed up another tree and he tried separating them apart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1385;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl napé kiŋ anáǧibyapi na átaš ikíkču okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1386;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then his hand got trapped, and he couldn’t get it out at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1386;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1387> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čhaŋwáŋkal yaŋkíŋ na áta “Wáŋ, misúŋ, ták tókȟanuŋpi hwo?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1387;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1387> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he sat in the tree, and he said, “gosh, little brothers, what are you two doing?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1387;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Amáyuštaŋ po!” eyáya wičháyaečheča wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1388;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Let me go!” he tried to convince them to do."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1388;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Napé kiŋ glutíktitaŋ khéš sutáya oyátȟake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1389;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He pulled at his hand, but it was very stuck."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1389;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟokȟála eyá tókhiya yápi na iyópteya iyáyapi kte éyaš hóyewičhakhiyiŋ na “Misúŋ, hél yápi šni yo!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1390;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so some kit foxes were going somewhere, and they were starting to pass by, but he called out to them and said, “little brothers, don’t go!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1390;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél tȟaló eyá čhewáuŋpa-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1391;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was frying some meat there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1391;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáš atȟébmayayapi kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1392;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1392> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe you all are going to eat it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1392;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhákičho iyéčhel heyá čha áta kawíŋǧapi na tȟaló kiŋ átaya tȟebyá iyéyapi, haŋké špáŋ šni kiŋ hé kȟó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1393;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that like he was inviting them, so they really turned around, and they left to eat all the meat, also half of the uncooked meat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1393;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná tȟaló kiŋ áta henála čha iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now all the meat was gone so they left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ȟčeháŋl čháŋ hená khinúŋkȟaŋkiya iyáya čha Iktó napé ikíkču na khúl gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1395;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so just then the trees separated into two, so Iktó took back his hand, and"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1395;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš waná tȟaló waníča čha, “Hehehé, misúŋ tȟaló kiŋ átaya atȟébmayape ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But then there was no meat left, so he said, “goodness, my little brothers ate all the meat!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na líla ločhíŋ čha čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he was really hungry so he cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhéya-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgná tȟáȟča pȟá kiŋ éna ayúštaŋpi čha waŋyáŋkiŋ na áta tȟanásula eyá mahél úŋ kiŋ čhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was crying, and so he saw that maybe they left a deer head back there, and he wanted all the brains that were inside of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Éčuȟčiš hé wátiŋ kte ló,” ečhíŋ na ičú-wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He thought, “I’ll just eat that,” and he tried taking it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš oȟlóka kiŋ očík’ala čha napé kiŋ okíphi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the hole was small so it was too small for his hand."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu khéš zuzéča ič’íčhaǧiŋ na oȟlóka čík’ala uŋ hé ogná mahél iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When it was like that, he turned into a snake, and he went inside that small hole."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na héčhiya áta yuphíya tȟanásula íphiič’iye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he filled himself up good with brains there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla oyúl wašté čha oȟ’áŋkȟoya tȟebyá iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It tasted really good so he went eating it quickly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná glináphiŋ kta uŋkȟáŋ – hoští! – líla wóte kiŋ uŋ pȟá kiŋ waná líla tȟáŋka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then when he was about to come back out – darn – since he ate a lot, his head was really big."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčha uŋ waná heháŋyaŋ okíphi šni čha glinápȟa okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, he wasn’t too big for it anymore so he couldn’t get out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha éna ȟpáyiŋ na akhé čhéya-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he laid down back there and he was crying again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta hótȟaŋkaya čhéye éyaš tuwéni naȟ’úŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He cried while crying out, but nobody heard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ pȟakás’iŋ-wačhíŋ uŋkȟáŋ leyáš tȟáȟča pȟá kiŋ líla kap’óžela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then at one point in time he tried to raise his head, but all the while the deer head was light."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha yuhá nážiŋ hiyáyiŋ na íŋyaŋg tókhiya yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he stood up with it, and he was going running somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhelaka táku waŋ sutá čha kahíŋȟpeye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all of a sudden he ran into something hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Nitúwe hwo?” eyá iyúŋǧa yuŋkȟáŋ, “Wazí miyé yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Who are you?” he asked, and so it said, “I am Pine."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhúŋšoke kiŋ léčhiya imáčhaǧe ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I grow around here in the woods.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé hetáŋhaŋ íŋyaŋkiŋ na akhé táku waŋ líla sutá čha iwóȟtake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He ran from there again, and he bumped into something hard again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wáŋ, níš, nitúwe hwo?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ “Eyá, lé pséȟtiŋ miyé yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Well, you, who are you?” he said, and so it said, “well, I’m Ash."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mni-íkhiyela ečé imáčhaǧe ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I only grow near the water.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktó hečhíŋ, “Oháŋ čha mni-íkȟaŋyela waúŋ itéke ló,” ečhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó thought, “okay, so it looks like I’m near the water.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena máni yuŋkȟáŋ mayá kiŋ isáŋm iyáyiŋ na áta wakpá él ohíŋȟpaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was still walking, and so he went off a cliff, and he fell right into the river."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš mní ohíŋȟpaya čha héčhetu khéš nuŋwáŋ yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was that he fell into the water, so whenever it was that way, he went swimming."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhela wakhúl wičháša eyá waŋyáŋkapi na ayúta inážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so suddenly down there some men saw him and they suddenly saw him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋží heyé, “Waŋyáŋka po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One said, “look!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ká táku waŋ nuŋwáŋ hiyáye kiŋ hé wičháša s’eléčheča,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ waŋží íŋš, “Hóȟ, wáŋ k’éya, hé tȟáȟča yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seems like something going by swimming there is a person,” and so one said, “absolutely not, that’s nonsense, that’s a deer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Miyéš héčhel waŋbláke ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I myself see it like that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ahóyekičhiyapi kiŋ ičhúŋhaŋ khiyéla hiyáya čha “Tȟáȟča, léčhiya ú wo!” eyá hóyekhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "While they argued about it, it went by nears, so they yelled at it, “deer, come this way!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla kipáŋpi éyaš Iktó átaš nawíčhaȟ’uŋ šni s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They really yelled at it but it seemed like he wasn’t listening to them at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha mní kiŋ él iyópsičapi na étkiya nuŋwáŋ yápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they jumped into the water, and they swam towards it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó waŋwíčhayaŋka čha áta naphíŋ na óhuta uŋmá ečhétkiya líla nuŋwáŋ yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó looked at them, so he came out, and he was swimming over to the other side of the shore."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiya íŋyaŋ tȟáŋka waŋ hé éyaš haŋkéya mni-máhel hé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A big rock was there, but finally it was in the water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó naháŋȟči tȟáȟča pȟá uŋ hé pȟóštaŋ čha waŋyáŋka okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He didn’t see that Iktó was still wearing the deer head on his head"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha héčhetkiya tókhel okíhika nuŋwíŋ na uŋgná íŋyaŋ uŋ hé áta t’osyéla kahíŋȟpeye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was swimming as hard as possible towards it in that direction,"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟáȟča pȟá kiŋ átaya wobléče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he really shattered the deer head."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1431> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš Iktó akhé niíč’iyiŋ na wičháša kaȟyá óhuta kiŋ él nážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1431;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1431> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that Iktó escaped again, and he stood on the shore in the shape of a man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1431;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1432> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wakhúl wičháša kiŋ hená hótȟaŋkaya aíwičhaȟat’e."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1432;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1432> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he laughed loudly at the men going down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1432;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša kiŋ Iktó iyékiyapi na heyápi, “Éktáŋš tókhel ȟ’aŋ-phíča šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the men recognized Iktó, and they said, “it’s impossible."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé Iktó é čha uŋgnáyaŋpe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was Iktó that tricked us again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha kawíŋǧapi na glá po,” eyápi na úpi k’uŋ héčhetkiya nuŋwáŋ khiglápi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they turned around and went back,” and they went swimming back to where they came from."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi líla ločhíŋ čhaŋkhé wóyute olé ománi-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi was really hungry, and so he was walking around looking for food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1446> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš wakpá waŋ šmá čha él í na tókȟa iyúweǧa okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1446;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1446> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he came to a really deep river, and he couldn’t cross it at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1446;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1447> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha óhuta el íyotakiŋ na áta čhéya yaŋká-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1447;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1447> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he sat at the edge, and he sat sobbing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1447;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟatȟáŋka waŋ él hí na heyé, “Tákuwe lé yačhéya-haŋ hwo?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a buffalo came up to him and said, “why are you crying?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋl waú k’uŋ héhaŋni načhíȟ’uŋ weló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I heard you when I was coming a long way back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “Hehehí, Misúŋ, wakpá kiŋ lé kȟowákataŋ blá wačhíŋ éyaš iblúweǧa owákihi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “goodness, little brother, I want to go to the other side of this river, but I can’t cross it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nuŋwé wačháŋmi kte éyaš líla kalúziŋ na mniítȟaŋčhaŋ kiŋ waš’áke ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was going to try to swim, but it feally flows, and the current is strong.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Na wóyute maníča čha áta akíȟ’aŋmat’iŋ kte s’eléčheča yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “I don’t have any food, so it feels like I’m going to die!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ úŋšila na heyé, “Oháŋ čha miyé iblúweǧiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The buffalo was kind to him, and he said, “okay, so I will cross myself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkȟáhu akáŋl mayáŋka yo, ačhíyiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sit on my back, I will take you there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó: “Hóȟ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “Oh absolutely not!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta nitȟáŋka čha anáčhiskapa owákihi šni kiŋháŋ, mní él omáhiŋȟpayiŋ kte ló!” eyíŋ na wičála šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You are really big, so when I won’t be able to fit my legs around you, I’ll fall into the water!” and he refused."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ heháŋl heyé, “Hó čha oníhiŋȟpaye háŋtaŋš, siŋté kiŋ omáyuspiŋ na mihákab nuŋwáŋ yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then the buffalo said, “so if you fall into it, grab my tail, and swim behind me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tókša iyúweȟ ačhíyiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I will surely have you cross the river.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš Iktó áta oúŋšila šíče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Iktó was really hard to please."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leyé, “Hóȟ, wáŋ, misúŋ… Sitúpsaŋ iyéyaye háŋtaŋš, áta mničhókab iyémayayiŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “absolutely not, gosh, little brother… if you wag your tail, you’ll send me straight into the middle of the water.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ akhéš, “Oháŋ čha pȟá kiŋ akáŋl mayáŋkiŋ na hé kiŋ iyókogna mayáŋka yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the buffalo said again, “okay, so sit on my head, and you can sit between my horns.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš akhé Iktó wičála šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Iktó said he refused again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyé, “Éyaš mní latké háŋtanaš, mayálušna kte séče ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said, “but if you drink water, you might drop me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyaŋ waná tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ wačhíŋ húŋkešni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From then on the buffalo didn’t have a strong will."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha tókhel ȟ’aŋphíča hwo?” íšikčhiŋ eyá yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó heháŋl leyé, “Misúŋ, iyéš namápča yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So what can be done?” he said angrily, and so Iktó then said, “little brother, swallow me, instead."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl uŋmá ečhíyataŋhaŋ iyáhuŋni kiŋ, líla hoyáȟpiŋ na igléb hiyúmayayiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then when you reach the other side of it, you will cough and you will vomit me out.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ héčhetula čha ečhél Iktó napčíŋ na yuhá iyúweǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The buffalo agreed so he swallowed Iktó like that and it crossed it with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš uŋmá ečhíyataŋhaŋ ihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ hoȟpíŋ na iglépiŋ kte k’uŋ hé átaš éktuŋže."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But it reached the other side of it, and so he coughed, and it completely forgot that he was supposed to throw him up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na  čhaŋíyohaŋzi waŋ él iyúŋkiŋ na wáŋčag ištíŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kálAnd it laid down in the shade of a tree, and it immediately went to sleep."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thezí mahél Iktómi áta čhaŋzékiŋ na líla páŋ-he éyaš héčhena tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ ǧópa-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi was really angry in his stomach, and he was screaming, but still the buffalo was snoring."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu khéš míla ikíkču na uŋ čhuwí hepíya kiŋ wahúŋ na etáŋhaŋ glinápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It being like that, he took his knife, and using it he cut into the side of its stomach, and he came out from there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ áta úŋštiŋma t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the buffalo died in its sleep."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó héčhuŋ na khiyéla wičhágnaška ožú waŋ háŋ čha él inážiŋ na óta yúte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó did that, and he came up to a gooseberry grove that was there, and he ate a lot of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋhaŋ yíŋ na owátohaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ itȟúŋkala eyá škáta-haŋpi čha waŋwíčhayaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went from there, and in a little he saw some mice playing around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhel škátapi; uŋmátȟoktȟok ištá kiŋ glušlókapi na waŋkál yekíyapi na akhé glukȟápapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They played like this; they took out their eyes one after another, and they threw them up, and they caught them again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tukté waŋží iyótaŋ waŋkátuya ištá yekíyiŋ kta héčiŋ hé akíčhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They competed about which one of them threw them up the highest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó hé oíyokiphi yawá čha él wičháyiŋ na hewíčhakiye, “Misúŋ, wóškate kiŋ hé uŋspémakhiya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó thought that was fun, so he went to them, and he said to them, “little brothers, teach me that game."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš-eyá waškáta wačhíŋ yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I want to play it, too!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha uŋspékhiyapi yuŋkȟáŋ, “Hó, Iktó, níš heháŋtu weló,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1479;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they taught him and so they said, “well, Iktó, it’s your turn.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1479;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1480> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé ištá nuphíŋ glušlókiŋ na áta waŋkál yekíye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1480;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1480> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he took out both his eyes, and he sent them up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1480;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1481> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš ohíyiŋ kte ȟčiŋ čha líla eháš waŋkátuya yekíye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1481;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1481> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he really wanted to win, so he threw them up extremely high."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1481;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1482> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khútakiya kú-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋáletka waŋ ikȟóyakiŋ na hél otké!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1482;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1482> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were coming down, and so they got stuck in a tree, and they hung there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1482;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1483> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš Iktó waná ištá čhóla nážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1483;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1483> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like that so Iktó was standing without any eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1483;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1484> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl itȟúŋkala kiŋ áta “Háŋta po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1484;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1484> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the mice said, “get away!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1484;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Él uŋkáyapi kte ló!” eyápi na ábebeya napȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He’s going to blame us!” and they scattered in all directions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na waná Iktó ištáǧuŋǧa čha úŋšiya yutȟáŋtȟaŋ ománi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And now Iktó was blind, so he walked around feeling around pitifully."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wačhíŋyeye šni kiŋ uŋ khúl íyotakiŋ na čhéya-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Since he was hopeless, he sat down and was crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš ištá waníča čha ištámniyaŋpi čhóla, hó ečé uŋ čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he didn’t have any eyes, so without tears, he cried with just his voice."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó išnála yaŋká kéčhiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgná tuwá kȟaŋyéla heyé, “Tákuwe yačhéya-haŋ hwo?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó thought he was sitting all alone, and so maybe someone nearby said, “why are you crying?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha “Huŋhuŋhí, misúŋ, othéȟike ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “goodness, little brother, it’s really hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé ištá mawániča čha wóyute kayéš iwágni owákihi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I don’t have any eyes, so I can’t even look for food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akíȟ’aŋmat’iŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’ll die of hunger!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leyálaka hé Wanáǧi Itȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ é čha kičhí wóglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But actually, it was the Spirit Chief that he was talking with."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Hó čha čháŋ waŋ yuhá naŋké kiŋ hé ičú na makȟá kiŋ tȟáŋkaya yumímeya ičáǧo égle yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it said, “well take this stick that you’re sitting on and draw a big circle on the ground.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečhél ečhúŋ yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl Wanáǧi Itȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ heyé, “Oháŋ čha čhaŋgléška waŋ yakáǧe kiŋ lé imáhel waúŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that, and so then the Spirit Chief said, “okay, so I will be in the circle that you drew."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ yutȟáŋtȟaŋ ománi na omáyuspe wačhíŋ yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so walk around touching things and try to catch me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Omáyaluspa oyákihi háŋtaŋš, ištá kiŋ iyékču kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If you can catch me, you will take back your own eyes.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha Iktó mahél iyáyiŋ na tȟokátakiya istó yuǧátiŋ na áta yutȟáŋtȟaŋ íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó went inside, and he raised his arm forward, and he ran feeling around a lot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na watúkȟa na themnít’a čhaŋna asníkiya íyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he got worn out, and whenever he was sweating, he sat resting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yámničhaŋ héčhuŋ na itópačhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ nakéš Wanáǧi Itȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ oyúspe!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that for three days, and on the fourth day he finally caught the Spirit Chief!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčagna ištá kiŋ él kú na ečhél khíyotakiŋ na Iktó akhé taŋyáŋ wawáŋyaŋka škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of a sudden, his eyes came back until they returned back, and Iktó saw well again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hetáŋhaŋ tókhiya oyáte kiŋ wičhágnaye iyáye ka héči."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it’s a mystery as to where he went from there, tricking people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó wakpála čík’ala waŋ opȟáya ománi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó was walking along a small creek."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oštéšteya hakítȟuŋ na wičhítegleǧa há waŋ siŋté kȟóya íŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was dressed weirdly, and he was wearing a raccoon skin tail over his shoulder, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáhela wakpá waŋ otȟáŋkaya na šmá čha ektá í, na óhuta él inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of a sudden, he arrived at a wide and deep river, and he stopped at the edge."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óptakiya okíhi šni čha éna íyotakiŋ na čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He couldn’t go across it, so he sat back there, and cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhetáŋ waŋ kiŋyáŋ hiyáya čha Iktó kipáŋ na “Hé, misúŋ, wáŋ, misúŋ!” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “Tókȟa hwo?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a hawk went flying by, so Iktó called out to it, and he said, “hey, little brother, hey, little brother!” and so it said, “what’s wrong?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heyé, “Misúŋ, amáyiŋ na uŋmá ečhíyataŋhaŋ éiȟpemaya yo!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “little brother, take me and take me over to the other side!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha “Oháŋ” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it said, “okay.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ pahá tȟáŋka waŋ khiyéla háŋ čha čhetáŋ kiŋ ektá í na hekíye, “Hó, waná akáŋmayaŋka yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was at a big hill, so the hawk got there to him, and it said, “well, now get on me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na sutáya mayúza yo – ničáitomni kte séče ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And hold on tight – you might become dizzy.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “Oháŋ, líla philámayaye ló, misúŋ,” eyá íyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, sitting down, Iktó said, “okay, thank you, little brother.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná čhetáŋ kiŋ Iktó k’íŋ kiŋyáŋ yá yuŋkȟáŋ kȟoháŋ Iktó áta apȟóšiŋšiŋ na akát’apt’ápiŋ na ačhéžiyaŋpyaŋp yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the hawk flew along with Iktó on his shoulders, and so in the meantime, Iktó was making faces, and sat snapping his fingers at him and sticking his tongue out at him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naȟmála ečhúŋ éyaš čhetáŋ kiŋ uŋgná naǧí kiŋ waŋkíglakiŋ na hečhíŋ, “Waȟtéšni kiŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did it in secret, but the hawk might have seen his shadow, and it thought, “piece of trash!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé lé Iktó é yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s Iktó again!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1518> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟóš, čhaŋóȟloǧeča waŋží él oblúšna kte!” ečhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1518;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1518> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "First, I will drop him into a hollow tree.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1518;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋóȟloka waŋ  háŋ čha čhetáŋ kiŋ ékawiŋǧiŋ na áta iwáŋkab oȟ’áŋkȟoya iglúptaŋyaŋ čha Iktó mahél ohíŋȟpaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1519;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kálThe hawk turned around at a log, and he flipped himself upwards really quickly, so Iktó fell into it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1519;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél oyátȟakiŋ na čhéya-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋkátotola waŋ wagnúka ewíčhakiyapi héčha čha líla pȟá lúta yuŋkȟáŋ čháŋ kiŋ él híyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1520;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was stuck there, so he was crying, and so there was a woodpecker, called a red-headed wookpecker with a red head that landed on the wood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1520;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1521> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktó heyé, “Misúŋ, hél míčičaȟloka yo!”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1521;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1521> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó said, “little brother, break a hole into this for me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1521;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha katóto na kíčičaȟloka čha Iktó waná hetáŋhaŋ tȟaŋkátakiya étuŋwaŋ nážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it knocked on it, and made a hole in it for him, so then Iktó stood from there looking outside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl wíŋyaŋ núŋm čhaŋk’íŋ hiyáyapi čha hečhíŋ, “Tókheškhe kaná wičháwagnayiŋ kte sél,” ečhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then two women passed by gathering wood, so he thought, “maybe I should trick those ones somehow.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ olówaŋ waŋ léčhel ahíyaye:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he sings a song like this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhítegleǧa čhépa lél maŋké ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A fat raccoon, here I sit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel lowáŋ-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ wíŋyaŋ kiŋ uŋmá heyé, “Má, čépȟaŋši, wičhítegleǧa čhépa waŋ hél yaŋká kéye ’uŋ.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was singing like that, and so one of the women said, “wow, cousin, it said that a fat raccoon is sitting here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá čha heháŋl Iktó iyótaŋ líla howáye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said that so then Iktó let out a loud cry!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na sáŋm hótȟaŋkaya lowáŋ na leyé:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he sang even louder and he said,"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhá čhépa lél maŋké ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A fat raccoon, I sit here!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhá čhépa lél maŋké ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A fat raccoon, I sit here!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wíŋyaŋ uŋmá kiŋ, “Huŋhí, héčha líla oyúha waštépi ’uŋ, uŋkíču héči.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the other woman said, “goodness, this type of it must be easy to carry, if you and I take it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá yuŋkȟáŋ akhé Iktó, “Yutȟáŋkal imáču po, oyúha mawášte yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said that and so Iktó said again, “if you take me out, I will be easy to carry!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha waná nazúŋspe ikíkčupi na čháŋ k’uŋ kaúŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then they took an ax and they cut down the tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičhítegleǧa há šiná waŋ Iktó yuhá k’uŋ hé siŋté kiŋ oȟlóka ogná patȟáŋkal hiyúyiŋ na akhé šna yumáhel ičú-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And Iktó pushed out of the hole the tail of the raccoon skin blanket that he had, and again he was drawing back in often."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akhé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ waŋží heyé, “Čépȟaŋši, léna ȟčiŋ yaŋké kštó!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So one of the women said again, “cousin, it’s sitting right here!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóškhe ečhúŋk’uŋ kta he?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “Pȟéta aúpi na ošóta-t’emáya po."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What are we going to do?” she said, and so Iktó said, “come here with fire and kill me with smoke."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel ečéla waglínaphiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will come out of here just in that way.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akhíyapi ektá uŋmá gníŋ na pȟéta akú na uŋmá íŋš éna awáŋyaŋg nážiŋ kta kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So one came back where they talk about it, and she was bringing fire, and the other one stood watching over it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš Iktó heyé, “Hiyá – nuphíŋ yá po,” eyá čha héčhetulapi na nuphíŋ iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Iktó said, “no – both of you go,” so they agreed and both left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋ waŋ ektá íŋyaŋkiŋ na héčhiyataŋhaŋ ahíyokas’iŋ na áta iȟát’e!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He ran to a tree, and he picked in from there, and he laughed hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heíč’iye, “Wíŋyaŋ henáuŋs nuphíŋ witkópi k’uŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said to himself, “both of those women are fools!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ognáye waštépi na míš miyé makhíli yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were gullible and I’m really so good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná wíŋyaŋ kiŋ nuphíŋ theȟíya pȟéta yuhá kúpi čha Iktó áta t’eblézešni iȟát’a áptaŋyiŋ na iglúš’iŋš’iŋ na iglúȟlaȟlate."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now both the women were having trouble coming back with the fire, so Iktó rolled around laughing all crazy, and he tickled himself, and he scratched himself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ oígluspiŋ na čhaŋsákala eyá ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he restrained himself and took some twigs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míla waŋ yuhá čha uŋ tokhéčhačha čhaŋsákala k’uŋ kažíbžipiŋ na étkiya wičháye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He had a knife, so he was casually shaving the twigs, and he went towards them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyékiyapi šni čha hewíčhakiye, “Tȟaŋkší, lé táku tókȟanuŋpi hwo?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They didn’t recognize him, so he said to them, “younger sisters, what are you two doing?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá uŋkȟáŋ okíyakapi čha heyé, “Óčhičiyapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that, and so they said something, and he said, “I will help you two."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhítegleǧa kiŋháŋ líla wígli óta yukȟáŋpi čha etáŋhaŋ wahíŋkpe isláye etáŋ omáyak’upi waštéke ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Raccoons are really greasy so it would be good for you two to give me grease to oil my arrows with.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná čháŋ kiŋ áta oíleyapi na kabléblečapi éyaš tákuni ogná úŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they set all the trees on fire, and they shattered them, but nothing was inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó heyé: “Tȟaŋkší, wičhítegleǧa kiŋ líla wičhášapišni ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “younger sisters, raccoons are cunning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáš pȟéta hiyóilalapi na kákhiya aínab ilálapi k’uŋ héhaŋ tokhíyotȟaŋ iyáyekiya načhéče ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe when you two left for fire and left to the other side over there, he ran away somewhere.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyíŋ na ȟeyáb inážiŋ na áta šiná óǧeya wičhákat’apt’ape."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that, and stood away from them, and he snapped at them through his blanket."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Itȟó, eyá uŋgnáš čhaŋ-káksa omáwani kte,” eyíŋ na iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “I guess, maybe I’ll walk chopping down trees,” and he left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heíč’iye, “Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ henáuŋs áta nasúla waníčape ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1556;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said to himself, “those two women have no brains!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1556;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wačhíŋ kiŋháŋ nuphíŋ tókȟašniyaŋ sáŋm wičháwagnayaŋ owákihi tkȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When I want, I could trick both of them even more no problem."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš witkópi tkȟá nimákhiyapi čha eyá…héčhegla kte ló,” eyá škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they are fools, but they saved me so… that will be all.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi tókhiya ománi yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhela tuktél lowáŋpi na akíš’api čha naȟ’úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi was walking along somewhere, and so all of a sudden he heard that there was singing and jeering somewhere"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha anáǧoptaŋ nážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ áta wačhí kiníča čha sičhúha kiŋ yašpúye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he stood listening to it, and so he felt like dancing, so his foot itched."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuktél oíyokiphiya wačhípi kiŋ olé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He found where they were dancing happily."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sáŋm hótȟaŋkaya lowáŋpi na akíš’api yuŋkȟáŋ khiyéla čhaŋkú aglágla tȟatȟáŋka pȟá šéča waŋ yaŋká yuŋkȟáŋ hetáŋhaŋ hiyú čha abléze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The singing and was louder and so there was a dry buffalo skull close along the road, and so he realized it was coming from there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khúl iyúŋkiŋ na él éyokas’iŋ yukȟáŋ hená itȟúŋkalapi čha wačhípi na áta oíyokiphi tȟáŋka yuhápi!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He laid down, and he peered inside, and so he saw mice that were dancing, and they were having a lot of fun!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktó thiyópa katóto na heyé, “Misúŋ, úŋšimalapi na thimá ú iyówiŋmakhiya po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó knocked on the door and said, “little brothers, be kind to me and let me come in!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš-eyá wawáčhi kte ȟčiŋ yeló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I really want to dance, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha “Wáŋ, thiyópa kiŋ čhiyé kiyúǧaŋ po!” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they say, “well, open up the door for our older brother!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé waná thiyópa lazátahaŋ kiŋ kiyúǧaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they opened up the back door for him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó natá kiŋ tȟokéya mahél iyékiye éyaš heháŋyela okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó stuck his hand in first, but he couldn’t go any further."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha pašlóg-wačhíŋ éyaš átaya oyátȟake!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he tried to take it off, but he was totally stuck!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ itȟúŋkala kiŋ waŋží ité waŋyáŋkiŋ na, “Háŋta po! Iktó é yeló!” eyá čha iyúha íŋyaŋg napȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one of the mice looked at his face, and it said, “look out! It’s Iktó!” so they all left running away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waná oíyokpaza čha Iktó áta ištáǧuŋǧe s’e wawáŋyaŋke šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then it was dark, so Iktó was looking around like he was totally blind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha išnála čhaŋkú aglágla tȟatȟáŋka pȟá k’uŋ úŋ yaŋkíŋ na áta čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was sitting there alone along the path wearing the buffalo head, and he was really crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá khiyéla hiyáya naȟ’úŋ čháŋna líla hótȟaŋkaya čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever he heard someone pass nearby, he cried very loudly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na iyópta iyáya čháŋšna akhé naȟmáȟma úŋšiya čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever they went passing by, he sobbed softly and pitifully."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl ták tókȟuŋ načhéče, éyaš táku čha ečhúŋ kiŋ ótakiya oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then that may be what happened, but they tell what he did in many ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáš léčhuŋpi-s’e: Íŋyaŋ tȟáŋka waŋ khiyéla yaŋká yuŋkȟáŋ él í na “Tȟuŋkášila, ómakiya yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe it was just like this: a big rock sat nearby, and so he approached it, and he said, “grandfather, help me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha íŋyaŋ kiŋ heyé, “Oháŋ, čha létkiya íŋyaŋkiŋ na natá kiŋ kóskos hiyúya yo,” eyá ayúpte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the rock replied, “okay, so run over here, and swing your head.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktó héčhuŋ naháŋ íŋyaŋ kiŋ íčat’a kahíŋȟpeyiŋ na tȟatȟáŋka pȟá kiŋ áta kabléče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktó did that, and he ran into the rock really hard, and the buffalo skull completely shattered."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iyé natá kiŋ kȟó iwóič’ito čhaŋkhé natá ksúyeič’iye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he bumped himself against his head too, and so he hurt his head."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta kaítomni na tȟéhaŋ owáŋžila yaŋkíŋ na gléglepa-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he got really dizzy, and he sat still for a long time, and he flew up over and over again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš húŋȟ léčhel oyákapi: Tȟatȟáŋka pȟá uŋ hé wakpá él oíȟpeye-šípi čha ečhúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or some tell it like this: he was told to throw the buffalo skull into the river so he did it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iyé kȟó oíȟpeič’iyiŋ na ečhél mnít’e séče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he also threw all of himself into it until he might have drowned."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš uŋgnáš léčhetu: Iktó čhethí na owátohaŋyaŋ tȟatȟáŋka pȟá kiŋ pȟéta kiŋ iwáŋkab yúziŋ na ečhél líla ǧuíč’iya škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or maybe it’s like this: Iktó built a fire, and he held it over the fire until he burned himself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhekčhe oštéšteya wičhóoyake kiŋ lé oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They tell the story in many different and odd ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni oyáte waŋ wičhóthi yuŋkȟáŋ él wikȟóškalaka waŋ wíŋyaŋ wašté čha thí na líla waštélakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A people from long ago lived in a village, and so a pretty young woman lived there, and they really liked her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waúŋšila na nakúŋ ksápa čha wičháša kiŋ iyúha asčúpi na kičhí úŋpi čhíŋpi éyaš iyé wičháčhiŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was compassionate, and also smart, so all of the men were attracted to her, and they wanted to live with her, but she didn’t want them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él kȟoškálaka waŋ líla ówaŋyaŋg wašté čha tókhiyataŋhaŋ hí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day, a really good-looking young man from somewhere else arrived there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka k’uŋ líla waštélakiŋ na hiŋgnáyaŋ čhíŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young woman really liked him, and she said that she wanted to marry him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš, húŋku na atkúku kiŋ owíčhakiyake šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But she didn’t tell her mother and her father."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ée kȟoškálaka kiŋ kičhí naȟmála iyáyiŋ kta iglúštaŋ na héčhetkiya iglúwiŋyeya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Instead she decided to leave in secret with the young man, and she got ready over there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná haŋčhókaŋ háŋl hiyóhi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then, when it was the middle of the night, he came for her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka k’uŋ čhápala waŋ waníyaŋpi yuhá čha ikíkču na hinápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young woman took a beaver she had as a pet, and she left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka kiŋ thilázata apȟé nážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ kičhí iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young man was waiting behind the tipi, and so she went with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla yápi na blé waŋ šmá čha él ihúŋnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They went a ways, and they reached a deep lake."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ kȟoškálaka kiŋ, “Hó, nuŋwáŋ iblúweǧiŋ kta čha čhuwí akáŋl ímayotaka yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the young man said, “well, I’ll swim across it, so sit on my back.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš wikȟóškalaka kiŋ ečhúŋ čhíŋ šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the young woman said that she didn’t want to do it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wáŋčag kȟoškálaka kiŋ áta čhaŋzékiŋ na íšiŋkčhiŋ heyé, “‘Él íyotaka yo,’ epȟé!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all of a sudden the young man got really angry, and he angrily said, “I said, ‘sit on it!’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečhánuŋ šni kiŋháŋ mni-máhel iȟpéčhiyiŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If you don’t do that, I’ll throw you into the water!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná wikȟóškalaka kiŋ líla kȟokípȟa čha ečhél ečhúŋ, agná nuŋwáŋpi uŋspé šni kiŋ hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the young woman was really scared, so she did that, since moreover she hadn’t learned how to swim."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná nuŋwáŋ yápi na wikȟóškalaka k’uŋ čhuwí akáŋl yaŋkíŋ na nažúte kiŋ él étuŋwaŋ yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they went swimming, and the young woman was sitting on his back, and she sat looking at the nape of his neck."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ abléziŋ na héčhiyataŋhaŋ nakúŋ ité yukȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she noticed something, and there was a face, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋuŋ, kȟoškálaka waŋ waštélake k’uŋ hé lé é šni kiŋ nakéš abléziŋ na líla waȟtélašni na nakúŋ líla glá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Indeed, she realized that this wasn’t the young man that she liked, and she really hated him, and also absolutely detested him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyúweǧapi na khiyéla čhaŋmáhel wakhéya waŋ líla tȟáŋka čha etáŋhaŋ šóta izíta-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ él ípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They crossed, and they arrived at a big tent near the forest that had smoke coming out of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl wičháša kiŋ, “Maȟwá yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the man said, “I’m tired."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyómičile yo, kȟoháŋ mištíŋmiŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Look to see if I have lice, I’ll be sleeping in the meanwhile.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé waȟtélašni uŋ áta alóslos hiŋglé éyaš kȟaŋyéla hiyúŋka čha heyókičile na ečhél yuíštiŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she felt immense disgust towards him, but she laid down near him, and she searched for lice until she made him fall asleep."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ matȟápiȟ’a eyá líla čikčík’alapi čha opúza čhaŋkhé pȟehíŋ kiŋ égna psípsičapi!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was infested with what were small little toads, and so they jumped throughout his hair."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha íŋyaŋ blaská núm ičú na matȟápiȟ’a waŋží oyúspa čháŋšna íŋyaŋ kiŋ okógna égnakiŋ na šna íŋyaŋ kiŋ íčhiyapȟa na ečhél kat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she took two flat rocks, and whenever she caught a toad, she laid it between the rocks, and she often bumped the rocks together until it died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anúŋg ité kiŋ waná mahétuya ištíŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Double Face was in a deep sleep."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kiksúyešniyaŋ ȟpáye kiŋ heháŋl, pȟehíŋ líla háŋskaska yukȟé kiŋ húŋȟ ičú na léčhel yuhá škáŋ:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he was laying uncouscious, she took some of his really long hairs, and she used it like this:"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟošú waŋ él iyákaškiŋ na akhé húŋȟ tȟošú tȟókeča waŋ ektá éiyakaškiŋ na héčhel iyáza áye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She tied it to a tipi pole, and she tied it to some other tipi poles, and she went form one to another."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋp-s’e thiyókawiŋȟ glihúŋni čha iktómi tȟawókaške s’e híŋ na čhokáŋyaŋ anúŋg ité k’uŋ ȟpáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She went around the tipi just like that, so it sat like a spider web, and Double Face sat in the middle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčagna čhápala k’uŋ ikíkču na thiyátakiya íŋyaŋg gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Immediatley she took her little beaver and she started to run back home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná thíkhiyela kú yuŋkȟáŋ mní šmé k’uŋ glakíŋyaŋ ȟpáya čha ektá khihúŋni na tókȟa iyúweǧe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then she was coming close back to her home, and so she arrived back at the deep water lying across there, and she couldn’t cross it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éna íyotakiŋ na líla čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she sat back there, and she really cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena čhápa kiŋ čháŋ óta yaksáksa škáŋ naháŋ íyečhana čheyáktȟuŋpi waŋ kaȟ-yúštaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The beaver kept working biting down a lot of trees, and soon afterwards he finished making a dam."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha él alí gliyúweǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they crossed by walking on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋmá ečhíyatahaŋ waná makȟá alípi yuŋkȟáŋ tuwá wičhílazata páŋpaŋ ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They walked on the earth to the other side, and so someone was coming yelling behind them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka kiŋ hakíkta uŋkȟáŋ anúŋg ité k’uŋ hé é čha áta napé apáhaha étkiya íŋyaŋke!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young woman turned around, and so it was Double Face that was running towards her with his hand out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋš-eyá čheyáktȟuŋpi k’uŋ hé alí-wačhíŋ éyaš líla očík’ala kiŋ uŋ iwáŋyaŋg ȟ’aŋhíya ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was trying to walk on the dam too, but since it was narrow, he was coming carefully and slowly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča čha kȟoháŋ čhápa kiŋ étkiya yužúžu áye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1652;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like that so in the meanwhile the beaver was taking it apart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1652;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anúŋg ité kiŋ čhokáta í ȟčeháŋl čheyáktȟuŋpi kiŋ okápsagyiŋ na ohíŋȟpayiŋ na mnít’e."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1653;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Right when Double Face got to the middle, it struck off the dam, and he fell in, and he drowned."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1653;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena wikȟóškalaka k’uŋ čhápa oglúspiŋ na líla íŋyaŋg gníŋ na thiyáta khí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1654;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young woman kept holding the beaver, and she went back really running, and she got back home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1654;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél waŋglákapi eháŋl áta ok’óke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1655;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When they saw her there, there was a lot of commotion."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1655;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋkáke kiŋ líla wíyuškiŋpi na nakéš kȟoškálaka waŋ anúŋg ité kiŋ é kúŋze k’uŋ hé hiŋgnáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1656;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Her parents were really happy, and finally she married the young man that Double Face pretended to be."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1656;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhápala uŋ hé theȟílapi na taŋyáŋ yuhápila čha hetáŋhaŋ áta waštéič’ila škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1657;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They loved that little beaver, and they kept him, and from that it thought very highly of itself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1657;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1658;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1658;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni, oyáte tȟáŋka waŋ wičhóthi yuŋkȟáŋ égna wikȟóškalaka waŋ witȟáŋšna úŋ čha él thí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1661;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1661> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago, a large group of people were camped, and so she lived as a single woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1661;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla wíŋyaŋ wašté na wakáȟ wóphika čha wičháša kiŋ iyúha yúzapi čhíŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1662;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1662> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was a very pretty woman, and she was skilled at making things, so all the men wanted to take her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1662;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1663> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš waŋžíni wičháčhiŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1663;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1663> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But she didn’t want anybody."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1663;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša óta ókšaŋtaŋhaŋ oyúspe hípi khéš átaš él éwičhatuŋwe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1664;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1664> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever many men came around to court her, she didn’t look at them at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1664;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ haŋhépi waŋ él, akhé kȟoškálaka kiŋ ektá ípi na okhíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1665;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1665> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one evening, the men came by again, and they courted her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1665;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1666> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋží wókiyag nážiŋ na uŋmá kiŋ hená enána apȟé yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1666;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1666> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One stood talking, and others sat back there waiting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1666;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ȟčeháŋl itókaǧataŋhaŋ kȟoškálaka tȟókča waŋ ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1667;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so just then one other young man was coming from the south."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1667;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na agná kȟoškálaka waŋ kičhí wóglaka-he uŋ hé átaš éwačhiŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1669;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And moreover she didn’t pay any attention to the young man that was talking with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1669;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečháŋleš waŋží ú k’uŋ hé ečéla ayúta-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1670;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Instead she was only looking at the one that was coming."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1670;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná khiyéla ú yuŋkȟáŋ áta wakšúpi eyála s’e iglúziŋ na pȟehíŋ háŋskaska na tókhel okíhika ówaŋyaŋg wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1671;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he was getting close, and so he was wearing nothing but beadwork, and his hair was really long, and he was as good-looking as could be."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1671;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hihúŋni kta háŋl sémni waŋ wíŋyaŋ kiŋ wókiyaka-he uŋ hé iyénayiŋ na ȟeyáb iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1672;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When he was arriving, the young man that had been talking to the woman gave up, and he went away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1672;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka waŋ ú k’uŋ wikȟóškalaka kiŋ aóhomni iyáyiŋ na itȟókab hinážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1673;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young man who was coming went around the young woman, and he arrived in front of her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1673;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1674> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Hó, wíŋyaŋ, nišnála waštéčhilake uŋ, tȟéhaŋtaŋhaŋ wahí yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1674;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1674> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “hey, woman, since I like you alone, I came from very far away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1674;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgníŋ kta čha čhihíyowahi yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1675;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You and I will go back, so I came here for you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1675;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1676> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iyówiŋyaye háŋtaŋš, mihákab ú wo,” ekíye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1676;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1676> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if you agree, come back with me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1676;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1677> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhegla waéyiŋ na khiglá uŋkȟáŋ wáŋčagna ihákab iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1677;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1677> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all he said, and he left and so immediately she followed after him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1677;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1678> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ čha kȟoškálaka uŋmá k’uŋ hená iyúha inážiŋpi na owátohaŋyaŋ étkiya étuŋwaŋ nážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1678;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1678> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She did that, so all the other young men stopped, and they stood watching her for a short time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1678;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1679> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na haŋkéya kibléčahaŋpi na thípi ektákta glápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1679;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1679> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And finally they scattered, and they went back to their tipis."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1679;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1680> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, haŋhépi átaya wikȟóškalaka kiŋ kȟoškálaka kiŋ lé kičhí ománi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1680;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1680> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all night the young woman was walking along with the young man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1680;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1681> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná líla tȟéhaŋl ihúŋnipi uŋkȟáŋ heyé:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1681;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1681> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they arrived a long way off, and so she said,"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1681;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1682> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Yú! Ečéš, ȟ’aŋhíya máni ye! Líla nilúzahaŋ čha watúkȟamayaye kštó,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1682;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1682> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Gosh! Gosh, don’t walk fast! You walk really fast, so you are tiring me out.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1682;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1683> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša kiŋ íšikčhiŋ, “Hóȟ, iníla khéš ináȟni yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1683;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1683> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the man said angrily, “goodness no, hurry up quietly instead!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1683;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áŋpawi kiŋ hináphiŋ kta čha wakhíhuŋni kte héčha yeló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1684;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The sun will come up, so I must get back.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1684;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wikȟóškalaka k’uŋ blihéič’iyiŋ na ihákab máni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1685;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the young woman gathered her courage, and walked following him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1685;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waná wí hináphiŋ kta wahéhaŋl kȟoškálaka uŋ hé ayúta uŋkȟáŋ haŋhépi hiyói uŋ hé é šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1686;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then around the time when the sun was rising, she looked at that young man, and so in the evening he was not the one that had taken her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1686;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakšúpi na pȟehíŋ na wókȟoyake waštéšte uŋ hená iyúha tókȟaȟ’aŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1687;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All the nice beeded things, and hair, and costumes were gone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1687;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ée wičháša kiŋ akȟóketkiya máni éyaš nakúŋ ahítuŋwaŋ ú s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1688;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Instead, the man walked with is back to her, but it was like he was coming looking at her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1688;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anúŋg ité eyápi héčha!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1689;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was the one called Double Face!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1689;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Yá!” wikȟóškalaka kiŋ eyíŋ na éna patȟág inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1690;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ah!” the young woman said, and she stopped back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1690;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčagna anúŋg ité k’uŋ kawíŋȟ hiyú na uŋžíŋžiŋtka hú waŋ yužúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1691;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Immediately Double Face turned around, and he pulled out wild roses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1691;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuhá áta kasáksakiŋ na pasí áye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1692;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He whipped her with it, and he marched ahead of her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1692;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1693> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wakpála čhúŋšoke waŋ opȟáya yápi uŋkȟáŋ čhaŋmáhel šóta izíta čha étkiya pačékček áye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1693;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1693> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they were going along the forest, and so he pushed her towards something smoking in the woods."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1693;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1694> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, hél wizíla – thiíkčeka tȟaŋníla – waŋ háŋ čha thiyópa kiŋ él inážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1694;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1694> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, they arrived at the door of an old smokey tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1694;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1695> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná wičháša kiŋ leyé, “Hó, thimá iyáya yo!” eyá čha thimíyaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1695;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1695> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the man said, “hey, go inside!” so she went inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1695;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1696> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl čhatkúta wikȟóškalala núm yaŋkápi čha waŋwíčhayaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1696;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1696> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then she saw that two young women were sitting at the back of the tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1696;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1697> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ité na napé kiŋ áta oíyokšilyela ȟaŋȟáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1697;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1697> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Their sad faces and hands were full of scabs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1697;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1698> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ anúŋg ité kiŋ; “Hó, iyáyiŋ na hená ób íyotaka yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1698;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1698> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Double Face said, “okay, go and sit with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1698;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená íŋš-eyá waštéič’ilapi čha awíčhawagli yeló!” eyá čha ób íyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1699;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They thought highly of themselves too, so I brought them here!” he said, so she sat with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1699;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1700> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thičhókata očhéthi waŋ yaŋkíŋ na él čhéǧa ogná táku píǧiŋ na áta anágloglo-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1700;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1700> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She sat in the middle around the fire, and there was a kettle boiling something, and it was bubbling."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1700;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1701> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ etáŋhaŋ wičhánape waŋ nawáŋkal hiyú!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1701;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1701> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a human hand rose from in it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1701;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1702> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na thiyópa ikȟáŋyela winúȟčala waŋ yaŋká yuŋkȟáŋ anúŋg ité kiŋ hekíye:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1702;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1702> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And an old woman sat near the door, and so Double Face said to her,"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1702;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1703> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Uŋčí, lená waná eyáš špáŋ načhéče ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1703;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1703> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Grandma, maybe these are cooked too much."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1703;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha imíčiču wo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So get it for me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka kiŋ lená ób wátiŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyá čha kazé na wakšíča tȟáŋka waŋ ožúye, waháŋpi kȟóya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will eat these young women,” so she served a dish, and she filled a big bowl, including soup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na anúŋg ité kiŋ wók’u čha waháŋpi iyáyustag yúte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And she fed Double Face, so he ate it together with the soup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iglúštaŋ na heháŋl wikȟóškalaka kiŋ wóyapte kiŋ wičhák’u."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He finished it, and then he gave the women the leftovers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1708> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičálapi šni éyaš uŋžíŋžiŋtka hú k’uŋ hé uŋ áta wičhákasaka čha waháŋpi na tȟaló kiŋ hená yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1708;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1708> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They refused it, but he whipped them with the rose stalks, so they ate the soup and the meat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1708;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, wól iglúštaŋpi uŋkȟáŋ heháŋl anúŋg ité kiŋ iglútȟaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1709;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, they finished eating, and so then Double Face got all dressed up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1709;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1710> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé hayápi waštéšte eyá uŋ šna wíŋyaŋ wičhágnaye uŋ hená kič’úŋ na phiyá wičháša wašté ič’íčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1710;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1710> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He put on the nice things that he had often tricked the girls with, and he turned into a good-looking man again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1710;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1711> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl winúȟčala uŋ hé khíŋ na, “Hó, Uŋčí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1711;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1711> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he addressed the old woman and said, “well, grandma."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1711;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1712> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé ománi mníŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1712;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1712> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will leave walking around again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1712;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1713> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoháŋ lé wikȟóškalaka waŋ eháke awágli kiŋ lé kté na pȟá kiŋ kaksá yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1713;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1713> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meantime, kill the last woman that I brought back here, and cut off her head!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1713;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókša wátiŋ kte ló,” eyíŋ na tokhíyotȟaŋ iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ll surely eat it,” he said, and he left to somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1715> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ winúȟčala uŋ hé hewíčhakiye, “Tȟakóža, wikȟóškalaka waštéšte léčhel ečé awíčhagli na šna wičhákte na wičháyute."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1715;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1715> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the old woman said to them, “grandchildren, he only brings pretty women like this back, and usually he kills them, and he eats them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1715;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha takómni niyé kȟó niyútapi čhíŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he certainly wants to eat you all too!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš, tȟakóža, nitȟéčapi kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But you, granddaughters, you all are young."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na miyéš makáŋ ye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I’m old myself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha maktépi na líla napȟá khiglá pe,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So kill me, and run back to where you came from,” she said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl leyé; “Kákhiya čhaŋmáhel čhaŋwákakse s’a kiŋ héčhiya nazúŋspe čík’ala mitȟáwa kiŋ hé ičú pe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then she said, “take that small ax of mine there where I often cut down trees."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ mitȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ iyáyustag iȟpéyapi na ináȟni napȟá pe!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so throw it away with my body and hurry away!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná witȟáŋšna úŋ waŋ eháke aglípi k’uŋ hé inážiŋ na winúȟčala kiŋ kat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the last woman to have arrived stood up and she killed the old woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na waéčhuŋ-ší uŋ hená ečhékčhe ečhúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She did that, and since she told her to do things, she did them like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iyúha líla khiglápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So all of them really went back to where they had come from."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tónačhaŋ heháŋyaŋ líla thiyátakiya íŋyaŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They sprinted towards home for a couple days."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋhaŋ yámni-čhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ anúŋg ité kiŋ khihúŋni na tȟaló tȟéča kiŋ iyútȟa čhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Three days later, Double Face arrived back, and he wanted to taste the fresh meat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl čhaŋmáhel tuwá čhaŋ-kátoto-haŋ čha ektá hóyeye; “Uŋčí, waná kú na lená imíčiȟ’aŋ yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then somebody was knocking on wood, so he yelled out, “grandma, come now and cook me something!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wátiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’m going to eat.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Tȟakožá, híŋyaŋka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so someone responded, “grandson, wait a minute."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná čónala ihéwakiya čha waglúštaŋ na heháŋl wakú kte ’uŋ,” eyá ayúpte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will finish the little that I have left to do, and then I’ll be coming back.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena čhaŋzékiŋ na, “Wáŋ, Uŋčí, ináȟni-čhiší yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He kept being angry and he said, “hey, grandma, I told you to hurry up!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ináyaȟni šni háŋtanaš tȟebčhíyiŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if you don’t hurry up, I will eat you up!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá uŋkȟáŋ winúȟčala k’uŋ hé akhé hóuye; “Híŋyaŋka, Tȟakóža."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that, and so the old woman said again, “wait a minute, grandson."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná léčheglala čha waglúštaŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now this is all so I’ll be finished.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anúŋg ité uŋ waná áta čhaŋzégzeg hiŋgníŋ na čhaŋyátakiya yé éyaš kȟúŋšitku tȟaŋčháŋ kiŋ ečéla t’á ȟpáya čha iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Double Face then got really angry, and he went towards trees, but he found just his grandmother’s dead body."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčagna, “Waȟtéšni šíčapi kiŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Immediately he said, “pieces of trash!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋčí míktepi na tókhel iyáyapi ’uŋ!” eyíŋ na thi-ánataŋ na míla tȟáŋka okíle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They killed my grandmother and left somehow!” and he charged towards the house and looked for his knife."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyékiyiŋ na héčhena wikȟóškalaka kiŋ oyé otȟáb wičhákhuwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He found it and he kept chasing after the young women’s tracks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta líla lúzahaŋ čha wáŋčag tókȟašniyaŋ wičhákigleǧe!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He ran super fast so he had no problem catching up with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka eháke k’uŋ hakíkta uŋkȟáŋ waná anúŋg ité kiŋ toháŋyela ú na leyáya íŋyaŋke:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The last young woman turned around, and so Double Face was coming from there, and he ran saying,"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Waȟtéšni kiŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Piece of trash!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ináȟmemayákhiyapi okíhipi šni!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They can’t hide you from me!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makȟá kiŋ níškola yeló!” eyíŋ na áta míla kpazózo ú čha wikȟóškalaka eháke k’uŋ áta čhéya íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The world is only so big!” and he came showing off his knife, so the last young woman ran along sobbing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl itȟókab blé waŋ líla tȟáŋka čha yaŋká čha óhuta kiŋ él inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then, she came up to the shore of a really big lake that was there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhokáta thípi máza waŋ háŋ čha waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she saw that in the middle there was an iron house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ etáŋhaŋ wičháša waŋ líla háŋska čha hinápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a really tall man came out of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ uŋ nihíŋčiya kipáŋ; “Wičháša, ómakiya ye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The woman yelled out in fear, “sir, help me!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋ makté kte ’uŋ!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Something is going to kill me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Oháŋ, tȟoéyaš takúmayayiŋ kta hwo?” eyá ayúpte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he responded, “okay, but first, what will your relationship to me be?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé, “Íŋ, hiŋgnáčhiyiŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ wičála šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “uh, I’ll marry you,” and so he refused."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1751> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hiyá, tóškhe takúmayayiŋ kta hwo?” eyá čha wótakuye eyá yukȟé kiŋ iyúha čhažéyate."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1751;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1751> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“No, how is it that you will be related to me?” he said, so she named all the kinship relations that people can have."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1751;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1752> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óhaŋketa, “Atéčhiyiŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ “Háu, Čhúŋkš, héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1752;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1752> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally she said, “you will be my father,” and so he said, “yes, daughter, that’s how it is."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1752;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha mní kiŋ alí hiyú wo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So come walking across the water.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ mní kiŋ alíli íŋyaŋkiŋ na thípi kiŋ él ihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she ran on the water, and she arrived at the house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl nakéš waná anúŋg ité k’uŋ mnióhuta él hinážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then finally at that moment Double Face got to the edge of the water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sáŋm hiyú okíhi šni čha aglágla glakíŋkiŋyaŋ íšiŋkčhiŋ máni-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He couldn’t come any further, so he angrily walked along the edge of the water from side to side."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋ heháŋl leyé, “Hó, Čhúŋkš, thimá níŋ kte éyaš waktá yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the man said, “Well, daughter, you were going inside, but wait."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wamákȟaškaŋ tób wičhábluha yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I have four animals."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiyópa kiŋ itȟáŋnuŋg igmú tȟáŋka waŋ é na matȟó waŋ kičhí ȟpáye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "On the doors on both sides lay a cougar and a bear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na thičhókab zuzéča tȟáŋka waŋ yuŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And in the middle of the house there’s a big snake."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na thičhátku kiŋ hél íŋš tȟatȟáŋka waŋ ȟpáye ló,” eyé.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1761;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And there’s a buffalo at the honor place."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1761;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1762> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha thimá ilániŋ kte kiŋháŋ, ‘Até thimá hiyú-maší ye,’ eyá yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1762;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1762> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So when you go inside, say, ‘my father told me to come in.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1762;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1763> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na zuzéča waŋ ȟpáye kiŋ akȟótaŋhaŋ, tȟatȟáŋka waŋ ȟpáye kiŋ itȟáhena, hél iyókogna íyotaka yo,” eyá čha ečhékčhe ečhúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1763;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1763> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the snake that’s laying on the other side, and the buffalo that’s laying on this side, sit down between them,” he said, so she did it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1763;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋ íŋš-eyá thimá gličú, na thiyópa máza kiŋ ečhél iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1764;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1764> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The man was going back inside, and he closed the iron door."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1764;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl anúŋg ité kiŋ tókheškhe hiyú wélakȟa hihúŋni na thiyópa kiŋ katóto."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1765;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1765> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then Double Face, evidently having come somehow, arrived there, and he knocked on the door."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1765;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wičháša šíča, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ hé hiyúmičičhiya yo!” eyá čha, “Iyáya yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1766;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Evil man, hand me that woman!” he said, so he said, “leave!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1766;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mičhúŋkši kiŋ ayúštaŋ yo!” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ héčhena áta čhaŋzéke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1767;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leave my daughter alone!” and so he kept being really angry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1767;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1768> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míla tȟáŋka waŋ yuhá k’uŋ hé uŋ thiyópa kiŋ tókhel okíhika aphíŋ na kašpú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1768;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1768> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He banged his knife that he had on the door as much as he could, and he knocked it loose."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1768;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1769> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha wičháša waŋ máza thípi othí uŋ hé é čha heyé, “Igmú, matȟó, wíŋyeya ȟpáya po!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1769;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1769> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the man who lived in the iron house said, “cougar, bear, lie ready!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1769;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1770> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na waná wahúkheza waŋ uŋ anúŋg ité kiŋ khiŋíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1770;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1770> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then he threw a lance at Double Face."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1770;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ makhú ot’íŋs aphíŋ na ȟčeháŋl igmú na matȟó k’uŋ áta iyáȟpayapi na ktépi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1771;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it hit him right in the chest, and just then the cougar and bear attacked him, and killed him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1771;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičháša uŋ hé anúŋg ité k’uŋ yuslóhaŋ áyiŋ na makȟóblaye waŋ él éuŋpe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1772;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that man dragged Double Face away, and he laid him in a flat meadow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1772;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heyé, “Hó, Čhuŋkší, čhaŋšéča óta tȟokšú aglí na akšú na ačhéthi yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1773;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said, “well, daughter, come back carrying dried wood, and pile it on him, and light a fire on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1773;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na él waŋyáŋg nážiŋ yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1774;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And stand looking at him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1774;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ táku wóyuha waštéšte hetáŋhaŋ napsípsil hiyú kte éya waŋžíni ičú šni yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1775;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And don’t take any one of the nice items that will spring out of there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1775;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Waŋží uŋgná iyáču kiŋháŋ, šičáya kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1776;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If you take one, it will be bad!” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1776;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wikȟóškalaka k’uŋ waná ečhél ečhúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then the young woman did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ anúŋg ité kiŋ ȟugnáȟ áye kiŋ ečhél, táku waštéšte pȟéta kiŋ etáŋhaŋ napsípsil hiyú – wizípȟaŋ naíŋš takúku wíŋyaŋ tȟa-wóyuha héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so while Double Face was burning up, many nice items sprung out from the fire – satchels or items that are women’s things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟahíŋšpa waŋ uŋ háŋpa kaǧéǧepi s’a kȟá čha líla wašté yuŋkȟáŋ napsíl hiyú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1779;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she remarked a very nice awl to make moccasins out of that sprung out from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1779;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na wikȟóškalaka kiŋ itȟókab kawóslal glihé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It did that and it stood in front of the young woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ atkúku kiŋ héčhuŋ šni ší éyaš núŋǧe wanílya ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so her father told her not to do that, but she took it without listening."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Á oȟláthe yumáhel ičú yuŋkȟáŋ héčhena tȟahíŋšpa k’uŋ áta čhuté él ičhápȟe!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She took it under her armpits, and so the awl accidently stabbed her under the arm."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anákiȟma uŋ-wáčhiŋ éyaš waná líla yazáŋ na išíl áya čha áta t’íŋ kte s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She tried to hide it, but then it hurt a lot, and she was becoming sick because of it, so she felt like she was going to die."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha héčhetu khéš ogláke: “Até, tákuni ičú šni-mayáši k’uŋ, tȟahíŋšpa waŋ iwáču."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this being the case she said, “father, you telling me not to take anything, I took an awl."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná uŋ mat’íŋ kte s’eléčheča ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So now I feel like I’m going to die.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heyá ayúpte, “Háu, hé wičháša kiŋ nikté čhíŋ yuŋkȟáŋ waná witkóya oyáȟ’aŋ čha héčhel óyakiye ló!” ekíye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he responded, “yes, that man wants to kill you, and so you took that action so you helped him like that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ matȟó kiŋ aphíye-ší."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he told the bear to cure her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟnáȟna ohítiya škáŋ éyaš áta otúyačhiŋ čha haŋkéyaš iyénaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He worked ferociously while grunting, but it was absolutely in vain, so he gave up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heháŋl igmú tȟáŋka uŋ hé iyútȟe eyáš íŋš-eyáš okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then the cougar tried, but he couldn’t either."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ aphíye-wačhíŋ na akhé okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then the buffalo tried to heal her, and he couldn’t again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó heháŋl zuzéča k’uŋ hečéla okápte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then the snake was the last one left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná owótȟaŋla ȟčiŋ iyúŋkiŋ na á kiŋ yapȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1792;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he laid down straight up, and he held his mouth to her armpit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1792;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1793> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ ópta iyáyiŋ na zuzéča uŋ siŋté kiŋ alí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1793;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1793> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then the buffalo went by, and he stepped on the snake’s tail."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1793;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1794> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta čhaŋzé hiŋgníŋ na wikȟóškalaka kiŋ wanúŋ yaȟtáke!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1794;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1794> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it got really angry, and he bit the young woman on accident!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1794;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1795> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ á kiŋ líla pó hiyúyiŋ na etáŋhaŋ tȟahíŋšpa uŋ hé naslúta čha akísni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1795;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1795> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a lot of puss came from her armpit, and the awl came out, so she was cured."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1795;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl wičháša kiŋ heyé, “Hó, Čhúŋkš, toháŋyaŋ yačhíŋka lél úŋ wo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1796;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then the man said, “well, daughter, stay here as long as you want."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1796;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1797> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na toháŋl iyónikiphi na yaglá yačhíŋ kiŋháŋ ogláka yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1797;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1797> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if you are happy and you want to go back home, tell me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1797;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋke s’e yuŋkȟáŋ watóhaŋl líla thiyáta glá čhíŋ čha atkúku kiŋ okíyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1798;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1798> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It seemed like some time and then at one point she wanted to go back home, so she told her father that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1798;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ matȟó kiŋ é na igmú tȟáŋka k’uŋ kičhí akhíȟpeye-wičháši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1799;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1799> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he told the bear and the cougar to go with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1799;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1800> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Thi-ótȟaŋiŋyaŋ éiȟpeyapi na gličú po,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1800;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1800> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Drop her off in sight of her tipi and come back,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1800;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha matȟó igmú kičhí wikȟóškalaka kiŋ waná aglápi na thi-ótȟaŋiŋyaŋ inážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1801;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1801> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the young woman went was going back with the bear and the cougar, and they stopped in view of her tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1801;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋhaŋ išnála gníŋ na thiwégna khí čha áta oíyokiphi tȟáŋka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From there she was going back alone, and she arrived on the outskirts of the tipis, so she was really happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl wamákȟaškaŋ kiŋ kawíŋǧapi na íŋš-eyá thiyátakiya khiglápi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the animals turned around, and they started back on their way home, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1814> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka yámni čhiyékičhiyapi čha  thípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1814;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1814> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kálThree young men were brothers to each other so they lived over there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1814;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakhúl wóphikapi na nakúŋ waókapi čha yuphíya tákuni ičákižešniyaŋ úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1815;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were skilled in hunting, and they were good marksmen, so they lived not suffering from lack of anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1815;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš waŋžíni tȟawíčutȟuŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1816;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But not one of them were married."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1816;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1817> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él, wíŋyaŋ waŋ ȟtayétu eháŋl tȟaŋkál hinážiŋ na pȟámahel ičhóma nážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1817;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1817> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day, a woman was standing outside when it was evening, and she sat with a blanket wrapped on her head."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1817;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1818> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl wóta-haŋpi čha tȟokápȟa kiŋ heyé, “Wáŋ, thimá kičhó po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1818;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1818> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then they were eating, so the eldest one said, “hey, invite her in!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1818;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1819> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋš-eyá wótiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1819;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1819> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She’ll eat, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1819;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1820> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé Hakéla ináphiŋ na thimáhel ú-ší."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1820;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1820> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the youngest one went out and asked her to come inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1820;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iníla ȟčiŋ híyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1821;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she sat down all quietly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1821;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wók’upi éyaš iníla ȟčiŋ ičú na tákeye šni wóte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1822;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They gave her things to eat, but she took them quietly, and she ate not saying anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1822;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tokȟáš waŋží hiŋgnáyiŋ kta hí séča uŋkȟáŋ tȟéhaŋ él úŋ éyaš héčhuŋ kta awáčhiŋ šni čha ablézapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1823;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe she had come to marry one of them, and so she was there for a long time, but they realized that she wasn’t thinking of doing that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1823;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl kȟokípȟa áyapi na, “Uŋgnáš lé uŋktépi čhíŋ na uŋ hí séče ló!” ekíčhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they were getting scared, and they said to each other, “maybe she wants to kill us, and that might be the reason she came!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ híŋhaŋni waŋ él, ománi yápi kta uŋkȟáŋ Hakéla léčhel ekíyapi: “Hó, Hakéla, aŋpétu átaya thiákaŋl yaŋkíŋ na awáŋyaŋka yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one morning, they were going to walk around, and so they told Hakéla, “hey, Hakéla, sit on the tipi all day, and stand watch."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na uŋglípi kiŋ táku tókȟa háŋtaŋš oyáka yo,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And when we come back, if something’s the matter, say so.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná čhiyéku kiŋ iyáyapi čha ób iyáye kúŋziŋ na ečháŋleš héktakiya glí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then the younger brothers left, so he pretended to leave with them, but instead he came back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiíkčeya tȟošú kiŋ waŋží alí na íŋkpata yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1828;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He climbed up one of the tipi poles, and he sat at the top."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1828;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1829> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhéškoȟloka kiŋ ogná thimá éyokas’iŋ na wákhil yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1829;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1829> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He peered inside through the smoke hole, and he sat looking around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1829;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waná wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ hé išnála yaŋká kéčhiŋ na šiná waŋ wičhápȟaha ečé uŋ káǧapi čha glubláye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1830;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then the woman thought that she was sitting all alone, and she spread out her blanket made of scalps."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1830;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na leyé, “Lé naháŋȟči waglúštaŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1831;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And she said, “I still haven’t finished this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1831;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1832> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš Hakéla pȟehíŋ šikšíčela kiŋ iwáču kiŋháŋ, heháŋl éwakihuŋni kte ’uŋ!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1832;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1832> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But when I take Hakéla’s really bad hair, then I will have finished!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1832;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1833> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hakéla thi-ákaŋl hé naȟ’úŋ yaŋká čha líla nihíŋčiye-la, na čhiyéku kiŋ glípi eháŋl wáŋčag owíčhakiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1833;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1833> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hakéla was really scared sitting there listening on the tipi, and when the brothers came back, he told them it immediately."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1833;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1834> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé híŋhaŋni čhaŋkhé kȟoškalaka kiŋ ománi iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1834;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1834> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again it was the morning, and so the young men left walking around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1834;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1835> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ wóžuha gluškíŋ na etáŋhaŋ táku eyá gmigmágma čha šiŋšíŋyela púza čha napóžula ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1835;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1835> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then she untied a bag of hers and she took a handful of round and wrinkled dry things from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1835;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na waháŋpi kiŋ él okála na ečhél khičháŋye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1836;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1836> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She did that, and she sprinkled them on the soup, and she spiked it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1836;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1837> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná špáŋ čhaŋkhé wótiŋ kta čha waháŋpi eyá kaptá ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1837;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1837> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then it was cooked, and so she would drink it, so she ladled up some soup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1837;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1838> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leyaš táku ókaȟ hiyéye kiŋ hená wičhánuŋǧe héčha!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1838;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1838> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the things that were scattered throughout were human ears!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1838;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1839> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé é čha pusyá yuhá na eyášna yúte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1839;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1839> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was that that she had dry, and she often ate them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1839;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1840> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ kiŋ él Hakéla thi-ákaŋl waŋyáŋg yaŋká čha áta tȟaŋságt’e."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1840;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1840> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hakéla sat on the tipi seeing her doing that, so he was scared to death."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1840;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1841> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhiyéku glípi eháŋl héčhena owíčhakiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1841;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1841> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And when the brothers came back, he still told them about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1841;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1842> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Naúŋpȟapi kta iyéčheča yeló!” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1842;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1842> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “we should run away!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1842;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1843> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš tȟokéya wíkȟaŋ waŋ ičúpi na tónačhaŋ heháŋyaŋ aŋpétu ál’ataya čhéǧa waŋ ogná piȟyápi, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ ománi iyáya čhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1843;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1843> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they took a rope first, and they boiled it in a kettle for several days all day, when the woman left walking around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1843;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1844> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná tȟéhaŋ héčhuŋpi na pusyápi čha tókhel okíhika pȟaŋpȟáŋla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1844;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1844> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they did that for a long time, and they dried it, so it was as fragile as coupld be."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1844;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él, wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ glí čha, “Hó, tȟaŋkší, čhaŋk’íŋ yá yo,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day, the woman came back, so they said, “hey, younger sister, go gather wood.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čháŋ čhoǧíŋ šašá hená ečé akú wo,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said, “come back with the red pith of a tree.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíkȟaŋ kiŋ k’úpi na wíŋyaŋ kiŋ čhaŋmáhel iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They gave her the rope, and the woman went outside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pahá aísiŋyaŋ iyáya yuŋkȟáŋ héčhena ȟčiŋ uŋwéya pȟakíȟtapi na líla napȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She left to the other side of the hill, and so they bundled up her travel provisions, and she left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoháŋ, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ čháŋkaksa-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meantime, she was chopping wood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš čhoǧíŋ šašá kiŋ hená (čhaŋšúška eyápi héčha) líla suksúta na okákse šíča čha tȟéhaŋ theȟíya škáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But those piths of the trees were really hard (they were box elders), and they were hard to cut, so she was working hard for a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka kiŋ héčhel slolyápi čha hé uŋ čháŋ héčha ečéla akú-šípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young men knew that, so for that reason they told her to only come back with wood like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná ok’íŋ waŋ káǧe éyaš yuhá inážiŋ kta khéš ečháŋl wíkȟaŋ kiŋ kapsáka na čháŋ kiŋ okálaya hiŋȟpáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then she made a carrying pack, but when she arrived with it, the rope broke and the wood fell scattering about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta iyótiyekiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was a really hard process."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1854> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel théȟiya kú naháŋ haŋkéya thiyótȟaŋiŋyaŋ glihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ waná othíwota."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1854;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1854> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She came back in a hard way like that, and finally she arrived back with the tipi in sight, and so it was an old campsite."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1854;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta íšiŋkčhiŋ heyé, “Waȟtéšni šíčapi kiŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1855;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she said angrily, “pieces of trash!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1855;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋk’uŋ lená ečhákel akú-mašípe lé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s clear that they told me to do that on purpose."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš tókȟa šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But that’s no problem."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owíčhabluspiŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyíŋ na líla wičhákhuwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will catch you,” she said, and she chased after them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hakíktakta íŋyaŋkapi uŋkȟáŋ waná wičhílazata pahá waŋ aíyoȟpeya áta makȟá šóta s’e hiyú!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They ran looking behind themselves, and so she came behind them like smoke rolling downhill!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná khiyéla ú čha tȟokápȟa kiŋ uŋkčéla waŋ pahí na héktakiya kaȟ’ól iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then she was coming close, so the oldest one picked up a cactus, and he threw it behind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lazáta makȟá kiŋ áta uŋkčékčela hiŋglá čha wíŋyaŋ kiŋ íȟaŋhaŋ tókȟani hiyú šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the ground behind them suddenly became a cactus bed, so the woman wasn’t able to come for a little while."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋkéya ȟ’aŋhíya, čhaŋkú iwáŋyaŋg okógnagna okáwiŋȟwiŋȟ ú čha kȟoháŋ líla tȟéhaŋ iȟpéya iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally, she was coming turning around between the roads looking through, so in the meanwhile they ran away for a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš wíŋyaŋ kiŋ líla kaȟwóka čha íyečhana akhé wičháyuza nuŋs’é aú!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the woman was really quick, so she came almost catching them shortly thereafter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ, tȟokápȟa íyokhihe kiŋ hé míla gluslútiŋ na héktakiya iȟpéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, the next oldest one pulled out his knife, and he threw it behind himself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ áta makȟá etáŋhaŋ míla pȟestóstola yawá-phičášniyaŋ óta čha hináphiŋ na ówaŋčaya pȟestóstoya hé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there were countless sharp knives sticking out of the earth, so they came in sight, and they stood up sharp everywhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akhé hél owátohaŋyaŋ ú okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she couldn’t come at them for a short time again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš tóškhe akhé naíč’išpiŋ na wičhákigleǧa nuŋs’é aú!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But she escaped again somehow, and she was coming almost catching up with them!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčagna nihíŋčiya makhínaȟtaȟtakapi uŋkȟáŋ makȟá kiŋ áta wičhíhakab glakíŋyaŋ našléče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Immediately they stomped and stomped out of fear, and so behind them the earth cracked here and there behind them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ sáŋm hiyú okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the woman couldn’t come any more."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena líla íŋyaŋkapi na wakpá waŋ otȟáŋka čha glakíŋyaŋ ȟpáya yuŋkȟáŋ él inážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They kept sprinting, and they arrived at a large river that was laying across."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná čhopȟá iyúweǧapi kta háŋl, ečháŋl winúȟčala tȟókeča waŋ tokhéčela máni-la čha čhaŋyátaŋhaŋ hiyú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When they were crossing it by wading into it, a different old woman came barely walking from the woods."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé heyé, “Tȟakožá, kȟowákataŋ éiȟpemaya pe,” ewíčhakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And she told them, “grandchildren, bring me across the river.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla ináȟnipi na nakúŋ nihíŋčiyapi éyaš akhé úŋšilapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were really rushing, and they were scared too, but they were also compassionate."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waŋží k’íŋ na iyúweȟ aí yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl heyé, “Íŋše lé óčhičiyapi kta tkȟá waúŋšiyalapi héčiŋhaŋ slolwáya wačhíŋ ye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So one of them put her on his shoulders, and crossed with her, and so she said, “I was just going to help you, but I wanted to know if you all were compassionate."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná khiglá pe!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then go back the way you came!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ ečháni ú kte kštó,” eyá čha akhé líla napȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The woman will be coming here,” she said, so they left again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋpi na ítohaŋtu yuŋkȟáŋ wíŋyaŋ šíče k’uŋ mnióhuta ektá hihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that and a little later the bad woman arrived at the edge of the water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél áta blézešniyaŋ glakíŋkiŋyaŋ mni-áglagla oíŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There she was walking around the edge of the water back and forth all crazed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé winúȟčala k’uŋ wíŋyeya nážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the old woman stood ready."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ šíče k’uŋ mní él čhophíŋ kte ȟčeháŋl winúȟčala kiŋ pȟéta waŋ wakpá él oíȟpeye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Right when the bad woman was about to wade into the water, the old woman threw a torch into the water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1881> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta iléšaša hiŋgníŋ na mní k’uŋ áta pȟéta hiŋglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1881;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1881> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So suddenly red flames burst up, and all of the water became fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1881;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé hetáŋhaŋ kȟoškálaka kiŋ kpaptápi na thiyáta ní khípi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the young men survived from there, and they got back home alive."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yašlé waŋ tókhiya yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ othíweta waŋ él míla waŋ iyéyiŋ na yuhá héčhena yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A coyote went going somewhere when he found a knife in an abandoned campsite and he still went along with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl pahá akȟótaŋhaŋ matȟó tȟáŋka waŋ ú čha kȟokípȟa čhaŋkhé blokáskaska-ič’íye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then a big bear came from the other side of a hill so he was scared and so he was hiccupping himself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na heyé, “Wáŋ, híŋhaŋni kiŋ lé táku tȟáŋka tȟebwáya owákihi čha léčhel blowákaska-he!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that and he said, “hey, this morning I could gobble down something big so that’s why I’m hiccuping.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ matȟó kiŋ íŋš-eyá blokáskaska na, “Wáŋ, híŋhaŋni kiŋ lé táku níškola tȟebwáya owákihi čha léčhel blowákaska-he k’uŋ!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the bear hiccuped too and he said, “hey, this morning I could gobble down something as small as this so you know that’s why I’m hiccuping!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá čha heháŋl yašlé k’uŋ íčat’a kȟópȟegla čha míla waŋ iyéye uŋ hé pazózo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that so then the Coyote was extremely afraid so he showed off the knife that he had found."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na nakúŋ olówaŋ waŋ léčhuŋp-s’e hópȟestoya yawáŋkal éyaye: “Tuwá mitȟókab hiyáya čháŋšna čhawápȟapȟa na wakté yeló.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he also raised his voice in song in a squeaky way and said, “whenever someone passes in front of me I stab and stab away and kill them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Matȟó íŋš waŋží ahíyayiŋ na; “Tuwá mitȟókab hiyáya čháŋšna blaȟúȟuǧiŋ na wakté yeló,” eyá lowáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Bear also sang one and he sang, “whenever someone passes in front of me, I chew them to pieces and kill them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš Yašlé naȟ’úŋ šni kúŋs akíš’aš’a na míla k’uŋ yuptáŋptaŋ na matȟó uŋ khuwá éyaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Coyote, pretending not to hear, gave off some war whoops and turned the knife over and over and he chased the bear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iyé tȟáŋka k’éyaš nakípȟiŋ na čhaŋóžu waŋ él khinážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was big himself but he ran away and he stopped in a forest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé akhé, “Mačík’ala éyaš tuwá čhaŋwóhaŋ ináȟma čháŋšna pazáŋzaŋ él mníŋ na čhawápȟapȟa ’uŋ,” eyá lowáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote sang again, “I’m small but whenever someone hides among the trees, I go looking through it and stab away.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá yuŋkȟáŋ Matȟó akhé napȟíŋ na wakpá waŋ él mničhókab inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that and so Bear ran away again and he stopped in the middle of the water in a river."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé, “Tuwá mničhókaya onápȟa čháŋšna mní él kignúŋg iblámniŋ na čhawápȟapȟa ’uŋ!” eyá lowáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote sang, “Whenever someone flees into the middle of the water, I dive into the water and I stab away!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha Matȟó akhé napȟá uŋkȟáŋ waná heháŋyaŋ Yašlé kȟokípȟe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Bear ran away again and so then Coyote wasn’t scared anymore."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé Yašlé heyé, “Wáŋ, Misúŋ, kú wo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1899;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote said, “hey, little brother, c’mon back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1899;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wačhíŋka kiŋháŋ eháŋni čhačhípȟapȟa kta kȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If I had wanted to, I would have already stabbed you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋše lé waškátiŋ na hepȟá-he ló!” eyá čha Matȟó él glí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was just playing and that’s all I’m saying,” he said so Bear came to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1902> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš hetáŋhaŋ zuyá yápi yuŋkȟáŋ maštíŋčala waŋ čhaŋkú glakíŋyaŋ hiyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1902;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1902> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So from there they went on the warpath and so a rabbit was crossing the road."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1902;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1903> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena Yašlé: “Wáŋ, Maštíŋčala; nakpá háŋskaska na phuté ȟčiȟčí! Hiyú uŋtȟó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1903;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1903> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Coyote said, “Hey, rabbit; long ears and ragged nose! C’mon."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1903;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1904> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Zuyá uŋyáŋpi čha níš-eyá óyapȟa kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1904;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1904> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We’re on the warpath so you should join in, too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1904;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Maštíŋčala íŋš, “Éyaš oímayaȟaȟa k’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so rabbit said himself, “but you made fun of me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé akhé, “Huŋhuŋhí, íŋše ówehaŋhaŋ ‘Pȟežíȟóta mnála’ epȟé ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote said again, “Goodness, I was just saying ‘it smells like white sage’ as a joke."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tasé oštéšteya waéčhičiye ka!” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ ognáye wašté čha wičála na ób iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Of course I didn’t say those weird things to you!” he said, and so he tricked him good so he believed him and he went with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná wí khúčiyela yaŋká čha patȟág inážiŋpi na pȟeží wókheya waŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the sun was low so they stopped there and they made a grass shelter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thimá íyotakapi ȟčeháŋl waná tȟóka eyá ahíhuŋni na áta aóglutȟewičhayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Right when they sat down inside, some enemies arrived and they completely surrounded them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Matȟó thiyópa ot’íŋš yaŋká čha Yašlé heyé, “Wáŋ, Misúŋ, makíyukȟaŋ yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Bear sat in the doorway so Coyote said, “hey, little brother, make room for me!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Miyéš wičháwakhute wačhíŋ ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I want to be the one to shoot them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyé k’éyaš tȟóka kiŋ uŋgnáhelaka kakhíyotȟaŋ eyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that but suddenly the enemies left in some direction."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hétkiya wičhákhuwa íŋyaŋkapi na pahá aísiŋyaŋ khíyotakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they ran following them in that direction and they sat down on the other side of a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟóka kiŋ akhé aglíhuŋni na ób kičhízapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the enemies arrived back and they fought with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owátohaŋyaŋ héčhuŋpi na óhaŋketa napȟéwičhayapi čha tȟóka k’uŋ áta ábeya akhíyagle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that for a short time and finally they drove them off so all the enemies scattered off from where they came from in different directions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš itȟókab iyé líla wičháopi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But beforehand they shot at them a bunch."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé heyé, “Itȟó, líla uŋkópi čha waná mázasu kiŋ ihóȟpa hiyúuŋkiyapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote said, “I guess, they really shot us so now we should shoot out our bullets."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwé núm ótaȟča hiyúuŋyaŋpi héči henáos ohíyapi kte ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If two of us shoots a whole lot, those two will win."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na waŋží íŋš čónala hiyúye kiŋ hé uŋmá kiŋ ktépi na yútapi kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the one who shot the fewest bullets will be killed and eaten!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhetulapi čhaŋkhé waná mázasu kašpášpa hiyúkiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they agreed and so they spat away with their bullets."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1921> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Matȟó líla óta akhígle ópi čha iyé mázasu ótaȟča hiyúye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1921;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1921> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Bear shot just a whole lot of times so he shot out a lot of bullets."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1921;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš ištógmus yaŋkíŋ na héčhuŋ čha kȟoháŋ Yašlé Maštíŋčala kičhí ókšaŋtaŋhaŋ amánuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he sat with his eyes closed and he did that so meanwhile Coyote stole them from all around him with Rabbit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná henála yuŋkȟáŋ Matȟó itȟáŋokšaŋ čónala yuhá (amánuŋpi kiŋ uŋ) čha ktépi kta kéyapi yuŋkȟáŋ héčhetukila čhaŋkhé ktépi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now there was nothing left and so Bear had few around him (them having stole them) so they said that they would kill him and so he agreed and so they killed him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš yútapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they didn’t eat him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé Maštíŋčala hekíye, “Hó waná wakȟáŋyaŋ wówahiŋ kta čha iyáyiŋ na Uŋčí tȟa-čhéǧa k’uŋ makáku wo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote said to Rabbit, “Well now I will cook some sacred things so go and bring me back grandma’s kettle.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Maštíŋčala psípsil pahá aínab iyáyiŋ na áškaŋ šni s’e čhéǧa waŋ yuphíya wiyákpa čha aglí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Rabbit left jumping over to the other side of the hill and he came back quickly with a kettle that was well polished."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé hé é šni kéyiŋ na akhé hiyóye ší na heháŋl čhéǧa waŋ šá líla wašté aglí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote said that that wasn’t it and he sent him there to get it again and then he came back with a really nice red kettle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé hé é šni kéyiŋ na tȟókeča waŋ akú ší čhaŋkhé waŋží tȟoyéla wašté čha aglí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again, he told him that that wasn’t it and he send him back again to get a different one and so he came back with a nice blue one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ k’éyaš akhé hé é šni kéya čhaŋkhé akhé iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that but again he said that that wasn’t it and so he left again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhéǧa waŋ áta šilyéla ȟuȟúǧahaŋ čha aglí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he came back with a pot that was all banged up and red."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé, “Wáŋ, wačhíŋtȟuŋšni-la!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote said, “hey, stupid!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakéš hé é yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally this is it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta…eháš iníč’iȟaȟa yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What a fool you always make of yourself.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná tȟaló eyá iyóȟpeyiŋ na Maštíŋčala wayáotȟaŋiŋ ší."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he boiled some meat and he told Rabbit to make an announcement about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyapaha ománi yuŋkȟáŋ enánataŋhaŋ wamákȟaškaŋ kiŋ iyúha, matȟápiȟ’a yéš kȟó ahíhuŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he walked around announcing it and so from back in those place all the animals, even including toad, came to there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hípi na íŋyaŋ blaská waŋ akáŋl Yašlé itȟáŋčhaŋ égnakapi čha waná wičháša tȟáŋka ič’íla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They came and they sat Coyote on top of a flat rock like a chief so then he saw himself as an important man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ištógmus, ǧúŋǧa yaŋká-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ ečháŋl wamákȟaškaŋ k’uŋ táku iȟ’áŋ-he uŋ hená, pápa kȟóya, áta ikhíničapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "With his hand of his mouth, he was sitting haughtily and so just then the animals all fought over the things that he had been cooking, including the jerky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha khuwá éwičhayayiŋ kte éyaš íŋyaŋ k’uŋ éna uŋzé kiŋ áta iyáskape!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was going to chase them off but his butt was all stuck to the rock back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha líla páŋ éyaš ečháŋl ábebekiya khiglápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he screamed out but just then they left to return where they came from all scattered."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta “Pápa mič’íčhaǧe ’uŋ!” eyáya čhéya úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was crying out, “you know that I’m made that jerky for myself!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ kȟoháŋ uŋkčékhiȟa waŋ pápa k’uŋ yuhá kiŋyáŋ hiyáya čha waŋglákiŋ na iyótaŋ líla čhéya-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so meanwhile a magpie flew by with the jerky so he saw it and he cried really bad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhúŋhaŋ, píško eyá itȟáŋokšaŋ okíŋyaŋpi čha heyá páŋ; “Misúŋ, misúŋ, theȟíya maŋké ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meantime, some nighthawks flew around him so he yelled out, “Little brother, little brother, I’m doin’ bad!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Úŋšimala po!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Have pity on me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš él étuŋwe šni okíŋyaŋ-haŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl, “Ničhíŋča kiŋ wičhábluonihaŋ kte ló!” eyá wičhákipaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they flew around not paying attention to him and so then he yelled out to them, “I will be respectful to your children!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ píško uŋ waŋží khúčiyela kiŋyáŋ hiyú na kawáŋkal khiglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a nighthawk came soaring down and turned back up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhúŋhaŋ líla úŋkče hiŋglé kač’úŋ Yašlé kákhi tókhiya áta kaȟláya iȟpéye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Meanwhile, because he farted all of a sudden, Coyote was peeled off of the rock thrown over there in some direction."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Yašlé heyé, “É, šilyéla!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Coyote said, “hey, ugly!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋše ikčéya maŋká-he k’uŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You know I was just sitting here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwáš heháŋyaŋ ohítiya hokší-thekíȟila ka,” eyíŋ na nážiŋ hiyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He’s someone who really must love his children,” he said and got up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčag uŋkčékhiȟa waŋ pápa kiŋ khí k’uŋ hé iyátȟab yíŋ na mní waŋ él ihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Immediately he went following the magpie that stole the jerky and he arrived at a body of water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mni-máhel étuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ héčhiya uŋkčékhiȟa uŋ hé yaŋkíŋ na pápa waŋ amánuŋ k’uŋ hé ahípazo s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He looked in the water and so there he saw that magpie sat down and it was like he was holding out the meat that he stole."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha Yašlé líla čhaŋzékiŋ na kignúŋg iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Coyote was really angry and dove in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakpála čheté él yutȟáŋtȟaŋ olé k’éyaš oníya ptéčela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He searched feeling around on the bottom of the river but he didn’t have enough breath."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhetu khéš óhaŋketa nawáŋkal khiglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But whenever he was like that, finally he came back up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šeháŋštukȟa waná íŋyaŋ eyá ičú na pȟaǧé él aígluskitiŋ na akhé kignúg iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For sure this time he took some rocks and binded them around himself and he dove in again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš tké kiŋ uŋ áta okáspiŋ na khutákiya iyáye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he sank on account of his weight and he went downward!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ niyášni t’íŋ kta wahéhaŋl tokhéčela kpaptíŋ na puzáta khihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so at about the time that he was about to die from lack of breath, he barely survived and he returned back to dry land."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leyáš halháta k’uŋ čhaŋ-wáŋkal yaŋkíŋ na pápa kiŋ kiyúta-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all the while the magpie sat on a branch and he ate his jerky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš mní kiŋ míyoglas’iŋ s’e ȟpáyiŋ na hé Yašlé gnáye, éyaš abléze šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the water was like a mirror and it tricked Coyote, but he didn’t realize that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná waštéyela tȟebkhíyiŋ na iyáyiŋ kta háŋl Yašlé ihúkhul kašé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now he was completely eating his foot and just when he left, Coyote tripped over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1961> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kaítuŋkab gliȟpáyiŋ na waŋkál étuŋwaŋ ȟpáya yuŋkȟáŋ nakéš waŋyáŋka škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1961;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1961> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He fell down on his back and he lay looking upwards and so finally he saw him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1961;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1962> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1962;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1962> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1962;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu waŋ él, Khéya ozúye olé ománi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1964;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One day, Snapping Turtle was walking around looking for a war party."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1964;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ pȟatkáša waŋ él hí na “Čhiyé, tókhiya lá hwo?” eyá čha, “Íŋše zuyá blé,” eyá ayúpte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1965;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he came up to a turtle and he said, “little brother, where are you going?” so he responded, “I’m just going on the warpath.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1965;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Itȟó, Čhiyé, uŋyíŋ kte ló!” eyá čha kičhí yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1966;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “I guess I’ll go with you,” and he went with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1966;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Čhaȟóta hiyáyiŋ na waŋwíčhayaŋka čha inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1967;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Ashes went past and he saw them so he stopped there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1967;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókhiya lápi hwo?” eyá čha okíyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1968;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Where are you two going?” he said so they told him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1968;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1969> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ób yíŋ kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1969;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1969> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it is said that he went with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1969;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1970> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná yámni yá-haŋpi, yuŋkȟáŋ zičá waŋ íŋš-eyá ópȟa kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1970;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1970> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the three of them went along, and so it is said that a squirrel joined them, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1970;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1971> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná tópa zuyá yápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1971;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1971> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the four of them went on the warpath."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1971;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íyokhiheya waléǧa waŋ é na thuswéčha waŋ ahí-ópȟapi čha waná šákpepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1972;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Next a bladder and a dragonfly came and joined them so then there were six of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1972;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta iyókiphiya lowáŋwaŋ yápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1973;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they all went happily along singing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1973;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟóka wičhóthi kiŋ ihúŋnipi šni haŋní, wakpála waŋ iyúweǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1974;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Before they arrived reached the enemy camp, they crossed a river."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1974;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1975> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla ȟliȟlíla čha Pȟatkáša kaȟlí na glinápȟa okíhi šni čha iȟpéya iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1975;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1975> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was really muddy so turtle got stuck and he couldn’t get back up so they left him behind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1975;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1976> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš záptaŋla waná yápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1976;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1976> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so now just five of them went along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1976;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1977> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ útahučhaŋ tȟáŋka waŋ oȟláthe iyáyapi yuŋkȟáŋ hél úta líla óta enána hiyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1977;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1977> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they went under a big red oak tree and so there were many acorns scattered about back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1977;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1978> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčagna Zičá sáŋpȟa yá čhíŋ šni kéya čha úŋyaŋ iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1978;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1978> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said that squirrel immediately didn’t want to go further so they left him behind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1978;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóblala waná zuyá yápi yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhela tȟaté hiyú, na Čhaȟóta woblú iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1979;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then just four of them went along and so suddenly the wind blew, and Ashes was blown away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1979;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl wóȟešma waŋ ópta yápi naháŋ el wapȟépȟeka óta, čha Waléǧa iyúȟlečiŋ na sníze!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they went through a patch of thick grass and there were a lot of brambles there, so Bladder tore against them and he deflated!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Thuswéčha uŋgnáhela pšá na čhaŋkȟáhu kiŋ katȟáŋkal iyékiya čha t’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Dragonfly suddenly sneezed and he blew out his back so he died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Khéya heíč’iye; “É, iyéš mišnála waú kiŋ wašté kȟá,” eyíŋ na waná tȟóka thípi kiŋ ektá ihúŋni na él iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Snapping Turtle said to himself, “Huh, it should be good that I’m the one to be coming here all alone,” and then he reached the enemy tipis and he went there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ oyáte kiŋ, “Wáŋ, táku héčhiyataŋhaŋ ú weló,” eyápi na áta ok’óke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the people said, “Hey, something is coming from over there,” and there was a fuss."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičúpi na wíŋyaŋ kiŋ iyótaŋ waštélakapi na, “Má! Čhéwiŋš waštéla ké! Tákula he?” eyá nážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They took him and the women especially liked him, and they stood saying, “Wow! How cute is he! What is he?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tákuwe hí kiŋ iyúŋǧapi čha, “Zuyá wahí yeló!” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “Huŋhí! Čísčila éyaš zuyá hí-la kštó,” eyápi, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ iyúha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They asked him why he came so he said, “I came on the warpath!” and so all the women said, “Gosh! He’s small but he just came on the warpath.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Zuyá hí kiŋ lé táku kȟokípȟe-la sél?” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “I wonder what this thing that came on the warpath is afraid of?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Pȟéta kȟoyákipȟa he?” eyápi uŋkȟáŋ, “Hóȟ, hé átaš wókȟokpȟeke šni!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “are you afraid of fire?” and so he said, “Oh absolutely not, I’m not afraid of it at all!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heháŋl táku wókȟokpȟeke kiŋ iyúha čhažéyatapi éyaš hená átaš ítokȟa šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then they named all the sorts of things that are dangerous but it’s said that he didn’t worry about any of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(Iyúha itéšniyaŋ kȟokípȟe éyaš wičhágnaye wačhíŋ.)"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(He was very much afraid of all of them but he was trying to trick them.)"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óhaŋketa mni-máhel iȟpéyapi kta kéyapi uŋkȟáŋ ité agláȟpiŋ na čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally they said that they would throw him into the water and so he covered his face and cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Mní ečéla kȟowákpȟe!” eyíŋ na líla čhéya čha wakpá-ta áyapi na čhokáta oíȟpeyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“I’m only afraid of the water!” he said and he was really crying so they brought him to the river and they threw him into the middle of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋyaŋ s’e mahél iyáya čha khiglápi kta uŋkȟáŋ ȟčeháŋl glinápȟiŋ na áta akíš’aš’a nuŋwáŋ hiyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went in like a rock so just when he was about to return back from where he came, he came back into sight and he swam along giving some war whoops."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na iyé khiglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that and he himself went back to where he came from."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiyáta khihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ khéya oyáte kiŋ áta wóiyuškiŋ uŋ wačhípi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He reached back home and so snapping turtle nation danced with joy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl tuwá táku waŋží líla čhíŋ éyaš wičála šni kúŋza čháŋšna, Lakȟóta kiŋ leyápi: “Khéya čha mní él áyapi kte ȟčiŋ s’e” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays whenever someone really wants something but they pretend not to believe that, Lakota people say, “they’re a turtle so it’s like they really want to be brought to the water.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p1997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=1997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟeží háŋskaska ožú waŋ él, tȟašíyagnuŋpa wíŋyela waŋ hoȟpí kíčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In a growth of long grass, a female meadowlark made her nest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waná čhiŋčá kiŋ tȟaŋkíŋkiŋyaŋ áyapi éyaš naháŋȟči kiŋyáŋpi uŋspépi-la šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then she was carrying her large children but they still didn’t know how to fly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu waŋ él wítaya yaŋkápi ȟčeháŋl uŋgnáhela siŋtéȟla waŋ wahóȟpi kiŋ ohómni hiyúŋke!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When one day they were sitting together suddenly a rattlesnake came and lied down around the nest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla tȟašíyagnuŋpa húŋkupi kiŋ kȟokípȟa čha áta čhaŋtíyapȟa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The meadowlarks’ mom was very scared so her heart was beating very hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš ítokȟa šni s’e iyókiphi kúŋziŋ na heyé, “Huŋhí, Čhiŋkší, nilékši kiŋ waná hí čha lol’íwečiȟ’aŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But, as if she wasn’t worried, she pretended to be happy and she said, “well, my son, your uncle just came here so I will cook for him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyáyiŋ na čhéǧa waŋží olé ye!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leave and look for a kettle!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhena čhiŋčá tȟokápȟa kiŋ kiŋyáŋ iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then the oldest one left flying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé tȟoká kiŋyé wačhíŋ-la éyaš taŋyáŋkel iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That one just tried to fly for the first time but he left pleasently."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋ glí šni yuŋkȟáŋ tȟašíyagnuŋpa wíŋyela k’uŋ heyé, “Huŋhí, čhéǧa olé iyáye uŋ hé tȟéhaŋ glí-la šni!”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He didn’t come back after a long while and so the female meadowlark said, “well, that one who went to look for a kettle just hasn’t been back for a while!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyíŋ na čhiŋčá íyokhihe kiŋ čhiyéku okíle yeší."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said that and she told her next oldest son to go look for his older brother."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé íŋš-eyá iyáyiŋ na akhé tókhi iyáya tȟaŋíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that one left too and again he left somewhere until he wasn’t visible anymore."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé waŋží yeší čha iyáya yuŋkȟáŋ čík’ala ȟče kiŋ waná ečéla éna yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She told one to leave again and so he left and so then only the littlest one was sat back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná siŋtéȟla k’uŋ apȟé kapíŋ na phiphíya iyúŋka čha ziŋtkála kiŋ áta nihíŋčiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the rattlesnake got tired of waiting and he lied down again and again so the bird was really scared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Hakéla, Čhíŋkš, ničhíye awíčhatuŋwe yá ye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2017;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “Littlest one, my son, go look for your older brothers!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2017;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáš núnipi séče,” eyá čha íŋš-eyá kiŋyáŋ iyáye-la."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2018;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe they got lost,” so he just left flying away, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2018;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel iyúha iglúsotapi na heháŋl tȟašíyagnuŋpa wíŋyela k’uŋ ákablablaǧiŋ na, “Hó, hél ȟpáya ye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2019;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they were all gone and then the female meadowlark spread her wings and said, “well, keep laying down here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2019;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2020> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwé čha lol’íničiȟ’aŋ kta héči!” eyíŋ na íŋš-eyá tokhíyotȟaŋ iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2020;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2020> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I wonder who it is that will make your food!” and she left to somewhere, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2020;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ zuzéča kiŋ gnáyaŋpi čha akíbleza škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2021;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the snake realized that they tricked him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2021;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2022;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2022;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka waŋ líla theȟílapi yuŋkȟáŋ hé šiná waŋ waštéȟča čha yuhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A boy was very loved and so it was a really nice blanket that he had."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Óhiŋniyaŋ ahókipȟiŋ na nakúŋ glušlóka čháŋna waŋkál otkékiye s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He took good care of it and also whenever he took it off, he would always hang it up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ haŋhépi waŋ él, tuwá manúŋ éyaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so at night, someone went away having stolen it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčag okíle iyáyiŋ na yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgná igmú tȟáŋka waŋ khušéya hinážiŋ čha atáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Immediately he went to look for it and was going and so suddenly a cougar stopped blocking the path so he ran into him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé hekíye, “Tókhiya lá hwo, Tȟakóža?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “Where are you going, Grandchild?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šiná kiŋ oyákile héči, lél ogná tuwá yuhá yá čha waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If you lost your blanket, I saw someone who was going along with it along this way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhena okíle yo, Tȟakóža."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So still look for it, Grandchild."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš, táku tókȟa háŋtaŋš ečháš anámataŋ yo!” ekíye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But, if something goes wrong, be sure to run towards me,” he told him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hetáŋhaŋ yá yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl ziŋtkála waŋ ptehíŋčičila eyápi héčha čha čhaŋwáŋkal yaŋká uŋkȟáŋ atáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was going from there and so then he saw a type of bird called a killdeer so he sat up in a tree and so he ran across him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watȟéšlaka sápa waŋ pȟóštaŋ na akíš’aš’a nážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He had a black band around his head and he stood there crying out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka k’uŋ waŋyáŋke eháŋl ayáštaŋ na heyé, “Tȟakožá, šiná oyákile načhéča čha táku tókȟa kiŋháŋ anámataŋ yo!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When he saw the young man he stopped crying out and he said, “Grandchild, you might be looking for a blanket so if something goes wrong run towards me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé tȟatȟáŋka waŋ él í yuŋkȟáŋ íŋš-eyá heyé, “Tȟakóža, táku tókȟa kiŋ anámataŋ yo!” ekíye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again he got to a buffalo and so he said too, “Grandchild, if something goes wrong, run towards me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋmáhel thípi waŋ háŋ čha ektá í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was thus that he was going along and so he reached a tipi standing in the woods."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itȟáŋokšaŋ makȟá kiŋ sutá čha él wakȟáŋyaŋ čhaŋhúta ič’íčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2054;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All around the ground was hard so he magically turned into a tree stump."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2054;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel nážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ wikȟóškalaka waŋ tȟa-šína k’uŋ hé úŋ čha hinápȟiŋ na tȟéhaŋ ayúta nážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2055;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He stood like that and so a young woman wearing that blanket of his came out and she stood looking at him for a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2055;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tóhaŋni ká čhaŋhúte kiŋ kál hé šni ’uŋ,” eíč’iyiŋ na thimá khiglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2056;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“That stump has surely never stood there before,” she said to herself and she went back inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2056;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2057> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčagna akhé kȟoškálaka k’uŋ kiwíčhaša na ektáwapȟaya iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2057;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2057> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That young man immediately turned himself back into a person and he went a little further."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2057;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2058> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná čhaŋókpaŋ puŋpúŋ ič’íčhaǧiŋ na thi-kȟáŋyela yuŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2058;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2058> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he turned himself into rotten woodchips and he lay close to the tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2058;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2059> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka uŋ akhé hinápȟiŋ na tȟéhaŋ ayúl nážiŋ na heháŋl akȟóketkiya yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2059;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2059> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young woman came out again and for a long time she stood there looking at him and then she went into the distance."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2059;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2060> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl akhé kiwíčhaša hiŋgníŋ na nážiŋ hiyáyiŋ na ilázata hiyú na šiná uŋ hé khi-wáčhiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2060;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2060> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then he suddenly turned back into a person and he came up behind her and he tried to take the blanket from her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2060;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2061> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka kiŋ áta blaǧáhe s’e howáye éyaš kȟoškálaka kiŋ yušlóg khí na gluhá thiyátakiya napȟé!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2061;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2061> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young woman let out a howl but the young man pulled it off and he fled back home with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2061;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2062> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wíŋyaŋ kiŋ tȟatȟáŋka gnaškíŋyaŋ ič’íčhaǧiŋ na áta khuwá ahíyu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2062;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2062> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the woman turned into the Crazy Buffalo and started to chase after him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2062;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná ahíkigleǧiŋ kte s’eléčheča uŋkȟáŋ wana ptehíŋčičila uŋ hé anátaŋ na, “Tȟuŋkášila, táku waŋ makté kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2063;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then it seemed like she was about to catch up with him and so then the killdeer charged forward and he said, “Grandfather, something’s going to kill me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2063;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé ptehíŋčičila k’uŋ glakíŋkiŋyaŋ khušéya kiŋyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2064;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the killdeer flew back and forth blocking the way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2064;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ čha tȟatȟáŋka k’uŋ inážiŋ na kičhí kičhíziŋ na ičhúŋhaŋ sémni k’uŋ líla napȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2065;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that so the buffalo stopped and he fought with it and meanwhile the young man ran away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2065;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2066> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟatȟáŋg-gnaškíŋyaŋ kiŋ ptehíŋčičila kiŋ tóškhe ktéla naíŋš gnáye lakȟa akhé khuwá-he!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2066;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2066> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the Crazy Buffalo just killed the killdeer somehow or it must have tricked him due to him chasing him again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2066;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta nihíŋčiya íŋyaŋkiŋ naháŋ igmú tȟáŋka uŋ hé tókhiyataŋhaŋ khušéya hinážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2067;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was running really scared and the cougar came up out from somewhere and blocked the path."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2067;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha oȟláthe iyáyiŋ na, “Tȟuŋkášila, táku waŋ makté kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2068;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he went under him and he said, “Grandfather, something’s going to kill me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2068;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2069> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha íŋš heháŋl waná tȟéhaŋ tȟatȟáŋg-gnaškíŋyaŋ kičhí kičhíze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2069;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2069> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then he himself then fought with the Crazy Buffalo for a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2069;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2070> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ waná igmú tȟáŋka kiŋ hetáŋhaŋ iglášpe lakȟa akhé kigléǧiŋ kta uŋkȟáŋ ȟčeháŋl tȟatȟáŋka ȟčalá k’uŋ hé khušéya hinážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2070;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2070> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It went like that for a long time and so then he must have broken loose from the cougar overtaking him and so just then the old buffalo stood in his path."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2070;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2071> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha kȟoškálaka kiŋ áta kaslóhaŋ gliȟpáyiŋ na niyášnišni, “Tȟuŋkášila, táku waŋ makté kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2071;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2071> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the young man fell headlong into him and out of breath he said, “Grandfather, something’s going to kill me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2071;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2072> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha glóglo nážiŋ na waná tȟatȟáŋg-gnaškíŋyaŋ k’uŋ hihúŋni kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2072;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2072> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he stood grunting and then the Crazy Buffalo was about to reach that place."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2072;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2073> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Našlóg itkób iyáyiŋ na áta tȟatȟáŋg-gnaškíŋye k’uŋ thezí woȟlél iyéyiŋ na ečhel kté!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2073;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2073> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He rushed forward facing him and he tore open the Crazy Buffalo’s stomach and he killed him like that!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2073;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2074> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha tȟatȟáŋka waŋ ókiye k’uŋ táku wóyuha waštéšte k’ú, na hetáŋhaŋ oyáte thípi ektá khihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2074;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2074> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he gave the buffalo that helped him some good possessions, and from there he arrived back at his home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2074;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2075> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟéhaŋ tókȟaȟ’aŋ úŋ čha húŋku na atkúku kiŋ nuphíŋ tȟéhaŋ čhéyapi kač’úŋ ištáǧuŋǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2075;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2075> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he had disappeared for a long time so, due to both his mother and father crying for a long time, they were blind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2075;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na nakúŋ wašíglapi uŋ pȟehíŋ glašlápi na úŋšiye ȟčiŋ čhaŋtéšilya yaŋkápi háŋl él wičhágli."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they also cut their hair in morning his death, and they sat miserably and sadly when he came back to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha maǧážu mní eyá ičú naháŋ ištá kiŋ awíčhakaštaŋ na uŋ ištá wičhákičiyužaža."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he took some rain water and he poured it into their eyes and using it he washed their eyes for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl tuŋwáŋpi na wawáŋyaŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they opened their eyes and they could see."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ natá kiŋ ál’ataya slawíčhayiŋ na pȟehíŋ kiŋ kaháŋskeya wičhákičičasto na uŋ pȟehíŋ háŋskaska uyéwičhakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He also rubbed all over their heads with annointing oil and he combed their hair smooth with long strokes and in that way he grew their hair for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl eháŋni s’e pȟehíŋ kiŋ háŋskeskeya wičhákičisuŋ na ištá kȟó aphíwičhakičíčhiya čha líla philáwičhaya škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then he braided their hair long for them like in the old days and he also healed their eyes for them and so they thanked him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoškálaka tób ówaŋžila thípi yuŋkȟáŋ tȟéča ȟče kiŋ, Hakéla ečíyapi kiŋ hé, čháŋ etáŋ ičú kta inápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Four young men lived together and so the youngest one, his name was Hakéla, he went outside to gather some wood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋčag akhé thimá gličú na wíŋyaŋ waŋ tȟaŋkál nážiŋ-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Right away he came back inside and he said that a woman was standing outside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhiyéku kiŋ heyá iwíčhayuŋǧe, “Takúuŋyaŋpi kta hwo?” eyá čha, “Tó, tȟaŋkéuŋyaŋpi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He asked his older brothers, “how is she related to us?” so they said, “Yeah, she must be our older sister.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thimáhel kičhó wo,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Invite her inside.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Hakéla khináphiŋ na, “Tȟaŋké, thimá hiyú wo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Hakéla went back outside and said, “older sister, c’mon inside.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Taŋyáŋ kičhó éyaš ayúpte šni iníla ȟčiŋ thimáhel hiyú na hetáŋhaŋ ób thí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He invited her inside well but she came inside all quiet not responding and from then on she lived with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná kȟoškálaka kiŋ ománi yápi kta čha, “Hakéla, awáŋyaŋka yo,” eyápi na iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the young men would go walking around so they said, “Hakéla, take care of her,” and they left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hakéla héčhena ziŋtkála waŋ škíbibila eyápi héčha ič’íčhaǧiŋ na thičhé íŋkpa ektá kiŋyáŋ iyáhiŋ na él yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hakéla all of a sudden turned into a type of bird that’s called chickadee and he flew and sat up at the top of the tent and he sat there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waná kȟoškálaka kiŋ tȟéhaŋl iyáyapi s’eléčheča kiŋ leháŋl, wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ hé wópȟaȟte gluǧáŋ na glužúžu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then, it feeling like the young men had left to a long ways away, the woman opened up her bundle and unpacked it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋhaŋ šiná waŋ áta wičhápȟaha kšúpi čha glubláye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From there she spread out a blanket all decorated with scalps."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aglúta na heyé, “Hakéla pȟehíŋ kiŋ šikšíčela k’éyaš oyáya kiŋ éčuȟčiš uŋ-phíča séče ’uŋ,” eyíŋ na wókȟokipȟeya iȟát’é!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2108;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She stared at it and said, “Hakéla’s hair is pretty bad but you know at least the limbs might be useful,” and she laughed scarily."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2108;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyá naȟ’úŋ kiŋ wáŋčagna Hakéla čhiyéku kiŋ éowičhakiyaka čha glípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As soon as he heard her say that, Hakéla went to tell his big brothers that so they came back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ él úŋ šni čha naȟmála mní piȟyápi na wíkȟaŋ waŋ tȟéhaŋ lolóbyapi na glí eháŋl k’úpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the woman wasn’t there so in secret they boiled some water and they boiled a rope for a long time until it was tender and when she came back they gave it to her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hekíyapi, “Hó, Tȟaŋké, čhaŋk’íŋ iyáya yo.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they said, “Hey, big sister, go out and gather wood.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ čhaŋk’íŋ í na čháŋ óta pahí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the woman got there to gather wood and she gathered a lot of wood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó tkȟá iyéna k’íŋ kta čhaŋ wíkȟaŋ k’uŋ kapsáka-haŋ čhaŋkhé tȟéhaŋ glí šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But every time she was about to put it on her back, the string went breaking and so it was a long time until she got back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečhél thiyáta tȟa-wóyuha k’uŋ áta oíleyapi na heháŋl nakípȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They set all of her possessions at home on fire like that and then they ran away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, wíŋyaŋ uŋ thiyátakiya étuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ líla izíta čha šóta kiŋ waŋyáŋkiŋ na gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2115;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, the woman looked back towards the home and so smoke was really rising up so she saw that it was smoking and she went back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2115;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Glí uŋ héhaŋ čhaŋzéya heyé, “Waȟtéšni kiŋ, theȟíya omákiȟ’aŋpi ’uŋ!”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When she got back she was angry and said, “Pieces of trash, they really treated me badly.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heyá hóyewičhakhiye, “Tókhiya lápi kta kéčhaŋnipi he?” eyáya wičhákipaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And she said yelling out, “do you all think you know where to go?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyíŋ na áta pȟéta kiŋ él yuǧálǧal iyéyiŋ na máza-waháčhaŋka waŋ é na mas’íhuŋničatȟa waŋ héčhel ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said that and she thrust her arms into the fire and like that she took out an iron shield and an iron club."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuhá nážiŋ hiyáyiŋ na wičhákhuwa čhaŋkhé líla íŋyaŋkapi kiŋ uŋ themnít’api."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She suddenly stood up with those and followed after them and so she sweated a whole lot from running."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokápȟa kiŋ, “Misúŋ, iyáya po! Miyé waná owákihi šni yeló!” eyíŋ na éna patȟág inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The eldest one said, “Younger brother, go! Me, I can’t go any further!” and he stopped back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahíŋkpe óta yuhá čha uŋ héktakiya wíŋyaŋ kiŋ khuté na ótakiya ó éyaš átaš ítokȟa šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He had a lot of arrows so for that reason he shot back at the woman and he hit her many times but she didn’t care at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éeye héčhena ú na áta iyúha pȟá kaksáksa awíčhau na ečhél ówečhiŋhaŋ wičhákte!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Instead she was still coming and she was coming towards them cutting off all their heads until she killed them one by one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na eháke Hakéla okápta háŋl akhé škíbibila ič’íčhaǧiŋ na kiŋyáŋ iyáyiŋ na čhaŋwáŋkal íyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And finally when Hakéla was the last one left, he turned into a chickadee again and he left flying away and he sat on a branch."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ oȟláthe wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ hinážiŋ na kat’ápt’ape."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the woman stopped below him and she snapped her fingers at him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečháŋl uŋkčékhiȟa waŋ iyópteya iyáya čhaŋkhé él étuŋwe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then a magpie went by and so she saw it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl Hakéla wahíŋkpe čík’ala waŋ “míwoštake” eyápi héčha čha ikíkču."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then, Hakéla took a type of small arrow called a blunt-headed arrow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ apáha na áta pȟaȟté kiŋ étulaȟčiŋ khuté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he aimed at her and he shot it right there between where her eyes sat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahíŋkpe kiŋ yučháŋčhaŋpi s’e yíŋ na él ó na kté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The arrow went as if it were shaking and it hit her there and killed her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl Hakéla gliyópsičiŋ na mas’íhuŋničatȟa waŋ uŋ pȟá wičhákaksaksa uŋ hé ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then Hakéla jumped down and he took an ax that she had cut them with."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na uŋ íŋš ehákela čhéyaya wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ áta kaȟúȟuǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that and using it he crushed the woman to pieces crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na heháŋl t’ekínil íŋyaŋ tȟokšú na okȟályiŋ na iníkaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that and then almost dying he hauled some rocks and heated them up and performed a purification ceremony."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iníkaǧiŋ na čhiyéku tȟaŋčháŋpi kiŋ él thimá tȟowíčhakšu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did the purification ceremony and he carried the bodies of his brothers inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ íyečhala thimá tuwá čhuwí okíniya na “Lé nitúwe čha waúŋšiyala héči uŋkíyuǧaŋ po!” eyá hiŋglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so soon afterwards somebody took a deep breath inside and suddenly said, “If, whoever you are, you’re a compassionate person, open up for us.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha yuǧáŋ na čhiyéku kiŋ iyúha kinípi, čha thiyáta wičháglokhi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he opened it and all his brothers had come back to life, so they took themselves inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél tȟéhaŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él akhé wíŋyaŋ waŋ tȟaŋkál hinážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They lived well there after a long while and so one day a woman stopped outside again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé thimá kičhópi na akhé hé tȟaŋkéyapi kta kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again they invited her inside and again they said that she must be their big sister."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hó, Hakéla, thimá kičhó wo!” eyápi čha ináphiŋ na akhé, “Tȟaŋké, thimá ú wo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hey, Hakéla, invite her in!” they said, so he went out and again he said, “Big sister, come on in.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Háŋ, Misúŋ,” eyíŋ na thimá í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “Yes, little brother,” and she got inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakéš hé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ líla wašté čhaŋkhé taŋyáŋ ób úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now the woman was very good and so they lived well with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lol’íwičhakičiȟ’aŋ na šna ób wótiŋ na wáŋžu naíŋš háŋpa kȟó wičhákičaǧiŋ na wakáȟ-wóphike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She cooked for them and often she ate with them and she made them quivers and mocassins and she was skillful at making things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iyúha líla čhaŋtíyokiphíya úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they all lived together happily."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Taŋyáŋ thiwáhe s’e úŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ watóhaŋl wíŋyaŋ kiŋ suŋkáku kiŋ ománi iyáyapi na tȟéhaŋ glípi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They lived well like a family and so eventually the woman’s younger brothers walked away and they didn’t come back for a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé haŋkéya wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ čhéya ománi-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so finally the woman was walking around and crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgná íŋyaŋ žaŋžáŋla waŋ iyéyiŋ na tákuwe lakȟa iyógnaka uŋkȟáŋ oyášlog ičú na napčé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all of a sudden she found a translucent rock and for some reason she put it in her mouth and so she sucked it in and swallowed it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla waŋ tȟúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "After a long time a boy was born."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ikíkču na tȟaŋkál kaȟ’ól iyéya yuŋkȟáŋ tóškhe thimá íŋyaŋgyaŋg gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She took him and threw him outside and so he started running back home somehow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé iníhaŋšni kaȟ’ól iyéya yuŋkȟáŋ háŋskela waŋ thimá gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again paying no attention she threw him out and so a young boy came back in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhé kaȟ’ól iyéyiŋ kta tkȟáš waná líla tȟáŋka čha heháŋyaŋ yuhá šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she was going to throw him out again but now he was really big so she couldn’t hold him anymore."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha tokhéčela tȟaŋkál iyéya uŋkȟáŋ heháŋl kȟoškálaka waŋ thimá gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she was barely able to shove him outside and so then a young man came back inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ waná “Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla” eyá čhaškítȟuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the woman named him “Stone Boy.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Tokhí mičhíŋkši kiŋ táku waštéšte óta yuhá ní!” eyá čhaŋkhé iyéčhetu na waná yuphíya wayúha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “If only my son had many good things!” and so it came true and then he had many nice things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla húŋku kičhí taŋyáŋ thí yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él heyé, “Iná, tókȟa čha lé uŋkíšnala ȟčiŋ uŋthí hwo?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was in that way that Stone Boy lived with his mother and so one day he said, “Mom, how is it that you and I live all alone?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ leyé, “Eyá nilékši ób wathí tkȟá éyaš eháŋni ománi iyáyapi na glípi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the woman said, “Well I used to live with your uncles but they left walking away a long time ago and they haven’t returned."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2154> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčha uŋ waná lé uŋkíšnala uŋyáŋke ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2154;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2154> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s why we sit here all alone.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2154;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2155> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla, “Itȟó, Iná, lekší owíčhakile mníŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2155;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2155> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Stone Boy said, “I guess then, mom, I will go look for my uncles!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2155;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2156> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋku kiŋ wičákičila šni čha čhéya gloníče éyaš iníhaŋšni iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2156;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2156> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "His mother didn’t agree with that so she cried trying to have him not, but disobeying her he left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2156;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kákhiya yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ thipȟéstola waŋ líla tȟaŋní čha, “wizí” eyápi héčha waŋ hé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2157;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kálHe walked around there and so there was a very old tipi called a “wizí” standing there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2157;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2158> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ektá yá uŋkȟáŋ etáŋhaŋ winúȟčala waŋ hinápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2158;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2158> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went there and so an old woman came out of there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2158;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟíŋ na heyé, “Tȟakožá, tȟoéyaš thučhúhu namáȟuȟuǧiŋ uŋtȟó!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2159;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She addressed him and said, “grandson, before you do anything else, please trample on my ribs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2159;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2160> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nilékši k’uŋ thučhúhu namíčiȟuȟuǧapi na iyáyapi ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2160;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2160> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Your uncles stepped on my ribs for me and they left you know,” she said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2160;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla hečhíŋ, “Waȟtéšni kiŋ, lé é čha lekší wičhákte séče ló!” ečhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Stone Boy thought, “Evil one, maybe this is the one that killed them!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hó, iyúŋka yo,” eyá čhaŋkhé khúl iyúŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Well, lie down,” he said and so she lied down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla ečháčha íŋyaŋ čha áta tkeyéla naȟúȟuǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Stone Boy was absolutely a rock so crushed her heavily."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naké, “Hó, Tȟakóža, eyáš henála ye!” eyé k’éyaš heháŋl líla naȟúǧiŋ na nat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally, she said, “Hey, Grandson, that’s really enough,” but then he really crushed her and killed her by standing on her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na thimá í yuŋkȟáŋ lekšítku kiŋ thiwókšaŋ ȟpáyapi čha iwíčhakikču."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that and got inside and so his uncles were laying around the tipi so he took them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl iníkaǧiŋ na íŋyaŋ kiŋ mni-ákaštaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he had a purification ceremony"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl čhuwí okíniyapi na, “Lé nitúwe čha waúŋšiyala héčiŋhaŋ uŋkíyuinaȟni po!” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then they took a deep breath and said, “If it is you who is compassionate, hurry it up for us!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wáŋčag thiyópa kiŋ yuǧáŋ na yutȟáŋkal iwíčhaču na iyúha líla čhaŋtéwaštepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So immediately he opened the door and he took them out and they were all very happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lekšítku kiŋ ób thiyáta khí čha húŋku k’uŋ suŋkáku waŋwíčhaglakiŋ na líla wíyuškiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went home with his uncles so his mother saw her younger brothers and she was very happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ítohaŋtu yukȟáŋ leyé, “Itȟó, míš heháŋl omáwani kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A little bit later, he said, “I guess I should go take a walk around then.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kákhena yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ ptesáŋ wikȟóškalaka tópa oslóhaŋ kič’úŋ-haŋpi čha waŋwíčhayaŋkiŋ na ektá wičháye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“He went around there and so he saw four young white buffalo women sledding and he went towards them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟoéyaš í šni haŋní pahá isáŋm iyáyiŋ na hokšíla úŋšika ič’íčhaǧiŋ na heháŋl él wičhái."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But first before he arrived, he went further up the hill and turned into helpless boy and then he arrived at where they were."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Hiyú we, hokšíla, oslóhaŋ uŋkíč’uŋpi čha ónipȟa kte ’uŋ,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “Come here, boy, we’re sledding so you can definitely join in.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ “Ííí! Nitképi čha ogmígma nihíyupi kiŋháŋ mayápat’api kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “Aaaaaw! You all are heavy so when you all roll downhill, then y’all’ll crush me to death!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé, “Ečhá lazátahaŋ naŋkíŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyápi čha “Oháŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “naturally you’ll sit in the back” so he said, “okay.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš héktataŋhaŋ yaŋkékhiyapi na iyáyapi uŋkȟáŋ iyé íŋyaŋ čha áta ogmígma hiyúi’čiyiŋ na iyúha wičhákte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was in that way that they had him sit in the back and they went and so he was himself a rock so he really took off rolling downhill and he killed them all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl há kiŋ iwíčhaču na aglí čhaŋkhé lekšítku kiŋ wáŋžu wičhákičaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he took their hides and went back with them and so he made his uncles quivers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhé ománi yíŋ naháŋ tȟatȟáŋka wičháȟčala waŋ hé kpamá-haŋ čha atáyiŋ na él í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he went walking along again and he ran into an old buffalo bull who was sharpening his horns and he went up to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lekíye, “Tȟuŋkášila, tákuwe hé yakpáma-haŋ hwo?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “grandfather, why are you sharpening your horns?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé, “Wáŋ, Tȟakóža, oyákapi naháŋ Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla ečíyapi waŋ ptesáŋ wikȟóškalaka tób wičhákte škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “gosh, grandson, they tell that someone called Stone Boy killed four young women.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha étȟauŋkpapi kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we’re going to go and attack him!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla, “Tȟuŋkášila, toháŋl tȟakpé yápi kta škȟá hwo?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “Toháŋl maȟpíya ǧiǧíya kaȟwóȟwok ahíyaye kiŋ héhaŋtu kta škhé ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Stone boy said, “Grandfather, when is it said that they will go attack him?” and so he said, “It should happen at the time when brown clouds are blown around”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Wáŋ, witkó, lé Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla miyé yeló!” eyíŋ na tȟatȟáŋka wičháȟčala k’uŋ kté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “Gosh, that’s crazy, I’m Stone Boy!” and he killed the old buffalo."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Glí uŋkȟáŋ, “Lekší, maȟpíya ǧiǧíya kaȟwóȟwok ahíyaye kiŋháŋ tȟakpé maúpi kta škhé ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He came back and so he said, “Uncles, it is said that when brown clouds are blown around, they will come here to attack me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé čhúŋkaške óhiye tópa pawóslal iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they erected four stockades in a row."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná maȟpíya kiŋ ǧiǧíya kaȟwóȟwok ahíyaye k’uŋ leháŋl tȟatȟáŋka oyáte kiŋ áta ahíhuŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then when the brown clouds blew around, at this time all of buffalo nation arrived here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhúŋkaške tȟokáhe kiŋ él hihúŋnipi k’éyaš wičháktepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They reached the first stockade but they killed them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla húŋku kiŋ heháŋl míla waŋ kíčiyumiŋ na oȟláthetaŋhaŋ tȟatȟáŋka sihútkȟaŋ kiŋ wapsápsag awíčhaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then Stone Boy sharpened a knife for his mother and she went cutting off their hoof tendons from underneath."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhúŋkaške kiŋ iyúha kiníl paúŋkapi na óhiye waŋžíla okáptapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they almost pushed over all the stockades and just the last row was left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš ȟčeháŋl tȟatȟáŋka wičháȟčala waŋ heyá iwáhowičháye, “Hó, ȟeyáta khiglá po!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But just then a old buffalo bull warned them saying, “Hey, get back to the hills!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋyaŋ Hokšíla ničásotapi kte ló!” eyá čhaŋkhé akhíyagla škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Stone Boy will kill us all!” and so they went back to where they came from."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2192;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2192;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš hokšílala waŋ kȟúŋšitku kičhí láȟčiŋ thí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Once upon a time a little boy lived just with his grandmother."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él kȟúŋšitku kiŋ čhaŋk’íŋ iyáya čhaŋkhé hokšíla kiŋ išnála thiyáta yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day his grandmother left to pick up wood and so the boy sat at home alone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2202> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhúŋhaŋ itȟúŋkala waŋ táku yak’óǧa-haŋ čha naȟ’úŋ s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2202;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2202> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meanwhile a mouse was gnawing something so it felt like he heard it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2202;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2203> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Winúȟčala k’uŋ wóyute tuktél gnáke kiŋ hokšíla kiŋ heháŋhuŋniyaŋ slolyé šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2203;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2203> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Up to then the boy hadn’t known where his grandmother stored food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2203;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2204> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha waná lé naȟ’úŋ kiŋ uŋ olé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2204;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2204> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then he looked for it since he heard it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2204;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wasná waŋ líla wašté čha kȟúŋšitku kiŋ naȟmá yuŋkȟáŋ hé é čha itȟúŋkala kiŋ yašpášpa-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2205;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2205> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his grandmother hid a really good piece of pemmican and so it was the mouse that was nibbling at it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2205;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aŋpétu kiŋ átaya winúȟčala kiŋ él yaŋké šni čha hokšíla kiŋ itȟúŋkala k’uŋ awáŋyaŋg khuwá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2206;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2206> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All day the old woman wasn’t there so the boy watched the mouth closely."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2206;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iwáŋyaŋgya – itȟúŋkala kiŋ yaȟtákiŋ kta ikȟókipȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But cautiously – he was afraid that the mouse would bite him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná óhaŋketa áta tȟebyé séča uŋkȟáŋ heháŋl hokšíla kiŋ tȟaŋkál inápȟiŋ na heyá páŋ, “uŋčí, kú wo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then finally he might have gobbled it all down and so then the boy went outside and he yelled, “grandma, come here!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itȟúŋkala waŋ lél wasná kiŋ lé tȟebníčhiyiŋ kte ló.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A mouse will have eaten all your pemmican here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Híŋyaŋka, Tȟakóža, tókša wakú kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “Just wait a minute, grandson, I’ll be right there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoháŋ anápta khuwá ye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meantime, corner it!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókša nazúŋspe kiŋ lé uŋ wakáȟuȟuǧiŋ kte kštó,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Certainly I’ll smash it with this ax.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟéhaŋ čhaŋkhé waná hokšíla kiŋ líla ločhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a long time passed and so then the boy was really hungry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu khéš čhaŋsákala waŋ čík’ala čha ičú na yuktáŋ yúze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally he took a stick that was small and he took it and bent it sideways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ mniȟúha ošpúla waŋ ikȟóyagyiŋ na wasná k’uŋ étkiya napé kiŋ paslóhaŋ iyékiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he fastened a piece of fabric to it and he slid his hand where the pemmican was."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ičhúŋhaŋ heyá lowáŋ:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And meanwhile he sung:"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itȟúŋkala he, tákula čha yáte-la so?Haŋké mak’ú-la ye, míš-eyá wáte-la kte.Ičhé, ičhé!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Little mouse, what is it that you’re eating?Give me some, I will eat it, too.Please, please!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš ahíyayiŋ na heháŋl napé kiŋ ikíkču."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was that he sung and then he withdrew his hand."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wasná haŋké waŋ líla čísčila ikȟóyake, ičhíŋ hé itȟúŋkala kiŋ ok’ú-la."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he held to a tiny little bit of pemmican, because the mouse lent it to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyútȟa uŋkȟáŋ líla oyúl wašté čhaŋkhé akhé etáŋ čhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He tried it and so it tasted really good and so he wanted some more."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akhéšna lowáŋ na napé kiŋ mahél iyékiya-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he sang again often and he was reaching his hand in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yámni akhígle héčheȟčiŋ ečhúŋ na iyéna wasná haŋké ičú čhaŋ yúte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did it just like that three times and each time he took part of the pemmican, he ate it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-he ečháŋl šúŋka waŋ kȟúŋšitku kiŋ yuhá čha thimáhel hiyú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just when he did that, a dog that grandma had came inside the tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ itȟúŋkala kiŋ kȟíŋ na, “Kȟolá, waŋ, aótala s’e mak’ú wo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy addressed the mouse and he said, “friend, look, give me more than usual."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ héčhanuŋ kiŋháŋ letáŋhaŋ Uŋčí wómak’u čhaŋ očhíč’u kte ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As you know from the moment when you do that, whenever grandma gives me food to eat, I will give it to you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ itȟúŋkala kiŋ heyé, “Hóȟ, wáŋ kȟolá, nikȟúŋši tókhel okíhika waȟtémalašni yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the mouse said, “Absolutely not, look, friend, your grandma hates me as much as possible."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu ópta mičhíŋča ób wawátiŋ kta čha wóyute éwegle čháŋšna iyúhaha ok’íŋ na šna atȟéb’uŋyaŋpe lo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Throughout the winter I would eat with my kids so whenever I laid the food aside, she dug it all up and often she’d eat up our food.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ, “Hé táku čha éyagle khéš tȟebníčhiya hwo?” eyá čha, “Wáŋ, kȟolá, áta…pȟaŋǧí naíŋš makȟátomniča naíŋš šiŋkpáŋka kȟókȟo éwagle čháŋšna amámanuŋ weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy said, “but what is it that whenever you laid it aside she gobbled it all down?” so it said, “look, friend, everything… whenever I set aside artichoke or wild beans or roots too she stole that from me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha kȟolá, iyéš wasná kiŋ lé aglémayakhiya waštéke ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So friend, it would instead be good for you to let me take this pemmican back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ, “Hó ečhá, kȟolá, thóéyaš Uŋčí tȟa šúŋka kiŋ lé kičhí kičhíza yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy said, “well then my friend, first fight with my grandma’s dog."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhanuŋ yuŋkȟáŋ niyé ohíyaye háŋtaŋš, wasná kiŋ lé čhaŋtéwašteya yuháčhičhiyiŋ kte ló!” eyá uŋkȟáŋ itȟúŋkala kiŋ iyówiŋye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You do that and so if you win, I’ll happily let you have this pemmican,” and so the mouse agreed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš waná hokšíla k’uŋ wasná kiŋ ičú na itȟúŋkala kiŋ iyówas’iŋyaŋ waléǧa waŋ él ognáke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like that so then the boy took the pemmican and together with the rat he put it in a bladder."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na kȟúŋšitku kiŋ šúŋka tȟáwa kiŋ yuhéktab yúze, ičhíŋ itȟúŋkala kiŋ tȟakpé iyáyiŋ kte ȟčiŋ s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that and his grandmother’s dog pulled it back, because it was like it really wanted to go and fight the rat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waná ayúštaŋ iyéyiŋ na “Iyáȟpaya yo!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then he let it go and he said, “grab it!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha šúŋka kiŋ áta našlóg iyáyiŋ na waléǧa kiŋ iyáȟpaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the dog rushed forward and he grabbeed the bladder."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyáȟpaya čhaŋkhé itȟúŋkala k’uŋ hé etáŋhaŋ glináphiŋ na hokšíla ektá ipsíče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He grabbed it and so the mouse came out from it and he jumped to the boy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl hiŋyéte aúŋyaŋ íŋyaŋkiŋ na tȟa-ógle kiŋ mahél iyáyiŋ na héčhiya áta nihíŋčiya nak’éȟk’eȟ naȟláȟlal úŋ! Héčhena hokšíla k’uŋ áta t’eblézešni čhéya iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then he ran across his shoulder and he went inside his shirt and there he was digging his claws into him and scratching him out of fear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heyá páŋ, “Uŋčí, gličú wo! Itȟúŋkala waŋ makté kte ló!” eyá čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he screamed out crying, “Grandma, come here! A mouse is going to kill me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhúŋhaŋ winúȟčala kiŋ glihúŋni na thimá gličú yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ čhéya úŋ čhaŋkhé íŋš-eyá čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meantime the old woman came back and she came inside and so the boy was crying and so she was crying, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waná itȟúŋkala k’uŋ tukténi tȟaŋíŋ šni na šúŋka kiŋ éha wasná k’uŋ atȟébyiŋ kte s’eléčheča čha winúȟčala kiŋ waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then the mouse wasn’t seen anywhere and the old woman saw what looked to be the dog eating her pemmican back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čhaŋzéya heyé, “Huŋhí, Tȟakóža, mayágnaye kštó!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she angrily said, “my goodness, grandson, you tricked me!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léš itȟúŋkala čha wasná tȟebmákhiyiŋ kta kéhe k’uŋ,” eyíŋ na nazúŋspe kiŋ yuwáŋkal ikíkču."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“You said that it was this here mouse that would eat up my pemmican” and she raised up her ax."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ošúŋgye yuhúkhul kós iyéyiŋ na hé uŋ šúŋkala kiŋ áta natá kiŋ kašlél apȟé!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She swung it downwards with force and for that reason she struck the little dog’s head splitting it open."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ íšiŋkčhiŋ heyé, “Tȟakožá, eháŋk’uŋ ečhákel wasná kiŋ hé mamáyakinuŋ kte ȟčiŋ čha waná slolwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she angrily said, “grandson, I know that it’s clear that you really wanted to take my pemmican on purpose."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akȟó iyáyiŋ na tókhiya yačhíŋka yá ye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So go away and go wherever you want."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wasná waŋží tȟókeča čha lé íŋskokeča makáku we!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And bring me another piece of pemmican of this size.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ wal’íyopȟeyapi éyaš “oháŋ, Uŋčí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy was scolded but he said, “okay, grandma."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itázipa na wahíŋkpe kȟó míčaǧa yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Make me a bow and arrows.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé kíčaǧiŋ na yuštáŋ k’uŋháŋ hokšíla kiŋ ičú na yuhá ománi iyáya škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she made them for him and when she finished, the boy took them and left walking along with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš waná hokšíla k’uŋ ománi iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like that that the boy left walking along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋl yé šni eháŋl pté optáye waŋ tȟáŋka čha waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He hadn’t gone far when he saw a large buffalo herd."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pahá waŋ akáŋl ȟpáyiŋ na pté kiŋ aówičhakas’iŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He laid on a hill and he peered at the buffalo."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhel ȟ’áŋ yuŋkȟáŋ wičhíkhiyela yíŋ na waŋží ó kta héčiŋhaŋ hé iyúkčaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He acted in some way and so he went near them and he was thinking if he should shoot one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl pté kiŋ táku nakípȟape lakȟa áta iyáyekiyapi na  khinážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kákhiyaJust then the buffalo apparently left fleeing from something and they stopped over there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša waŋ étkiya wičháyiŋ na iyópteya iyáyiŋ na makȟá obláye čhokáŋyaŋ čhaŋkpéškamakȟagle inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a man was going towards them and he went passing by them and in the middle of some flat land he stopped and got down on his knees."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟatȟáŋka waŋ pté optáye kiŋ etáŋhaŋ čha išnála inážiŋ na wiyóȟpeyatakiya étuŋwaŋ nážiŋ-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a buffalo came from the herd so it stopped alone and he stood looking to the west."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl pté kiŋ hé wičháša k’uŋ hetáŋhaŋ čhaéglepi akézaptaŋ wahéhaŋyaŋ ihúŋni na inážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then that buffalo reached about fifteen paces from the man and it stopped."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ makȟáta iȟpéič’iyiŋ na ičáptaŋptaŋ kič’úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it threw itself on the ground and wallowed about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl inážiŋ na sí uŋ makȟá aíglala."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then it got up and threw dirt on itself with its hoof."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na yuŋkȟáŋ lé wičháša waŋ čhaŋkpéškamakȟagle nážiŋ k’uŋ hétkiya našlóg iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then it charged at the man who was on his knees there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ihúŋni kta háŋl wičháša k’uŋ čhéya iyáyiŋ na áta ȟeyáb iȟpéič’iye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When it was about to reach him, the man started crying and threw himself out of the way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ iyópteya iyáye, nážiŋ kȟá k’uŋ hél “Híŋ!” eyá hiŋgníŋ na."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the buffalo went by, he said where he once stood, “whoops!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó akhé wičháša k’uŋ ečhél khíyotaka čha tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ átayela él yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well the man knelt down again so the buffalo fully went towards him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "K’éyaš akhé ečhéȟčiŋ ȟeyáb iȟpéič’iya čhaŋkhé iyópteya “Híŋ!” eyá hiŋglá iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But again he threw himself out of the way just like that and so going by again he said, “whoops!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yámni akhígle héčhuŋp-s’e ečhúŋ na ičítopa uŋkȟáŋ wičháša k’uŋ napȟé šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did it just like that three times and on the fourth time the man didn’t run away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ hé uŋ ikȟóyagyiŋ na éyaye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the buffalo stuck him with its horn and went away with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhelaka pté núm íčhisakhibya iyáyapi na optáya wičhégna iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so suddenly two buffalo went next to each other and they went among the herd."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena pté oyáte kiŋ ptáyela tokhíyotȟaŋ iyáyapi na waŋžíla éna nážiŋ čhaŋkhé hokšíla k’uŋ hé étkiya yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The buffalo herd still went somewhere together and just one stood back and so the boy went towards it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟatȟáŋka k’uŋ, “misúŋ, tókhel yaúŋka hwo?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the buffalo said, “little brother, how are you?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nikȟúŋši thí-la kiŋ etáŋhaŋ yahínapȟe uŋ heháŋtaŋhaŋ awáŋyaŋg čhičhúwa yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve been watching over you ever since you left your grandmother’s tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó eyá, míš-eyá líla iyótiyekiya waúŋ weló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well, I’ve been living with pretty hard times, too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókhel mičhíŋča ób ní waúŋ kte kiŋ hé óhiŋniyaŋ awáčhaŋmi-he ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“I’m always thinking about how I could stay alive with my children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ kítaŋȟčiŋ tókheškhe ečhámuŋ kiŋháŋ óhiŋni wóyute bluhá kte kiŋ iyéwaye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so finally when I do that somehow, I find the food that I’ll be having forever."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋyaŋ waní kiŋ heháŋyaŋ makȟásitomniyaŋ tuktétu k’éyaš wóyute óta míčiyaŋkiŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As long as I live everywhere all around the planet there will be food for me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Misúŋ, yačhíŋ háŋtanš, níš-eyá nikȟúŋši kičhí iyótiyeyakiye s’a k’uŋ tókhel wámaphike kiŋ iyéhaŋyaŋ wáphičhiyiŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So young brother, if you want, also your grandmother that you usually suffer so much with, you will be as well off as I am.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hokšíla kiŋ heyé, “tkȟá čhiyé, lé nitúwe hwo?” eyá uŋkȟáŋ uŋmá kiŋ ayúptiŋ na, “wáŋ, misúŋ, ‘Iktó-Makȟásitomniyaŋ-Oyúmni’ eyá čhažéyatapi kiŋ hé lé miyé yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy said, “but older brother, who are you?” and so the other one answered, “well, younger brother, I am the one that they call ‘Iktó who travels all around the world.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na toháŋl tuwá atáwaya čháŋšna tókhel wačhíŋka ečhél wakhúwa yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever I run into someone, I treat them however I want."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhe sakhíb uŋyíŋ kta iyéčheča yeló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we should go together like that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "K’éyaš, hokšíla kiŋ heyé, “Wáŋ, Čhiyé, Uŋčí líla wičháyagnaye s’a kéya iwáhomaye ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the boy said, “well, little brother, you know that my grandma warned me saying that you often trick people.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá, nuphíŋ uŋyé kiŋháŋ, tuwá itázipa na wahíŋkpe mitȟáwa kiŋ lená yuhá kte ka?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, when both of us go, who the heck will have my bow and arrows?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “Hó Misúŋ, háŋpa kiŋ hená glušlókiŋ na saŋní itázipa na wahíŋkpe kiŋ hená aíyaglaška yo. Héčhel nikȟúŋši kiŋ oníčile ú kiŋháŋ hená iyéyiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “Well little brother, take off those shoes and tie your bow and arrows to it. In that way, when your grandma comes looking for your things, she will find those.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(Ičhíŋ hokšíla kiŋ lé išnála ȟčiŋ pȟatkáša háŋpa yuhá.)"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "(Because the boy all one his own had turtle mocassins.)"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Čhiyé, háŋpa kiŋ lená átaš naȟlóg-phičá šni naíŋš natȟéb-phičá šni kiŋ uŋ líla thewákiȟila yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “big brother, you can’t get a hole in these mocassins at all, or I like them because they don’t get worn down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš niyé ehé kiŋ ečhél waglúšlokiŋ kte ló,” eyíŋ na glušlóke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But since you told me so, I will take them off,” and he took them off."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tókhel ečhúŋ šípi kiŋ itázipa kiŋ él aíyaglaškiŋ na wítaya  ékignake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kálAnd he did it as told so he tied his bow to it and put them down there together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé Iktó, “Hó Misúŋ, iglúwiŋyeya yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again Iktó said, “well, little brother, get ready."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2287> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wiyóȟpeyatakiya étuŋwaŋ čhaŋkpéškamakȟagle nayážiŋ na ištóyagmuziŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2287;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2287> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You should get on your knees looking to the west and shut your eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2287;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋhuŋhí, Misúŋ, eháŋni waȟpániča-inít’e k’uŋ, letáŋhaŋ waná óhiŋniyaŋ tȟaló óta toháŋl yačhíŋka čhaŋ luhá kte ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oh gosh, little brother, who lived so incredibly poor, from now on you will have as much meat as you want."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oníhitikiŋ na nayápȟe šni háŋtaŋš, čhačhípȟe kiŋháŋ wówaš’ake waŋ bluhá kiŋ lé haŋké níš-eyá luhá kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If you’re brave and you don’t run away, when I stab you, you too will have some of the strength that I have!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2290> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná hokšíla kiŋ čhaŋkpéškamakȟagle inážiŋ uŋkȟáŋ Iktó-tȟatȟáŋka k’uŋ él ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2290;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2290> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So now the boy got down on his knees and so Iktó the buffalo came towards him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2290;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2291> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "K’éyaš hokšíla kiŋ čhaŋtét’iŋs kič’úŋ na napȟé šni čha wáŋčag hé ičháphiŋ na kȟó éyaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2291;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2291> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the boy had courage and didn’t run away so right then he stabbed him with his horn and he also took off with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2291;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla k’uŋ Iktó kičhí iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy went with Iktó."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná íŋš-eyá pté kéčhiŋ éyaš leya wakȟáŋȟ’aŋ kiŋ iyéčhetu šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he thought he was a buffalo but unfortunately no miracle passed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Iktómi wótheȟi akhípȟa-ič’ila."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Iktómi felt he went through some hardship."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hé! Misúŋ! Tákuwe wakȟáŋwaȟ’aŋ k’uŋ mayákilušiča hwo?” eyíŋ na čhéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Gosh! Little brother! Why did you ruin my spiritual act?” he said and he cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé hokšíla kiŋ khéya-há háŋpa k’uŋ okíhiŋ na itázipa wahíŋkpe kiŋ kȟó ikíkču na héčhena wiyóȟpeyatakiya Iktómi úŋyaŋ iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy put on his turtle skin mocassins and he took his bow and arrows and he left keeping to the west with Iktómi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋl yé šni ečhél wičháša waŋ líla háŋska čha tȟahénakiya ú čha waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He didn’t get very far when he saw a very tall man was coming towards him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl wakpála kiŋ etáŋhaŋ wičháša tȟókeča waŋ maštíŋčala há wapȟóštaŋ waŋ úŋ čha íŋš-eyá ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then, from the river there also came a different man who was wearing a rabbit skin hat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Misúŋ, tókhiya lá hwo, nišnála ȟčiŋ?” eyá čha hokšíla kiŋ, “Wáŋ, léčhi oyáte waŋ wiyóȟpeyata wičhóthi škȟá čha ektá wičháble ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Little brother, where are you going, all by yourself?” he said so the boy said, “Well, it’s said that there is a group who live in the west so I’m going to them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋše hé akhé Iktó é čha hí éyaš, “Wáŋ, Misúŋ, héčhiyataŋhaŋ lé waú čha sakhíb uŋyíŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again it was just Iktó that had got here but he said, “well, little brother, I’m coming from there so we should go together.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋl wičháša waŋ líla háŋske uŋ hé waná hihúŋni kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2301;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Just then a very tall man arrived here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2301;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2302> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Misúŋ, wičháša waŋ ú kiŋ hé waŋláka hwo?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2302;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2302> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, “little brother, did you see the man who is coming?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2302;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé Anúŋg Ité eyápi kiŋ é yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2303;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He is the one called Two Face."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2303;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2305> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé, “Čhiyé, tákuwe hečíyapi he?” yuŋkȟáŋ, “Wáŋ Misúŋ, wičháša na pté kȟókȟo ál’ataya tȟebwíčhaye s’a čha hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ hečíyape ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2305;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2305> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “big brother, why do they call him that?” and so, “well, little brother, he often gobbles down all people and also buffalo so for that reason they call him that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2305;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2306> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hokšíla kiŋ, “Čhiyé, héčheča háŋtaŋš, uŋkíye kȟó naúŋpčapi kte séče ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2306;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2306> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the boy said, “big brother, if it is like that, he might eat us too!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2306;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókheškhe uŋȟ’áŋ yuŋkȟáŋ niúŋkič’iyiŋ kta hwo?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2307;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When we act somehow, will we save each other?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2307;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2308> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó: “Híŋyaŋka yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2308;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2308> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “wait a minute."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2308;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2309> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókȟa šni yeló, Misúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2309;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2309> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There’s nothing to worry about, little brother."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2309;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá itóhewaya čhaŋ waȟmúŋǧe ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever I look in the direction somebody, I bewitch them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋ waná čhaglépi wikčémna wahéhaŋyaŋ ú kiŋ héhaŋni niyá čhaŋ nuphíŋ áta yačékček iwíčhaču."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then whenever the man who was coming breathed about ten paces away, he yanked both of them in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná hinážiŋ kiŋ él, Iktó hekíye, “Misúŋ, nitúwe hwo?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “Wáŋ, lé ‘Í Mahél Wičhóthi’ ečíyapi k’uŋ hé lé miyé yeló!” eyá ayúpte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then stopping there, Iktó said, “little brother, who are you,” and so, “well, I am the one that is called ‘They Camp In His Mouth.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2313> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Misúŋ, tóhaŋ iníčhaǧa hwo?” Iktó eyá uŋkȟáŋ, “wáŋ, makȟá kiŋ lé káǧapi uŋ héhaŋ míš-eyá makáǧape ló,” Iya kiŋ eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2313;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2313> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “little brother, when did you grow up?” and so Íya said, “well, when this earth was created, I was also created, too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2313;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2314> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena Iktó, “Oháŋ! Waná nakéš wéksuye ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2314;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2314> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó kept saying, “Okay! Now I finally remember!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2314;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makȟá kiŋ lé wakáǧiŋ na waná miglúštaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ haŋké akáb iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I made this earth and then I finished and so there was some left over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha uŋ tákula waŋ šíče ȟča čha wakáǧe ’uŋ…eháŋuŋ, hé niyé yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s why I made a little something that was really bad … right, that’s you!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu kiŋ uŋ, Misúŋ, iyógmus úŋ wo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That being the case, little brother, keep your mouth closed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš-eyá léčhel owákihi yeló,” eyíŋ na niyá čhaŋ iyéna Íya kiŋ yatíktitaŋ ahíyu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I can be like this too,” he said and every time that he breathed in, he brought Íya towards him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé Íya áta kȟokíphiŋ na “Čhiyé, héčhuŋ šni yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Íya was really scared and he said, “big brother, don’t do that!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waní kte ȟčiŋ yeló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I really want to live."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó ayúštaŋ na “Ečhá, úwa yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó stopped and he said, “then come here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Takúku kȟoúŋkipȟapi kiŋ hená uŋkóglakapi kte ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“We will tell what things we’re scared of."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla, niyé nitȟókahe kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Boy, you should go first.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hokšíla kiŋ waná heyé, “Hó, Čhiyé, táku waŋžíla kȟowákipȟe kiŋ hé Uŋčí tȟa-názuŋspe uŋ hé é yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then the boy said, “well, little brother, the only thing that I’m scared of is my grandmother’s ax."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ lé iyótiyekiya makȟóskaŋl omáwani yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s why I’m walking around in the wilderness struggling so badly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋl Uŋčí nazúŋspe kiŋ hé takúŋl apáha čháŋšna, tókhel niíč’iye wačhíŋ phičá šni yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever my grandma raises that ax over anything, there’s no use in trying to live."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋ, lečhála šúŋka waŋš theȟíla séča uŋkȟáŋ áta natá kaóȟpe ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well, recently she might have loved a dog and so she broke open its head."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tákuš isáŋm kȟokípȟe phičá ka!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What is there to fear more than that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hó, míš heháŋtu weló,” Iktó iš’óš’oye ȟčiŋ eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Well, it’s my turn now,” Iktó enthusiastically said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hó Misúŋ, takú kȟowákipȟa čha waná nayáȟ’uŋpi kte ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Well little brother, I’m scared of something so now you two will hear about it!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itȟó, tȟokéye láȟčiŋ akíš’api kiŋ kȟowákipȟe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "First of all, I’m afraid of people shouting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl wagmúha kaȟlápi kiŋ hé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then the rattling of rattles."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl hiŋháŋ hotȟúŋpi na čháŋčheǧa apȟápi na šiyótȟaŋka yažópi kiŋ hená iyúha kȟowákipȟe lo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then I’m scared of owls hooting and the hitting of drums and the playing of flutes,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena Íya eyé; “Philámayaye ló, Čhiyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya still said, “thank you, big brother.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Míš-eyá hená é ȟča čha kȟowákipȟe ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You surely know that I too am scared of all those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená waŋží nawáȟ’uŋ háŋtaŋš, wáŋčag éš éna mat’íŋ kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If I hear one of those things, I’ll just immediately die back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó, “Hó, waná oglág uŋkígluštaŋpe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “well, now we’ll stop telling.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičhóthi-ta uŋyáŋpi kte ló, líla lowáčhiŋ čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So let’s go to the village, because I’m really hungry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá, Misúŋ, niyé tȟóéyaš léna yaŋká yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But, little brother, first sit down back here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoháŋ hokšíla kiŋ kičhí mníŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meantime, I will be going with the boy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Í kiŋ uŋčíkčik’alapi čha waúŋyutapi na ičhúŋhaŋ tóna čhépapi kiŋ hená uŋníčičaȟniǧapi kte ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Our mouthes are quite small so we will eat things and meanwhile we’ll pick up the fat ones for you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya héčhetula čhaŋkhé “Hó, hé ogná kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya agreed and so he said, “that will be good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yaglípi kiŋháŋ ečháš iyúha akhé wičhóthi-ta uŋyáŋpi kte ’uŋ,” eyíŋ na ištíŋma čha iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When you two come back here we will surely go to the village,” and he went to sleep so they left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheya hená Iktó tȟóyate čha kákhel ihúŋnipi kiŋ wáŋčagna wayáotȟaŋiŋ hiyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They really were Iktó’s people so they went around right away announcing the news upon their arrival there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Íya kiŋ takúku kȟokípȟa kéye uŋ hená iyúha wítaya mnayáŋpi na waná glápi yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša tóna wičhíhakab yápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they gathered together all the things that he said Íya was afraid of and then they were on the way back and so several men went after them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hená enána aínab éwičhaglepi na kičhíšnala Íya ȟpáye kiŋ ektá khípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they made them stand on the far side here and there and with just him, he came back to where Íya was laying down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ itúŋkab naíčabyeya ištíŋme."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he slept up with his mouth wide open."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha í él eyokas’iŋpi naháŋ thezí kiŋ iyágleya waŋyáŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they peered inside and they saw all the way to his stomach."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Imáhel wičhótapi s’eléčheča naháŋ nakúŋ héčhiyataŋhaŋ wičháho líla tȟaŋíŋpi!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was as if there was a big crowd of people inside and also voices were really heard from over there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé Iktó hokšíla kiŋ khíŋ na, “Misúŋ, niyé khuté yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó addressed the boy and said, “little brother, you shoot.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčheš wahíŋkpe waŋ ektá égle na khuté yuŋkȟáŋ héčhena Íya kiktá íyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was like this that he set an arrow and shot it and so Íya sat right up like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé Iktó čhaŋȟpí waŋ ikíkču na “Waȟtéšni šíča, wanáyaȟ’uŋ šni yélakȟa, ništíŋma-he ló!”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó took his club and said, “evil one, you’re evidently not listening, you’re sleeping!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyíŋ na yunážiŋkhiyiŋ na pasí áye, wičháša eyá ináȟma yaŋkápi k’uŋ héčhetkiya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that and made him stand up and marched him away, over there some men sat hiding."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Íya iȟát’iŋ na heyé; “Wáŋ, Čhiyé, túŋweni mat’íŋ kte šni yeló, pȟéta úŋpi šni háŋtaŋš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Íya laughed and said, “well, big brother, nobody will kill me, if they don’t use fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta čhignáyaŋpe ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I tricked you all!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋš ilémayaŋpi kiŋháŋ, pȟéta kiŋ etáŋhaŋ takúŋl ȟčiŋ napsíl hiyú háŋtaŋš, tuwá hé ičú kiŋháŋ íŋš-eyá t’íŋ kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When they also light me on fire, if something comes jumping out from the fire, when someone takes it, they will die, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša óta wičháwakte kiŋ hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve killed many people in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhíŋ tuwá takúŋl miyé etáŋhaŋ napsíl hiyú čha ičú háŋtaŋ, hé táku waštéwalake kiŋ hená íŋš-eyá waštélaka čha hé uŋ t’íŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Of course, if someone takes something that ran off jumping from me, they also like the things that I like so that’s why he’ll die.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyáya yíŋ na ečhél wakpópȟaya iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He kept saying that until they went along the river."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgná tókhiyataŋhaŋ kiŋ iyúha waná awíčhahiyupi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then maybe they came towards them with all those things from all directions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta ȟláȟla kaȟlápi na čháŋčheǧa apȟápi na akíš’api na hiŋháŋ hotȟúŋpi na wayážopi kȟókȟo uŋ awíčhahiyupi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They really came with rattles and beating drums and whooping and hooting and with flutes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé Íya iyáye wačhíŋ tkȟáš oyúspapi na éna čhaŋksá, čhaŋȟpí, íŋyaŋ kȟókȟo kíčiuŋpi na kaȟúȟuǧapi na ečhél ktépi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Íya wanted to leave but they caught him and they used clubs, tommahawks, and also rocks and they tore him open until he died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl čháŋ wítaya égnakapi na él iléyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they set the sticks aside together and they set him on fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé waná líla ilé yuŋkȟáŋ áta pȟéta etáŋhaŋ wóyuha iháŋkeya waštéšte kiŋ iyúha napsípsil hiyú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then he really burned and so the best of his possessions came jumping out of the fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš Iktó waŋžíla kayéš ičú šni wičháši na aéyapaha wičháši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But even Iktó told them to not take one little thing and he made them announce it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwé waŋží takúŋl ȟčiŋ ičú kiŋháŋ wáŋčagna t’íŋ kte kiŋ hé iwáhowičhayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When someone takes something, they will immediately announce them dying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íya ktépi šni kiŋ heháŋyaŋ líla oyáte óta tȟebwíčhaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "By the time they killed Íya, he had eaten many people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋše ktépi hetáŋhaŋ oyáte kiŋ nakéš iglúotapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Since they had killed him, finally the people multiplied."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé itȟókab waná oyáte kiŋ wičhóta áyapi čháŋšna Íya el hiyú na paháhayela tȟebwíčhayiŋ na hé uŋ oyáte kiŋ óhiŋni čónalapi kȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Beforehand, whenever the people then would be growing there, Íya came here and he gobbled them up in great numbers and for that reason there always used to be few people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hokšíla kiŋ waná Iktó kičhí wičhóthi-ta khí na léčhuŋ-s’e Iktó kíčiyatȟaŋiŋ: “Hó, waná letáŋhaŋ wókȟokipȟe waníčiŋ kte ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then the boy arrived back at the village with Iktó and he testified like this on his behalf, “well, now there’s no scary thing anymore!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla kiŋ lé waná očháštȟuŋke ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This boy is brave!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé ‘Pȟatkáša Háŋpa Oháŋ’ ečíyapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They will call him ‘He-Wears-Turtle-Mocassins.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟokátakiya lé wačhíŋyayapi kte kiŋ é yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in the future you all will be able to ask him for help!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itázipa na wahíŋkpe kȟó iyáyustag yuhá kiŋ hená é čha uŋ wayátapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "By using the bow and arrows that it is that he has with himself, you all will be able to eat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená uŋ oyáte čhiŋčápi kiŋ ičháǧapi kte ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And with those things the people’s children will grow up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla kiŋ lé waná itázipa, wahíŋkpe kȟó ničáhipe ló!” Iktó eyá oyáte kiŋ owíčhakiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This boy will bring his bow and also arrows to you all!” Iktó said to the people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ Lakȟóta Oyáte kiŋ toháŋtaŋ kiŋ itázipa na wahíŋkpe kiŋ hená wačhíŋyaŋpi, na uŋ wóyute ičúpi na iglúotapi na šna niíč’iyapi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2377;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2377> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, ever since, Lakota people have relied on the bow and arrow and that’s why they take food and multiply and often survive."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2377;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2378;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2378> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2378;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Watóhaŋl wičháša waŋ čhiŋčá waŋ yuhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At some time a man had a child."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él ikíkču na pȟesléte él wáčhiŋhiŋ waŋ paslátiŋ na “Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská” eyá čhaškítȟuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day he took him, and he set a plume upright on his head, and he named him “White Plume Boy.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na tóna akhígle tȟaŋkátakiya kaȟ’ól iyéya čhaŋ iyéna sáŋm ičháǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that and whenever he was thrown outside several times, he grew more."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé óhaŋketa kȟoškálaka waŋ líla wičháša wašté čha aŋpétu tȟahéna yuhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so finally before the end of the day he had him as a very good-looking young man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na, “Tokhí mičhíŋkši kákhel na kákhel yuhá ní!” eyá čháŋna iyéčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that, and whenever he said, “I wish that my son could have such and such things,” it was so."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čhiŋkšítku kiŋ haŋkéya líla taŋyáŋ iglúziŋ na nakúŋ paháyela wayúha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So his son finally was dressing very well, and he also had a pile of things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl atkúku kiŋ léčhel čhiŋčá kiŋ wókiyake:"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then the father talked to his child like this,"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čhíŋkš, lé oyáte kiŋ theȟíya uŋk’úŋpe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Son, we, the people, are having a tough time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša tób líla šičáya uŋkhúwape ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Four men treat us very badly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha uŋ tókhel yaȟ’áŋ oyákihi héči ečhúŋ wo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, do something if you can act somehow.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ihíŋhaŋni kiŋ wičháša tób tȟaŋkál hinážiŋpi na heyápi, “Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská, khiíŋyaŋg uŋkánipȟepi kta čha uŋhípe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the next morning the four men stopped outside, and they said, “White Plume Boy, we will challenge you to a race, so we came here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hinápȟa yo!”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Come out!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyápi čhaŋkhé “Háu!” eyíŋ na inápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said that, and so he said, “yes!” and he came out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša tópapi čha waŋží šaíč’iyiŋ na waŋží tȟoíč’iyiŋ na waŋží saŋíč’iyiŋ na waŋží sab’íč’iya čha itȟókab inážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there were four men, so they stood in front of him, one of them being painted red, and one being painted blue, and one being painted white, and one being painted black."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ šaíč’iye k’uŋ hé tȟokéya kičhí khiíŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he raced first with the one who was painted red."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋ waŋ anátaŋpi na alí íŋyaŋkapi na hukhúl gličúpi kta uŋkȟáŋ wičháša šaíč’iye uŋ hé táku kalá iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They rushed to a tree, and they ran up climbing it, and they would come back down, and so the man wearing red scattered something on the ground."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská él étuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ hiŋtkáŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "White Plume Boy looked at it, and so it was cattail fuzz."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ obláye kiŋ áta hiŋtkáŋhu héčha hiŋgníŋ na wapȟégnake tȟáwa k’uŋ hé átaya kaíyapehaŋhaŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was cattail that appeared across the prairie, and so what he was wearing in his hair got tangled up in it!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé tȟéhaŋȟčiŋ hél hená yuglá-wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he tried to unravel his hair from it for quite a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš heháŋl líla gličú na wičháša šaíč’iye uŋ hé kigléǧiŋ na kȟapȟá glihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But then he was rushing back, and he caught up with the man in red, and he got to him overtaking him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋksá tób hél eháŋni paslátapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they set up four clubs a while ago."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋží šá čha hé wičháša šaíč’iye kiŋ tȟáwa čha yužúŋ ičú na uŋ kat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He pulled out the red one that belonged to the man in red, and he killed him with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ waná yamníla okáptapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, there were then just three left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé ihíŋhaŋni yuŋkȟáŋ yámni uŋ hená tȟaŋkál hinážiŋpi na khiíŋyaŋg apȟépi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again the next morning, the three of them stopped outside, and they challenged him to a race."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská ináphiŋ na waná tȟoíč’iye uŋ he íŋš heháŋtu kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So White Plume Boy came out, and then they say that it was the blue one’s turn."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha kičhí iyáyiŋ na čháŋ waŋ ektá ihúŋnipi na alípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he left with him, and the arrived at a tree, and they climbed up it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khúl gličúpi na héčhena áta thiánataŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They got back down, and they kept rushing back to the tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš waná khútakiya kúpi kiŋ leháŋl tȟoíč’iye uŋ hé táku kalá iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But then at this time that they were coming back down, the one in blue scattered something on the ground."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská él étuŋwaŋ uŋkȟáŋ henáke wináwizi wapȟépȟeka čha uŋgnáhela makȟá kiŋ áta wináwizi ožú hiŋglé!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "White Plume Boy looked at it, and so suddenly the ground was covered with what were cocklebur brandles."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wapȟégnake k’uŋ áta ikȟóyaka čha tȟoél héna nážiŋ na yušpú-hiŋ na gluštáŋ kiŋ, él nakéš gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They got attached to what he was wearing in his hair, so first he stopped, and he pulled pieces of them off, and when he finished, finally he started back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčheča éyaš líla lúzahaŋ čhaŋkhé tȟoíč’iye k’uŋ ékȟapȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like that, but he was really fast, and so he overtook the one in blue."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋksá waŋ tȟoyápi čha oíhaŋke él kpasláte k’uŋ hé ičú na uŋ kat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he took a blue club that he sat upright at the end, and he killed him with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2431> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waná núŋblala iháŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2431;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2431> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then there were two left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2431;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2432> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičíyamni híŋhaŋni yuŋkȟáŋ núŋpapi k’uŋ henáos akhé hípi čha heháŋl saŋíč’iye uŋ hé kičhí íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2432;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2432> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The third was the next morning, and so both of them came again, so then he raced with the one in white."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2432;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé íŋš čháŋ k’uŋ hé iyálipi na waná hukhútakiya kúpi háŋl akhé táku kaȟ’ól iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they climbed up the tree themselves, and then when they were coming down, he threw something again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská waŋyáŋka uŋkȟáŋ henáke čhaŋpȟáhu čhaŋkhé wáčhiŋhiŋ waŋ pȟégnake uŋ hé áta kaíyuwi iyéye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So White Plume Boy saw it, and so they were chokeberry bushes, and so he got his plume all tangled up in them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héna tȟéhaŋ gluéčhetu wačhíŋ škáŋ-hiŋ na kȟoháŋ wičháša sáŋ uŋ hé waná khihúŋni kte s’eléčheča háŋl nakéš Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was working for a long time to try to make it right, and in the meantime, when it seemed like the man in white was going to get there, finally White Plume Boy started going."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ áta kaȟwóka čha ilázataŋhaŋ ahíkigleǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was carried by the wind, so he overtook him from behind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2437> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheš akhé hél čháŋ waŋ saŋyáŋpi kiŋ háŋ čha akhé ičú na uŋ kat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2437;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2437> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was then that he took the stick that was painted white, and he killed him with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2437;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2438> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, eháke híŋhaŋna yuŋkȟáŋ waŋžíla sabyápi čha gluhá hí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2438;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2438> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, finally, the next morning, he arrived with the one painted black."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2438;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2439> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éna ékignakiŋ na waná Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská kičhí iyáyiŋ na čháŋ waŋ alípi s’a uŋ hé akhé kičhí alí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2439;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2439> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He put his down back there, and then he left with White Plume Boy, and again he climbed a tree that they had often climbed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2439;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2440> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná khútakiya kúpi na makȟáta gliyópsičapi kta háŋl íŋš-eyá táku kalá iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2440;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2440> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he was coming back, and when he was about to jump on the ground, he threw something on the ground, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2440;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2441> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská ektá étuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ tȟaspáŋhu pȟestóstola héčha čha makȟóčhe kiŋ áta héčha ožú hiŋglé!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2441;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2441> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So White Plume Boy looked at it and so they were something like crab-apple stalks, so the ground became full of them!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2441;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2442> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé wáčhiŋhiŋ kiŋ áta ikȟóyaka čha éna tȟoél glušpúšpu na waná wičháša sápe uŋ hé khihúŋni kta háŋl nakéš gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2442;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2442> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So first he pulled the things sticking to his plume back there again, and then when the man in black was about to arrive back there, he finally started back again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2442;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2443> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ líla lazáta yúza nuŋs’é kú na ečhél kȟapȟá glihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2443;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2443> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was coming almost grabbing him from behind until he overtook him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2443;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čháŋ sabyápi k’uŋ ičú na uŋ wičháša kiŋ kat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2444;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he took the stick that was painted Black, and he killed the man with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2444;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ oyáte k’uŋ tuwéni naǧíyewičhaye šni čha okáblaya úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So for that reason, he never annoyed anybody, so they lived undisturbed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2446> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él, “Itȟó, ománi mníŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2446;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2446> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day, he said, “I guess I will go travelling around.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2446;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2447> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé atkúku kiŋ iyókhišni na “Hehehí, Čhíŋkš, eyá winíčhaša čha omáyani kte kiŋ héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2447;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2447> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his father forbid him from doing that, and he said, “Goodness, son, so you are a man, so it’s right for you to travel."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2447;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš akšáka, hél khušéya wíŋyaŋ waŋ wičhášašni čha úŋ weló” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But unfortunately, there is an evil woman blocking the path there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš átaš ítokȟa šni héčhena iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he still left not caring at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wiyóȟpeyatakiya yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ wíŋyaŋ waŋ táku yuhá yá-haŋ čha waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was going to the west, and so he saw the woman going along with something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé, “É! Táku waŋ até iwáhomaye uŋ hé lé é séče ló,” ečhíŋ na tȟáŋkaya aóhomni wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he thought, “hey! This is the thing that my father might have warned me about,” and he really tried to avoid her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "K’éyaš wíŋyaŋ kiŋ khušéya inážiŋ na heyókičile kte ȟčiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the woman stood blocking the path, and she said that she really wanted to rid him of his lice."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská: “Hóȟ tasé homákšilala na heyómapuze ka!” eyíŋ na héčhena iyáyiŋ kte éyaš líla okákišye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So White Plume Boy said, “absolutely not, I’m not a boy in any way, and it’s nonsense to suggest that I have lice!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋkéya tóškhe ȟ’áŋ na gnáye lakȟa iyówiŋyaŋ iyúŋkiŋ na heyókičile-khiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally she acted somehow, and evidently he was tricked into accepting to lay down, and she picked lice from his hair for him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha pȟehíŋ kiŋ pazáŋzaŋ khuwá na wáŋčag wapȟégnake uŋ hé yušlóg ičú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she parted his hair, and she immediately jerked out what he was wearing in his hair."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ yuŋkȟáŋ waná šúŋka waŋ hakté-la čha howáya óštaŋ yaŋká čha iȟpéya iyáye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She did that, and so then a mangy dog sat wimpering in his place, so she left him behind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šika úŋšiye ȟčiŋ omášte waŋ él aŋpétu áta ȟpáye-la."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The poor thing laid down miserably in a sunny spot all day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leyálaka waná akhé Iktó hé é čha wáčhiŋhiŋ k’uŋ manúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so in fact it was again Iktó that had stolen his plume."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé pȟégnakiŋ na iyé hokšíčhaŋlkiyapi kaȟyá wičhóthi-ta í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he put it in his hair, and he arrived at the camp pretending to be a child-beloved."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčha ič’íčhaǧiŋ na oyáte kiŋ wičákȟelapi čha wáŋčagna thípi waŋ é na wíŋyaŋ k’úpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He turned into someone like that, and the camp believed him, so they immediately gave him a tipi and a wife."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ íŋš-eyá líla theȟíla yuŋkȟáŋ yúziŋ na kičhí hóčhokata éthipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The woman really loved him, too, and so he took her, and they lived in the center of the camp circle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ watóhaŋtu waŋ wíŋyaŋ k’uŋ leyé, “Eyá, híŋhaŋni čháŋšna šuŋǧíla waŋ lógna hiyáya čháŋna khutépi khéš tuwéni ó okíhi šni ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so at about that time the woman said, “well, whenever it’s morning, whenever a red fox passes by this way, they shoot it, but nobody hits it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná híŋhaŋni yuŋkȟáŋ táku ȟmúŋ s’e ikík’opi uŋkȟáŋ, “Hó hé é, waná hé hiyáye ’uŋ!” eyé, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then it was morning, and so there was a murmur of excitement, and so the woman said, “that’s it, it’s passing by now!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena Iktó, “Hó, thiyópa kiŋ yuǧáŋyaŋ égle yo!” eyá čha tȟawíču kiŋ ečhél égle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then Iktó said, “well, prop open the door!” so his wife propped them open like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ thiyótȟaŋiŋyaŋ hiyáya čha khuté kte séče k’uŋ ečháŋl Iktó, “Híŋ! Wognáye-mayaŋpi ’uŋ!” eyíŋ na ó šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it ran right in sight of the door, so when he was maybe about to shoot it, he said, “Oops! They went tricking me!” and he didn’t shoot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhé tȟawíču kiŋ heyé; “Nakúŋš lél ogná eyášna ziŋtkála waŋ lúta čha kiŋyáŋ hiyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his wife said again, “also a red bird often flies by here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋna líla khutépi khéš tuwéni ó šni ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever they shoot, nobody hits it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ȟčeháŋl táku áta ikík’opi čha wíŋyaŋ kiŋ heyé; “Ihó, waná hé kiŋyáŋ hiyáye lakȟa, akíš’ape!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so just then there was a ruckus, so the woman said, “hey, it looks like it’s flying by just now, they’re jeering!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó šeháŋštukȟa waó kta ič’íla, “Thičhé oȟlóka kiŋ yuǧáŋ iyéya yo!” eyá čha otúyačhiŋke s’e yuǧáŋ ékičigle na waŋyáŋg yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so for sure this time Iktó was confident that he would shoot it, saying “go and open the top of the tipi,” so she set them open like it was in vain, and he sat seeing it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leyáš oȟlóka kiŋ ogná khuté kte séče k’uŋ ečháŋl áta itázipa ikȟáŋ glapsáke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all the while, when he was maybe about to shoot it through the hole, he strung his bow so hard that it broke."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha “Híŋ! Itázipa ikȟáŋ mitȟáwa kiŋ napsáke ’uŋ!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “Oops! My bow’s arrow broke!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel uŋmáni ó šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He didn’t shoot either like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl Iktó heyé; “Niyáte kiŋ éyapaha-wičhákhiye-ší yo, čhaŋnúŋmuŋpiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then Iktó said, “tell your father to send a crier around, I’m going to smoke a pipe.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha aéyapahapi uŋkȟáŋ íyečhana áta thiyót’iŋs ahíyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they announced it, and so shortly thereafter he sat all in the door."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó heyé, “Hó, čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ tópakhigle blablú kta čha takúŋl hinápȟe kiŋ kat’é-wačhíŋ po!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “well, I will puff on the pipe in four directions, so try to kill whatever comes out.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé itúȟčiŋ wíŋyeya yaŋkápi éya tákuni hiyú šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they waited in vain with nothing coming out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé wičháša kiŋ iyúha čhaŋl’éčhečapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all the men were disappointed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoháŋ, ȟeyáta wičhíŋčala úŋšikela waŋ húŋku kičhíšnala maníl thípi uŋkȟáŋ makȟóskaŋl čhaŋk’íŋ yá-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meantime, there was a poor girl that lived all alone with her mother in the wild of the hills, and so she was going around gathering wood in the wilderness."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ šúŋkala uŋ hé átayiŋ na “Šika! Čhéwiŋš šúŋkala waŋ iyótiyekiye-la,” eyáya pȟežíȟota kíčiyušlašla na uŋ oyúŋke waŋ kíčaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2479;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she came upon a dog, and she said, “poor thing! How awful that a dog is suffering like this,” pulling up white sage, and using it she made him a bed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2479;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2480> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ šúŋkala uŋ heyé; “Wičhíŋčala, líla waúŋšiyala kiŋ átȟaŋiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2480;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2480> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the dog said, “girl, it’s clear that you’re really kind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2480;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2481> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Amágla yo,” eyá čha héčhena šiná ognákiŋ na thiyáta akhí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2481;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2481> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Bring me home,” so like that she put a blanket on him and brought him back home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2481;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2482> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thimá égnakiŋ na khináphiŋ na akhé thimáhel glihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ šúŋkala uŋ hé tókȟaȟ’aŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2482;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2482> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She laid him down, and she went back out, and again she came back in, and so the dog had disappeared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2482;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2483> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ée kȟoškálaka waŋ líla ówaŋyaŋg wašté čha thičhátku él yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2483;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2483> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And instead a very good-looking young man sat in the honor place."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2483;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2484> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé, “Hó, tuwá miyé kaȟyá hokšíčhaŋlkiyapi s’e hí uŋ hé Iktó é yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2484;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2484> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “well, Iktó arrived as someone who is disguised as a child-beloved."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2484;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ektá yíŋ na wapȟégnaka waŋ amámanuŋ kiŋ hé míčhu-ší yo,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So go to him, and ask him to return to me what I had in my hair that he stole."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičhíŋčala kiŋ ektá í na thiyópa él inážiŋ na heyé, “Iktó, wapȟégnake k’uŋ wičháwečihiyohi ye,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the young woman went there, and she approached the door, and she said, “Iktó, I came to fetch what you have in your hair.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Hó kíčagla yo, kíčagla yo! Takómni tȟáwa yeló,” eyá čha wapȟégnake kiŋ akhíyagle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “oh, take it back for me, take it back for me! It is definitely his,” so she left with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena oyáte kiŋ áta Iktó aš’ápi na manítakiya áyapi na tȟéhaŋl éyuštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The people kept screaming at Iktó, and they took him out into the wilderness, and they left him there a far way aways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš “Tókša akhé kú kte ’uŋ…Eháš Iktómi é yeló,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they said, “surely he will be coming back… it’s Iktómi after all.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhé šuŋgíla uŋ hé hiyáya uŋkȟáŋ Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská tókȟa šni s’e ipáȟna ó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the red fox passed by again, and so White Plume Boy shot it like it was no problem."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na akhé ihíŋhaŋni yuŋkȟáŋ ziŋkála lúta uŋ hé waŋkál okíŋyaŋ-haŋ čha čhaŋté kiŋ glakíŋyaŋ ó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And again the next morning the red bird was flying around overhead, so he shot it right through the heart."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé thičhé kiŋ él šayéla otkékičičhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they sang it up for him all red at the top of his tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl, “Hó, čhaŋnúŋmuŋpiŋ kta čha lél uwíčhaši po,” eyá čha thimá akhé kaót’iŋs ahíyotake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he said, “well, I will smoke a pipe, so ask them to come,” so he came to sit down in the packed tipi again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Lé čhaŋlí kiŋ tópakhigle blablú kta čha takúku hinápȟapi kiŋ hená iyúha wičhákat’e-wačhíŋ po!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “I will puff on the tobacco in four directions, so try to kill all of the various things that come out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wíŋyeya yaŋkápi yuŋkȟáŋ  čhaŋlí šóta kiŋ yablúblu kiŋ héčhel ziŋtkála očháže iyúha hinápȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "kákhelSo they sat ready, and so many types of birds came out with him puffing on the pipe and smoke coming out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hinápȟapi na áta thiókiŋyaŋpi čhaŋkhé wičhákat’a áyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They went out, and they flew around the tipi, and so the went along killing them dead."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ečhél mázawakȟaŋ na šiná oówa šá naíŋš tȟó naíŋš ǧí, sápa kȟókȟo hiŋȟpáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so in that way guns, and red, or green, or brown, and black blankets fell down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wóyuha iháŋkeya waštéšte kȟó kaȟpápi, ziŋtkála kiŋ héčha hiŋglápi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they knocked down the best possessions, all sorts of birds appearing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hetáŋhaŋ oyáte kiŋ wóyuha waštéšte yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So from there the people had many good possessions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáčhiŋhiŋ Ská wičhíŋčala waŋ úŋšike k’éyaš sáŋm waúŋšila k’uŋ hé yúze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "White Plume Boy took the poor girl, but she was even more compassionate."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kičhí hóčhokata thiwíčhakhiyapi na óhiŋni líla thewíčhaȟilapi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He repaired the tipi in the center of the camp circle, and they always loved them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maštíŋčala waŋ taŋyéȟčiŋ thí-la yuŋkȟáŋ matȟó waŋ čhiŋčá ób tókhiyataŋhaŋ él hí na tȟaŋkál iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A rabbit was living well, and so a bear arrived somewhere with its cubs, and they went outside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋpi na iyé thí kiŋ él óštaŋ thípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that and they sat taking up the house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé maštíŋčala kiŋ khiyéla wakhéya šíčela waŋ ič’íčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the rabbit made itself a bad little tent."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, híŋhaŋni iyóhila, matȟó kiŋ tȟaŋkál hinážiŋ na šna “Maštíŋčala ȟčiȟčí-la, hinápȟa yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so every morning, the bear went outside, and whenever he said, “notched nose rabbit, come on out!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟatȟáŋka óta ahíhuŋni yeló!” eyá čháŋna maštíŋčala k’uŋ hinápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A lot of buffalos arrived here!” the rabbit came out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hináphiŋ na šna wahíŋkpe wakȟáŋ waŋ yuhá čha uŋ pté tóna íčhiyokhihéheya wičháo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It came out and he had a magic arrow, so it shot through multiple of them at once."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ čháŋna šna matȟó kiŋ čhiŋčá ób él hiyúpi na šna tȟaló kiŋ átaya ičúpi na akhíyaglapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever he did that, the bear came out with its cubs, and it took all the meat, and came back in with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóhiŋni maštíŋčala kiŋ haŋkéla k’úpi šni na uŋ waná líla tȟamáheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He never gave part of it to the rabbit, and for that reason he was very skinny."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhé wapȟátapi čha él inážiŋ éyaš wóla šni haŋní kišíčapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it came and stood where the meat was being cut up again, but before it asked for food, they sent it away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé kawíŋȟ gličú kta uŋkȟáŋ kaíyuzeya wéyotȟa waŋ – wé oš’é waŋ tȟápa s’e gmigméla čha – yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so when he was going to turn around, there was a blood clot – a drop of round blood ball shaped – sitting there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aȟíčahe kúŋziŋ na yumáhel ičú na á oȟláthe naȟmé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It pretended to trip and fall, and he took it up, and he hid it under its armpit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ matȟó kiŋ, “Wáŋ, waȟtéšni šíča, táku iyáču s’eléčheča yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the bear said, “hey, piece of trash, it seems that you’ve taken something!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha “Hiyá, íŋše waná líla lowáčhiŋ kač’úŋ mahúŋkešni čha makáčekčeke ló,” eyíŋ na héčhena thiyátakiya khiglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it said, “no, just because I’m so hungry, I’m weak, so I stumbled,” and it kept leaving to return back home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khí na wáŋčagna wéyotȟa k’uŋ hé yuhá iníkaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It got back and immediately it did a sweat ceremony over the blood clot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mni-ákaštaŋ ohítiya škáŋ yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhela hél thimá tuwá čhuwí okíniya naȟ’úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It worked hard to pour the water on it, and so all of a sudden he heard someone take a breath in there in the house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl tuwá, “Waúŋšiyala héči thiyópa kiŋ yuǧáŋ yo!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then someone said, “if you are compassionate, open the door!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha thiyópa kiŋ kiyúǧaŋ uŋkȟáŋ kȟoškálaka waŋ áta šayéla hinápȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it opened the door for them, and so a red young man came in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha maštíŋčala k’uŋ líla wíyuškiŋ na tȟakóžayiŋ kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the rabbit was really happy and he said that he would have him for a grandchild."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tokhí mitȟákoža kákhel na kákhel yuhá ní!” eyá čháŋšna iyéčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2541;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever he said, “let me grandchild have such and such things,” it was like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2541;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé aŋpétu haŋkéyela táku wašté kiŋ iyúha yuhá, táku čhiŋ-phíča k’uŋ iyúha ȟčiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so on the same day he had all the nice things, everything that he could want."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ “Wé Hokšíla” eyá čhaškítȟuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he named him, “Blood Clot Boy.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš, maštíŋčala kiŋ wóyute níča čha tókȟa wók’u šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But, the rabbit didn’t have nay food, so he couldn’t feed him at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Wé Hokšíla leyé; “Tȟuŋkášila, tákuwe wičháša waŋ wížiča na wašéča čha ikhíyela yathí škȟá akíȟ’aŋ yaúŋ he?” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Blood Clot Boy said, “grandfather, why is there a man who is rich and well-stocked that you live near, but you are starving?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tókhel matȟó kiŋ khuwá uŋ hená taŋyéȟčiŋ, gligléya okíyake: “Hehehé, Tȟakožá, táku yakȟé ló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in detail he told him carefully how the bear chased him away, “goodness, grandson, what do you mean!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wáŋ k’éya, miyé ȟča čha pté kiŋ hená wičháwao s’a yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Don’t you know, it was me who often shot the buffalos."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá wičháo bluštáŋ čháŋšna matȟó kiŋ čhiŋčá ób hiyú na šna áta éyayape ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But whenever I finished shooting them, bear came out with its cubs, and they took all of it away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "‘Wáŋ, Maštíŋčala, phuté ȟčiȟčí-la, hinápȟa yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "‘Goodness, rabbit, knotched nose, come out!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟatȟáŋka óta ahíhuŋni yeló!’ emákiye s’a yeló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many buffalos have come!’ he would say to me,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wé Hokšíla hé naȟ’úŋ na líla čhaŋzéke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Blood Clot Boy heard that, and he got really angry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha pséȟtiŋ alétka waŋ ǧuǧúyiŋ na čhaŋksá waŋ káǧiŋ na wíŋyeya yuhá yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he burned an ashwood stick, and he made a club, and he sat ready with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná héčheča kte uŋ, híŋhaŋni laȟčiŋ matȟó k’uŋ tȟaŋkál hinážiŋ na “Maštíŋčala, phuté ȟčiȟčí-la, hinápȟa yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then being like that, the very next morning, the bear stopped outside, and it said, “rabbit, split nose, come on out!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟatȟáŋka óta ahíhuŋni yeló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many buffalos have arrived!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Maštíŋčala tȟakóžakpaku kiŋ tókhel waéye-ší kiŋ ečhéȟčiŋ ekíye; “Hóȟ, akȟó glá yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the rabbit told his grandson just what to say, saying, “absolutely not, go away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tákuȟča yakȟé ’uŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2556;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There is a lot of stuff."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2556;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhéš tȟaló kiŋ áta ayákšižiŋ kte ló!” eyíŋ na hinápȟe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You will hold onto all the meat again!” and it didn’t come out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ matȟó kiŋ íšiŋkčhiŋ oyúspiŋ kte ȟčiŋ thimáhel hiyú éyaš Wé Hokšíla thimá thiyópa ikhíyela nážiŋ na čhaŋksá uŋ hé uŋ áta kat’á iȟpéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the bear, in anger, really wanted to go inside and catch it, but Blood Clot Boy stood next to the door, and he killed it using the club."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl tȟuŋkášitku kiŋ matȟó thawíču kiŋ ektá yeší na léčhel eyé-ší: “Nihíŋgna kiŋ waná wačhíŋniye ló,” eyé-ší."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he sent his grandfather to the bear’s wife, and he had it say, “your husband need you now.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2560> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé iyáyiŋ na matȟó thí kiŋ él itȟáŋkal inážiŋ na “Matȟó wíŋyela, nihíŋgna kiŋ waná wačhíŋniye ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2560;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2560> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he left, andshe stopped outside of bear’s house, and it said, “bear woman, your husband needs you now!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2560;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟawíču kiŋ thimáhetaŋhaŋ hóuyiŋ na “Huŋhí, tóna wičhák’iŋ he?” eyá čhaŋkhé, “Pté núm wičhák’iŋ yeló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his wife called from inside the house, and she said, “goodness, how many is he carrying?” and so it said, “he’s carrying two buffalos.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Ečéš, eháš čónalapi!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said to herself, “really, that’s so few!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyášna óta wičhák’iŋ ’uŋ,” eíč’iye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He usually carries a lot.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heháŋl, “Eyá, pté yámni wičhák’iŋ yeló,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “Hinú, óta wičhák’iŋ s’a ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then it said, “well, he’s carrying three buffalos,” and so she said, “well, he usually carries a lot.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akhé, “Íŋ, pté tópa wičhák’iŋ yeló,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl naké, “Oháŋ, híŋyaŋka,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So again he said, “uh, he’s carrying four buffalos,” and so then finally she said, “okay, gimmie a second.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná hináphiŋ kta uŋkȟáŋ Wé Hokšíla tȟaŋkál nážiŋ na pȟá patȟáŋkal iyékiye kiŋ héčhena áta t’osyéla akáŋl aphíŋ na kat’é."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then when she was about to come out, Blood Clot Boy was standing outside, and then when here head was coming out, he hit her really hard, and he killed her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thimíyaya uŋkȟáŋ matȟó čhiŋčála kiŋ yumímeya yaŋkápi na wóta-haŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went inside the house, and so the bear cubs were sitting in a circle, and they were eating."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé, “Hó, tuwá mitȟúŋkašila kiŋ lé úŋšiyalapi héčiŋhaŋ, ‘Miyé’ eyá po,” ewíčhakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he told them, “well, if someone is kind to my grandfather, say ‘me.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iyúha “Miyé! Miyé! Miyé!” eyápi čha áta ȟmúŋ s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “me! me! me!” so it was like they sat with just a hum there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl waŋží, “‘Miyé’ eyápi škȟá miyéš mišnála wówauŋšila wakíyuha ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then one said, “they said, ‘me,’ but it is just me alone that has compassion.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé okáȟmi él matȟó čhiŋčála hakáktala kiŋ ǧiyéla, pȟowáya yaŋké-la."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the youngest bear cub, brown and furry, was sitting in the corner."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha maštíŋčala kiŋ heyé, “Tȟakožá, hé wičákȟe ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the rabbit said, “grandchild, that one is telling the truth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáhaŋšna tȟaló čisčíla waŋžígži míčipataŋ na iyémakhiye ló,” eyá čhaŋkhé, “Hó, inápȟa yo – yaní kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Every now and then, he saved me a little bit of meat, and he sent it to me,” and so he said, “well, leave – you will live.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ináphiŋ na uŋmápi kiŋ iyúha ȟčiŋ wičhákat’api."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he left, and he killed all of the rest of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋhaŋ maštíŋčala k’uŋ eháŋni thí k’uŋ hél phiyá kithí na wahíŋkpe wakȟáŋ k’uŋ héčhena gluhá čha akhé líla wašéča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From then, the rabbit made the old house into a new house for himself, and he still had his magic arrow, so he was well stocked with lots of food again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ Wé Hokšíla é na matȟóla uŋ hé ób thí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he lived with Blood Clot Boy and Little Bear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋhaŋ tȟéhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgná Wé Hokšíla owáŋžila úŋ kiŋ iwátukȟa na heyé, “Tȟuŋkášila, lé tokhíyotȟaŋ oyáte wičhóthi he?” eyá čha, “Eyá, wiyóȟpeyata oyáte waŋ wičhóthi yeló,” eyá ayúpte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time after that, maybe Blood Clot Boy was tired of staying still, and he said, “grandfather, where do the people live?” so it responded, “well, there’s a group of people living to the west.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Itȟó, ektá íčhimani mníŋ kte ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “I guess that I will make a trip there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé maštíŋčala kiŋ líla iyókhišni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the rabbit really refused him to do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hiyá, Tȟakóža, tȟawát’elčhičhíye šni yeló!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It said, “no, grandson, I’m not willing to have you do that!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél khušéya táku waŋ líla wičhášašni čha úŋ weló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Something very sneaky is blocking the way.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš heháŋl iyótaŋ líla kitáŋ na haŋkéya iyáye.,"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But then he was especially insistentand finally he left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟéhaŋ yé šni ečhél wičháša waŋ táku khuté-haŋ čha waŋyáŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He didn’t go for a long time until he saw a man who was shooting at something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“É, Tȟuŋkášila táku waŋ wičhášašni kéye uŋ hé lé é séče ló!” ečhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He thought, “hey, this is the thing that grandfather said was sneaky.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ítȟehaŋyaŋ aóhomni-wačhíŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, “Misúŋ, úwa yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He tried to go around him at a great distance, and so he said, “little brother, come here!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟoéyaš ká miyéčio na heháŋl ilániŋ kte ló,” eyíŋ na kátkiya épazo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But first shoot that for me, and then you will leave,” and he pointed over there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "K’éyaš “Hóȟ, lé ináȟni omáwani ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he said, “oh no, I’m in a rush."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tasé ináwažiŋ na wačhíčio kte ka!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There’s no way that I can stop and shoot things for you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš líla úŋšiši iyá čhaŋkhé kawíŋȟ gličú na ziŋtkála waŋ kȟé uŋ hé ipáȟna kíčio na héčhena iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he spoke really pitifully, and so he turned around, and he shot through the bird that he referenced for him, and still he went."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhé kipáŋ na, “Wáŋ, Misúŋ, wahíŋkpe waŋ wašté čha yeyáye ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he yelled to him again and he said, “hey, little brother, you shot a nice arrow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwáš héčha iȟpéye ka!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What type of person would throw it away!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ wahíŋkpe uŋ hé ziŋtkála kiŋ ikȟóyag čhaŋwáŋkal oyátȟake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because you know that that arrow is stuck lodged in the bird up in the tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Wé Hokšíla, “Kináš iyáču na luhá šni ’uŋ,” eyíŋ na iyáyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Blood Clot Boy said, “why don’t you take it and have it,” and he was going to leave."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš ečháŋl, “Misúŋ, úŋšimayala k’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But just then he said, “little brother, be kind to me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2595> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyáli na imákiču ye!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2595;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2595> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Please climb up and get it for me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2595;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhetu khéš waná čháŋ kiŋ iyáli kta čha kú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2596;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it being like this, he would climb up the tree, so he was going back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2596;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2597> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhé heyé; “Misúŋ, tȟoéyaš hayápi kiŋ hená glušlóka yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2597;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2597> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said again, “little brother, first take off your clothes!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2597;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2598> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla waštéšte ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2598;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2598> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They are really nice."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2598;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2599> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ókinahaŋš čhaŋáletka kiŋ iyúȟlečiŋ kte séče ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2599;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2599> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Respectfully, the branches might tear them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2599;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2600> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé yaéčheča čhaŋkhé áta iglúžužu na hačhóla čhaŋ-áli."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2600;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2600> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He convinced him again, and so he took off all his clothes, and he climbed up the tree naked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2600;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2601> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná wahíŋkpe uŋ hé ičú na khútakiya kú kiŋ leháŋl wičháša kiŋ naȟmáȟmala tákeyaya nážiŋ čha naȟ’úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2601;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2601> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he took that arrow, and at this point where he was coming back down, he heard that he was standing there saying something in private."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2601;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2602> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé “Tókhe tákehe so?” eyá uŋkȟáŋ, “Íŋše, ‘Misúŋ, khúya kú wo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2602;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2602> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “what are you saying?” and so he said, “little brother, keep coming down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2602;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2603> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoyáȟ’aŋ yo!’” epȟé ’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2603;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2603> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, ‘hurry up!’” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2603;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2604> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha “Oháŋ,” eyíŋ na wáŋčagna khúl gličú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2604;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2604> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “okay,” and he immediately started coming down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2604;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná makȟáta glihúŋni kta háŋl wičháša k’uŋ hónisko “Iyáskapa yo!” eyá hiŋglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2605;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then when he was about to get back to the ground, the man suddenly called out all loud, “stick to it!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2605;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2606> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhena Wé Hokšíla čháŋ kiŋ éna iyáskape."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2606;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2606> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Blood Clot Boy kept himself stuck to the tree back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2606;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha eháŋk’uŋ Iktó hé é čha šilyá waéčhuŋ!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2607;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was clear that it was Iktó that was acting badly!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2607;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ináȟni Wé Hokšíla tȟa-háyapi kiŋ iyúha ečhékčhe kič’úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2608;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he quickly put on all of Blood Clot Boy’s clothese like he would."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2608;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2609> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ na iyé hayápi šikšíča úŋ k’uŋ hená éna našlóg iȟpékiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2609;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2609> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that, and he rushed to throw away those bad clothes of his that he wore."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2609;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2610> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na “Wé Hokšíla, niyé hená úŋ wo!” eyá akáȟ’ol iyékhiyiŋ na wičhóthi-tákiya iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2610;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2610> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And, throwing his clothes at him, he said, “Blood Clot Boy, wear those!” and he went to the village."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2610;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél wikȟóškalaka waŋ tȟokápȟa yuhápi na líla theȟílapi čha “Čhokáb Thí Wíŋ” ečíyapi yuŋkȟáŋ hé é čha él yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There they had a young woman who was the eldest daughter, and they loved her, so they called her, “She Lives in the Middle of the Circle [Čhokab Thí Wiŋ]” and so it was her that he was going to."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hóčhoka kiŋ él ihúŋni eháŋl héčhena “Wé Hokšíla Čhokáb Thí Wíŋ hiyóhi yeló!” eyá éyapahapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When he arrived in the middle, they called out saying, “Blood Clot Boy has come for Čhokáb Thí Wiŋ!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé huŋkáke kiŋ wáŋčag čhuŋwíŋtkupi kiŋ k’úpi na čhokáta thiwíčhakhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so her parents immediately gave her to him, and they let them live in the middle of the camp circle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hél aŋpétu tȟahéna Iktó wówičhašašni uŋ áta yuphíya ahíthi na táku óta ohíič’iye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So before the day was over Iktó came her to camp with meanness, and he won many things for himself."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ihíŋhaŋni kiŋ él wakȟáŋȟ’aŋ kta kéyiŋ na léčhel wíwahowičhaye; “Hó, kȟoškálaka kiŋ šináhiŋšma waŋží yušlápi na pahá akȟótaŋhaŋ áyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the next morning he said that he would do something sacred, and he promised them by saying, “well, let the young men rip the hair off of a buffalo robe, and let them go and bring it to the other side of a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél kaȟmí kiŋ enána híŋ kiŋ kalápi na ečhél yuóblečapi kte ló,” eyá čha ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Let them scatter it back there at a bend until they scatter it,” so they did it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ihíŋhaŋna yuŋkȟáŋ ektá yewíčhaši čha ektá ípi éyaš átaš tákunišni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The next day he told them to go, so they arrived there, but there was nothing at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟoháŋ, Čhokáb Thí Wíŋ tȟaŋkákula waŋ thí él í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the meanwhile, Čhokáb Thí Wiŋ arrived to her younger sister’s tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wáŋčag čhuwéku kiŋ heyá kišíče; “Akȟó glá ye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so immediately her older sister told her to go away, saying, “go away!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mihíŋgna kiŋ él étuŋwe wačhíŋ-he šni ye!” eyá čha čhéya iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Don’t try to look at my husband!” so she left crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maníl čhéya ománi yuŋkȟáŋ héčhiya kȟoškálaka waŋ líla wičháša wašté čha čhaŋ-áiyaskab nážiŋ-haŋ čha iyéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was walking in the wilderness crying, and so she found a very good-looking young man who was standing stuck to a tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “Wičhíŋčala, waúŋšiyala héčiŋhaŋ makáȟlaya yo!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “girl, if you’re kind, peel me off!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó lé theȟíya omákiȟ’aŋ na wičhóthi-takiya úŋyaŋ imáyaye ló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Iktó treated me badly, and he left me behind as he left to the camp!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha nazúŋspe waŋ uŋ kȟoškálaka k’uŋ kaȟláyiŋ na kičhí šiná ówaŋžila glowíŋ thiyáta akhí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she peeled off the young man using an ax, and she went back to her home with him wearing her blanket together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyé; “Hó, čhokáb thí kiŋ hé él yíŋ na hayápi mitȟáwa kiŋ míčaku-ší yo.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “so, go to the center of the campcircle, and tell the one wearing my clothes to come to me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičhíŋčala kiŋ čhuwéku thí thiyópa kiŋ él inážiŋ na, “Iktó, Wé Hokšíla tȟa-háyapi kiŋ wéčihiyowahi ye!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the girl stopped at the door of her older sister’s tipi, and she said, “Iktó, I’ve come to get Blood Clot Boy’s clothes!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhuwéku kiŋ waná akhé, “Akȟó glá ye!"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so her older sister then said again, “go away!"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mihíŋgna kiŋ él étuŋwe wačhíŋ-he šni ye!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Try not to look at my husband!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heyé k’éyaš Iktó íŋš haglúšlog iyéyiŋ na yapsáke šni “Iyékičičhiya yo, iyékičičhiya yo,” eyáya yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said that, but Iktó took them off, and he sat saying bits of, “hand them to him, hand them to him.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha nakéš heháŋl wikȟóškalaka k’uŋ Iktó gnáye kiŋ waŋglákiŋ na áta čhéya úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then finally she saw that Iktó was the young man that tricked her, and she cried and cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná Wé Hokšíla hayápi ečhékčhe kič’úŋ na áta ȟobyákel yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then Blood Clot Boy put on his own clothes, and he was sat down looking really attractive."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl Iktó eyé k’uŋ ečhéȟčiŋ heyé; “Hó, kȟoškálaka kiŋ šináhiŋšma waŋží yušlápi na pahá akȟótaŋhaŋ áyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he said the thing Iktó had said like this, “well, let the young men rip the hair off of a buffalo robe, and let them go and bring it to the other side of a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél kaȟmí kiŋ enána híŋ kiŋ kalápi na ečhél yuóblečapi kte ló,” eyá čha ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Let them scatter it back there at a bend until they scatter it,” so they did it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ihíŋhaŋni čha ektá ípi uŋkȟáŋ iyéštukȟa wakȟáŋ čha kaȟmí kiŋ áta pté hiyót’iŋze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The next day, the arrived there, and so lucky for them mysteriously the bend was crowded with buffalo."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áwičakȟeya yuphíya wanásapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they hunted buffalo really well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé ȟtayétu kiŋ omníčiye thípi kiŋ él wóyute paháyela aípi na wičháša kiŋ wóglakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That evening they came to the council tipi with piles of food, and the men spoke."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktó íŋš-eyá él í éyaš tȟaló ošpúla waŋ líla čísčila čha ečéla ok’úpi, héčhegla ȟčiŋ okíni čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó came too, but they only loaned him a small little bit of meal, he received just that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íyečhala Wé Hokšíla gníŋ kta kéyiŋ na wičhíŋčala waŋ nikhíye uŋ hé kičhí gníŋ kta čha iglúwiŋyeyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Soon thereafter Blood Clot Boy said he was going back home, he was getting ready to be going back with the girl that had saved him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wikȟóškalaka waŋ waȟ’áŋič’ila na uŋ tȟaŋkákula kiŋ kišíče s’a uŋ hé – Čhokáb Thí Wíŋ ečiyápi kiŋ hé – nakéš Iktó hiŋgnáyaŋ čhíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a young woman was arrogant, and for that reason, the younger sister she had sent away – her name was Čhokáb Thí Wiŋ – she didn’t want to marry Iktó."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičhíhakab áta čhéya yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she followed them crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋš ehákela kišíčapi éya núŋǧe wanílya yá-hiŋ na ečhél waná Wé Hokšíla thí kiŋ ikhíyela glápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally she was going not listening to them telling her to go back until they got to Blood Clot Boy’s house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waná ótȟaŋiŋyaŋ glápi uŋkȟáŋ matȟó čhiŋčálala uŋ hé išnála paháta waákhil yaŋká-he ȟčeháŋtu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they were coming back in plain sight, and so it was just then that the little bear cub was sitting looking out alone on the hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé waŋwíčhayaŋke lakȟa áta nážiŋ hiyáyiŋ na akȟóketkiya aíyoȟpeya khiglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he shot up evidently having seen them, and run downhill back towards home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Niyášnišni khihúŋni na “Waná nitȟákoža kú yuŋkȟáŋ wíŋyaŋ waŋ akú weló!” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He arrived out of breath and said, “your grandson is coming back now, and so he’s bringing a woman!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena maštíŋčala kiŋ líla wíyuškiŋ čha áta psípsil itkób wičháyiŋ na tȟakóžakpaku kiŋ kič’íŋ gloglé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The rabbit was really happy, so he went hopping towards them, and carried his grandson on his back on the way back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha matȟóla kiŋ íŋš-eyá wičhíŋčala kiŋ kič’íŋ na ihákab glé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the little bear also put the woman on his back, and it followed it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš yuhá šni čha wikȟóškalaka kiŋ sí kiŋ áta makhíčaǧoǧoyela aglápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But it couldn’t carry her, so the young woman’s feet were scrapping along the ground on the way back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó tkȟá čhuwéku waŋ waȟ’áŋič’ila tkȟá k’uŋ hé tuwéni él étuŋwe šni čha iyéčhiŋka wičhíhakab í."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But her older sister thought a lot of herself, but nobody paid attention to her, so she got back following them all on her own."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋhaŋ iyúha iyókiphiya ptáyela thípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From then on they all lived happily together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš wikȟóškalaka uŋ hé išnála iyókiphi šni ičhíŋ čhaȟóta kiŋ iȟpéye-khiyapi s’a škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But that young woman wasn’t happy all alone, because they often made her take out the ashes for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela oíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé aŋpétu kiŋ tókhel imáčhaǧa héči hé owáglakiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2685;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Today I will tell how I grew up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2685;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni mačík’ala k’uŋ héhaŋ South Dakota él imáčhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2686;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I grew up in South Dakota a long time ago when I was little."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2686;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé Sičháŋǧu Oyáŋke él imáčhaǧiŋ na, hetáŋ wahíyu na, Oglála makȟóčhe ektá hiŋgnáwatȟuŋ na, hetáŋ wašíču makȟóčhe ektá wahíyu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2687;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I grew up on Rosebud reservation, and from there I arrived here, and I got married at Pine Ridge, and from there I got here outside the reservation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2687;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héhaŋ eháŋni wamákȟaŋyeža čha héhaŋ ináwaye kiŋ máni šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2688;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So a long time ago when I was a child so back then my mom didn’t walk."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2688;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu wikčémna máni šni na, aŋpétu waŋ él máni kta yuŋkȟáŋ ičhúŋhaŋ hiŋgnáwatȟuŋ na, léčhiya Oglála makȟóčhe ektá wahíyu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2689;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She didn’t walk for ten years and one day she would walk and so during that time I got married and arrived here at Pine Ridge."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2689;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héhaŋ Lakȟóta étkiya hiŋgnátȟuŋmakhiyapi čha wičhámak’upi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2690;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So back then they arrainged a marriage for me so I was given to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2690;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičháša waŋ hiŋgnáwaye kiŋ slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2691;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I didn’t know the man that I married."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2691;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Slolwáye šni éyaš hiŋgnáwayiŋ na waníyetu yámni séča héčhi waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2692;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I didn’t know him but I married him and I was like that for maybe three years there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2692;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2693> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hetáŋ wašíču makȟóčhe ektá wahíyu, Čhasmú Okáȟmi ektá wahíyu, na héčhiya waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2693;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2693> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And from there I got off reservation, I got to Alliance, and I lived there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2693;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2694> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hél wówaši ečhámuŋ na, hokší ičháȟwakhiyiŋ na, hetáŋ iyópteya Ȟé Ská étkiya wahíyu na, heháŋtaŋ Ȟé Ská Oyáŋke léčhiya otȟúŋwahe waŋ tȟáŋka čha héčhiya waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2694;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2694> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I worked there and I raised my child there and from there I came here through the Rocky Mountains and from there I’ve lived in a big city, Denver."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2694;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2695> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná waníyetu wikčémna tóp sáŋm akéšaglóǧaŋ henákeča léčhiya waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2695;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2695> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now for 48 years I’ve lived here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2695;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2696> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš wašíču úŋpi kiŋ othéȟikiŋ na Lakȟóta wičhóuŋ kiŋ sáŋm gnúni uŋkáyapi čhaŋkhé oíyokišiče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2696;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2696> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But it’s hard where white people lived and we are losing the Lakota way more and more, and so that’s sad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2696;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2697> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó leháŋ uŋk’úŋpi kiŋ naŋké uŋLákȟotapi kte ȟčiŋ éyaš uŋkókihipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2697;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2697> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well nowadays we really want to live as Lakota people but can’t."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2697;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2698> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Takómni waš’ágyahaŋ wašíču wičhóuŋ ogná uŋk’úŋpi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2698;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2698> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because they’re really living according to the white way of things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2698;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Othéȟiya núni s’e uŋk’úŋpi, lé aŋpétu kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2699;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Today it’s like we’ve lost our way really bad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2699;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2700> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ etáŋ, Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ naíŋš táku kiŋ lená héktakiya yukínipi, na ečhél tȟokátakiya yuhá mánipi kte, na ečhél Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lená héčhuŋ-s’e Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ úŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, taŋyáŋ úŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2700;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2700> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they’re trying to revive Lakota traditions or things like back then from that until they live like that in the future and if Lakota people keep living just in the way of these traditions, they will live well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2700;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2701> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kta kéyapi na, hená héčhuŋpi éyaš, mnišíča waŋ líla khičháŋyaŋpi na, úŋ núnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2701;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2701> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say they would and they do that but they’re addicted to alcohol and live lost."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2701;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2702> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čhaŋkhé leháŋ oínikaǧe él awíčhayapi na, mní wičhák’upi naíŋš čhaŋnúŋmwičhakhiyapi lená waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2702;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2702> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nowadays nobody brings them to do the sweat lodge ceremony and they don’t give them water or have them smoke."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2702;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2703> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋni yukȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2703;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2703> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back then we had those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2703;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leháŋ hená waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And now today we don’t."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená akhé héktakiya kú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So those things are coming back again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha lená wóčhekiye uŋ oyáte kiŋháŋ ób šna iníuŋkaǧapi na, wačhéwičhauŋkičičhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so we do sweat ceremony with the people using prayer, and we pray for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hógna kaówotȟaŋ iyáyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hógna ečéla lená Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way if they leave in a fair way, then in that way Lakota people will just live well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2708> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na hé uŋ, wašíču úŋpi kiŋ hé uŋ, kakížapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2708;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2708> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And for that reason, the way in which white people live, they suffer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2708;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha leháŋ wičhóuŋ kiŋháŋ húŋȟ wóuŋspe waŋkátuya yuhápi k’éyaš, Lakȟóta húŋȟ wayáwapi šni hená ówičhakiyapi šni čha, leháŋ otȟúŋwahe ektá thiníčapi na ločhíŋpi na wóčhiŋ ománipi naíŋš tuktéktel thiáglagla ištíŋmapi k’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2709;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2709> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays some of the generations have higher educations, but some of the Lakota who don’t go to school aren’t helped, so now in the city they’re homeless and hungry and they walk around begging or sometimes they sleep between houses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2709;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2710> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na osní háŋtaŋhaŋš, čhaŋkú naíŋš wakpála ektá aglágla hená héčhiya ištíŋmapi na hená héčhiya thípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2710;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2710> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if it’s cold, they sleep there along the river or the road and they live there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2710;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2711> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš héčhi čheyáktȟuŋpi oȟláthe čhethípi na hená okȟál’ič’iya yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2711;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2711> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or they make a fire there under the bridge and they sit warming themselves up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2711;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2712> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lená é čha Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ iwíčhauŋkičupi na ečhél owótȟaŋla asníwičhauŋyaŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, akhé hená wówaši ečhúŋpi naíŋš oíč’iye-wačhíŋpi kte na thiyúhapi kte naíŋš thiwáhe yaŋkápi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2712;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2712> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So these are the Lakota that, if we get them that until we cure them, they’ll work again or they’ll try to help themselves and they’ll have houses or will have households."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2712;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2713> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš lená waŋná waníčiŋ na, tȟačhíŋčapi kiŋ hená iyúha wašíču ičháȟwičhayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2713;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2713> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But now there aren’t any of those things, and white people raise all of those kids of theirs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2713;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s tough."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2715> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ leháŋ pȟežúta wičháša na waphíya wičháša lená waníčapi na, wakȟáŋ wičháša lená henála áyapi čhaŋkhé, tuwá wačhíŋuŋyaŋpi kta waŋ waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2715;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2715> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also nowadays there aren’t medicine men, and there’s getting to be no holy men left, and so there’s nobody for us to depend on."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2715;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówačhiŋye wičháuŋkilapi kiŋ lená húŋȟ itéšniyaŋ héčhapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of them that we ask for help aren’t really that kind of person."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itéšniyaŋ wóčhekiye él nážiŋpi šni tkȟá lená waínapiškaŋye héčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They don’t really sit in prayer but instead they’re the kind of person who plays around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čhaŋkhé tuktél uŋhíyayapi kta tȟaŋíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s not clear where they’re passing by."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha uŋkíyečhiŋka uŋkíyayapi na, wóčhekiye uŋkéyapi na, oyáte kiŋ lená ób naúŋžiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we leave on our own, and we say prayers, and we stand by the people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hógna ečéla, kawítaya uŋkhínažiŋpi kiŋ, uŋwáš’akapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Only that way, us going up and sitting together, we will be stronger."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na táku ablézapi kte na héčhel úŋšikičhilapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they would be aware of something and in that way we would feel for each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš ablézapi háŋtaŋhaŋ, wašíču wičhóuŋ kiŋ lé ogná taŋyáŋ úŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or if they were aware of it, they would live well according to white people’s ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel táku eháŋni tȟuŋkášilawičhauŋyaŋpi naíŋš uŋčíwičhauŋyaŋpi táku uŋkókiyakapi héči hená leháŋ hená é čha úŋkiksuyapi, na uŋ lečhála ičháǧe kiŋ wówičhauŋkiyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way nowadays we remember what it was that our grandfathers and grandmothers told us long ago, and for that reason we tell things to those growing up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha leháŋ wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ líla óta ipáyeȟ iyáyapi na, mázawakȟáŋ khičháŋyaŋpi na, lečhálaš Lakȟóta hokšíla waŋ Lakȟóta hokšíla waŋ kat’á iyéye čhaŋkhé, átaya wóčhaŋtešiče héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nowadays many of the kids go wrong, and abuse guns, and lately a Lakota boy just killed a Lakota boy, and so this is really a source of sorrow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lé itȟáŋnuŋgya čhaŋtéšičapi na lená héčhel wičhóuŋ šni čhaŋkhé toháŋ okíhilaka húŋkupi kiŋ kakížapi, na atkúkupi kiŋ nakúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they’re sad on both sides and that didn’t used to be the way of life and so their mothers suffer as much as can be, and the fathers too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaščhiŋ takómni wašíču wičhóuŋ na lená héčhel uŋspépi čha theȟíke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But of course it’s white people’s way of life and they learned these things like that so it’s rough."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó tȟokátakiya waníyetu eháke tóna kaphíyehaŋ zaníyaŋ waúŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, lená oyáte kiŋ ób tȟokátakiya mawáni kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if I’m healthy for several years eventually for a long time, I’ll live with those people in the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Miyé héčhel mitȟáwačhiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s my thought on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čhaŋkhé lená eháŋni atéwaye kiŋ lená wíwahokuŋmakhiyapi na lekšíwičhawaye kiŋ hená na tȟuŋwíŋwičhawaye kiŋ hená waŋná henálapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then a long time ago my father would give me some good advice about things and my uncles and aunts would be gone by now."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá waŋná waŋžíla bluhá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But still now I have one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟuŋwíŋwaye kiŋ waŋžíla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My one aunt."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čhaŋkhé iyé kayéš kakíža čhaŋkhé wóčhekiye hé š’agyáhaŋ líla gluhá nawážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so even she suffers and so I stand strongly with a prayer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hógna oyáte kiŋ akísnipi na, taŋyáŋ iyáyapi na, waš’ákapi kta úŋ lená héčhamuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way I do that so that the people get better, and get alright, and be strong."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel iyé thitákuyepi hená ówičhakiyapi kta čha hé uŋ léčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s in that way that they themselves will help their relatives."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhuŋ-s’e waéčhamuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I do those things for that very reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó leháŋ oyáte kiŋháŋ miyé étkiya wówačhiŋye makílapi naíŋš, wóčhekiye na wóasniye kiŋ lená makílapi čhaŋkhé, othéȟika tkȟá pȟežúta wičháša úŋ čha hé ečéla wačhíŋwaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays the people ask me to be a dependable person, or they ask me for prayers and healing, and so it’s rough but there’s just one medicine man that I depend on."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋšna ektá mas’ámičipȟapi čháŋšna, tókhel waéčhuŋk’uŋ kte lená uŋkókiyakapi háŋtaŋhaŋš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever people call him on my behalf, he tells us how we should do things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé ogná ečéla oyáte kiŋháŋ wóčhekiye uŋ asníwičhauŋyaŋpi naíŋš ówičhauŋkiyapi na, hená oyáte kiŋháŋ Sičháŋǧu naíŋš Oglála oyáte ečélapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Only in that way do we make the people well with prayer or help them, and those people aren't just Sičháŋǧu or Oglála people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená áta oyáte makȟásitomniya úŋpi kiŋ, lená áta ówičhauŋkiyapi kta uŋ hená héčhuŋk’uŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These are people all over the globe, we help them by doing those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš ská oyáte naíŋš hasápa oyáte naíŋš hazí oyáte kiŋ lená iyúha ówičhauŋkiyapi kta čha uŋ léčhel uŋhínažiŋpi na, hógna uŋkíč’ičhuŋzapi čhaŋkhé, othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We’ll help white people or Black people or Asian people and so we stand like that, and we promise that to ourselves, and so it's tough."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókheškhe waníyetu óta uŋyáŋpi na, toháŋ waŋná uŋkókihipi šni háŋtaŋhaŋš, tuwá lená áyiŋ kte kiŋ lená waníčapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We've been going along for many years somehow, and when we can't, there will be none to go on."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it's difficult."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó éyaš lé aŋpétu kiŋháŋ lená wówačhiŋye na wóokhiye wičháuŋkilapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But today we ask them for assistence and help."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó ečhéȟčiŋš wíŋyaŋ waŋ wičhókhuže šíča yuhá na, akísni čhíŋ na, ní čhíŋ na, wašíču wakȟáŋ kiŋ wí yámnila k’úpi hó éyaš, waŋná wí šakówiŋ ní."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So a woman had a bad sickness just like that, and she wanted to get better, and she wanted to live, and the doctors gave her just three months, but now she's lived for seven months."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná waŋbláke šni tkȟá hohú ečhéča kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I haven't seen her now but they say she's just bones."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé waŋná letáŋ híŋhaŋni akȟótaŋhaŋ khigníŋ kta čha hó ičínuŋpani hé waŋúŋyaŋkapi kte šni škȟá iníhaŋšni uŋkíksuyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So now, nowadays, we’ll never see her again because the day after tomorrow she’ll pass away, but nevertheless we’ll remember her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héhaŋ lená tȟathítakuye na čhiŋčá lená wókakiže él ikȟóyakapi lená ablézapi šni čha hó tkȟá, hená íȟaŋhaŋ kéčhiŋpi éyaš, lená toháŋ úŋyaŋ uŋkíyayapi čháŋšna, othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So her relatives and children didn't realize that they are caught in suffering, but they thought it was temporary, but whenever they leave us, it's hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟaŋkake kiŋ úŋyaŋ uŋkíyayapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héhaŋ othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If elders leave us, then it's hard at that moment."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuktél uŋhíyayapi kta waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We don't have a place to go to."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó wašíču wičhóuŋ kiŋ lé toháŋ okíhilaka othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The white man's way of living is as tough as can be."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2751> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha blihéuŋkič’iyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2751;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2751> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we will do our best."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2751;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2752> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na óuŋkičhiyapi kta waŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2752;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2752> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And we have to help each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2752;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lé aŋpétu kiŋháŋ lé wanáǧoyapi kiŋ lé táku lená oyákapi naíŋš, uŋgnáš wówapi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So today they tell some things, the tape recorder, or maybe they write things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé hená uŋkíčhiŋčapi na uŋkítȟakožakpakupi kiŋ hená yawápi háŋtaŋhaŋš, uŋgná hetáŋ táku slolyápi kta uŋ lená héčhamuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If our children and grandchildren read them, maybe I’ll do things in having them know something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha tuktógna k’éyaš mitȟá-oiye oyáte kiŋ namáȟ’uŋ wačhíŋ na uŋ lená léčhel wakáǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so whichever way I want the people to hear my words and in that way I do these things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokátakiya wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ lená wašíču étkiya waúŋspepi na Lakȟól’iya nakúŋ waúŋspepi háŋtaŋhaŋš, iyé táku eháŋni uŋspéuŋkhiyapi hó hená íŋš eyá leháŋ wayúphikapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héčhel núni šni yé ksabyáhaŋ tȟokátakiya mánipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If the children in the future learn English and Lakota too, if we teach old things and if they're skilled in them, that way losing nothing they’ll wisely go into the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋ iyótaŋš wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ kȟó waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays especially there's no leader."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuwéni oíye naȟ’úŋpi kta waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So there is nobody whose words they hear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it's tough."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó leháŋyela waépȟiŋ kte naháŋ táku tȟókeča waŋží oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that's all I have to say and I’ll talk about something different."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni matȟéča na wimáčhiŋčala wahéhaŋtu čha letáŋ oblákiŋ kte naháŋ leháŋl waŋná wimánuȟčala."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2766;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2766> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ll start to tell you about long ago from when I was young and around when I was a little girl and now I’m an old woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2766;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heháŋl owáglakiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2767;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2767> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’ll tell about back then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2767;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2768> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wimáčhiŋčala waŋ héhaŋ, Oglála na Grass Creek ektá iyúha uŋthípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2768;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2768> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When I was a little girl, we all lived in Oglála and Grass Creek."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2768;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2769> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ hél owáyawa naháŋ, Number 5 Day School eyápi čha, tókhiya waníyetu mašágloǧaŋ naíŋš manápčiŋyaŋka wahéhaŋ, wabláwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2769;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2769> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And there was a school there, it was called Number 5 Day School, so around when I was eight or nine years old, I studied there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2769;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2770> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hél uŋkíčhaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2770;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2770> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And we grew up there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2770;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makȟásáŋ oyáte kiŋ hél uŋthípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2771;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2771> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We lived there in Whiteclay."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2771;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hetáŋ hél wabláwa naháŋ hó atéwaye kiŋ t’á čha, ináwaye kiŋ é na thiblówaye kiŋ é čha héčhegla hél uŋthípi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2772;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2772> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I studied since then and well my father died, so because of that my mom and brother immediately lived there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2772;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hél tókhi uŋkíčhaǧapi kiŋ hél owáuŋyawapi naháŋ ho hetáŋ tókhi ma-nineteen naíŋš twenty wahéhaŋ, hé Pine Ridge Boarding School é čha akhé hél wabláwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2773;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2773> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we grew up there when we were studying and at that point I was maybe nineteen or twenty, again it was Pine Ridge Boarding School that I studied at."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2773;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hél enáwakiyiŋ na ho, hetáŋ héčhena Oglála él uŋthípi na, hetáŋ wičháša waŋ átawayiŋ na, hé kičhí waúŋ na, hetáŋ miyé family mitȟáwa kiŋ start na, ho leháŋl wakȟáŋyeža óta wičhábluha na, iyúha ičháǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2774;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2774> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I quit doing that there, and so from then we still live in Oglála, and from then I met a man, and I lived with him, and from then I started my family, and so now I have a lot of kids, and they all grew up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2774;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta tókhiškhiya California na íŋš-eyá húŋȟ Pine Ridge héčhikčhiya hená naháŋȟči ní úŋpi čha, miyé ho hé thiwáhe tȟáŋka bluhá čha ho leháŋl waŋná léčhiya akhé wakȟáŋyeža ičháǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2775;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2775> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they still live all around in California and some in Pine Ridge there abouts so me, I have a big family so nowadays kids grow up around here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2775;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená iyúha hiŋgnátȟuŋpi na tȟawíčutȟuŋpi čha, iyéčhiŋkala thí glépi čháŋna, leháŋl miyé mišnála thiwáhe waŋ él maŋké naháŋ, iyúha ičháǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2776;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2776> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So all the girls got married and all the boys got married, so I myself live all alone in the household (because) whenever they come back here they live all on their own and they all grew up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2776;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé táku kiŋ léčhel owáglakiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ll tell this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni Oglála él uŋthípi naháŋ šúŋkawakȟáŋ wičháuŋyuhapi na ptebléška nakúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago we lived in Oglala and we had horses and cows, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wimáčhiŋčala k’uŋ héhaŋ, hená mní wičháwak’u."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When I was little, I took them to water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2805> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šúŋk’akaŋmaŋkiŋ našná, kaȟáb iyéya áwičhamniŋ našná, mniyátkaŋpi na, héčhel akhé héktakiya šna pasture ektá thimá khigléwičhawaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2805;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2805> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I rode them, and usually I drove them there, and usually they drank water, and usually I brought them back home to pasture."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2805;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2806> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na héčhel akhé ptaŋyétu ikhíyela čháŋna, akhé hél pȟeží naŋkséyapi iyéhaŋtu čháŋna, šna thiblówaye kiŋ hé kičhí ówakiye našná, pȟeží naŋkséuŋyaŋpi naháŋ, uŋyúhiŋtapi na, pȟeží pahá óta éuŋglepi na, hé ptebléška kiŋ hená waníyetu ópta yútapi s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2806;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2806> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And that way whenever it was near fall, whenever it was around that time they cut the grass, I helped my brother, and usually we cut grass, and we raked it, and we set up hay bails, and throughout the winter the cows would eat that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2806;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2807> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel šna héčhuŋk’uŋpi s’a čháŋna, uŋkítȟamakȟapila ektá šna éuŋthipi naháŋ tókhi wí waŋží naíŋš wahéhaŋšna héčhiya maníŋl úŋthipi, na pȟeží naŋkséuŋyaŋpi na, éuŋglepi na, éuŋglepi čha akhé héktakiya šna uŋthípi ektá uŋglápi naháŋ, ho heháŋl akhé wagmíza naíŋš táku čikčík’ala ičháȟ’uŋyaŋpila kiŋ hená nakúŋ akhé uŋyúksapi na, hená iyúha šna pus’úŋyaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2807;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2807> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason whenever we were doing that, we got to your little bit of land and lived there and for something like a month we lived there in the wild and, we cut the grass, and set it up, and set it up so we got back again to where we live, and then we harvested corn or little things that we grew again, and we usually dried it all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2807;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2808> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waštúŋkala uŋkáǧapi naíŋš héčhekčhe šna héčhuŋk’uŋpi na, hená iyúha waníyetu ópta uŋyútapi kta čha hé éuŋkiglepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2808;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2808> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We made dried sweet corn or we usually made stuff like that, and we would eat all that throughout winter so we stored it away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2808;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2809> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héčhel waníyetu theȟíke éyaš héčhel uŋyáŋkapi waníyetu ópta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2809;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2809> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in that way winters were tought but we sat through winter like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2809;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2810> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na akhé wétu čháŋna šna, iŋšé waŋná matȟáŋka čha wawówakiyiŋ na, wičhíŋčala mačík’ala k’uŋ héhaŋ, tákunikel ečhámuŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2810;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2810> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And again whenever it was spring, now I was bigger so I helped, and I didn’t do much of anything, when I was a young girl."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2810;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2811> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená heháŋyela hé wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2811;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2811> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s all I remember."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2811;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó Pine Ridge oyáte kiŋ hél eháŋni owíčhakte waŋ Wounded Knee eyápi čha hé toháŋyaŋ slolwáye kiŋ hé oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2815;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2815> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Pine Ridge people here call an old massacre Wounded Knee so I will speak as much as I know of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2815;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé ináwaye kiŋháŋ hél ópȟa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2816;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2816> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My mother was part of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2816;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2817> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na táku thitákuye nakúŋ hél úŋpi kiŋ húŋȟ wičháktepi naháŋ, húŋȟ iyáyekiyapi na, leháŋl ináwaye kiŋháŋ húŋȟ thitákuye čha hená napȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2817;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2817> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they killed some relatives of mine who were there, and some escaped, and then my mother was among those who fled."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2817;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2818> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ináwaye kiŋ é naháŋ súŋkaku waŋ é čha heháŋl tókhiya ní úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2818;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2818> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was my mom and her young brother that then lived somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2818;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2819> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhegla slolwáye čha očhíčiyakiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2819;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2819> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I told you all that I know."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2819;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni waníyetu tókhi 1979 wahéhaŋ, uŋgnáhelaka ištáǧuŋǧa amáhi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back in about 1979, I suddenly went blind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ištámaǧuŋǧa kiŋ hé tȟéhaŋ šni tkȟá líla othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I hadn’t been for a long time but it was hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tákuni waŋbláke šni yuŋkȟáŋ átaya othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I didn’t see anything and so it was really hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé aŋpétu wakȟáŋ híŋhaŋni čha wačhékiye mníŋ kta waškáŋ-he yuŋkȟáŋ, otȟáŋkaye ektá thimá iblámniŋ na wanúŋwe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So on a Sunday morning I was getting read to go pray, and so I went to the bathroom and I took a bath."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wanúŋwiŋ na, waglínapȟiŋ na, hawéč’uŋ na, héktakiya thimá ibláble yuŋkȟáŋ, hél vacuum cleaner waŋ háŋ čha, hú kiŋ él naíyapehe iyéwayiŋ na makát’e."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I took a bath, and I got out of the tub, and got dressed, and I went back in the room, and so there was a vacuum cleaner standing there, so it suddenly got wrapped around my leg and I fell down hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé iháŋke kiŋ, lé wakȟáŋgli wíkȟaŋ ikȟóyake kiŋ hé é čha, hú él čhamápȟiŋ na makhíyamapȟá čha, hú etáŋ waglúžuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the end of that, the power cord plug, it was that that stabbed into my leg and I hit the ground, so it came out of my leg."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na iyáskab wétȟuŋ na héčhena thiúŋma-takiya, olól’iȟ’aŋ étkiya thimá iblábla yuŋkȟáŋ, tókheškhe uŋgnáhelaka nawášlute šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I put on a bandage andI still went to the other room, the kitchen, and so I didn’t slip all of a sudden."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "K’éyaš mayúŋkahe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But I fell over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha makáčhaŋzekiŋ na, “tókheškhe šikšíča omáyakhuwa éyaš takómni wačhékiye mníŋ kte k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I got angry and I said, “you’re treating me badly but you know that I’m definitely still going to pray.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwé čha hé wówakiyake lakȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I just told whoever it was those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena iyéčhiŋkyaŋka íblutakiŋ na ibláble."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I still got in the car and drove off."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé tókheškhe wakáȟapeka, héčhi, mišnála iblábla čha, čha mníŋ na owáčhekiye tȟáŋka waŋ ektá wačhékiye uŋyáŋpi čha hé Ská Úŋ owáčhekiye čha, hél uŋthípi kiŋ hetáŋ makhíyutȟapi akéšagloǧaŋ ečhétu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So somehow I drove there, because I went all on my own, so I was going and we were going to a big church to pray so it was an Episcopalian church, so it was about 18 miles from where we lived."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé hiyágleya tókheškhe wakáȟape kiŋ wéksuye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I don’t remember however I drove arriving there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átaš hó éyaš héčhi waí na, waŋná owáčhekiye kiŋ él thimá ibláble k’uŋ héhaŋ wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But I got there, and then I remember when I entered the church."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íblutakiŋ na, átaya čhéya wačhéwakiyiŋ na, miglúštaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I sat down, and I prayed while really crying, and I finished."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋškékȟamagle nawážiŋ na, wačhéwakiya yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel miglúštaŋ na, owákaŋyaŋke kiŋ él íblutakiŋ na, wačhékiya wičháša kiŋháŋ wówahokuŋkhiya-haŋ čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was on my knees, and I prayed, and so I finished like that, and I sat in the chair, and because of that the priest was preaching."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ektá anáǧoptaŋ maŋkíŋ naháŋke, ablúta yuŋkȟáŋ, léčheglake s’e nážiŋ na wóglake s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I sat listening, and then I looked at him, and so it was like he was standing close and talking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anáǧoptaŋ maŋká-hiŋ na, waŋná wačhékiyapi iglúštaŋpi čha, áta aglínapȟa čha waglínapȟiŋ na, tȟaŋkál ókšaŋkšaŋ étuŋwaŋ nawážiŋ-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, lé čhaŋkú él lé inážiŋpi čháŋna šna, naíle eyá yukȟé hená é čha naílele."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was sitting listening to him, and then they finished praying, so everyone fully went outside so I went outside, and I stood looking around outside, and so whenever on the road they (cars) stopped, it was those traffic lights that there were that flashed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waŋyáŋg nawážiŋ-hiŋ na, epȟé, “uŋgnáhelaka waŋbláka,” čha wáŋčag héčhel imánihaŋ na, wíyuškiŋ mahíŋgniŋ na naháŋke, wóphila epȟíŋ na, aglágla lé wówapi kiŋ hená waŋbláke yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel ášlayela waŋbláka čhaŋkhé, átaya Tȟuŋkášila wóphila ewákiyiŋ na, átaya líla wíbluškiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I was standing and looking there, and I said, “all of the sudden I can see,” so I was instantly shocked, and I got happy, and then I said thanks, and I saw those signs along it, and so I saw clearly like that, and so I gave thanks to God, and I was so very happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na héčhena waglíyaču na, iŋšé eháŋni itȟókamna ištámaza kitȟúŋ waúŋ tkȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I went home immediately, and long ago before that I used to wear glasses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na líla ištá imákakiže yuŋkȟáŋ héhaŋ wahínažiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And my eyes hurt me a lot and so I’ve made progress since those days."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héhaŋ thiyáta waglí naháŋke owáglakiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then I went home and I told about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókȟašniyaŋ waŋblákiŋ na líla iŋšé wóiyuškiŋ omážula."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I see with no problem and I’m just full of happiness."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha héčhena amákisni na, hetáŋ lehíŋyagleya ištámaza čhóla waúŋ na éyaš, hé tuktéhaŋ lé wé waŋkál iyáyapi kiŋ hemáčheča čha, ištá kiŋ lazáta wéyotȟa waŋ ímayotaka čha ištá masáŋnila."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’m still getting better, and from then up to now I don’t need glasses, but sometimes I’m in a way that I have high blood pressure, so bloodclots sit behind my eyes so one of my eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iníhaŋšni héčhiyataŋhaŋ kȟó eyášna uŋ taŋyáŋ waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But not worrying on account of that I often see well using it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leháŋ ȟtálehaŋ ištá wašíču wakȟáŋ waŋ waŋyáŋg waí yuŋkȟáŋ, átayaš ištá tomákheča ečhíyataŋhaŋ, átayaš ištámaza múŋ owákihi šni kiŋ tókȟa šni kéye čha, wabláwa háŋtaŋhaŋš, lé ištámaza ikčéka hé é čha uŋ-máši čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so recently yesterday I arrived there to see an eye doctor, and so in regards to something being wrong with my eyes, if I can read, he said it’s said that there’s no problem with me not being able to wear glasses at all, then he told me that it was these reading glasses that I should wear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla iblúškiŋ čha éyaš, hé lé Hásapa wíŋyaŋ kiŋ wówaši ečhúŋ čha, hé é čha wičámala šni hé ištámaza čhóla waníyetu wikčémna waúŋ čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was really happy, but it was this Black woman that was working that didn’t believe me, me having lived ten years without glasses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ imáyutȟe éyaš, tókȟašniyaŋ wabláwa, táku makípazo, na blawá na awábleze čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she tested me, but I read without any trouble, what she showed me, and I read it and I knew it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla iyúš’iŋyaŋ na, ištá saŋní mašíče ečhíyataŋhaŋ uŋ, wayáwa-maši éyaščhiŋ waŋbláke šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was very surprised, and in regards to the use of one of my eyes being bad, she had me read things but of course I didn’t see it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé skayéla nážiŋ čha waŋbláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I saw that she stood there in white."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha owákiyakiŋ na táku waŋ ská mak’ú čha iwáču."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I told her that and she gave me something white so I took it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋke owákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then I told her it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé é čha, “tókheškhe ečhíyataŋhaŋ haŋhépi waŋláka he?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was like, “how do you see at night like that?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oíyokpaze ektá waŋláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You see in the dark."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2881> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená wóinihaŋ héčha k’uŋ,” eyá omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2881;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2881> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s amazing,” she told me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2881;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha ištámaza sápa múŋ kiŋ imáyuŋǧapi čha, “hiyá, eháŋni múŋ tkȟá éyaš tóhaŋni heháŋyaŋ múŋ šni.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they asked me about me wearing glasses so I said, “no, I used to wear them a while ago but I’ve never worn them since then.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha pȟežúta ištá omíčiyuš’epi na, ištá waŋmíčiyaŋkapi éyaš, átaš ištá kiŋ tomákheča šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they dropped medicine into my eyes, and they examined me, but there was really nothing wrong with my eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waŋná oglínaŋpȟe él ištámaza sápa uŋmákhiyapi čha, áta yutȟáŋtȟaŋ wakú na waglínapȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then at the exit they had me wear black glasses, so I came back feeling all around and I came out of there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha aímaȟat’a-haŋpi éyaščhiŋ ištámaza čhóla léhaŋ waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they were laughing at me but of course now I don’t wear glasses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená wakȟáŋyaŋ tókheča čha uŋ wakȟáŋyaŋ mawáni, ištá masánila éyaš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those were miraculous so for that reason I walk in a spiritual way, but only one eye."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená é čha iŋšé owáglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those were what I just wanted to tell you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2904> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "2.6 – A Sweatlodge Ceremony"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2904;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2904> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Neva Standing Bear"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2904;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wóphila iníkaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so we held a thankful sweatlodge ceremony."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hé tȟakóža waŋ haŋbléčheya čha, hé waŋná iglúštaŋ kta čha wóphila káǧiŋ na, hé aŋpétu kiŋ iníuŋkaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So a grandchild went on vision quest, so then he gave thanks because he finished it, and that day we held the sweatlodge ceremony."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé tȟakóža Wallace Black Elk é naháŋ tȟakóža Lydia Black Elk na isáŋm tȟakóža Bernard Ice lená ób oínikaǧe waŋ uŋyúhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This grandchild was Wallace Black Elk and we held the sweatlodge ceremony with my grandchild Lydia Black Elk and also my grandchild Bernard Ice."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋyúhapi yuŋkȟáŋ hél thimá wóčhekiye uŋkáǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We held it and so we made prayers inside there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla wičhótapi thimá, óhiye núŋm átaya thimá yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was really a lot of people inside, two whole rows of people sat inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hé thimá hená iyúha wačhékiyapi čha, él maglíhuŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they were all praying inside, so it got to my turn."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha wówaglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I spoke."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówaglakiŋ na, tókhel táku uŋ imákakiža héči hená é čha iwówaglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I spoke, and I spoke about how, what it is that I suffer from."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na oyáte kiŋ tȟáŋtaŋhaŋpi uŋ makákiža čha hé é naháŋ hokšíla waŋ kahíŋȟpemaya čha, waníyetu waŋží uŋ imákakiža čha, hená uŋ hél yuŋkȟáŋ wanáǧi eyá hípi, hená wičháša ewíčhakiyapi, wičháša eyá čhažéwičhayatapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I suffer on behalf of the people so that was that and a boy ran me over, so I’d been suffering of it for a year, so on account of those things there and so some spirits came, those were called wičháša, they’re named wičháša."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hípi na mígnapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they came and comforted me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mígnapi na pȟaȟté wíyaka waŋ uŋ émakaȟtaka čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They comforted me and because of that he touched my forehead with a feather."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ pȟaȟté él émakaȟtake, hé é, naháŋ wagmúha waŋ uŋ kaȟláȟla pȟaȟté él émakaȟtake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He touched my forehead with it, it was that, and he touched my head with a rattle that he was shaking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ mitȟákoža kiŋ lé omákiyakiŋ naháŋ wačhékhiyapi kiŋ ičhúŋhaŋ, hená tȟóéyaš wóyakiŋ kta čha tȟóéyaš ékignag-wičháši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so my grandson told me this and while they prayed, he had them hold off on it so that he would speak."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ hená wanáǧi kiŋháŋ hé wičháša kiŋ hená úŋšimalapi naháŋ míkčatapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so those spirits, those wičháša, had compassion for me and it is said they scolded me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku uŋ wóčhekiye wakáǧiŋ naíŋš, táku uŋ lená waéčhamuŋ éyaš, éyaš takómni makákiža čha hená iwóglag-mašípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There is a reason why I say prayers, or why I do those things, but certainly I was suffering so they had me talk about those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel ómakiyapi kta kéyapi, wičáwakȟa eháŋtaŋhaŋš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said that I would speak about that, if I was telling the truth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2921> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hená iwówaglakiŋ na, hokšíla waŋ waníyetu šaglóǧaŋ čha Uŋčíyapi Tȟamákȟa etáŋ hí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2921;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2921> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I talked about those things, and an eight year old boy who came from Britain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2921;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ hé oníya šíča čha hé uŋ húŋku kiŋ ektá amáhi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he has asthma and for that reason his mother brought him to me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé thiyáta South Dakota ektá aglápi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were going to bring him home to South Dakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš lél ahípi na waŋmáyaŋkiŋ kta škȟá čha ahípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they came here with him and he was supposed to see me so they came with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ hé wačhéwečičhiyiŋ na lé oníya šíče kiŋ lé akísni kta képȟiŋ na, pȟežúta waŋ azílwaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I prayed for that boy and it’s said that he got better from his athsma, and I smudged medicine."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ tókȟašniyaŋ niyá kéyiŋ naháŋke, omákiyakiŋ na, humášte kiŋ hé asnímayiŋ kta kéye naíŋš, makhúže kiŋ hé amákisni kta čha uŋ hé čhaŋkpé kiŋ él oȟláthe émapatȟaŋ kta kéyiŋ na, wačhémičičhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s said that he breathed without any trouble, and then he told me that, and it was said that my leg would hea,l or I’d get better from my sickness so for that reason he said that he would touch under my knee, and he prayed over me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ átaya napé kiŋháŋ toháŋ okíhilaka kȟáte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his hand was as hot as can be."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš sí kiŋ áta kȟó makȟáta yuŋkȟáŋ kaóȟlaya imáyaye s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or my foot was also really hot and so my foot became relaxed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla matáŋyaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I felt perfectly fine."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hená é čha iwówaglakiŋ na hená kȟoškálaka, hokšíla kiŋ lé uŋ wačhéwečičhiyiŋ kta képȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was those things that I spoke to him about and those young men, I said that I would pray for the boy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó na oyáte kiŋháŋ líla uŋ iwímakakiže."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I suffer for the people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé owáglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I said those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋ mičhúŋkši kiŋ hé wówaši ečhúŋ ábla čháŋna šna, Lakȟóta kiŋ áta otȟúŋwahe aglágla wayátkaŋ nážiŋpi naíŋš ištíŋmapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever I bring my daughter to work, all the Lakota people on the outside of the town are standing drinking or sleeping."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuktéktel él éič’iktuŋwaŋpi šni čha, hená ičháŋtemašiča képȟiŋ na, tókhel ečhámuŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, na héktakiya taŋyáŋ wačhíŋksapapi na, mnišíča kiŋ hé ayúštaŋpi na, Tȟuŋkášila étkiya waŋkátakiya étuŋwaŋpi naháŋ, lená taŋyáŋ mánipi kta képȟiŋ na, héčhel čhaŋkú waŋ lúta čha ogná čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ hé yuhá mánipi kta iwówaglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sometimesthey don’t care for themselves, so I say that I feel bad about those things, and whatever could I do, and back then they came to, and they stopped with the alcohol, and they looked up towards God, and I said that they walked well, and I talked about them walking with a pipe along the red road."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hená taŋyáŋ waépȟa škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said that I said good things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wóčhekiye wakáǧiŋ na eháŋni waphíya wičháša waŋ hékta waníyetu wikčémna kiníča k’uŋ héhaŋ uŋspémakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I did some prayers and a long time ago, almost ten years ago a medicine man taught me something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená táku kiŋháŋ uŋ Lakȟóta kiŋ nípi naháŋ uŋ zanípi kta kiŋ hená omákiyakiŋ na mahíyohipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He told me and came for me using those things Lakota people will live and be healthy by."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wanáǧi eyá ób mahíyohipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He came for me with the spirits."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hená kiksúya nawážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, héktakiya waníyetu núŋpa yuŋkȟáŋ héhaŋ wičhíŋčala waŋ haŋbléčheya yíŋ kta čha thiyáta awákhi yuŋkȟáŋ, haŋíyačhiŋkešni wičháša kiŋ lé waŋná makȟá mahél ȟpáye k’éyaš, héčhiyataŋhaŋ lowáŋ na olówaŋ waŋ mak’ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I stood remembering those things, and so two years afterwards I took a little girl back to her home so that she would go on visionquest, and so in the middle of the night this man laid in the earth, but still he sang from there and he gave me a song."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé awáhiyaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I sang that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé awáhiyayiŋ na, miglúštaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, lé wanáǧi kiŋ lená omákiyakapi na, táku epȟá héči hená wówičakȟe na, hená úŋšiya Tȟuŋkášila hóyewakhiya čha, namíčiȟ’uŋpi naháŋ, letáŋ tȟokátakiya owíyuškiŋyaŋ zaníya mawáni kta kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I sang that, and I finished, and so those spirits told me something, and what I’m saying is the truth, and I spoke humbly to God, so they heard me for him, and they say that I’ll walk happily and healthily from now on."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ iyéčhel amáye čha toháŋ okíhilaka ičháŋtemawašte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I’m getting to be like that so I’m as happy as I can be."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó na tákuni ítokȟa šni-mašípi héčhel tókša iyé lená khičháŋyaŋpi na, tókša iyéčhiŋka lená oyáte kiŋháŋ mnišíča kiŋ hé ayúštaŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they told me to not worry about anything because they will surely take care of those things, and surely the people will stop drinking alcohol of their own accord."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka étkiya kiksúyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they will remember God."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ lé yuhá čhaŋkú waŋ lúta čha ogná mánipi kta kéyiŋ na, hená Lakȟóta kiŋ išnálapi kte šni tkȟá, Hásapa oyáte na wičháša lúta na wičháša zí oyáte kiŋ na ská oyáte kiŋ čhaŋkú waŋ wašté ogná mániwičhawakhiya wačhíŋ k’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they said that they will walk along the red road with this pipe, and those Lakota people won’t be all alone, but I want them to make Black people and Native people and Asian people and white people go along the good path."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé ogná mánipi kta tákeyapi omákiyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What they told me is that they will walk along that one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha tákuni ičháŋtešiče šni-mašípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they asked me to not be sad about anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hetáŋ líla wóphila eyá waglínapȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I came out of there with many thanks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó tókȟašniyaŋ waglínapȟiŋ na, sagyé čhóla mawáni, na lé aŋpétu kiŋháŋ líla matáŋyaŋ čha, mitȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋháŋ zaní čha waŋná wašíču wakȟáŋ waŋ ektá waí yuŋkȟáŋ, tȟaŋmáhel wičhókhuže tákuni imákȟoyake šni na, wé mitȟáwa kiŋ wašté na mičháŋte kiŋ wašté naháŋ ažúŋtka kiŋ mawášte naháŋ, thezí naháŋ phí naháŋ čhaǧú kiŋ lená iyúha tomákȟa šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I came out without any trouble, and I walked without a cane, and I was feeling very good that day, so my body was healthy so then I arrived at a doctor’s, and so there was no sickness holding onto my body, and my blood was good and my heard was good, and my kidnies were good and there were no problems with all my liver and lungs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha líla ičháŋtemawašte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I was really happy about all that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó tkȟá lé čhaŋháŋpi khúžapi kiŋ lé é čha naháŋ wé kiŋ waŋkál imáyaye watóhaŋšna éyaš, hená tókša ehákela hená khičháŋyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But it’s diabities that sometimes brings my blood pressure up, but he will surely eventually take care of that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha héčhegla éyaš líla čhaŋté imáwašte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that’s all but I’m very happy about that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hená uŋ tȟokáta wóphila waŋží wakáǧiŋ kte naíŋš lená kte šni tkȟá tȟokátakiya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I’ll give many thanks in the future for those things or those will be it but in the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená táku kiŋháŋ ómawakȟaŋkȟaŋ šni tkȟá lená líla wóphila tȟáŋka epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’m not telling any lies but I’m saying many thanks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hékta blokéhaŋ wiwáŋyaŋg wačhípi uŋkhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Last summer we got back to Sundance."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waphíya wičháša waŋ eyášna léčhiya šna hóčhoka wéčičaǧa-he yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhel thí ektá olé uŋkhípi yuŋkȟáŋ, Oglála ȟče héčhiya waŋkáta tuktél wiwáŋyaŋg wačhípi waȟpé wókheya waŋ káǧa čha, maníŋn úŋ škhe čha ektá olé uŋkípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I usually went making an alter for a medicine man around there, and so for that reason we got back there looking for him, and so somewhere up there around Oglala he made a sundance arena so, it was said that it was out in the wild so arrived there to look for him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ apȟé uŋyáŋka-haŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, glí naháŋke, hé “wáŋ, líla taŋyáŋ yahípe ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was sitting there waiting for us, and so we arrived, and then he said, “well, glad to have you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tȟéhaŋ léčhiya waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He told me, “I’ve been around here for a while."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itȟó éyaš wówaši ečhámuŋ čha hé uŋ léčhiya waúŋ-he” eyá omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ve just been working so I’ve been around here for a while.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóuŋkiyaka-haŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We talked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋke, “líla taŋyáŋ waŋčhíyaŋkapi k’uŋ, tóhaŋni waŋčhíyaŋke šni yuŋkȟáŋ lé otȟókaheya waŋčhíyaŋke k’uŋ” eyíŋ na, “táku tókȟa,” kéyiŋ na omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then he said, “Meeting you is very nice, I’ve never seen you and so this is the first time that I’m seeing you,” and so he told me, “something’s the matter.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hená léčhiya húŋȟ waphíyapi kéič’iyapi na, wakȟáŋ wičhášapi kéyapi na k’éyaš, hená iyéčhetu šni škȟá heyápi kéye,” omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Some of the people here say that they can cure people, and they say that they’re medicine men, but they’re not those things, despite the fact that it’s said that they say that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená wóglag yaŋká-hiŋ na hé “wáŋ, lél watóhaŋ šna šuŋgmáyetu tȟáŋka waŋ eyášna híyutakiŋ našná, ahítuŋwaŋ yaŋká-he k’uŋ” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He sat talking about those thigns and he said, “yeah, sometimes a wolf comes and sits down here, and so he looks towards here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Akhé tókȟaȟ’aŋ našná, akhé tuktél ipáyeȟ híyutakiŋ našná, yaŋká-he” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“He disappeared again, and often he sat down somewhere different, and often he sat,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókhi hé lél itówapinaškaŋškaŋyaŋpi waŋ káǧapi kiŋ hél Kevin Costner ečíyapi waŋ hél škáta čha hé tókhi olé hí-haŋ načhéče” epȟá čha, toháŋ okíhilaka iȟát’iŋ na, “hóȟ” eyíŋ naháŋke, “lé itéšniyaŋ wówaglaka škȟá,” eyíŋ na, iȟát’e."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“They made that movie that Kevin Costner played in so maybe it was coming looking for him,” I said, so he laughed as hard as he could and he said, “oh gosh no,” and then “I was talking seriously, even though [you weren’t]” he said and laughed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Naíŋš uŋgná héčhuŋ-s’e čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“For that reason maybe it was just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáš hé olé ahí-he séče k’uŋ,” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “I’m sure that maybe he came looking for him.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Takómni héčhuŋ kštó, úŋyaŋ khiglá čha,” epȟé yuŋkȟáŋ iȟát’a-hiŋ naháŋ kéye, “waŋ éna yaŋká po, waúŋyutapi kte,” čha éna uŋyáŋka-haŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ hé, “iníuŋkaǧapi kta čha niyé kȟó iníuŋkaǧapi kte ló,” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “maybe he did that, that’s why he left without him,” and so he was laughing and said, “well, wait right here, we’ll have something to eat,” so we sat there and so he said, “We’re going to have a sweat so you all should have a sweat, too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Oháŋ, éyaš tákuni gluhá wahí šni k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Okay, but I didn’t bring anything to wear [for it],” I said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičhíŋčala waŋ kičhí waí kiŋ hé é čha, “etáŋ bluhá čha tókša očhíč’u kte k’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was the young woman who I came with that said, “I have some so I’ll definitely lend them to you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha toháŋ čha áta maníŋn oíyaye šíča waŋ ektá uŋkípi yuŋkȟáŋ iníokaǧe waŋ héčhi maníŋn hé, pahá akáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was for some distance that we arrived at a difficult place to get through in the wilderness and so out there in the wilderness stood a sweatlodge, on a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha uŋkípi yuŋkȟáŋ, wíŋyaŋ waŋ tókhi pahá akáŋ haŋbléčheya čha, aglípi čha, hé é čha wačhékičičhiye-maši na hé uŋ iníkaǧapi kta kéya čha, ektá uŋkípi na, kičhí iníuŋkaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we arrived there, and so a woman was going on visionquest somewhere on the hill, so they came back with her, so it was him who had me pray and for that reason it was said that they would sweat, so we got there, and we did the ceremony with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhiŋš iyé čha wačhékhiyiŋ kte séče yuŋkȟáŋ, wačhékiye-makhiye čha, wačhéwakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2998;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I just assumed that it would be him that prayed, and so then he asked me to pray, so I prayed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2998;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé wačhéwečičhiyiŋ na, uŋpákhiŋtapi na, uŋglínapȟapi na, héčhiya hukhúta thí ektá uŋkhípi na, waúŋyutapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p2999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I prayed for this woman, and cleansed her, and we got out, and there we returned back to the house downhill, and we ate."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=2999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waúŋyutapi na héčhena uŋglíyačupi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We ate and right away we started back to here (where the story’s being told)."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiyáta Rosebud owákpamni héčhi uŋkhípi na, hé wiwáŋyaŋg wačhípi kte kiŋ škáŋ-haŋpi kiŋ héčhi uŋkhíhuŋnipi ȟtayétu eháŋn éyaš, líla matáŋyaŋ šni éyaš, akhé uŋkhípi k’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We arrived back home at Rosebud reservation, and when we arrived back it was night with them doing lots of work for when they would sundance, but I didn’t feel good, but we got back again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iníkaȟ-uŋšipi čhaŋkhé iníuŋkaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They asked us to do a purification ceremony and so we did it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ iníwičhauŋkičičaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We performed that purification ceremony on behalf of the women."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhekčhekel táku wóiȟaka na íŋš-eyá itéšniyaŋ táku eyášna iwóuŋglakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in that sort of way we had fun and we often talked about things seriously, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó, henákeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, that is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni iyéčhiŋkyaŋke waníča čha héhaŋ hé tókhi 1922 naíŋš 1923 načhéče čha héhaŋ até é čha iyéčhiŋkyaŋkela waŋ, Model T Ford waŋ, yuhá kéye, iyéčhiŋkyaŋke čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3027;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago there used to be no cars so it was around 1922 or 1923, so back then it was said that it was my father who had a little car, a Model T Ford, that’s why it was a car."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3027;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ awókheya kiŋ yuȟpápi čha, eyášna ogná yaŋkíŋ na, iŋšé líla lúzahe šni, hená iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3028;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he removed the top, so he often got in it, and it just went really slow, those cars."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3028;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš ogná yaŋkíŋ na haŋíyačhiŋkešniyaŋ glá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3029;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he got in it and it’s said that he was on his way back home in the middle of the night."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3029;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3030> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋžíŋžiŋtka Owákpamni étkiya očháŋku waŋ eháŋni ȟpáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3030;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3030> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was an old road towards Rosebud."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3030;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3031> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋ íŋš haŋké yuksápi, čhaŋkú kiŋ, na čhaŋkú waŋ lečhála hél éuŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3031;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3031> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays it’s cut off, the road, and recently they laid a road there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3031;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé ogná aíyakapteya glípi čháŋšna iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ tokhéčela íŋyaŋka kéye, aíyakapteya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3032;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So whenever he was headed back uphill on that, it’s said that the car barely ran, up the hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3032;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ até oyákiŋ na, táku waŋ sápa čha iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ isákhib íŋyaŋka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3033;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so my dad said that, and it’s said that it was something black that ran alongside the car."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3033;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ektá étuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, lazátaŋhaŋ íyutaka kéye naháŋke, lé héktataŋhaŋ oyáŋke hé ektá oíȟpeič’iya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3034;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he looked at it, and so it’s said that it sat down in the back, and then it’s said that it threw itself there from the back seat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3034;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha líla tké kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3035;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s why it’s said that it was really heavy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3035;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3036> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta tokhéčela aíyakapteya gníŋ na, waŋná khiyáhiŋ na, hakíkta éyaš, tuwéni šni yuŋkȟáŋ, akhé isákhib híyutaka kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3036;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3036> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was barely coming home up the hill at all, and then he got to the top of the hill, and he looked back, but there was nobody, and so that’s why it’s said that it sat beside him again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3036;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ektá étuŋwe éyaš tuwéni šni kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3037;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He looked at it but that’s why it’s said that there was no one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3037;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokátakiya étuŋwaŋ čháŋšna isákhib yaŋká kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3038;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever he looked forward it’s said that it sat beside him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3038;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha átaya gníŋ na Sápa Úŋ othí étkiya glá kéye, St. Francis-takiya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3039;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he went right back and it’s said that he went right back to the Catholic mission, to St. Francis."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3039;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lowáŋ yaŋká kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said that he sat singing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta lowáŋ yaŋkíŋ na, ȟná hiŋgníŋ na, hakíkta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He sat really singing, and he growled, and it’s said that he looked back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tuwéni šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said that there was nobody."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kap’óžela hiŋglá kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3043;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s why it’s said that the car became really light all of a sudden."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3043;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átaya paŋȟyá khigníŋ na, thiyáta khihúŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He started back home really fast and it’s said that he got back home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ogláka kéye yuŋkȟáŋ, tȟuŋkáŋku kiŋ é čha héya kéye, “wáŋ, hél eyášna wičháša waŋ tuwá išnála glá čháŋšna, khuwá škhé yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said he told about it, and so it’s said that it was his father-in-law who said, “hey, they say that whenever someone’s coming home all alone, a man chases them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Nišnála ománi šni yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Don’t travel alone,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iŋšé íyohakab, waníyetu tónakeča íyohakab, hé ogná tȟuŋwíŋ waŋ oglákiŋ na, iyéčhiŋkyaŋke ogná glápi yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhuŋ-s’e iŋšé akhé wičhísakhib íŋyaŋka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so just afterwards, several years afterwards, an aunt told about it and they were headed back in the car and so it’s said that just like that it just ran beside them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé napȟápi naháŋke čhaŋkú kaípayeȟ iyáyapi yuŋkȟáŋ lé aíyakapteya čhaŋpágmiyaŋpi waŋ hiyáhaŋ čha kahíŋȟpeya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they ran away and then they took the wrong road and so he hit a wagon that stopped uphill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kahíŋȟpeyapi na, čhaŋpágmiyaŋpi ihúpa kiŋháŋ lé kaȟápe kiŋ í opázaŋ na, átaya čhehúpa opážužu kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They hit it, and the wagon’s handle that’s driven with pierced his mouth, and it fully dislocated his jaw."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ šúŋkawakȟáŋ kiŋ lé ožáŋžaŋglepi kiŋ čhokáŋ naȟtákiŋ na, ité ogná naȟtáka čha, áta ité kiŋ inápȟaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And this horse kicked the middle of the windshield, and it kicked her in the face, so it smashed her face all in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha okhúže thípi ektá éwičhauŋpapi yuŋkȟáŋ, owíčhakiyakapi na, eháŋni hél wanáǧi eyá wiwíla wičháša ewíčhakiyapi čha héčheča hená eyášna wičhákhuwapi kéya oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they put them in the hospital, and so they told them that, and there there are some old spirits called spring men that they say that it’s said that they often still chase people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hé atéwaye kiŋ hé wanáǧi waŋ kičhí yaŋkíŋ naíŋš hená wiwíla ewíčhakiyapi kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So my father sat with the spirit or what they call spring spirits."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé otóhaŋn gníŋ na, paháta khinážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, gliyópsičiŋ na, tókhiya iyáye kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he came home for some distance, and he stopped at the top of the hill, and so it jumped off, and it’s said that it went somewhere else."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3075> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl akhé takúŋl Lakȟótiya oblákiŋ kta čha hé uŋ lé wíŋyaŋ kiŋháŋ ečhél yuíyeska kte tȟokáta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3075;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3075> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now I’ll talk about something in Lakota again so for that reason this woman will translate it properly in the future."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3075;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl iŋšé wakȟáŋyeža mitȟáwa kiŋ húŋȟ Sápa Úŋ owáyawa čha él wayáwapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays some of my kids study at the Catholic school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Holy Rosary hél wayáwapi na iyúha wóuŋspe gluštáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They study there at Holy Rosary and they finished all their studies."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé iŋšé oblákiŋ kte na tȟokálaȟčiŋ wayáwapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I’ll talk about that and they’re studying for the very first time"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héhaŋ Manderson ektá uŋthípi čha lé wičhíŋčala kiŋ šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋkiŋ našná hetáŋ wayáwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So back then we lived in Manderson so this girl [her daughter, Helen] rode a horse and usually went to school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wayáwa našná, ȟtayétu čháŋna šna, khí na, akhé híhaŋni čha kiktá na, líla osní na, wašmé čháŋna šna, hél hokšíla waŋží eyášna héktakiya glá čha, hé owáyawa ektá éȟpeye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She studied, and usually whenever it was in the evening, she got home, and again in the morning she woke up, and whenever it was really cold, and there was deep snow, a boy usually was going back there, so he dropped her off at school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná aŋpétu áta wayáwa na, ȟtayétu čha hiyói našná, akhé akhí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then she studied all day, and in the evening he got there to pick her up, and usually he’d come back home with her again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héktakiya uŋthípi ektá akhí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He brought her back to where we lived."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na toháŋl hé owáyawa kiŋ hél iglúštaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then she finished with that school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó hetáŋ čha Holy Rosary ektá akhé wayáwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So from there she studied at Holy Rosary again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋȟ hél wayáwapi, wakȟáŋyeža mitȟáwa kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some studied there, [some of] my kids."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhi záptaŋpi s’eléčheča hél wayáwapi na iyúha wayáwapi iglúštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was something like about five that studied there and they all finished studying there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš hél Sápa Úŋ owáyawa kiŋ hé líla táku óta oglákiŋ kta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But she would tell a lot of things about that Catholic school there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Taŋyáŋ šni šni owíčhakhuwapi éyaš, iníhaŋšni hél waníyetu tóna iyúha úŋpi na, iglúštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They treated them in a not at all well way, but regardless they lived all those several years there, and finished."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3089> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta wótapi naíŋš táku ečhúŋpi kiŋ iyúha líla wówasukiye óta čha, iglúžažapi naíŋš waglúžažapi kiŋ iyúha tȟogyé ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3089;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3089> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They really ate or there were many rules for all that they did, so they all did it differently, washing themselves and washing their clothes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3089;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó iyúha tȟogtȟógye na ipáyeȟ ičháȟwičhauŋyaŋpi naháŋ, wayáwapi kiŋ hél itȟókeča čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we raised them all differently and incorrectly, and that’s why it was different at school."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iníhaŋšni hél waníyetu tóna iyúha úŋpi na iglúštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But regardless they lived there for all those several years and they finished it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé nakúŋ táku eyá hél tókȟa kiŋ lé ogláke kiŋháŋ hé obláke šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I haven’t said some of the things that were wrong there that she [Helen, her daughter] told."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé hená líla hél wóasukiye óta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There were just a lot of rules there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Takúŋl ečhúŋpi šni eháŋtaŋhaŋš, čha áta hú kiŋ él awíčhapȟapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they didn’t do something, so it’s said that they hit them all on the legs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Belt naíŋš táku uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "With a belt or something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha táku kiŋ hél líla wówasukiye suksúta úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So there were a lot of really hard rules there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyaš hetáŋ líla wóuŋspe óta uŋspépi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So but from there they learned a lot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waglúžažapi naíŋš nuŋwáŋpi kiŋ, hená nakúŋ líla wówasukiye óta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in doing their laundry or washing themselves, they had a lot of rules, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mní čónala úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They lived without water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owíčhakaške él úŋpi iyéčhelya hená wičhákhuwapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They treated them like they were in a prison."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená iyúha leháŋl taŋyáŋ iglóayapi naháŋ, waŋná iyé čhiŋčápi kiŋ hená hél wičhágloayapi čhíŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They all are doing well dowadays, and now they don’t want to take their very own children there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha leháŋl tȟokȟáŋkȟaŋlya wóuŋspe yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays they receive an education at other places."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená ipáyeȟ wayáwakičhiyapi naháŋ léčhiya leháŋl iyúha taŋyáŋ úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "[My children] They’re having them study elsewhere and nowadays they all live well there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héhaŋ iŋšé hél owáyawa Holy Rosary él tókhel úŋpi čha oglákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they just talk about how they lived at Holy Rosary back then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé uŋ obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s why I say this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heháŋyaŋ bluštáŋ s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’ve finished up to now."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl Psáloka oyáte kiŋháŋ tókheškhe waéčhuŋpi hená tókhel slolwáye kiŋ oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Today I’ll talk about how I know how Apsaalooke people do things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu núŋpa hó wahéhaŋ šna héčhiya uŋkípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We arrived there every other year."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wótakuye héčhiya wičhábluha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I have relatives there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhiya waí našná, mitákuye hená ób šna tókheškhe thípi naíŋš, tókheškhe tónačhaŋ hé wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I got there, and usually my relatives usually live with them in some way, or they dance with them in some way for a couple days."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená áta oíyokiphiya iyúha ptáyela wičhóthi naháŋ, thióblečha kiŋ hená čónala na, lé thipȟéstola kiŋ hé é líla óta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They all have fun living together, and there aren’t any tents, and it’s tipis that there’s a lot of."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš líla oíyokiphi s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they often have a lot of fun."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó na hél tókhi núŋpa naíŋš yámni čháŋ ečhél šna wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they dance like that for about two or three days there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ na Psáloka oyáte kiŋ hená iyúha tȟogtȟógye iglúzapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3143> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people and Apsaalooke people all dress in different ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3143;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé ečéla wačhípi kiŋ ákhilečheča éyaš táku ečhúŋpi kiŋ héčhel líla oíyokiphi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3144> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Only the dance is alike but it’s said that they have fun doing it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3144;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ihíŋhaŋni čháŋna six o’clock héhaŋni šna áta wičháyuȟičapi našná, éyapaha waŋ áta óhiŋniyaŋ šna táku ečhúŋpi kte kiŋ hená yaótȟaŋiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The following day at six o’clock in the morning they wake them up, and usually a crier always announced what they’ll be doing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó héhaŋ šna waŋná ikpázopi hé yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then at that time they usually have a parade."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla šúŋkawakȟáŋ ótapi čha, hená šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋkapi na, hená iglútȟaŋpi na, šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋkapi kiŋ hená wókȟoyake iyúha kič’úŋpi našná, ikpázopi yuhápi kiŋ hé líla háŋska čha, líla oíyokiphiya wówaŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There are a whole lot of horses, so they ride them, and they dress them up, and the riders put on regalia, and usually that parade is really long, so it’s a really happy sight."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó na hé iglúštaŋpi čháŋna šna, hó heháŋl čhokáta waȟpé wakhéya tȟáŋka waŋ háŋ čha, hél iyúha šna khiwítayapi našná, ho heháŋl hél aŋpétu kiŋ áta šna wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever they complete that, then they all gather there around the big arbor that there is, and usually then they dance all day long."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná akhé ȟtayétu čháŋ owápȟe núŋm ečé iyúha glápi naháŋ, ȟtayétu wótapi na, hó hé iglúštaŋpi čháŋ, héktakiya waȟpé wakhéya héčhiya hetáŋ akhé wačhípi našná éyaš, wačhípi kiŋ hená líla wičhótapi na, líglila oíyokiphi yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now whenever it’s evening they come back for just two hours, and they have dinner, and so whenever they finish they dance back there at the arbor, but usually a whole lot of people dance, and they’re extremely happy doing so."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó líla wówaŋyaŋke tȟáŋka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s really quite the show."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heháŋyaŋ slolwáye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s as much as I know."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhi wičhóthi na léčhi wičhóthi kiŋ ítȟokeča éyaš héčhiya kiŋ hé líla wówaŋyaŋke wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There’s a lot of people there and they’re different from each other but they put on a good show there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha heháŋyela oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s as much as I’ll speak."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni tókhi waníyetu akézaptaŋ wahéhaŋ, héktakiya héhaŋ líla makákiže."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago, maybe around 15 years back, I was hurting a lot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋ ištógmus íblutake háŋtaŋhaŋ, wičhíte waŋblákiŋ naíŋš, táku ipáyeȟ, tȟókeča waŋbláka čháŋšna, uŋgnáš tokhíyotȟaŋ ománi blé háŋtaŋhaŋš, hó na hé étkiya blá wačhíŋ šni khéš ipáyeȟya šna blá čha, lé táku waŋbláke k’uŋ hená eyášna wašíču waŋ kičhí waúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If I ever sat down with my eyes closed, I saw faces, or whenever I saw something wrong, strange, maybe if I went walking somewhere, but whenever I didn’t want to go there, I went to wrong places, so I was often living with a white man when I saw that stuff."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé natá wimátko kéyiŋ na héčhel wašíču wakȟáŋ waŋ waŋyáŋg-maši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said that I went insane and that’s why he told me to see a doctor."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ektá waí na owákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I arrived there and I talked to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha kičhí wómaglakiŋ na, “hé táku kiŋ lená waŋláke kiŋ lená niyé niLákȟota čha, lená táku kiŋ lená itȟókamna slolyáye k’éyaš, núŋ yačhíŋ šni naíŋš ayábleze šni, čha hé uŋ wíničakiže k’uŋ,” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I talked with him and he said, “These things that you see, you’re Lakota, so you knew them beforehand, but you don’t want to use them or notice them, and that’s why you’re suffering.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Slolyáyiŋ na hená ayábleze hátaŋhaŋš, uŋgná ničákižiŋ kte šni k’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “If you know them and you acknowledge them, maybe you won’t suffer.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hepȟé, “hená héčhel waŋbláka-he éyaš, lená é čha héčhel bluhá héčiŋhaŋ, wóilagwaye wačhíŋ šni k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I said, “I’m seeing them that way but, if it is those things that I have in that way, I don’t want to make use of them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tuwéni wímayuŋǧe šni tkȟá, tȟaóuŋ kiŋ waŋblákiŋ na, ‘ečháŋni nit’íŋ kte k’uŋ’ epȟá owákihi šni k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “They don’t ask me, but I see their life, and I can’t say, ‘soon you’re going to die.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “hó héčhel múŋ wačhíŋ šni k’uŋ” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I said, “that’s why I don’t want to use it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha tókša tȟokáta toháŋn iyémičihaŋtu hátaŋhaŋš, uŋgná wóilagwayiŋ kte k’uŋ,” eyá owákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I told him, “so if ever in the future it came my time, maybe I’ll make use of it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé, “niLákȟota na Lakȟóta kiŋ hená iyúha hé ESP yuhápi čha héčheča luhápe ló” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “you’re Lakota and all Lakota people have ESP so you have it like that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha hená uŋ toháŋn waphíyapi naíŋš uŋgnáš takúŋn ečhúŋpi kte háŋtaŋhaŋ, hená eháŋtaŋ slolyápi k’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “So for those reasons when they cure people or maybe they’re planning to do something, they know it from those things.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha níš-eyá hé luháš čha hé é čha wóilagyayiŋ kta škȟá, ečhánuŋ šni, čha hé uŋ ničákiže ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “So you even have it too so you have to make use of what it is, despite you not doing it, and for that reason you suffer.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čha, “éyaš wóilagwaye wačhíŋ šni k’uŋ,” epȟé čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that so I said, “but I don’t want to make use of it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho čha tókša uŋspéčhičhiyiŋ na, takúŋn héčhel iyáhaŋble éyaš, ičínuŋpa waŋlákiŋ kte šni,” eyá čha, “oháŋ, ho čha ičínuŋpani waŋbláke šni.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “So I will teach you at some point, and in that way you’ll dream something, but you won’t see it again,” so [I said], “okay, I’ll never see it again.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leháŋn wičhóuŋ kiŋ lél ičhúŋhaŋ táku óta iblúkčaŋ čha slolwáyiŋ na owákaȟniǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nowadays throughout life I think about things so I know them and understand them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na uŋgnáš tuwá takúŋn iyúkčaŋ ešáš, tókhiya uŋ našná uŋgnáhelaka wičháša kiŋ hé naíŋš wíŋyaŋ kiŋ hé awíblukčaŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená táku iyúkčaŋpi kiŋ slolwáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And maybe for example someone is thinking about something, who is somewhere, and maybe if I’m thinking about that man or that woman, I know what they’re thinking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha otúyačhiŋ hená slolwáye šni iŋšé na tókhi wakȟáŋ héčhiyataŋhaŋ hená héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I don’t know those things just for nothing and maybe those things are spiritual in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha wamákȟaŋ šni éyaš iŋšé hená wóilake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3192;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3192> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’m not sacred but it’s just useful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3192;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3193> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená oyáte kiŋ waówakiyiŋ kta čha hé uŋ lená héčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3193;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3193> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’d be like that so that I would help the people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3193;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3194> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tákuni šíča héčhel wíblukčaŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3194;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3194> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I didn’t think about anything badly like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3194;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Takómni hená wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3195;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3195> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They definitely have to be good [thoughts]."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3195;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha leháŋ enágnakiya wóilagwaye éyaš tákuni tóhuŋweni šil-áwiblukčaŋ owákihi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3196;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3196> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays now and then I make use of it but I can’t ever think badly about anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3196;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhel iŋšé owáglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3197;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3197> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I just talk like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3197;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3198> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋn hená wóilagwaye háŋtaŋhaŋš, iŋšé čha héčhel maŋkíŋ na, tuwá tak-tókȟuŋ kte kiŋ itȟókamna owéčiyaka-haŋ owákihi éyaš, héčhel wóilagwaye wačhíŋ šni čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3198;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3198> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever I make use of those things, so I sit like that, and I can be telling someone what they should do while facing them, but that’s why I don’t want to make use of it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3198;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé ogná iyómakiphi kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3200> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that way I’m happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3200;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé é čha henákeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3201> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3201;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ká Winner, South Dakota ečhíyataŋhaŋ, kȟoškálaka núŋm él inážiŋpi na, wayátkaŋ-haŋpi naháŋke, mní wakȟáŋ owíyopȟe waŋ hél háŋ čha hél khinážiŋpi naháŋke, mnipíǧa opȟétȟuŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Over there on the other side of Winner, South Dakota, two young men stopped there, and they were drinking, and then they stopped back there where there was a liquor store, and then it’s said they bought beer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé oyáte eyá Oak Creek etáŋ čha awáŋyaŋg wičhákhuwapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so some people were from Oak Creek so it’s said that they were watching them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Awáŋyaŋg awíčhakupi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said they watched them coming back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená itómnipi čha, “uŋgná mayá mahél iyáyapi kte ló,” eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were drunk so it’s said they said, “maybe they’ll go into the ditch.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša núŋblalapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because there were just two of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha awáŋyaŋg awíčhakupi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s said that they watched them coming back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iyéčhiŋkyaŋke núŋm wičhíhakab glápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s said that they followed them in two cars."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hél iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ waŋží él lekšíwaye kiŋ yaŋké kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s said that my uncle was in one of the cars there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na itómnipi kiŋ líla nuphíŋ wíyutȟa wóglag yaŋkápi na, glápi, na pahá akáŋ khinážiŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it’s said that both the drunk men were sitting talking, and talking with their hands, and they were on their way back and they stopped on a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké ikhíyela khihúŋnipi na, íŋš-eyá toháŋyaŋ akhínažiŋpi čhaŋké, uŋmá gličú naháŋ, ohómni iyáyiŋ na, uŋmáčhiyataŋhaŋ íyutaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they got near back there and they stopped some distance from back there and so another got out and he went around and it’s said that he sat down on the other side of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha uŋmá tȟogtȟóg kaȟápapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s said that they drove taking turns."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Chaŋké uŋmá kaȟápe šni kiŋ ečhíyataŋhaŋ hé ohómni iyáyiŋ na lé kaȟápe kiŋ héčhiya íyutake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Snd so the other went around to the side where they weren’t driving and sat down there on the driver’s side."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyaš núŋblala yaŋkápi éyaš, líla wóglag yaŋkápi na, lé iyóžaŋžaŋ čhóla glápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But just two of them sat down, but they sat really talking, and it’s said that they went back without headlights."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ iyóžaŋžaŋ waníča čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because the car didn’t have lights."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé uŋ wičhíhakab glápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s why it’s said that they went following them back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ líla wóglag yaŋkápi kéye nuŋphíŋ čhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ glápi na, khiyóȟpayapi yuŋkȟáŋ, waŋná iȟpéyawičhakhiya glápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said that both sat chatting and so they were going back, and went down into a valley, and so then they came home leaving them behind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé itómnipi kiŋ lená é čha hé pahá akáŋn khinážiŋpi kiŋ héhaŋ, hél Lakȟóta wíŋyaŋ waŋ ektá yuhá glápi na hé yuhá khinážiŋpi kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was those drunk people that after they stopped on the hill, they were headed back with a Lakota woman and it’s said that they stopped with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé mnipíǧa yatkáŋpi na lé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ hé k’úpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They drank beer and they gave it to that woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha húŋȟ ičú na yatkáŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she took some and drank."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena čhaŋlí okípaǧipi čha ičú na úŋpa kéye, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They kept offering her a filled pipe so she took it and smoked it, the woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké líla kičhí wóglag yaŋkápi éyaš, iyóžaŋžaŋ čha, héčheš tókȟašniyaŋ glápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they sat talking a lot with her, but there was light, so they were going back without any trouble."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Glápi naháŋke, lé Úta Wakpá kiŋháŋ isáŋm khiglápi na, ká maníŋtakiya čhaŋkú ikčéka waŋ čha ogná glápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were going back, and then they left past Oak Creek, and they were going back along a regular wilderness road."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋn hél thípi waŋ háŋ čha él khinážiŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they arrived back at a house that was there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ léyaš hé thípi šni, čháŋ tȟáŋka čha hél háŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so unfortunately that wasn’t a house, it was a big tree standing there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héhaŋ wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé é čha, “leháŋyela lél waglíyaču kte k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then it was the woman that said, “I’ll get off here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké iyóžaŋžaŋ khinážiŋpi na, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ hiyúič’iyiŋ na, héčhena iyáya čha, tókhetkiya iyáye kiŋ olépi éyaš, tukténi iyáye šni tókȟaȟ’aŋ kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they stopped with the lights on, and the woman got down, and she kept going, so they looked for her in the direction she took, but there was nothing where she left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ižáŋžaŋ waníča čhaŋké, áta yutȟáŋtȟaŋpi na, lé líla itómnipi k’uŋ hená é čha kiblézapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was no lights and so they felt around and those drunk guys got sober."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha čhaŋké héktakiya kawíŋǧapi na, Úta Wakpá opȟáya khinážiŋpi čhaŋké, lekšíwaye kiŋ é čha heyá kéye, “tóškhe iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ iyóžaŋžaŋ čhóla yakúpi he?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they turned around and they stopped along Oak Creek and so it was my grandpa who said, “how are you two coming back in a car with no lights.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Iyóžaŋžaŋ čhóla yakúpi he?” eyá kéye yuŋkȟáŋ, “hiyá, iyóžaŋžaŋ uŋkúpi éyaš iŋšé hé wičhíŋčala waŋ kičhí uŋkúpi čha,” eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Have you been driving without lights?” he said, and so, “no, we came back with lights but we were just coming back with a girl,” they said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Išnála kúpi škȟá heyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were coming back alone despite what they said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Lé mnipíǧa na čhaŋlí uŋk’úpi čhaš, čhaŋnúŋm yaŋkíŋ na, kȟó wayátkaŋ yaŋké k’uŋ,” eyá čha, iwáŋyaŋkapi yuŋkȟáŋ, lé čhaŋlí oǧú naháŋ mnipíǧa žaŋžáŋ kiŋ hená iyúha čhaŋówiŋža ektá yaŋká kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“We gave her beer and tobacco, so she sat smoking, and also drinking,” he said, so they inspected it, and so there were cigarette butts and beer cans lying on the floor."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tuwéni šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And there was nobody there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéni šni škȟá héčhel išnála kúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was nobody there but they were coming back alone like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wanáǧi čha hé kičhí kúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were coming back with what was a spirit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Awíčhakhi na úŋyaŋwičhakhiya glá kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She came back there with them and she was coming back leaving them there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟaŋságt’api na, kiblézapi kéye na, héčhegla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were scared to death, and got sober, and that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni atéwaye kiŋháŋ kȟoškálaka k’uŋ héhaŋ, líla ȟleté kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago when my dad was just a young man, it’s said he was really irresponsable."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé tuktétu k’éyaš kȟaŋsúkhutepi čha ektá iyáza ománi na, kȟaŋsúkhute ohíya ománi našná, táku masčháŋuŋpȟa naíŋš wíkȟaŋ naíŋš čhaŋwák’iŋ naíŋš ak’íŋ naíŋš uŋgnáš lé mas’ínaȟtake héčha naíŋš eyá takúšnišni ohíya šna ománi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he gambled everywhere so he walked around from one place to another, and he won in the gambling games, and usually he went around winning all sorts of things, things like bridles, ropes, saddles, saddle blankets, or spurs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na mázaska kȟó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And also money."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋké waŋná kȟaŋsúkhutepi škȟá čhaŋkhé étkiya yá-hiŋ na, í kéye éyaš lé héhaŋni lé akíčhitag, lená wawóyuspa kiŋ, lená tókhi anáwičhaslatapi éyaš, slolyé šni čha, ektá í na, waŋná thimá íyutaka kéye, lé akíčhita thiyóblečha héčha čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then he gambled despite that and so he was going towards there, and it’s said he arrived but that morning the akíčhita, the cops, they snuck up on them there, but he didn’t know, so he got there, and then it’s said he sat inside, because it was a sort of army tent."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thimá kȟaŋsúkhutepi na lé pȟetížaŋžaŋ ǧeǧéya yuhápi héčha čha, thimáhelya iyóšnišnišyakel iléya háŋ čha, thimá iyáyiŋ na, waŋná íyutaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were gambling inside and they had a lantern, so it gave a dim light inside, so he went inside, and he sat down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyaš tuwéni ayúta šni wapȟóštaŋ aíyoȟpa ikíkču čha tuwéni ayúta šni kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nobody saw him with his hat pulled down so nobody was looking at him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel íyutakiŋ naháŋke, waŋná kȟaŋsúkhute na, ohíya áya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He sat down like that, and then he gambled, and he got to winning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahéhaŋ tuwá thimá hiyú čha, ektá étuŋwe šni pȟamágle yaŋkíŋ naháŋke, iníhaŋšni kȟaŋsúkhute yuŋkȟáŋ, sí ektá waŋyáŋka yuŋkȟáŋ, lé eháŋni háŋpa eyá iškáhu háŋskaska čha, sipȟá kiŋ gmigmágma čha lé wawóyuspa kiŋ lená oháŋpi kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Around that time someone came in so, sitting with his head down he didn’t look at him, and then he gambled without paying attention to him, and so he saw his feet, and so they were some old times shoes with long ankles and round toes so police officers wore those."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akíčhita kiŋ lená háŋpa kiŋ wičhák’upi čha héčha čha oháŋpi na, uŋzóǧe eyá tȟotȟó čha hé úŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They wore what was like the type of shoes that they gave police officers, and they wore blue jeans."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-s’e waŋyáŋka čhaŋkhé, átaya nážiŋ iyáyiŋ na, uŋgnáhelaka lé wawóyuspa kiŋ é čha ité kiŋ ogná apȟíŋ na, kaúŋka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He saw him just like that, and so he stood up, and all of the sudden it was the police officer that he hit in the face, and he fell down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “wawóyuspa čha hípe ló,” eyíŋ na héčhena átaya lé pȟetížaŋžaŋye kiŋ hé é čha kasní iȟpéya čha, áta hená iyúha mázaska k’uŋ hená ayúštaŋpi na, kaábekiya napȟápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “he’s a cop so they came,” and the lamp was suddenly extinguished, so they left all that money behind, and they ran off in all directions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta napȟápi čha, wapȟóštaŋ glušlókiŋ na, lé mázaska k’uŋ hená iyúha okšú naháŋke, khinápȟiŋ na, iyáyekiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They all ran away so he took off his hat and stuffed all the money inside and so he returned out from there and he ran away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cha iŋšé íyohakab lé wawóyuspa kiŋ lé kiktá íyutakiŋ na, owíčhale éyaš, tuwéni šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So afterwards the police officer just sat up, and he looked for them, but there wasn’t anybody."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé tuwéni šni čhaŋkhé, héčhena šuŋg’ákaŋ iyéič’iyiŋ na, khiglá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there wasn’t anyone, and so he got on his horse, and went back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ atéwaye kiŋ é čha šuŋg’ákaŋyaŋkiŋ na, itkób yá čhaŋkhé, “lé tókhiya lá he?” eyá čhaŋkhé, “lé étkiya ománi blé k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was my father that got on his horse, and he went towards him and so he said, “where are you going,” and so he said, “I’m going this way.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “wáŋ, léčhiya kȟaŋsúkhutepi škhá čha ektá waí éyaš áta tókȟaȟ’aŋpi k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “well, they were gambling there so I got there but they all disappeared.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “wáŋ, átayaš slolwáye šni k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “well, I don’t know about that at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋniš mázaska kiŋ hená iyúha ičúpi na, napȟápi éyaš, uŋmá tuwéni hé kȟaŋsúkhute kiŋ waŋžíni mázaska waŋžíla kayéš yuhápi šni,” kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“A while ago they took all the money, and they left, but not one of the gamblers don’t have not even a dollar.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta lé Silas wawóyuspa waŋ átaš šúŋšuŋla naȟtákapi s’e apȟíŋ na, kat’á čha, kaábekiya napȟápi k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Silas hit a police officer like a kicking mule, and knocked him out, so they all got away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó henákeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wallace Black Elk hé tȟakóža kiŋ hé táku wakȟáŋ wanáǧi tȟáwapi kiŋ iyéwičhakičiska kiŋ tȟoká héčhuŋ kta čha, héhaŋ waŋblí waŋ waŋyáŋke čha, hé é čha ogláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My grandson Wallace Black Elk would first do interpretation for some sorts of spirits, so back then he saw an eagle, so he told about that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkú ogná glá yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel mniȟúha sápa čha kaȟwóka-he s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was coming back on a road, and so like this it was like a black piece of fabric was floating through the air."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla iníhaŋ čha, éna inážiŋ na, héktakiya uŋzíhekta gníŋ na, apsíl ektá kaísakhibya khinážiŋ na, gličú na, čhuŋkáške kiŋ iyáyiŋ naháŋke, étkiya yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was scared, so he stopped back there, and he moved back, and jumped next to it, and got back, and he went at a fence, and then he went towards it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3313> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé waŋblí čha tuwá ó čha, lé ȟupáhu kiŋ kawéǧa čha, kiŋyáŋ iyáyiŋ kte ȟčiŋ éyaš, okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3313;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3313> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This was an eagle that someone shot, so they broke its wings, so he tried to fligh away, but couldn’t."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3313;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3314> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé waŋblí kiŋ hé é čha heyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3314;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3314> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was that eagle that talked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3314;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋblí gléška čha, išnála čhaŋkhé, wókiyakiŋ na, heyá kéye, “lé waní kte šni yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was a juvenile eagle, so he was alone, and so it talked to him, and it said, “I won’t live.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hó éyaš ečháŋni iblámniŋ kta čha letáŋ wíyaka waŋží imáyaču na, uŋmá kiŋ lená yaȟá kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It said, “but I will leave soon so you will take a feather from me, and you’ll bury the rest.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na, “wíyaka kiŋ lé tóhaŋni tuwéni k’ú šni yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it said, “never give this feather to anybody.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Lé ečéla uŋ wíyoyakihi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “you will be powerful with just this.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čha hé wíyaka kiŋ hé ičú naháŋ, maníŋtakiya áya-hiŋ na, maníŋn éȟpeya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he took that feather, and he took it into the wild, and he left it in the wild."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tókhi hé wíyaka kiŋ hé óhiŋni wapȟóštaŋ él opázaŋ úŋ čha hé wíyaka kiŋ hé ziŋtkála kiŋ hetáŋ ičú kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he always wore that feather in his hat so he took that feather from the bird."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hetáŋ toháŋn ománi naíŋš uŋgná héčhel iníkaǧapi na thimá wačhékiyapi čháŋšna, hé ziŋtkála kiŋ hená ókiyapi čha, ektá šna hípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So from there whenever he walked around or maybe they did a purification ceremony like that or they prayed inside, those birds helped him, so they often came."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhel ób lé wanáǧi wóglaka čha, táku kiŋ hená slolyá čha hé uŋ, waŋblí kiŋ lená wóilagwičhaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in that way he speaks with spirits, so he knows those things, so that’s why he makes use of these eagles."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho míš-eyá hená waŋblí čha, míš anúŋkȟasaŋ éyapi čha héčheča hená wóilagwičhawayiŋ kta škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those eagles, they’re called bald eagles, it’s said that I will be able to make use of them like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená tókhel wačhíŋwičhawayiŋ kte eháŋtaŋhaŋš, ómakiyapi kta kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If I help them somehow, then they said that they would help me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hená héčhel wakȟáŋyaŋ ziŋtkála kiŋ lená úŋpi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because these birds live in a sacred way like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéni otúyačhiŋ wičhákte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nobody kills them for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéni otúyačhiŋ wóilagwičhaye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nobody makes use of them for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhegla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni wimáčhiŋčala k’uŋ héhaŋ, wikȟóškalaka waŋ kičhí wabláwa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago when I was a little girl, I went to school with a young woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha eháŋni tȟoká waúŋyawapi čha, héhaŋ húŋȟ waníyetu ótapi éyaš, lé nakéš otȟókaheya wayáwapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So a long time ago we first went to school, so at that time some were old, but just then they were going to school for the first time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé kindergarden kiŋ lé é čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because this was kindergarden."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wikȟóškala kiŋ lé tókhi wikčémna núŋm isáŋm iyáye k’éyaš nakéš héčhiya owáyawa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this young woman was maybe older than 20, but just then she was going to school there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héhaŋ iŋšé miyé waníyetu mawíkčemna."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then I just was ten years old."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wikȟóškalaka kiŋ lé hél wayáwa na, haŋkéya wayáwa šni yuŋkȟáŋ, oyákapi na, khúža kéyapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this young girl studied there, and finally she didn’t go to school, and so they said that, and because of that they said she was sick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wiyóhiyaŋpatakiya éyayapi kéyapi, héčhiya okhúže thípi waŋ ektá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that they took her eastward, there to a hospital."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Asníyaŋpi kta čha éyayapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They would cure her so they say they took her there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ líla tȟéhaŋ glí šni éyaš, oyákapi na, wašíču wakȟáŋ kiŋ hená gličúyapi okíhipi šni kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she didn’t come back for a good long time, but they said that, and that those doctors couldn’t let her come back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla khúža čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because she was very sick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ húŋku na atkúku kiŋ eyášna ektá waŋyáŋg ípi yuŋkȟáŋ, otóhaŋl oyákapi na, wikȟóškalaka kiŋ hé toháŋ tȟaŋkál yaŋkíŋ kta čháŋna šna, nihíŋčiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so her mother and father often got there to see her, and so they said that for some time, and they said that whenever that young girl had reached that time of the month, it scared her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wašíču wakȟáŋ kiŋ eyášna owíčhakiyakiŋ na, tóhaŋ héčheča kta čháŋšna, khúžiŋ na, tak-tókȟuŋ kte kiŋ slolkíye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she often told the doctors, and whenever it was like that, she got sick, and she didn’t know what to do."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla waš’áka áya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was said that she was becoming powerful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tóhaŋ héčheča kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, ikȟáŋyaŋ égnakapi čhíŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So when she was going to be like that, it is said that they strapped her down with a rope."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé eyášna áta thiyópa kiŋ hená kȟó aónatȟakapi čháŋšna, átaya tókhi gnaškíŋyaŋ načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she probably went crazy, whenever they often also completely shut the door on her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gnaškíŋyiŋ našná, átaya owákaŋyaŋke naíŋš wágleyutapi hená é kayéš kȟó áta kawéȟweǧa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She went crazy, and usually she totally broke the chair or even the table, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé haŋkéya máza ikȟáŋyaŋ gnákapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so finally it’s said that they tied her down with chains."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena haŋkéya líla áya čha ablézapi yuŋkȟáŋ, lé há kiŋ hiŋšmá áya kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Finally they realized that it was progressing, and so they say that she grew long fur."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé itȟúŋkala híŋ kiŋ héčha s’e áya čhaŋkhé, awáŋyaŋg khuwápi yuŋkȟáŋ, haŋkéya iyá okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It grew like it was mouse fur, and so they kept watching over her, and so eventually she couldn’t speak."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha líla wókȟokipȟeka kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they say that she was really scared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóhaŋ wí waŋží ihúŋni čháŋšna, lé tȟaŋkál yaŋkíŋ kte wahéhaŋ šna, héčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever the first month came, she was like that, around the time that her time of the month came."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha wahéhaŋ šna gnákapi éyaš, haŋkéya líla áya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So around that time they usually put her aside, but eventually it was said that it was progressing”."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na óhiŋniyaŋ kašká héčheča čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And that’s why she was always like that, tied up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha lé wašíču wakȟáŋ kiŋ lé tȟuŋkášilayapi ektá hená iyáyapi naháŋ, wóokiye lápi naháŋ, uŋgná húŋku na atkúku kiŋháŋ iyówiŋyaŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé pȟežúta k’úpi naháŋ, ištíŋmekhiyapi kta kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So those doctors, they went to the president, and they made an agreement, and maybe if her mom and dad agreed, they would give this woman medicine, and they say that they would put her to sleep."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ištíŋme kiŋ héčhena t’íŋ kta čha kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said that that way she would die in her sleep."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Húŋku na atkúku kiŋ owíčhakiyakapi čha, takómni tókhel okíhipi šni čha, waŋglág ípi khéš, haŋkéya iyéwičhakiye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Her mother and father talked to them, so they definitely couldn’t, but whenever they came to look over her, eventually she didn’t recognize them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha haŋkéya átaya hiŋšmá áya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in the end she became hairy all over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ayúštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they gave up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ayúštaŋpi na čhažé oígwapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They gave up and it is said that they signed their names."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wikȟóškalaka hé ištíŋmekhiyapi na héčhena t’á škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they put that young woman to sleep until she died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kéya oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that that’s what was told."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé tókhi wikȟóškalaka kiŋháŋ eháŋni táku wičháša eyá čhaŋkú ogná enágna ománipi na, hená šuŋmáyetupi škhé čha héčha načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So maybe that girl walked like some of those old sort of men on the road, and they say those were wolves so it’s possible she was like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáhelaka héčha hiŋglá kéya oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that it’s said that maybe she became like that"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó henákeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lél héktakiya tókhi okó tópa séče isáŋmya heháŋn, wíŋyaŋ waŋ kičhí iníuŋkaǧapi éyaš, lé ská wíŋyaŋ héčha čha, kičhí iníuŋkaǧapi yuŋkȟáŋ, héhaŋ lé glinápȟiŋ na, hé, “átaya wanáǧi nitȟáwa kiŋ hená aháŋnažiŋ makhúwapi čha, átaya iȟéyab iblábla owákihi šni, škaŋškáŋ šni maŋké k’uŋ,” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe more than about four weeks ago, we held a purification ceremony with a woman, but she was a white woman, so we held a purification ceremony with her, and so then she came out, and she said, “all your spirits were hanging around me so I couldn’t go outside, I sat there motionless.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Uŋgná tónikheča héči, hé uŋ héčhuŋpi k’uŋ.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Maybe they do that, if something’s wrong with you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ hetáŋ tókhi okó waŋžíča yuŋkȟáŋ, hiŋgnáku kiŋ oyákiŋ na hé, “mitȟáwiču kiŋ lé wašíču wakȟáŋ waŋ eyášna waŋyáŋkiŋ naháŋke, okíyakiŋ na, wašíču wakȟáŋ waŋží ektá naíŋš okhúže thípi waŋží ektá yíŋ na, waŋyáŋg-ič’íčhiye-ši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so maybe it was a week from then that her husband talked, and he said, “my wife usually sees a doctor, and then she talked to him, and she went to the doctor or to a hospital, and he asked her to have herself see him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thezí mahél táku waŋ úŋ čha.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because something was in her stomach.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho yuŋkȟáŋ haŋkéya líla khúža áya čhaŋkhé, okhúže thípi ektá aípi yuŋkȟáŋ, thezí ektá waglúla waŋ úŋ kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so eventually she was becoming really sick, and so they brought her to the hospital, and so they said that she had a tapeworm in her stomach."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé kaísakhibya líla óta ihéwičhaya kéye, nakúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said that she passed a lot of them near there, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhetu waŋná líla khúža kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she was really sick in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Glí na, iháŋbla yuŋkȟáŋ, heyá keye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She got back, and she had a dream, and so she said that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháho waŋ líla hó hukhúčhiyela čha, heyá kéye, “uŋníktepi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was a very low human voice that said, “we will kill you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé tȟaŋságt’eyapi čha, léčhiya makíyuȟlapi čha, owákiyakiŋ na, “hé táku čha thezí mahél ní uŋ héči, hé é čha waŋná t’íŋ kta čha hé uŋ, nikhúža-he kštó,” epȟé čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they scared her half to death, so there they called me, so I said something to her, I said, “if there is a thing that is living in your stomach, it will die, and so that’s why you’ve been sick.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Š’agyáhaŋ wačhékiyiŋ yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “go praying hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na nit’íŋ kta kéčhiŋ šni yé,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And don’t think you’re going to die.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éšéš aníčisni kta kéya yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Anyways it’s said that you will get better."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókša ečhél iníyayiŋ kte kštó,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “you will definitely get better.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hignáku kiŋ wakȟíŋ na, “thiyówazilyiŋ naháŋ, ikčéya lé mní kiŋ léčha čha ičú naháŋ, yatkíŋ kte háŋtaŋhaŋ, azílyatȟuŋ naháŋ, awáčhekiyiŋ na, k’ú we."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I addressed her husband and I said, “smudge in your house, and take some of those regular waters, and if she’s going to drink it, smudge over it, and pray over it, and give it to her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókša ečhél iyáyiŋ kte kštó,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She’ll definitely get better in this way,”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhuŋ kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said that he would do that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mní awáčhekiyiŋ na, azílyiŋ naháŋke, k’ú yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel líla áta thezí kiŋ yazáŋ na, átaya peháŋ-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He prayed over the water, and he smudged over it, and then he gave it to her, and so in this way her stomach was really hurting her, and she was all doubled up in pain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé hétkakiya okhúže thípi ektá aípi yuŋkȟáŋ, itȟó él apȟékhiyapi čha, héčheya líla khúže éyaš, apȟé ȟpáya-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, tȟaŋkáye kíniča čhaŋkhé, lé oyúŋke él šna oíheye waŋ wičhák’upi čha, hé é čha úŋ kta čha k’úpi yuŋkȟáŋ, lé waglúla waŋ hé é čha áta ihéya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they took her back to the hospital, and so I guess they made her wait, so she was actually really sick, but she laid waiting, and so she wanted to use the restroom, and so they gave them a toilet in the bed, so it was that that she would use, so they gave it to her, and so she expelled all of what were those tapeworms."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čikčík’ala kȟó átaya ihéwičhaya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And she expelled them which were really small."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ihéwičhayiŋ naháŋke al’áta lé thezí yazáŋ nathíbthipe k’uŋ hé akísni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She expelled them and then she got better from her stomach which was really badly hurting with cramps"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé “wašíču wakȟáŋ kiŋ aphíuŋniyaŋpi šni, tókheškhe ečhánuŋ wélakȟa, waglúla kiŋ ihéyaye k’uŋ” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “we didn’t treat you, evidently somehow you did it, you know you passed the tapeworms."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé, “háŋ, ičhíŋ líla tȟéhaŋ awápȟe čha hé uŋ haŋkéya thezí mayázaŋ,” čha hé, “éyaš lé pȟežúta čhóla ihéyaya oyákihi šni škȟá héčhanuŋ k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “yeah, because I waited a really long to so for that reason finally my stomach was sick” so he said, “but you couldn’t have passed them without this medicine and yet you did anyways.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha gličúyapi čha, thiyáta glí na, lé táku pȟaŋpȟáŋla hená é čha yul-wáši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they sent her back, so she got home, and I told her that it was soft foods that she should eat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel lé thezí mahél táku úŋ kiŋ átaya ihékiya čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way she passed all the things in her stomach."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ tákuni thezí mahél úŋ okíhi šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s why there was nothing in her stomach."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha héčhuŋ-waši yuŋkȟáŋ áta uŋgnáhelaka akhé mas’ámakipȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I told her to do that and so all of a sudden she called me again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhi hékta okó k’uŋ héhaŋ, mas’ámakipȟapi naháŋke, akhé ečhéȟči wákhipȟa čha, átaya makhú kȟó yazáŋ čha, hiŋgnáku kiŋ wakȟíŋ na, “héktakiya okhúže thípi ektá áya yé, uŋgná íŋyaŋ waŋží thezí mahél úŋ séče kštó,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe about a week ago, she called me, and then she just had stuff happen to her again, so her chest was hurting too, so I addressed her husband, and I said, “take her to the hospital again, maybe she has a stone in her stomach.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ léčhel aípi čha, héčheȟčiŋ apȟé ȟpáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he arrived there with her like that so she lay waiting just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iyéčhiŋka íŋyaŋ kiŋ hé ihéya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she expelled that stone all on her own."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋyaŋ kiŋ hé ihéya čha, kaéčhel iyáyiŋ na, leháŋn waŋná akísni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She expelled that stone, so she became well again, and nowadays she’s gotten better."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akísni éyaš eháke thezí kiŋ naháŋȟči mahél pȟaŋpȟáŋla čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She’s gotten better but her stomach is still sensitive inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Otóhaŋyaŋ hokšíčala tȟawóyute ečéla yúta-hiŋ kta képȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I think that she was eating just children’s food for a while."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókša kaéčhel iyáye kiŋháŋ, heháŋn okáblaya zaníya úŋ kta képȟa owákiyaka čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When she get’s all better, then I say that I think that she will live healthy and smoothly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lé awíyuškiŋ laȟčake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’m really happy about this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhegla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wí núŋpa k’uŋ héhaŋ, tȟakóžala waŋ líla khúže."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3433> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Two months ago, one of my grandchildren was really sick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3433;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Isáŋm tȟakóža héčha čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3434> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She’s one of my grand-grandchildren."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3434;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋn okíhilaka khúža čha okhúže thípi ektá aípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3435> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was as sick as could be so it’s said that they brought her to a hospital"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3435;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lél núŋǧe opȟáya yazáŋ na, áta t’eblézešni čhaŋké, wašíču wakȟáŋ kiŋ hé eyá kéye, “lé núŋǧe mahél oȟlóka waŋ” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3436> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so her inner ear was hurting and she was really going crazy and so it’s said that the doctor said, “it’s a hole inside your ear.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3436;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3437> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “éyaš aphíuŋyaŋpi uŋkókihipi šni k’uŋ, uŋgná aphíuŋyaŋpi kiŋháŋ, naȟ’úŋ okíhi kte šni, ho hetáŋ” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3437;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3437> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “but we can’t treat you, maybe when we treat her, she won’t be able to hear, from then on.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3437;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3438> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké tȟakóža kiŋ nihíŋčiyiŋ na lé isáŋm tȟakóžala kiŋ ahípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3438;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3438> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so my granddaughter was scared and they brought her here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3438;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3439> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ahípi na, aphíye-mašipi čha, miyé tákuni wakȟáŋ waȟ’áŋ owákihi šni, iŋšé Tȟuŋkášila hená ečhúŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3439;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3439> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They brought her here, and they asked me to cure her, and so me myself I can’t do any miraculous acts, just Creator does those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3439;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3440> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čha lél ahípi čha, čhaŋlí owápaǧi na, lé wačhéwakiyiŋ naháŋ, tȟakóža kiŋ iwáču na, núŋǧe ektá átaya šóta obláblu na, “hó tókša tȟakóža aníčisni kte kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3440;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3440> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then they brought her here, so I filled a pipe with tobacco, and I prayed, and I took my daughter, and I blew all the smoke into her ear, and I said, “you will surely get better, granddaughter.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3440;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3441> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená léčhuŋpi čháŋšna hená uŋ akísnipi,” čha epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3441;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3441> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever they do that, they get well from those things.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3441;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3442> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha waŋná lečhálakel toháŋn húŋku kiŋ omákiyakiŋ na, mitȟákoža kiŋ isáŋm tȟakóžakpaku kiŋ áta héktakiya wašíču wakȟáŋ ektá aí, yuŋkȟáŋ lé núŋǧe oȟlóka kéyapi k’uŋ hé naókhiyutȟiŋ na, átaya tókheča šni čha tókheškhe héčhamuŋ héči, imáyuŋǧapi k’uŋ čha, “ičhíŋ wačhéyakhiyapi uŋ hená héčheča k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3442;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3442> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then recently her mother told me something, and my granddaughter took her great-granddaughter all back to the doctor, and so the hole that they said had been in her ear healed up, and there was no problem at all, so they asked me if I did that, so I said, “you know things are like that through you all praying.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3442;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3443> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ée leháŋn tókhečašniyaŋ oíŋyaŋka-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3443;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3443> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So instead nowadays she is running around without any health issues."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3443;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha eháŋni ókowaŋžila kȟátiŋ naháŋ, khušyáhaŋ úŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, líla leháŋn áta tókhečala šni čha, kȟóš waŋná iyíŋ na, oíŋyaŋka-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3444;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So back then she always had a fever, and she was sickly, and so nowadays she’s not sick at all, so now she talks too, and she’s running around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3444;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3445> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3445;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhi lé waníyetu tópa séče čha, héhaŋni lé kiŋyékhiyapi oínažiŋ héčha čha hé líla tȟáŋka káǧapi čha, héčhiya lé Lakȟóta kiŋ eháŋni hená tuktéktel wičháȟapi škhé čha, hená wičhák’api na, héhaŋni yuȟéyab iwíčhačupi háŋtaŋhaŋš, ečéla hé thikáǧapi okíhipi kéyapi, naíŋš lé oíŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe about four years ago, back then they wanted to build a big sort/type of airport, so they say that they dug up old Lakotas scattered about, so they dug them up, and long ago they say that only if they moved them could they make the building, or this airstrip."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hó čha yuŋkȟáŋ héčhiya waŋží iyéyapi čha, k’ápi na, yuȟéyab ičúpi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So well then they found one there, so they dug it up, and they say that they put it aside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuktéktel hiyéye séče éyaš, tókhi anáȟmapi naíŋš, tóktu načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they might be scattered around, but maybe they kept them secret, or something probably happened."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé é čha waŋná yuštáŋpi na, yuǧáŋpi kta čha ektá wačhékhiye-mašípi čha, ektá waí šni háŋni, iblámniŋ na, ká lé wašíču eyá lé táku hohú k’ápi naíŋš, táku eháŋni makȟá mahél hiyéye kiŋ iyé olépi na, hé ičúpi na, hená uŋ táku slolyápi čha, hená héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is what they decided, and they would open it so they asked me to pray there, so before I arrived there I left, over there some white people dug up the bones, or they found something old strewn about in the ground, and they took it, and they learned something by using those, so they did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ektá wičháwai na iwíčhamuŋǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So here I arrived to where they were and I asked them something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Lé kiŋyékhiyapi oínažiŋ waŋ káǧapi kiŋ lél tákuni wičhátȟaŋ yaŋké šni he?” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “nobody’s body laid here at this airport they made?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wičhátȟaŋ yaŋké háŋtaŋhaŋš hená tȟokéya yuȟéyab iwíčhačupi, na hé yuǧáŋpi kiŋ wašté k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “If there were bodies they would remove them first thing, and you know of course that then it would be good for them to open it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “hiyá, tákuni šni k’uŋ, átaya hená uŋkólepi éyaš tákunišni k’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, “no, as you know there wasn’t anyone, they looked for them all but as you know there was nobody."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuwá hé hohú eyá ičú na, čhaŋ kaíčaŋyaŋ égle čha, hená é čha lé čhúŋkaške kiŋ aglágla égle k’éyaš, hená wičháša hohú šni kéyapi k’uŋ, hená wamákȟaškaŋ keyápi.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So someone, he took some bones, and he set them leaning against a tree, so it was those that he leaned along this fence, but as you know they say those weren’t the bones of men, they say those were animal bones."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hél tuktél táku wičhóthi k’ápi čha, hé átayaš makȟá kiŋ sápa čha, iyéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3476> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And somewhere around there they dug up a sort of village, so that earth was all black, so it is said they found it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3476;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ, “hená íš eháŋni wašíču oéthi k’uŋ,” kéyapi, “čha tókȟa šni k’uŋ,” eyápi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3477> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that’s why they said, “as for those, as you know those were an old white campground,” they said, and “so as you know, don’t worry about it,” they said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3477;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Oháŋ,” epȟé, “lé é čha hé yuwákȟaŋ-mašípi éyaš, Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ lená tóhaŋni mázaska slolyápi šni na, lé oínažiŋ kiŋ lé líla mázaska óta na, líla wičháša žičá hená uŋ ománipi kta čha, hé bluwákȟaŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, takúŋȟčiŋ Lakȟóta kiŋ héktakiya wičhákič’upi kiŋ wašté k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3478> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Okay,” I said, “it’s like that so they asked me to bless that, but these Lakota never knew about money, and this airstrip is a lot of money, and a lot of rich people would use it, so if I bless it, as you know it’d be good for them to give to the old Lakota.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3478;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Héčhuŋpi šni háŋtaŋhaŋš, takómni hená khušéya úŋpi kta čha, tóhaŋni ečhél káǧapi okíhipi kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3479;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3479> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“If they didn’t do that, they definitely would block it, so they would never be able to do it correctly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3479;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3480> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóhaŋni yuštáŋpi kte šni,” eyá owíčhawakiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3480;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3480> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They would never finish,” I told them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3480;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3481> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “hél tákuni úŋ šni škȟá heyá-haŋpi k’uŋ,” eyá, “hená takómni tókša slol’úŋyaŋpi kte k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3481;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3481> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “there is nobody there despite them saying that,” [and] I said, “surely we know those things.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3481;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3482> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Héčhel hél wanáǧi úŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš,” eyá owíčhawakiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3482;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3482> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“If spirits are here like that,” I told them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3482;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3483> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wačhéwakiye éyaš, “iŋšé hená lé yuǧáŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hél oyáte kiŋháŋ taŋyáŋ hípi na, taŋyáŋ khiglápi kta čha uŋ, wačhéwakiyiŋ kte k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3483;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3483> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I prayed but I said, “if they just open this, I will pray that people arrive here safely, and return back from where they came safely.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3483;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3484> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tóhaŋni thípi kiŋ na hé kiŋyékhiyapi oíŋyaŋke hógna hená awáčhewakiye owákihi šni k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3484;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3484> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “As you know I can’t ever pray over the building or the airport in that way.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3484;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Iŋšé hená oyáte kiŋ hél hípi na, etáŋ kiŋyáŋ yápi kta héči, héčhel wačhéwakiyiŋ kte k’uŋ,” eyá owíčhawakiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3485> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I told them, “As you know, I’ll just pray in that way for those people, who plan on coming here, and flying away from here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3485;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha héčhi wačhékiye waí čha, héhaŋ héčhuŋ-s’e wačhéwakiyiŋ na, toháŋ hé yuǧáŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená oyáte kiŋ uŋ tákuni tókȟa šni kiŋyáŋpi kta wóčhekiye epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3486> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I arrived there praying, so at that time I prayed just like that, and I said prayers for it so long as they opened it and people were using it without any trouble."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3486;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó yuŋkȟáŋ leháŋ yuštáŋpi éyaš, táku ipáyeȟya íŋyaŋkiŋ na, hená waŋná áta hél íŋyaŋ okástakapi čha, hená átaya našléšlečiŋ na, wanáǧi kiŋ šičáyela škáŋpi kéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3487> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So well then now it’s finished but something went wrong and now there is a lot of concrete there so that all split around, and they say it’s said that the spirits moved around badly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3487;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhiya lé Šahíyela oyáte naháŋ Pȟaláni naíŋš héčhekčhe héčhiya hóčhoka yuhápi kéyapi hé oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3488> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they said that some say that they have Cheyenne and Arikara or some [people] like that in the middle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3488;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená lé čha ektá mníŋ na, slolwáyiŋ kta képȟe lená táku uŋ čha héčhuŋpi héči na, wašíču kiŋ hená ówakȟaŋkȟaŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, takómni tóhaŋni ečhél iyáyiŋ kte šni na, hé átaya žužúwahiŋ kta čha, hé é čha úŋ leháŋ lé iwánaȟ’uŋ ektá hená oyákapi čha, áŋpaó héhaŋni čhiŋkšíwaye kiŋ mayúȟičiŋ na, omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3489> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they are this so I went there, and I said I would figure out the reason why they did these things, and if those white people lied, it would definitely never be fixed, and that would fall all apart, so it was that that they said on the radio, so one morning my son woke me up, and told me about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3489;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “tókša ektá mníŋ kte k’uŋ,” epȟíŋ na “tókȟa héči, tókša ób wówaglakiŋ kte k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3490> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I said, “soon I’ll surely go there,” I said, [and I said], “if something is wrong, I will surely talk with them,” I said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3490;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “hená iŋšé iyé átayela Lakȟóta kiŋ éwičahkiktuŋžapi na, iyé átayela žičá wačhíŋpi čha hé uŋ, tóhuŋweni iyéčheča kte šni k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3491> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I said, “they completely forgot about the Lakota, and they want to be absolutely rich, so for that reason it will never be that way.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3491;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhel waéčhuŋpi éyaš takómni ečhéča kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They may do things however but it will definitely not work properly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3492;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Takómni tóhaŋni íŋyaŋkiŋ kte šni čha eyá owákiyaka hé híŋhaŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It definitely won’t work so I told him that that morning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3493;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s how things are."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héhaŋ lé owáčhekiye kiŋ lé Mní Wičhóni Owáčhekiye eyápi čha uŋyúhapi. ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So at some time in the past we had a church called Living Waters Church"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hél wikȟóškalaka waŋ Lakȟóta tȟókeča čha eyášna hél wačhékiye hí yuŋkȟáŋ, hékta tókhi waníyetu yámni naíŋš tópa séče ká ȟé ektá otȟúŋwahe waŋ Kremmling, Colorado eyápi čha héčhiya í kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a young woman who is Native but not Lakota comes here to pray often, and so maybe three or four years ago it’s said that she came here to a town in the mountains called Kremmling, Colorado."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟawíčhaša waŋ kičhí í naháŋke, lé oȟpáye thípi čha él ípi naháŋke, hél ȟpáyapi kta čha, hetáŋ iyáyapi kta čha, hél ípi yuŋkȟáŋ, tókheškhe átaya čhuwí kiŋ snisní iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so her boyfriend came with her, and then they arrived at a hotel, and then they would stay there, so they would leave from there, so they arrived there, and so it’s said that she really got cold chills."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké ókšaŋkšaŋ étuŋwiŋ naháŋke, “tókheškhe tomákheča k’uŋ,” kéčhiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she looked around and then it’s said she thought, “somehow something’s wrong with me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋke lé thitȟáhepiya waŋkál étuŋwaŋ ečhél lé wičhápȟaha héčha núŋm naháŋ, wahíŋkpe na itázipa héčhekčhe otká kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then she looked up at the wall and so there was something like two human scalps, and arrows and a bow hanging here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké eyá kéye, “hená tókhiyataŋ luhá he?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “where did you get those?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wašíču kiŋ hé eyá kéye, “lená atéwaye kiŋ eháŋni léčhiya wiyóhiyaŋpata owíčhakte čha hél hená pȟahá kiŋ ičú k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that white man said, “there was a massacre in the east long ago so my dad took those scalps from there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičhíŋčala kiŋ heyá kéye, “tákuwe hená luhá he?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the young woman said, “why do you have them?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hená wičhát’a héčhapi škȟá wičháluha k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said, “those are some sort of thing from dead people, but they belong to them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “hiyá, hená atéwaye kiŋháŋ hená wówitaŋ uŋ yuhá k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “no, my father kept those with pride.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hená ohíya čha uŋ, iglátaŋ čha, yuhá k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “he won them, so that’s why he bragged about his victory, so he had them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “hená héčhanuŋ kte šni škȟá héčhanuŋpi k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “you shouldn’t do those things but you all do them anyways.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Éyaš lél waȟpáyiŋ kte šni k’uŋ, hená Lakȟóta pȟahá čha wičháluhapi čha,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“But I won’t rest here, because you all have those Lakota scalps.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyíŋ na, khinápȟiŋ naháŋke, iyéčhiŋkyaŋke ektá mahél išnála iyáyiŋ kta čha, íyutakiŋ na, iyáyiŋ kta yuŋkȟáŋ, táku waŋ iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ lé uŋmáčhiyataŋ hiyú na, íyutaka keye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said that, and so she was going to leave all alone in her car,so she got in, and she was about to leave, when something got into the other side of the car, and sat down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké héčhena iyáyiŋ kte éyaš, hé eyá kéye, “pȟahá kiŋ hená aglá yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she would have left like that, but it said, “bring the scalps back home with you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tákuni tókȟa kte šni čha ičú na aglá yo,”  eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It said, “it won’t be any problem so take them and go back home with them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Na akhí ȟá yo,” eyá čhaŋké, čhéya iyáyiŋ na, heyá kéye, “tákuwe čha amáyaluštaŋpi šni hé, líla hená uŋ kakíšmayayapi k’uŋ,” heyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It said, “and having gotten back, bury them,” and so she started crying, and she said, “why is it that you don’t leave me alone, you know you’re making me suffer because of this.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “hená ičú na aglá yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it said, “take them and go back home with them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3518> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hená Lakȟótapi,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3518;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3518> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It said, “they’re Lakota.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3518;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyaš héčhena waŋná iyáyiŋ naháŋke, otȟúŋwahe étkiya iyáyiŋ kta yuŋkȟáŋ, tókheškhe uŋgnáhelaka átaya iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ kaítȟokabya átaya iléȟleȟya háŋ čhaŋké, patȟág inážiŋ naháŋke, hiyúič’iya yuŋkȟáŋ, lé hél blé waŋ mninátȟakapi čha, ektá mahél iyáya tkȟá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3519;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So but then she left, and then she was leaving to the town, when all of the sudden somehow there were car headlights in front of her, and so she came to a stop, and then she got out, and then there was a lake that was damed, so she would have gone right into it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3519;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyaš lé wanáǧi kiŋ lé anápta čha éna inážiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3520;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the spirits topped her so she stopped back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3520;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3521> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héktakiya iyéčhiŋkyaŋke kiŋ ektá íyutakiŋ, na paúŋzihektakiya yíŋ naháŋke, heyá kéye, “táku čha héčhamuŋ kta héči omákiyaka pe, ečhél ečhámuŋ kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3521;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3521> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she sat down in the car, and she backed up, and then she said, “tell me what it is that I should do, I’ll do it right.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3521;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héktakiya gle-šípi čha, ektá khí na, wašíču kiŋ okíyakiŋ na, heyá kéye, “lená pȟahá kiŋ aglé-mašipi čha, héktakiya awágniŋ na, waȟá kte k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they told her to go back, so she arrived back there, and she talked to the white man, and she said, “they told me to come back home with the scalps, so I’ll go back with them, and I’ll bury them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké wičálašni éyaš héya kéye, “hé niyé čha ničákižiŋ kte k’uŋ, héčhel luhá-he háŋtaŋhaŋš” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he refused but she said, “it is you who will suffer, if you keep on having those.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Na lená wanáǧi kiŋháŋ ‘tákuni tókȟa kte šni,’ eyápi k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said, “and these spirits said, ‘nothing will go wrong.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké héčhena tȟawíčhaša kiŋ heyá kéye, “háŋ, k’ú wo, tókša niyé é wókaižu nič’úpi kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then her boyfriend said, “yeah, give them up, they will absolutely give you the credit for it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho čha niyáte lená héčhuŋ kte šni škȟá lená héčhuŋ weló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “so your father shouldn’t have done these things but he did do them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hená íŋš-eyá oyátepi čha, wičháktepi kte šni škȟá, ítaŋyaŋ waéčhuŋ weló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “they were people too, so they shouldn’t have killed them, but he did it proudly.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čhaŋké, “oháŋ, čha lená aglá po,” eyíŋ na, yuȟpíŋ na, wičhák’u čha, átaya haŋíyačhiŋšni yuhá kúpi éyaš, átaya líla haŋkȟókipȟapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that, and so he said, “okay, you two take them back,” and he took it down, and he gave them to them, so they came back with them right in the middle of the night, but they were really scared because of the night.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhena akúpi na, léčhiya thí ektá aglípi naháŋke, lé wágleyutapi él égnaka éyaš, líla haŋhépi átaya lé wanáǧi kiŋ ophíč’iyapi kéye, thimá, čha kiktá naháŋke, heyá kéye, “lená tókheškhe ečhámuŋ kta he?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they were coming home like that, and they arrived at their home here, and then they laid those down on the table, but those spirits were active all night long, at their home, so she woke up, and then she said, “what will I do with these?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “wáŋ, Neva kiyúȟla na iyúŋǧa yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “hey, call Neva and ask her.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha híŋhaŋni él makíyuȟlapi na imáyuŋǧapi čha, epȟé, “aŋpétu wakȟáŋ kiŋháŋ owáčhekiye ektá ayáu kiŋháŋ, tókša awáčheuŋkhiyapi na, toháŋn iyéhaŋtu kiŋháŋ, héktakiya lé owíčhakte héčhiya awíčhauŋglapi kte naháŋ, ektá wičháuŋȟapi kte k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they called me in the morning and they asked me, so I said, “when you come to church on Sunday, we will absolutely pray over them, and when it’s the right time, we will bring them back to where the massacre was, and we will bury them there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Héčhel naǧí kiŋ okáblaya iyáyapi kte k’uŋ,” eyá owákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said to her, “in that way the spirits will go along freely.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha leháŋn ilániŋ na, mniȟúha waŋží lúta čha iyáču na, pȟežíȟota éyagnakiŋ na, aóyapemni na, thiyówazilyaye kiŋ héčhel tókheča kte šni kštó.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So you go now, and take a red piece of fabric, and lay some white sage there, and wrap them around it, and nothing will happen with you smudging in your home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha héčhuŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s said that she did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And she told me that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé waŋná aŋpétu wakȟáŋ él, ektá lé pȟahá kiŋ lená ahí na, owáčhekiye él aglé na, wačhékiyapi kiŋ él ahígnaka čha, átaya waŋblákiŋ na, tókheškhe líla čhaŋtéšiča amáhi čha, čhéya iblámniŋ na, wačhéya-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then on Sunday, she brought the scalps there, and she was going to the church with them, and she came, and laid them on the altar, so I saw them all, and I started feeling really sad, so I started to cry, and I was crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha amákisni él wačhéwakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I prayed upon calming down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wačhéwakiyiŋ na phiyá opémni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I prayed and wrapped it up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hepȟé, “lé tȟokáta aŋpétu wakȟáŋ kiŋháŋ, iníuŋkaǧapi na, héčhiya hóčhoka waŋží éuŋglepi kte naháŋ, hetáŋ lená azíl’uŋtȟuŋpi kte na, ektá wičháȟa uŋkáyapi kte k’uŋ,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I said, “next Sunday, we will hold a purification ceremony, and we’ll lay it down in the middle there, and from there we’ll smudge on these things, and we’ll go along burying them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho čha niglúwiŋyeya kte, niyé hená awíčhayagli čha,” hepȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “so you’ll be ready, because you’ll bring them back.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha wóyute na táku wíȟpeyayiŋ kta héči hená niglúwiŋyeya kiŋ ho heháŋn ektá uŋkáyapi na, wičháuŋȟapi kte kštó,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3541;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “so we will take the food and whatever the things are that you prepare to give away, and we’ll bury them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3541;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “oháŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3542> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “okay.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3542;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná aŋpétu wakȟáŋ čha wačhékiye iglúštaŋpi čha iyópteya pahá ektá iníkaȟ uŋkípi naháŋ thimá awíčhai čha oínithikaǧe pȟežíȟota owíŋšwičhawakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3543> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The on Sunday they finished praying so we arrived straight at the hills to do the ceremony and the arrived there inside with them so I spread sage on the floor for the ceremony."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3543;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ektá égnagwičhawakhiyiŋ na ektá isákhib yaŋké-waši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3544> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I laid them there and I had her sit down next to it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3544;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu, “lená niyé awíčhayagli čha hená wičhágluha naŋkíŋ na ečhél toháŋn wičháȟapi kiŋ heháŋn niglúštaŋ kte kštó,” epȟé čha, “miyé hé wóokiye ničáhipi čha tákuni ayákhipȟa kte šni.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3545> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Things were like that, I said, “you yourself brought these so you sit with them until they’ve been finished being burried,” so, “they will bring you help so nothing bad will happen to you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3545;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waŋná hé iníuŋkaǧapi na waŋná ečhél hená éuŋglepi na thimá uŋkíyutakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3546> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then we had the ceremony and then we laid them down and we sat down inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3546;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta íŋyaŋ kiŋ toháŋn okíhilaka kȟáta čha tuwéni thimá yaŋká okíhi šni čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3547> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The stones were as hot as could be so then nobody could sit inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3547;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iníhaŋšni mišnála thimá maŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3548> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nevertheless I sat inside alone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3548;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená íŋyaŋ kiŋháŋ wačhéwakhiyiŋ na iwáštegla kȟátapi-waši."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3549> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I prayed, the stones, I softly heated them up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3549;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel, “táku ečhúŋk’uŋpi kiŋ uŋglúštaŋpi na hená héktakiya hé owíčhakte héčhiya wičháuŋgloglapi kta,” kepȟé, owákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3550> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “we will finish what we’re doing and we will be leading them back to the massacre site there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3550;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiya yuŋkȟáŋ íŋyaŋ kiŋ iwáštegla kȟáta čha héktakiyata thimá gličúpi čha ób wačhéwakiye naháŋke lé pȟahá kiŋ lená yuhá wačhéwakhiyiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ lé wikȟóškalaka kiŋ lé é čha átaya čhéya iyáyiŋ naháŋke, “Neva, misákhib mayánaŋkiŋ kta kéha yuŋkȟáŋ kákhiya mičhíŋča kiŋ yaŋké kiŋ ektá héčhiya naŋké.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3551> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There, and so the rocks got hot softly so they came back inside so I prayed with them and then I prayed with those rocks and so it was a young women who began crying and then she said, “Neva, you said that you would sit beside me and so you’re sitting there where my son is sitting.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3551;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhiŋčá kiŋ hé él úŋ šni škȟá heyá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Her son wasn’t there but she said that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3552;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čha, “tókša aníčisni kte kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3553> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said that so I said, “soon you will be alright again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3553;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wačhékiye é,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3554> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “pray.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3554;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókȟa šni kštó, tuwéni ksúyeniyiŋ kte šni kštó,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3555> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said, “don’t be worried, nobody is going to hurt you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3555;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha waŋná uŋkígluštaŋpi él, ká Čhasmú Wakpá héčhi Lakȟóta óta wičháktepi čha, héčhiya héktakiya hená awíčhauŋkipi na, ȟtáyetu eháŋn, uŋkíhuŋnipi na, áta waŋná ká owíčhakte kiŋ isáŋmya héčhiya oínažiŋ waŋ háŋ čha, ektá uŋkhínažiŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, átaya tȟaté tȟáŋka hí na, áta čháŋ kiŋ hená kawéǧiŋ kte s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3556;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3556> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then upon us finishing, at Sand Creek they killed many Lakota there, so we brought them back there, and when it was evening, we got there, and a parking lot was a little ways away from the massacre site there, so we stopped there, and so a really heavy wind came, and it seemed like the trees were going to break by bending over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3556;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta kawíŋšwiŋžiŋ na tókhel okíhika tȟaté kiŋ waš’áke čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were really bending over and the wind was as strong as possible."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiyóblečha waŋ pawóslal iyéyapi kiŋ hé áta kaúŋkiŋ kte s’eléčheča éyaš, iníhaŋšni thimá maŋkíŋ na, wól maŋká-he."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It felt like the square tent that they set up was going to cave in, but I sat inside without worrying, and I sat eating."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wíŋkčekče tȟaŋkál wanáǧi kiŋ ománipi éyaš maŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the spirits were walking around outside but I was sitting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3560> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iyé lená kȟokípȟapi na, átaya lé čhethípi na héčhel ókšaŋ yaŋkápi na ečhél aáŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3560;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3560> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they were scared of them, and they made a fire, and in that way they sat around it until the morning."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3560;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha waŋná hepȟé, “mayúȟiča pe, lé áŋpaó wičháȟpi kiŋ lé hinápȟe šni háŋni, mayúȟiča pe, lená uŋkígluštaŋpi kte kštó,” epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then I said, “wake me up, before the morning star rises up, wake me up, we will finish this.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I said that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná áŋpaó wičháȟpi kiŋ hé hinápȟiŋ kta kaítȟokabya áta ablákela na áta áinila-haŋ čha, mayúȟiča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then before the morning was about to arise, it was all calm out and it was quiet, so she woke me up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wékta na, héčhena héktakiya lé owíčhakte kiŋ hé étkiya máni uŋyáŋpi na, ektá uŋkíhuŋnipi na, makȟá k’awíčhawakhiyiŋ na, áta pȟežíȟota owíŋšwičhawakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I woke up, and we still went walking back to the massacre site, and we arrived there, and I let them dig up the earth, and I spread white sage all on the floor."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhamuŋ na, lé pȟahá kiŋ lená é čha, nuŋphíŋ mahél iyéwičhauŋyaŋpi na, wačhéwakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I did that, and we put both of those scalps there, and I prayed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé wačhékiya wičháša kiŋ hé wiwáŋyaŋg wačhí čha, wakȟíŋ na, epȟé, “wiwáŋyaŋg wayáčhi kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I addressed that pastor who was a sundancer, and I said, “you are a sundancer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ lé ičú na yuhá wačhékiya yé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Take this pipe and pray with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená héčhel wólakȟota uŋkáǧapi kiŋ wóokiye uŋyúhapi kte kštó.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way we will live peaceful having made peace.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyaš hé iyótaŋȟčiŋ tókhiyani yá okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he he couldn’t go anywhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta wanáǧi kiŋ hótȟaŋiŋpi čha nawíčhaȟ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He heard the spirits speak."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha waŋná hé čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ ičú na, wačhékiye čha wahéhaŋyeš áŋpaó wičháȟpi kiŋ waŋná hinápȟa yuŋkȟáŋ, áta lé wačhékiya nážiŋ kiŋ iwáŋkabya éwatuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, ziŋtkála núŋm kiŋyáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then he took that pipe, and he prayed so just at about that time the morning star came up, and then I looked up at him standing there praying, and so two birds flew by."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átaya pȟéičhiagleya nážiŋpi na átaya maȟpíya ektá waŋkáta kiŋyáŋpi čha. and they flew upwards towards the sky."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They stopped with their heads all together"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟamágle ináwažiŋ na, wačhéwakiyiŋ na, epȟé, “tȟuŋkášila, waŋná hená wičháuŋgloglipi čha, taŋyáŋ íŋš asníkiyapi kte na, taŋyáŋ tákuni tókȟašniyaŋ okáblaya tȟaóyate kiŋ ób úŋpi kta,” képȟa wačhéwakiya yuŋkȟáŋ, lé ziŋtkála kiŋ henáos kiŋyáŋpi k’uŋ lé wačhékiya wičháša kiŋ lé kákhel iglúštaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, ziŋtkála kiŋ kaítȟanuŋgya kiŋyáŋ iyáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I stood with my head bowed, and I prayed and I prayed saying, “grandfather, we’ve now brought them back to you, so they will rest, and they will leave well and freely with their people with no problems at all,” and so the pastor finished, both of the birds flying, and so the birds flew away on both sides."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kiŋyáŋ iyáyapi yuŋkȟáŋ, hé uŋmá wičháša na uŋmá hokšíla čha hé pȟahá wičháyuzapi čha hená é čha wičháuŋȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They flew away, and then there was another man and another boy so they burried those scalps that they grabbed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha áta líla aŋpétu wašté uŋyúhapi na, héčhiyataŋhaŋ yuphíya uŋkúpi na, léčhiya uŋglípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we had a very good day, and we got back from there well, and we arrived back here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé wówapi waŋ káǧapi čha, hél eháke hékta yubláyapi tóna kiŋ él owápi čha hél oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they wrote a book, so they talk about that reading at the end."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówapi kiŋ hé Songs of Sorrow eyápi k’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That book is called Song of Sorrow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuwá čhet’úŋmagla háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé yawá kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if somebody doubts me, read that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3604> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé táku waŋží iwówaglakiŋ kte kiŋ hé 1918 mniwáŋča kȟowákataŋ okíčhize na, héčhiyataŋhaŋ wazílyapi yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhiya hihúŋni na, oyáte óta héčhel sótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3604;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3604> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Something that I’ll be talking about, there was a war on the other side of the ocean in 1918, and they burned things from there, and so it came here, and many people died like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3604;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ húŋȟ thiwáhe átaya kiníl héčhel sótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3605;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3605> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so some people in almost all families died like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3605;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3606> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héhaŋ tȟuŋkášila kiŋ ní uŋ čha, héčhel uŋčí tȟuŋkášila kičhí čhiŋčá ótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3606;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3606> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so back then, because my grandfather was alive, my grandmother had a lot of children with my grandfather."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3606;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhiŋčá wikčémna na hé uŋčíwaye kiŋ čhiŋčá núŋpa čha akénuŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3607;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3607> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There were ten children and that grandmother of mine had two children so there were twelve."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3607;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átaya-kel akénuŋm wičháyuhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3608;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3608> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There were twelve all in all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3608;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3609> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná lé héhaŋ átaya maȟpíya kiŋ zí škhé naháŋ, wičhókhuže naháŋ, aŋpétu iyóhila owáčhekiye kiŋ lená wakáȟlapi na, hená wičháȟapi naháŋ iyótaŋš wíŋyaŋ eyá iglúš’akapi k’uŋ hená wičhókhuže kiŋ lé ičúpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héhaŋ iháŋkepi héčhel óta héhaŋ t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3609;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3609> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then back then it’s said that the whole sky was yellow, and there was a pandemic, and every day they rang church bells, and they burried them and if some of the women who far into their pregnancies got the sickness, back then many of them would die from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3609;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3610> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3610;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3610> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s what they say."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3610;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟuŋkášilawaye kiŋ lé pȟežúta kiŋ lená slolyá čha, iyáyiŋ na, pȟežúta tóna héčhel yužúŋ na, aglí na, hená héčhel hutkȟáŋ kiŋ hená héčhel húŋȟ waksáksiŋ na, hená áta čhéǧa tȟáŋka waŋ uŋ mní okáštaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so my grandfather knew the medicines, so he left, and pulled up several medicinal plants, and he came back with them, and he cut up the roots, and he poured water into a big pot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená áta piȟyíŋ na, héčhel íčat’a piȟyíŋ na, sniyáŋ égle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He boiled all those things, and in that way he really boiled them thoroughly, and he laid them down cold."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na lená átaya ȟpáyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it’s said they all laid there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khúžapi čha ȟpáyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were sick so it’s said they laid down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená iyóhila wíyatke iyóžugžula héčhel wičhák’u."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He filled all the cups like that giving them to them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená iyúha héčhel ečháwičhakičuŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, iyúha niwíčhakhiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that for all of them like that, and so it’s said that he saved them all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na uŋmá thiwáhepi kiŋ lená tókhi héčhuŋpi šni čha, húŋȟ t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the other families might have not done that, so some of them died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta oyáte óta héčhel sótapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Many Lakota people died in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wičhóoyake kiŋháŋ uŋčíwaye kiŋ lená omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My grandmother told me that story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ináwaye kiŋ lé omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And my mother told me it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hená waŋná él úŋpi šni éyaš, oíyepi k’uŋ hená héčhel."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so now they aren’t around, but their words are like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋȟčiŋ ní nážiŋpi kiŋ iyéčheča hená aŋpétu waŋžígži hé eyášna wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I remember, often on some days, like they were still standing here alive."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ úŋšikapi éyaš, táku héčhel eyá waštéšte slol’úŋyaŋpi k’uŋ lená uŋ táku uŋkókihipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And Lakota people are in need, but we accomplish things through us having known those sort of good things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átaya ȟčiŋ tóna wičákȟeya wičálapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some truly and completely believe."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená Lakȟóta wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ sutáya gluhá nážiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They live holding strongly on to Lakota traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená líla waštépi na hená wóphila héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those are very good people and they’re something to be thankful for."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku waŋží aŋpétu waŋ él waŋbláka čháŋ, miíšta uŋ waŋblákiŋ na hé é čha owáglakiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One day whenever I saw something, I saw it with my eyes and it is that that I’ll talk about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heháŋl wičháša waŋ kičhí waúŋ kiŋ hé ní úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so at the time the man that I lived with was alive."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha eyášna húŋku thí ektá, húŋku kiŋ thí hé na uŋthípi kiŋ íčhikȟaŋyela čha, eyášna héčhiya máni uŋkípi na, akhé šna máni uŋglípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we often got to his mom’s house, his mom’s house and our house were close to each other, by walking, and often we came back home walking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhiya uŋkípi naháŋ, wóuŋk’upi čha, hél waúŋyutapi na, ób wóglag uŋyáŋka-haŋpi na, waŋná tókhi haŋčhókaŋyaŋ kȟaŋyéla héčhiyataŋ máni uŋkúpi éyaš, waníyetu háŋtu éyaš, haŋósni šni na, wá yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so we got there, and she gave us food, so we ate there, and we were chatting with them, and then around midnight we were walking back close from there, but it was winter, but it wasn’t a cold night, and there was snow on the ground."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiyataŋhaŋ hél thí kiŋháŋ ilázataŋhaŋ aíyoȟpeya čha, hél ogná iyé tȟokáheya gliyóȟpayiŋ na, čhokáŋgnagya ósmaka s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he came downhill first from there on the hill behind the house, and it was as if there was a dip in the middle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé hél kú wahéhaŋl, míš waŋná waglíyoȟpaye kiŋ waléhaŋl, uŋgnáhelaka áta iyóyaŋpa waŋ héčhel aóuŋžaŋžaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Around when we were getting back there, about when I came down from the hill, suddenly there was a light all on us like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ožáŋžaŋ kiŋ hé átaya miméla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that light was all in a circle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Máni kú kiŋ héčhena aóžaŋžaŋ kú na, míš-eyá héčhel wakú na, hé ikȟówakataŋ él thípi waŋ uŋkíčičaǧapi čha hél eháŋni uŋyáŋkapi tkȟá, ho hél uŋglípi na, hél čhethí na, tókhiŋš iwóuŋglakapi kte s’eléčheča yuŋkȟáŋ, “slolyáya hé tókheča kiŋ” epȟá yuŋkȟáŋ, “háŋ,” eyíŋ na, héhaŋ átaš iwóglaka čhíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The light shown on him while he came walking, and I came too like that, and from over that way we sat at the house that they had built for us a long time ago, but we got back there, and he built a fire, and I thought we would talk about it [but we didn’t] and I said, “do you know what happened,” and so he said, “yeah,” and he didn’t want to talk about it then at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé táku waŋží leháŋl šna watóhaŋšna wéksuye kiŋ hé tákuwe čha hé waŋkáta éwatuŋwe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3643> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And something that sometimes I remember today is why I didn’t look up at it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3643;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho ečháŋmi s’a táku čha aíyouŋyaŋpapi héči maȟpíya ečhíyataŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3644> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I think if that the thing that shown on us was from the sky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3644;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé eyášna iblúkčaŋ s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3645> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I often think about that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3645;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho iyé átaš iwóglaka čhíŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he didn’t want to talk about it at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Haŋhépi waŋ él héčhel eháŋni oyáte kiŋ tȟaŋkáyapi kiŋ hé makhíkčeya tȟaŋkáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3667;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3667> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One night, a long time ago the people going to the bathroom like that, they went to the bathroom on the ground."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3667;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3668> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhel héčhuŋpi kiŋ slolwáye šni éyaš, oíheye thípi hé glépi na, kȟoháŋ héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3668;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3668> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I don’t know why they did that, but they set up that outhouse, and meanwhile they did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3668;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ináwaye kiŋ tȟaŋkáya čhíŋ na yeámapȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3669;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3669> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so my mother wanted to use the bathroom and she asked me to go along with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3669;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná íyutaka čha waŋbláke kiŋ waléhaŋl, ižáŋžaŋ waŋ, gas lamp eyápi čha leháŋl wašíču kiŋ yuhápi yuŋkȟáŋ, héčha waŋží iléyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, áta ȟmuŋyéla hé yuŋkȟáŋ, hé ée-ȟči, táku waŋ ȟmuŋyéla ú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3670;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3670> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then about when I saw her sit down, white people have a lamp, a gas lamp, and so if something like that was burning, then it was there really hissing, and so it was really it, something came by hissing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3670;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha él éwatuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, mítȟokab léčhel tȟápa čha tȟó s’eléčheča čha, ižáŋžaŋ héčhel ȟmuŋyéla makȟá etáŋ iwátohaŋn, hiyáyiŋ na, héčhena iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3671;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3671> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I looked at it, and so it was like there was a ball that was blue like that in front of me, so at about the time that it was hissing from the ground like that, it went by, it was going."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3671;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ eháŋni íš tȟuŋkášilawičhawayela na atéwičhawaye heháŋyaŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lé táku kiŋ hé lé oyákapi kiŋ hé, tukté él makȟóčhe waŋ él wígli yaŋké háŋtaŋhaŋ, hé táku kiŋháŋ waŋyáŋkapi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3672;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3672> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a long time ago the telling of this happening as goes for my grandpas and my fathers, if oil sits somewhere in the ground, they will see that thing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3672;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha taku kiŋ slolwáye šni éyaš, tokȟáš héčhetu séče lepčé ȟče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3673;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3673> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I didn’t know that thing, but I think that this might be true."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3673;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3674> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyášna hená leháŋl waŋná waníyetu maóta naháŋ tákuni owákihi šni éyaš tuktéktel šna maŋká čha wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ lená héktakiya hená kiksúya maŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3674;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3674> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Often nowadays then I’m old and I can’t do anything but sometimes I sit so I sit remembering back to that happening."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3674;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená táku úŋ lé ečháŋmi s’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3675;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3675> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I often think what those things were."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3675;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3676> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná waléhaŋl wahínažiŋ kiŋháŋ awábleza héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3676;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3676> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so around now when I’m this age, I realize it is true."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3676;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3677> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wičhóoyake kiŋ ečhíyataŋhaŋ: wakpá waŋ hé opȟáya itȟánuŋg makhíyutȟapi núŋmnuŋm wahéčhetuya wígli yaŋká kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3677;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3677> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "As regards this story: the oil sits about two miles along both sides of the river"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3677;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3678> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel oyákapi čha tokȟáš hé é čha uŋ lé waŋúŋyaŋkapi séče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3678;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3678> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They tell it like that so maybe it was using that that we might have seen it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3678;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wichóoyake kiŋháŋ héčhel lekšíwaye waŋží lé omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3714> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My uncle told me this story like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3714;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3715> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ makȟá tȟéhaŋ héčhel ománi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3715;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3715> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he travelled for a long tim on the land."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3715;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átayaš makhíyutȟapi wikčémna záptaŋ wahéčhetu načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3716> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was about fifty miles."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3716;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahéčhetuya iyótiyekiya makȟá máni héčhiya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3717> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He had a hard time travelling around there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3717;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíču kiŋ lé wówaši ečhákičuŋ s’a čha, héčhi í na, héčhi okó núŋm ú na, héčhi wówaši ečhákičuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3718> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He often worked for a white man, so he got there, and he was going for two weeks, and he worked for him there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3718;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wókažužu kič’úŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3719> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he gave him a paycheck."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3719;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha akhé héčhiyataŋhaŋ híŋhaŋniyela-ȟčiŋ mní iglúha na héčhiyataŋ kú kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3720> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he had water from there again really early in the morning and he was coming back from there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3720;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wótiŋ na héčhel kú kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3721> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He ate and he was coming back like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3721;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná mní iyúha hená glatkáŋ-haŋ čha waŋná áta glaȟépa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3722> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then he was drinking all of that water of his so then he absolutely drank it up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3722;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ kȟáŋšnišniyela héčhel wiwíla waŋ él glihúŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he unexpectedly arrived at a spring like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hél glihúŋni ho héhaŋ, waŋná mní kiŋ, wiwíla mní kiŋ, lená líla oyátke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So when he arrived there, then he really drank the water, the spring water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašté naháŋ líla mní kiŋ sní héčhel."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was good and the water was really cold like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wičhótȟawačhiŋ kiŋ él hiyú kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Something crossed his mind."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ táku waŋží kiksúya hiŋglé kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so suddenly he remembered something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wiwíla kiŋ hé tuwéni héčhel ígmuha yatkíŋ kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nobody should drink from a spring with their lips."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-s’e oyákapi kiŋ hé kiksúya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He remembered that they said it just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké lé žaŋžáŋ waŋ ogná mní iglúha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he had his water in a bottle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé waŋná henála čha, ipágmuŋg ičú na, ožúla čha yuhá íyutakiŋ na, mní hé yatkáŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There wasn’t any left then, so he dipped it in, and he sat with it filling it up, and he drank the water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mní hé yatkáŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhel wiwíla kiŋ óhuta etáŋ héčhel tuwá khiŋíŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He drank that water, and so somebody threw something at him from the edge of the spring."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hú akáŋl apȟá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it hit him on the leg."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hučhóǧiŋ hé wahétuktel apȟá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It hit him around his calf."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé glí na, ihíŋhaŋni yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhel hú él apȟápi hé héčhel yazáŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he came back from there, and when it was the morning, his leg was hurt where it was hit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na poyá híyutaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It swelled up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ héčhel pó úŋ hé napȟópa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it burst open with the swelling."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé oȟlógyahe kiŋ hé tóhaŋni naókhiyutȟe šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that wound never closed up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé tȟaŋkátaŋhaŋ iglói kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he took himself outside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiya héčhel hená asníwičhayapi okíhipi čha, ho hé Nebraska na lé South Dakota él ithímahetu čha héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they cure people there, so it’s that way inside of Nebraska or South Dakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ pȟežúta waŋ k’úpi yuŋkȟáŋ lé hú él oȟlógyahaŋ hé naókhiyutȟa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they gave him a medicine and so the wound on his leg healed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé táku waŋží oyákapi kiŋ hé, wiwíla kiŋ hená mní óhuta él wičháša eyá čikčík’ala úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So something they tell about, at the edge of the spring’s water some little men live there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-s’e oyákapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They tell it just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená toháŋl wí mahíyaye hé itȟókab, hená tȟaŋíŋič’iyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And before the sun goes down, they show themselves."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-s’e oyákapi čha kiksúya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He remembered that they told it just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé wí mahíyayiŋ kte-haŋ hél glíyutakiŋ na, mní ipágmuŋg ičú na, yatké éyaš, tuwá khiŋíŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3746> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The sun was about to be going down, and he dipped it in the water, and he drank it, but somebody threw something at him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3746;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wičháša hená waŋwíčhayaŋke šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3747> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He didn’t see those men."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3747;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé iŋšé wičhóoyake héčhuŋ-s’e akhípȟa na, waŋyáŋkiŋ na, slolyá čha, hená ogláka čha, mitȟá-mother kiŋ hé kičhíwičhowe čha lená wičhóuŋ táku slolyé k’uŋ hená okíyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3748> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that story happened to him just like that, and he saw it, he knew it, so he told it, so my mother was siblings with him, so he told her what he knew about those ways of life."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3748;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha etáŋ lená nawáȟ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3749> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I heard some of these."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3749;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé é čha iŋšé lé aŋpétu kiŋ oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3750> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it is this that I’ll tell today."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3750;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wičhóoyake kiŋ lé atéwaye kiŋháŋ omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My father told me this story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ eháŋni tȟéča ho héhaŋ, šuŋgwátȟogla akáŋyaŋka kéye eyášna."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a long time ago when he was young, he rode wild horses, often."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš tuktélšna šuŋgkáuŋspe-šipi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3779;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or sometimes they told him to break it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3779;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená ečhúŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ otȟúŋwahe waŋ South Dakota ithímahel yaŋké Edgemont eyápi čha hél rodeo čha héčhiya í kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there is a town inside South Dakota that’s called Edgemont where he arrived at the rodeo."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ šuŋgwátȟogla akáŋyaŋkapi él ópȟa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he participated in bronco riding."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iyéič’iyiŋ na, šúŋkawakȟáŋ kiŋ lé tókhi líla yeíč’iyiŋ na, agláskil gliȟpáyiŋ na, atéwaye kiŋháŋ héčhel t’á kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he jumped on it, and the horse really might have bucked hard, and it fell on top of him, and my father died like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhi toháŋ t’á načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe he died."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ íčhignuniyaŋ ókawiŋta é hé kiŋ él Lakȟóta kiŋ héčhi wiwáŋyaŋg aí na, éthipi kiŋ hél waŋží héčhel Lakȟóta waphíya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so in the meanwhile it was in the crowd that Lakota people arrived to Sundance, where they camped there was a Lakota medicine woman like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Lakȟóta waphíye kiŋ lé matȟó waphíye eyápi héčha kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this Lakota medicine woman was what they call a bear healer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé phiyíŋ na, pȟežúta k’ú yuŋkȟáŋ, phiyíŋ kta čha, pȟežúta kȟalkhíya yuŋkȟáŋ, hé íčhignuniyaŋ táku waŋ waŋyáŋke kiŋ hé t’á ȟpáye ičhúŋhaŋ, héčhel čhaŋógnaka waŋ ȟpáya kiŋ čha étkiya paslóhaŋ áyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she cured him, and she gave him medicine, and so she would heal him, so she heated it up, and so while he laid dead seeing something, they were pushing a casket along towards where he was lying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé čhaŋógnaka kiŋ hé ogná éuŋpapi kta čha hé uŋ, čhaŋógnaka paslóhaŋ áyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were going to put him into the casket, so for that reason they were pushing a casket along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahéhaŋl pȟežúta kiŋ lé k’ú yuŋkȟáŋ kiní kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At around that time she gave him this medicine and so he came back to life."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé wíŋyaŋ čha hé Lakȟól waphíya, matȟó waphíya čha, hé atéwaye kiŋ lé pȟežúta kiŋ lé niyá čha hé eyášna uŋ phikíla wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé kiksúya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was that woman who was a Lakota medicine woman, a bear healer, so my father breathed in this medicine so he remembered this woman often thanking her for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lé obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is what I wanted to tell."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mary Light emáčiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My name is Mary Light."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha leháŋl héktakiya líla táku eháŋni ečhúŋk’uŋpi kiŋ hená owáglakiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So today I will talk about what they did way back in the day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni šúŋkawakȟáŋ wičháuŋyuhapi na hená uŋ wígni uŋkómanipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the old days they had horses and we foraged with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tuktélšna ptektépi našná, pus’úŋkiyapi naháŋ, waníyetu ópta šna hená uŋyútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And sometimes they killed buffalo, and we usually made provisions, and throughout the winter we would often eat those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ nakúŋ čhaŋpȟá na, táku yušpípi kiŋ hená pusyápi na, hená nakúŋ uŋ waníyetu ópta hená yúl uŋyáŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3828;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And also we dried the chokeberries, and things that we gathered, and also we sat eating those things throughout the winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3828;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3829> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná ptektépi na, hená tȟaló kiŋ óhiŋniyaŋ taŋyáŋ kablápi na, pusyápi na, nakúŋ waníyetu ópta šna hená yúl uŋyáŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3829;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3829> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now they killed buffalo, and they always jerked the meat well, and they dried it out, and also they sat eating those things throughout the winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3829;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ ptaŋyétu čháŋna šna, heháŋl íš tókhiškhiya blopáhipi naíŋš, táku héčhel igní ománipi naháŋ, waníyetu ópta hená oyáte kiŋ iyúha taŋyáŋ úŋ nípi yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3830;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3830> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And during spring, then they picked potatoes in all sorts of places, or they walked around looking for things like that, and throughout the winter the people sat living well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3830;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na akhé ptaŋyétu čháŋna šna hená hé iyúha ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3831;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3831> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And during the fall they do all those things again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3831;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3832> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kičhíčhopi na hená iyópteya wóyute kiŋháŋ uŋkíčhič’upi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3832;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3832> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They invitde each other and gave the food across to each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3832;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3833> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená héčhel oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3833;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3833> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those things are what I’ll tell."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3833;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3844> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl tókheškhe pápa káǧapi kiŋ hé oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3844;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3844> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then I’ll tell about how they made jerky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3844;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé tȟokéya ptebléška kiŋ wičháktepi na wapȟátapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "First they killed cattle and they butcher."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl tȟaló kiŋ hé kablápi na taŋyáŋ pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they jerk that meat and they dry it well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl púza čháŋna šna, pápa kiŋ hé tókhel hená waštúŋkala hé ičáhiya oháŋpi naíŋš, tókhel bló naíŋš wašíŋ ikčéka ičáhiya uŋ waháŋpi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3847> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then whenever it’s dry, in some way they cook jerky mixing it with dried sweetcorn, or in some way they make soup by mixing potatoes or tallow with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3847;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ ho hé nakúŋ pápa kiŋ hé uŋ tókhel wasná káǧapi kte kiŋ hé, pápa kiŋ hé púze háŋtaŋhaŋš, taŋyélaȟčiŋ kapȟápi na heháŋl, wašíŋ ikčéka hé šloyápi naháŋ, hená uŋ wasná káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3848> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And also if the pemmican they would make, if the jerky was dry in some way, they would thoroughly pound it, and then they fry the tallow, and they make pemmican with those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3848;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ hé waŋná wasná kiŋ heháŋyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3849> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And that’s all for the pemmican."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3849;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ hé pápa kiŋ tókhel bló owás’iŋ naháŋ, wagmú waskúpi na, waštúŋkala na, pápa kiŋ hená iyúha owás’iŋyaŋ iȟ’áŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also in some way they cook all the jerky, and potatoes, and peeled squash, and dried sweet corn, and jerky together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé pápa kiŋ heháŋyela oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s all that I’ll say about jerky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl wagmíza skuyá kiŋ hé uŋ tókheškhe iȟ’áŋpi kiŋ hé oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now I will tell about how how they cook with sweet corn."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokéya wagmíza kiŋ hená owátohaŋyela lolóbyapi na, tȟaŋkál mniȟúha šóka waŋží él hená yubláyapi na, pusyápi na, ho heháŋl púza čháŋna, hená uŋ waštúŋkala káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "First they boil the corn for a little while until its soft, and they lay it out flat on a canvas outside, and they dry it, and then whenever it’s dry, they make dried sweet corn out of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl wagmíza wasná nakúŋ hé káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they make corn pemmican, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wagmíza kiŋ hená yukpáŋpi na wígli ikčéka naháŋ čhaŋháŋpi hená ičáhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They grind the corn and they mix tallow and sugar with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ hé waštúŋkala kiŋ iȟ’áŋpi na, tȟaníǧa kȟó ičáhiyapi na, hená waštúŋkala waháŋpi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they cook that dried sweet corn, and they also mix tripe with it, and they make dried sweet corn soup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha hená heháŋyela oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all that I have to say about those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl čhaŋpȟá yušpípi naháŋ wasná káǧapi kiŋ hená oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they pick chokeberries and I will talk about the pemmican they make."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokáheya čhaŋyáta ípi na, čhaŋpȟá kiŋ hená yušpípi na, aglípi na heháŋl, yužážapi na heháŋl, kaškípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "First of all they get out in the woods, and they pick those chokeberries, and they get back home with them, and then they wash them, and then they mash them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋyaŋ čhaŋpȟá ičáškipi uŋ čhaŋpȟá kiŋ kaškípi na heháŋl, yubláya, pusyápi na ohákab, púza čháŋna šna, ho heháŋl wóžapi uŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They mash the chokeberries with a cherry pounding stone, and then they lay them out flat, they dry them, and afterwards when they’re dry, they make chokecherry pudding."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóžapi kiŋ aǧúyapiblú čónala ičáhiyapi na čhaŋháŋpi héčhuŋ-s’e káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They mix a little flour with the chokeberry pudding and they make sugar just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋl hé wóžapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then it’s called chokeberry pudding."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl hé wašíŋkčeka čha hená šloyápi naháŋ wígli kiŋ hé é na čhaŋháŋpi ičáhiyapi héčhuŋ-s’e hená wasná kiŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then it’s tallow that they melt and they make pemmican by mixing fat and sugar just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená wóyute kiŋ hé waníyetu wóyute héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s food that’s eaten during winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná heháŋl kȟáŋta kiŋ hé nakúŋ íŋš iyéčhelya pusyápi naháŋ hená wóžapi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3899;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now then they also dry plums in the same way and they make chokeberry pudding."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3899;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maštíŋčaphuté kiŋ hená nakúŋ íŋš iyéčhelya taŋyáŋ kaslíslipi naháŋ, yumímeyela pusyápi naháŋ, púze kiŋ čha íŋš-eyá héčhuŋ-s’e wóžapi káǧapi na, héčhuŋ-s’e íŋš-eyá hená waníyetu ópta yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They press and press buffalo bears in just the same way, and they dried them in a round way, and being dry they also made pudding just like that, and they also ate that throughout the winter just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhuŋwíyaphehe kiŋ hená íŋš-eyá čhaŋyáta yušpípi naháŋ, hé iyéčhelya yužážapi naháŋ, pusyápi na, waníyetu ektá wóžapi káǧapi naháŋ, hená héčhuŋ-s’e waníyetu wóyute héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They also picked grapes from the forest, and they washed them in the same way, and they dried them, and in the winter they made pudding, and in that very way it was food for winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé aŋpétu kiŋ tókhel Lakȟóta kiŋ wóyute káǧapi na, waníyetu ektá hená ékignakapi na, waníyetu yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3905> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Today the way in which the Lakota make food, and how they store it during winter, and how they eat it in winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3905;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená wóyute kiŋ é čha oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3906> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those foods are what I’ll talk about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3906;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟokáheya tȟaló pusyápi na, pápa káǧapi naíŋš, wapúsyapi kiŋ lená tȟaníǧa, na tȟašúpa naíŋš phí na tȟačháǧu na tȟačháŋta kiŋ lená kablápi naíŋš, čhosyápi. ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3907> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So first they dry the meat, and they make jerky, or that preserved food is tripe, and they preserve intestines or liver and lungs and heartby drying it in the sun, or they jerk it"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3907;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ptebléška kiŋ lé ktépi na, átaya tȟaló kiŋ hená okhíŋyaŋke hená ogná waksápi na, hená é čha kablápi na, wakáblapi kiŋ líla háŋskaska káǧapi na, sáta čha glakíŋyaŋ tuktél aíyakaškapi naháŋ, hél akáŋ pápa kiŋ lená aíyaȟpeyapi na, čhaŋpȟáhu sákala čha lená hél ipátȟake tȟúŋpi na, pusyápi héčhuŋpi na, yuptáŋptaŋ iȟpéya pusyápi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3908> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they kill the cow, and they cut the meat with grooves in the tissues, and that is what they jerk, and they make those long pieces of meat that were jerked, and it’s a rigging pole so they lay them across it in some way, and they throw that jerky on it there, and they’re green chokeberries, so they put them on a bracing stick, and they dry them, and that’s why they flip them over and over while drying them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3908;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuphíya púze hátaŋhaŋš, hená ičúpi naháŋ, lé tȟahá wókapȟaŋ héčhiya mahél iyéyapi na, hená waníyetu waékiglepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3909> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If it is nicely dried, they take it, and they put them there into hide parfleche bags, and they set those things aside for winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3909;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná tȟaníǧa kiŋ hé íŋš áta yužážapi na, tȟašúpa kiŋ húŋȟ hená paéčhiyapi naháŋ, owóhe waŋží él čhéǧa waŋží ektá hená piȟyápi naháŋ, š’éš’eya ǧéǧeya otkéyapi čha, hená čhosyápi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3910> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then they clean all the trip, and they turn some of the intestines inside out, and they boil them in the kitchen in a pot, and they hang it up dripping, so that’s why they preserve it in the sun."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3910;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Púze háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená ošíče šni čha, héčhel pusyápi na, mahél iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3911> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If it’s dry, those make you feel bad, so they dry them like that, and they put them inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3911;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na tȟašúpa kiŋ hé íŋš húŋȟ kšaŋkšáŋ čha, hená póǧaŋpi na, itȟánuŋg iyákaškapi čha, héčhel póǧaŋpi na, héčhena púze čháŋšna, iyáyapi naháŋ, hená čháŋ čha kaíyapehaŋpi naháŋš čheúŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3912> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And some of the intestines wind around so they blow into them, and they tie them to each other on both sides, so they blow on them that way, and when they’re still dry they put them inside, and it’s a stick that they wind them around, and then they roast them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3912;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟéta kiŋ iwáŋkab čheúŋpapi na hé yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3913> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They roast them over a fire and eat it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3913;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tȟačháǧu kiŋ hé íŋš paȟlókapi na, héčhiya wašíŋkčeka mahél iyéyapi čháŋš, čhéuŋpapi čha, líla oyúl wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3914> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they also punch a hole in the intestine, and when they stick tallow inside it there, they cook it, so it tastes really good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3914;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tȟaphí kiŋ hé íŋš makȟá k’ápi na, pȟetáǧa ektá oíȟpeyapi na, lé tȟaphí kiŋ lé áta héčhi mahél oíȟpeyapi na, pȟetáǧa akšúpi na, áta yuphíya čhok’íŋpi čháŋšna, ikčéya wasléslel ičú yútapi na, ošíče šni héčhel iȟ’áŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3915> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they dig up that liver, and they throw it onto live coals, and they throw the whole liver right in there, and they pile live coals on it, and whenever they roast it really well in the ashes, they eat the sliced up ones, if they didn’t cook it badly like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3915;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tȟačháŋta kiŋ hé íŋš wasléslečapi na, héčhel pusyápi čha, iȟ’áŋpi kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená yuȟpápi na, tókhel wasléslečapi hená ičúpi na, iyóȟpeyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3916> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they cut up the heart, and they dry it like that, and if they’re about to cook it, they take it down, and they take the cut up parts, and boil it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3916;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš ló kiŋ héčhena húŋȟ tȟaló ipáečhiya eyápi čha héčhel tȟaló čha háŋskeya sósopi na, tȟašúpa kiŋ lé paéčhiyapi kiŋ okhíyakaškapi na, mní okáštaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3917> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or they say that they turn some of the tender meat inside out so it’s that meat that they cut into long skinny strips, and they tie the intestines that they turned inside out to each other, and they pour water on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3917;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tónakiya hé iyákaškapi na, héčhel hená iyóȟpeyapi čháŋna šna, mní mahél úŋ kiŋ hená waháŋpi káǧapi čha, hená yatkáŋpi, na iyáyustag iyáksa yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3918> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They tie it several times, and whenever they cook it like that, they make soup with water in it, so they drink that, and they eat it all together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3918;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hohú kiŋ hená é kayéš ičúpi na, hú hohú kiŋ hená kašléčapi čháŋšna, hená tȟačhúpa eyápi čha hená hetáŋ wígli hená ičúpi na, hená aǧúyapi ikášlutapi na, yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3919> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they even take the bones, and whenever they cut open the leg bones, they take fat from what’s called “bone marrow,” and they strike it off bread, and eat it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3919;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš uŋgná pápa káǧapi kiŋ lená kapȟápi čháŋšna, ektá ičáhiyapi na, hé yútapi na, lé hohú ókhihe kiŋ hená kašléšlečapi na, hená piȟyápi čháŋšna, wígli kiŋ hená akáŋ hiyú háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená ál’ataya kaǧépi na, ipáyeȟ ognákapi na, héčhel ipíȟyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3920> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or maybe whenever they pound the jerky that they made, they mix it with that, and they eat that, and they split open again and again the leg joints, and whenever they boil that, if fat comes from it, they skim all of it up, and they put it somewhere else, and they make it boil."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3920;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3921> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na ečhél wígli waníče háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená iȟpéyapi naháŋ, wígli kiŋ hená waȟpé waštémna ičáhiyapi čháŋšna, hená uŋ pȟehíŋ slakíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3921;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3921> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if there’s still no fat, they throw that on, and whenever they mix in some horsemint with it, they grease their hair with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3921;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na pȟá kiŋ íŋš hé ičúpi na, tȟačhéži na iyóȟa kiŋ lená nakúŋ hená piȟyápi na, pusyápi čha, toháŋn waníyetu kiŋ theȟí k’éyaš, tókhel ní yaŋkápi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3922> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they also boil and dry the taken the head, and the tongue and the jowl so it’s hard when winter comes but in some way they live through it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3922;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená ikíȟ’aŋpi na íŋš héčhel owólyala s’e yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3923> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They cook those things of theirs and in that way they sit with plenty of food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3923;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wagmíza nakúŋ hená čhosyápi čháŋšna, pusyápi čha, húŋȟ wagmíza kiŋ héčhena čhoǧíŋ ikȟóyagya súŋpi na, ǧéǧeya pusyápi, toháŋn iȟ’áŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3924> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever they cookcorn dry in the sun too, they dry it, so they braid some of the corn to the core, and they dry it by hanging it, if they cook it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3924;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš hé íyohakab šna yugnápi na, uŋmá hená íŋš waštúŋkala káǧapi čha, hená wagnápi naháŋ, iyóȟpeyapi naháŋ, líla špáŋšniyaŋ iyóȟpeyapi naháŋ, wágleyutapi akáŋ yubláya iȟpéyapi čháŋšna, hená pusyápi na hená waštúŋkala káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3925> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Usually after that they shake it off, and they make the others into dried sweet corn, so they cut them off, and they boil them and they boil them, so that they’re slighlty cooked, and whenever they throw them out flat on the table, they dry them, and they make dried sweet corn."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3925;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená íŋš-eyá waní-waékignakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3926> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they store them away for winter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3926;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš wagmú."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3927> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or squash."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3927;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wagmú zí čhaŋhá šóka hé é čha hená átaya kaskúskupi na, lé wagmú kiŋháŋ wasléslečapi na, íŋš-eyá héčhel wágleyutapi akáŋ pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3928> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So what they peel all up is the thick rind of a yellow squash, and they cut this squash into strips, and they also dry it out on a table just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3928;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš waŋží hená íŋš átaya okáwiŋȟ wasósospi na, wíkȟaŋ waŋží ičúpi na, čhokáŋ oyázapi na, yubláyapi čháŋšna, hená héčhel pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3929> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or they cut one of those into long circular strips, and they take a leather cord, and string it in the middle, and when they spread it out with the hands, they let it dry like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3929;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená ečhékčhe wóyute káǧapi naíŋš, waŋná waníyetu ektá hená ikíȟ’aŋpi kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená yuákaŋ ikíkčupi na, hená očhéthi kiŋ hél akáŋ hená iȟ’áŋ glépi čha, iyéčhiŋkala lolópela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3930> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in those ways they make those things into food, or then if they plan on cooking those things for someone during winter, they pull their things up, and they set it cooking on the firepit, so it becomes nice and soft on its own."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3930;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená tóhaŋni tákuni yusótapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3931> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they never use up anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3931;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená nakúŋ wóšpipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3932> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And also they gather berries."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3932;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Blokétu háŋtaŋhaŋš, wóšpipi na čhaŋpȟá hená áta yušpípi na, kaškípi na, pusyápi naháŋ íŋš-eyá hená mahél iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3933> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If it’s summer, then they gather berries, and they pick all those chokeberries, and they knock them down, and they dry them, and they stick them inside, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3933;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta yubláskaska hená égnakapi čháŋšna púze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3934> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When they lay down all the things that they flatten and flatten, it dries."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3934;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš kȟáŋta kiŋ hená ičúpi na eháŋni iŋšé wakȟáŋheža kiŋ kȟáŋta hená yaškíl-wičhakhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or they take those berries and in the old days they had the children squeeze it out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na sú kiŋ hená ȟeyáb iyéyapi eháŋtaŋhaŋš, sú čhóla hená pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if they threw the seeds to the side, then they let them dry without the seeds."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iŋšé leháŋn hená čhéǧa yuŋkȟáŋ čha, čhéǧa ektá oíȟpeyapi na, iyé toháŋn píǧiŋ na, áta napȟópe háŋtaŋhaŋ, šna kazépi na, sú kiŋ ȟeyáb iȟpéyapi na, héčhena hená pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays it’s just a pot, and so they throw them in the pot, and when it’s boiling, and if they all start to pop, often they ladle them out, and they throw the seeds to the side, and they still dry them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pusyápi čha iŋšé hená wóyute."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They dry them so they just are food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu čháŋ hená wóyute káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever it’s winter, they make that food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yužápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They cook it into a porridge."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iŋšé eháŋni čhaŋháŋpi waníča čha, wóyute kiŋ lená káǧapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, óta ičáhiyapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But in the old days there was no sugar, so if they made that food, they didn’t mix in a lot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená eháŋni héčhuŋpi šni na, eháŋni hená aǧúyapiblú ičáhiyapi éyaš, hená hé é čha waníče eháŋni čha, lé tȟahá kaȟ’úpi hená é čha uŋ wóžapi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They didn’t do those things a long time ago, and they mix it with flour a long time ago, but there wasn’t any of that a long time ago, so they made pudding by using what was scraped hide."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na iŋšé heháŋn tuwéni aǧúyapi yuhá šni čha, iŋšé lená lečhála wašíču kiŋ ahíyuweǧapi heháŋn nakéš aǧúyapiblú na khukhúše wašíŋ na wínakapo na haípažaža kiŋ lená wičhák’upi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And at that time nobody had just bread, so just recently white people crossed over the water and then they finally gave them flour and bacon and yeast and soap."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš hená táku kiŋ slolyápi šni čha úŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they didn’t know about those things so they didn’t use them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš eháŋni Lakȟóta kiŋ hená táku itéšniyaŋ wašté čha hená yútapi na, tákuni ikčéya íčhičahiyapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But a long time ago those Lakota ate what was really good, and they didn’t just mix anything together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na táku yútapi kiŋ hé tȟáȟča naíŋš tȟatȟáŋka na wahútopa čikčík’ala hená é tóna hená wičháyutapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And what they ate was deer and buffalo and small four-legged animals that they ate."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená ée, táku uŋmá hená šíča čha yútapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those are the things, they didn’t eat those other bad things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho tkȟá leháŋn táku k’éyaš, áta íčhižena káǧapi na, Lakȟóta kiŋ oyúlwičhakhiyapi čha, iyúha khúžapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But today the make everything all mixed together, and they make the Lakota eat those things, so they all are sick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhókhuže ečhéčapi na akísnipi okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They are infected with diseases and they can’t get better."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na hé tókhel pápa káǧapi kiŋ letáŋhaŋ wakápȟapi eyápi čha hená wašíŋkčeka čha, hená ičáhiyapi hé káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And from however they made that jerky is what they call pemmican, so that’s tallow that they make it by mixing it with."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ wasná čha hé íŋš pápa čha kapȟápi naháŋ, hé čhaŋpȟá čha hé íŋš-eyá íčhičahiyapi naháŋ, wašíŋkčeka na héčhel wasná káǧapi, íčhičahiya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it’s pemmican, it’s jerky that they pound, and it’s chokecherry that they mix into it too, and it’s tallow and in that way they make pemmican, mixing it with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn tuwéni hená ečhúŋ šni, hená iyúha čhaŋháŋpi ičáhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays nobody does that, they mix all those things with sugar."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku káǧapi kiŋ lená iyúha čhaŋháŋpi ičáhiyapi na, wíyukpaŋ čha uŋ hená yukpáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All those things that they make they mix with sugar, and it’s with a grinder that they grind those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé hená eháŋni íŋyaŋ eyá gmigméla čha él akáŋ wakáškipi naháŋ, íŋyaŋ imás’iyapȟa s’eléčheča hená uŋ kaškípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the old days it was just with some rocks that they ground those things with, and they ground them like that like it was a hammer."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn hená iyúha wíyukpaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ čha, hé yukpáŋ iyéyapi na, wágleyutapila kiŋ akáŋ iȟpéyapi naíŋš, wípusye yuŋkȟáŋ čha, haŋhépi ópta hená iyúha pusyápi na, mahél iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays it’s all grinders, so they find it ground, and they throw it on the table, or it’s a drier so throughout the night they dry all of it, and they put it inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé leháŋn wičhóuŋ kiŋ líla oȟ’áŋkȟo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays people’s lives go really fast."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni hená iyótiyekiya hená káǧapi čha, hená iyúha wóčhekiye ečhúŋpi na, hená gluónihaŋyaŋ mahél iyékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the old days it was hard to make those things, so they made all those prayers, and they respectfully put those things inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel oyáte kiŋ akiȟ’áŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way the people didn’t go hungry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn líla oyáte kiŋháŋ wašíču wičhóuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays the people live in a European way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha akíȟ’aŋpi naíŋš líla wičhókhuže čha šíča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they go hungry or there are very bad diseases."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3961> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lé isáŋm oblákiŋ kte éyaš, húŋȟ wéksuye šni, húŋȟ leháŋn čha hé toháŋn wéksuye kiŋ akhé húŋȟ oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3961;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3961> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will talk more about this, but I can’t remember some things, they’re somethings today that I will talk about when I remember some of them again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3961;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó lé ičínuŋpa kiŋ lé tȟahá káǧapi kiŋ hé é naíŋš tókhel wóilagyapi kiŋ hená oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So here now for the second time I will talk about how they made use of the hides they made."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho waŋná pté ktépi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená wóyute káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then if they killed the buffalo, they made it into food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na tȟahá kiŋ hé, ptebléška kiŋ hé há, yúzapi na, tȟahú kiŋ ognáyaŋ tȟakȟáŋ ȟpáya čha, hé yuslútapi naháŋ, yužážapi na, pak’óǧapi na, čháŋ waŋží kaíyaskabya pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they took the hide, that cow’s skin, and sinew lied along the neck, so they pulled it out, and they washed it, and they scraped it smooth, and they dried it by sticking it to a tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na tȟahá kiŋ hé ičúpi na, áta kašképapi naháŋ, yuzíl okátaŋpi na, pusyápi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héčhel híŋ kiŋ hená katkúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they took that hide, and they scraped it until it was dry, and they stretched it by nailing it, and if they dried it they shaved the hair like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ hé toháŋn katkúpi yuštáŋpi ehátaŋhaŋš, yuptáŋyaŋ iȟpéyapi naháŋ, uŋmáčhiyataŋhaŋ, tȟaló ečhíyataŋhaŋ, íŋš-eyá áta katkúpi na, tȟakȟáŋ naíŋš tȟaló táku él iyáskape kiŋ hená iyúha kaȟláyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever they finished shaving the hair, they’d turn it over and on the other side, the meaty side, they’d also shave the hair, and they’d peel off all the sinew or meat that was stuck to it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hó yuštáŋpi hátaŋhaŋš, iyáyapi na, tȟahá kiŋ hé áta tȟanásula čha, iyúŋpi na, átaya ipátȟaŋtȟaŋpi na, yuspáyapi ho na toháŋn hé áta kakpá iyáye háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho heháŋn ičúpi na, yužážapi ho na, yuškíčapi ho na, hé pȟežíkakse héčheča čháŋ ektá iyákaškapi, na ho hé é čha uŋ yuȟúŋtapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if they finished that, they went, and they applied brains to all the hide, and smeared it all on, and they wetted it, and so if it absorbed all that, then they took it, and they cleaned it, and they wrung it out, and they tied it to a sickle like that, and it was that that they softened by rubbing it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iwáštegla yuȟúŋn áyapi na ohómni okáwiŋȟ yuȟúŋta-haŋpi na, itȟánuŋgya áta ákhilečhelya yuȟúŋtapi čháŋšna, héčheš tukténi suksúta šni, áta héčhel íyakhilečhelya pȟaŋpȟáŋla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They gently went rubbing it until it was soft, and they went around rubbing it until it was soft all around, and whenever they rubbed it until soft in the same way on both sides, it was like that, until it wasn’t hard anywhere, it was really fragile like that on both sides."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hó čha héčhuŋpi na, héhaŋ hé tȟakȟáŋ kiŋ hé púze háŋtaŋhaŋš, yuȟláya ičúpi na, ho hená é čha yuslél ičúpi na, haȟúŋta káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they did that, and back then if that sinew was dry then they took it, and peeled it off, and it was those things that they took tearing lengthwise by hand, and they made it into twine."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟakȟáŋ kiŋ kazápi na, hená óta káǧapi ho na, hé égnakapi na, hená é čha uŋ áta pšitȟó kšúpi naíŋš, wóskapi pȟahíŋ óskapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They separated the sinew into strips, and they made a lot of them, and they laid it down, and it was with those that they beaded or made quillwork."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na toháŋn hená akáŋn tȟahá čikčík’a hená akáb’iyaye kiŋ hená íŋš-eyá táku čikčík’ala káǧapi na, wókapȟaŋ naíŋš míyožuha na, héčhekčhekel táku čikčík’ala hená káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they also made small things out of the leftovers of the small bits of hide, and those are parfleche bags or knife cases, and they made small things in those sort of ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ptebléška siŋté kiŋ hé ičúpi na, pablázapi na, yubláya yut’íŋš pusyápi čha, hená áta híŋ kiŋ katkúpi naháŋ, héčhel pȟahíŋ óskapi blaskáya watókhetuya óskapi čháŋšna, ho hél wíyaka núŋm aíyakaškapi čha, hé wapȟégnaka ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they took the cow’s tail, and they cut it open, and they dried it by setting it out flat, and tightening it so they peeled all the hair off of it, and in that way they embroidered about that much of it on the flat side with quillwork."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na uŋmá kiŋ lená čhuwígnaka káǧapi naíŋš tȟahá ógle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And with the others they made dresses or hide shirts."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ tȟaógle eyápi čha héčheča káǧapi naíŋš húŋska, tȟahá huŋská, naíŋš eyá hé wíŋyaŋ tȟahúŋska naháŋ, háŋpa naíŋš, eyá há tȟókeča čha, hená átaya sagyéla pusyápi na, púze háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená é čha waksápi naháŋ, haŋpsíčhu káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They called them Chiefs’ shirts, so they made those in that way, or they made leggings, hide leggings, or they made some leggings for women, and moccasins, or they dried others that were all different, until they were really stiff, and if it was dry, it was those that they cut, and made the pieces for a moccasin."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sičhúha hená káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They make the sole of the shoe with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš uŋgná haŋké čhaŋčhéǧa káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or maybe they make a drum with part of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋš-eyá táku héčhel wóilake uŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They also make something that’s useful in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé tȟahásaka kiŋ nakúŋ húŋȟ ičúpi naháŋ, sósopi naháŋ, yuspáyapi na, líla yut’ísya súŋpi čháŋšna, wíkȟaŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they also take some of that untanned hide, and they cut it into thin long strips, and whenever they weave them very tightly, they make a rope."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé é čha wíkȟaŋ káǧapi kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p3999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it is that that they made rope with."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=3999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená táku kiŋ iyúha há kiŋ hená wóilagyapi čha, Lakȟóta kiŋ tóhaŋni tákuni iȟpéyapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they made use of all those things of the hide, so Lakota people never threw anything away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku ptebléška na wamákȟaškaŋ etáŋ uŋ kiŋ iyúha wóilagyapi naháŋ, lé šaké kiŋ hená é kayéš piȟyápi na, hená waskúpi na, wanáp’iŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They made use of all those types of cows and some animals, and they even boiled the hooves, and they peeled them, and they made necklaces."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená šlašláyela nap’íŋpi čha, hená héčhel káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They wore those as jingling necklaces, so they made them in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičháša kiŋ nap’íŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The men wore them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha táku Lakȟóta wamákȟaškaŋ etáŋ uŋ kiŋ lená tákuni ikčéya iȟpéyapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Lakota people didn’t throw away things that come from animals without a good reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená iyúha wóilake káǧapi čha, leháŋtu éyaš, uŋgnáš takúŋn tuwá waŋyáŋke háŋtaŋhaŋš, šíča hečhíŋ na, iȟpéyapi éyaš, hená héčheča šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They made useful items of all those things, but nowadays maybe if someone sees something, they’ll think wrongly, and they’ll throw it away, but it shouldn’t be like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená iyúha wóilake čha úŋhaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All those thigns that we have are useful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená iŋšé eháŋni tȟahíŋšpa úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They just use the old awls."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená tȟahíŋšpa kiŋ hohú čha káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they made awls from bones."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená nakúŋ uŋ wakšúpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they also made beadwork using those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟahíŋšpa čha íŋš uŋ wakáyeǧepi éyaš, hená šikšíl’iyapi čha, hená obláka owákihi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s awls so they sew using them, but they talked dirty about them, so I can’t talk about those."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha uŋmá kiŋ lená ée, tȟahá kiŋ hená uŋgnáš wamákȟaškaŋ čík’ala kiŋ lená há kiŋ ičúpi naháŋ, wahíŋšma kiŋ lená uŋ húŋȟ háŋpa káǧapi na, ógle naíŋš wapȟóštaŋ naíŋš waháowiŋžapi čha hená héčhel káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So instead of those, maybe for skins they took small animal skins, and some people made moccasins using animal fur blankets, and they made shirts or hats or blankets like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená pȟaŋšpȟáŋžela čha hé uŋ hená héčhekčhel káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those are soft and for that reason they make them in those ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha Lakȟóta kiŋ táku óta waéčhuŋpi na hená leháŋn waníča áye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Lakota people made many things and nowadays they’re disappearing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená iyúha tȟokȟáŋtaŋhaŋ slolyápi čhíŋpi na, lená okáȟniǧapi héči, Lakȟóta kiŋ tókheškhe eháŋni wičhóuŋ hená slolyápi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they want to know all that from somewhere else, and if they understood those things, they will know how Lakota people lived long ago."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé Lakȟóta wičhóuŋ kiŋ lé aŋpétu kiŋ ítokȟapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They don’t care about Lakota traditions now."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lé waŋná táku tȟahá úŋpi kiŋháŋ hé wahéhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s that much about them using hides."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thíŋpsiŋla kiŋ lená ok’ápi na, hená átaya há yuǧápapi na, súŋpi na, pusyápi čha, hená nakúŋ wóyute káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They dig up prairie turnips and they strip off all the skin and they braid them and they dry them so they make food of them, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé June wíyawapi kiŋ él káǧapi na, hená lé Lakȟóta lol’íȟ’aŋpi kiŋ hená hél ikȟóyake kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in the month of June they make them and they are part of Lakota cooking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé tókhel wéksuye kiŋ héčhuŋ-s’e oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will tell just exactly how I remember this."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Išnáthi akílowaŋpi eyápi na uŋ huŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s called singing over the first period and that’s why they’re huŋká."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wičhíŋčala kiŋ lé otȟókaheya waŋná tȟaŋkál yaŋkíŋ kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, kȟúŋšitku kiŋ é naháŋ húŋku kiŋ iyáyapi naháŋ, thípi waŋ ékiglepi naíŋš, uŋgná iníyothi čha, églepi naháŋ, héčhiya wičhíŋčala kiŋ toháŋyaŋ tȟaŋkál yaŋké háŋtaŋhaŋš, winúȟčala kiŋ, kȟúŋšitku kiŋ kičhí yaŋké."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if a girl was going to sit outside, then her grandmother and mother left, and they set up the tipi for her, or maybe a sweat lodge, so they set it up, and if the girl sits out there for some amount of time, then her grandmother sits with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiya yaŋkápi na ečhél wičhíŋčala kiŋ iglúštaŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, iyáyapi na, azíltȟuŋpi na, wakpála ektá nakúŋ osní éyaš, wakpála ektá aípi na, nuŋwékhiyapi na, héktakiya aglípi na, lé oínikaǧe kiŋ lél thimá éyayapi na, iníkičaǧapi na, pakhíŋtapi naháŋ, ho hé él húŋku kiŋ iglúwiŋyeya čha, héčhel áta wóyute kiŋ tókhel okíhipi-ka hená iȟ’áŋpi naháŋ, wakšúpi eyála s’e wíȟpeyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They sit there and if the girl gets through it, they leave, and they smudge, and the river is cold also, but they bring her to the river, and they have her swim, and they get back there, and they bring her inside the sweatlodge, and they have a purification ceremony for her, and they wipe her dry, and then her mother gets ready, so in that way they cook as much food as they can, and they give away things that are beaded all over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé akhípi háŋtaŋhaŋš, lé thiíkčeya pawóslal iyéyapi čha, héčhi thimá aglígnakapi čha, héčhi wičhíŋčala tóna išnáthi iglúštaŋpi k’uŋ hená é čha iyúha héčhi thimá yaŋkápi čha, hená kȟoháŋ tȟaŋkál iglúwiŋyeyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé waŋná waphíya wičháša waŋ thimá iyáya čha, íŋš hé uŋgnáš wíŋyaŋ naíŋš wičháša waphíye héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they get back there with her, then they put up a tipi, so they set her up inside there, so while several girls who finish their period sit inside there, if they get ready outside, a medicine man goes inside, so maybe they’re a medicine woman or a medicine man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha thimá iyáyiŋ naháŋ, lená wówičhakiyakiŋ naháŋ, čhaŋpȟá haŋpí čha yatkéwičhakhiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he goes inside, and he talks with them, and it’s chokeberry juice that he makes them drink."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená okáwiŋȟ yatkéwičhakhiyapi naháŋ wasná iyógnagwičhakhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They make them drink it around in a circle and they place pemmican in their mouths."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋpi naháŋ, hé iglúštaŋpi hátaŋhaŋš, ho tȟápa waŋ kšúpi čha yuhá hinápȟapi na, hená ókšaŋ nážiŋpi čha, hé tȟápa kiŋ hé waŋkál yeyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They do that, and if they finish, they come out carrying a beaded ball, and they stand around it, so they throw that ball up in the air."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋkál yeyápi na, hená iyúha wačhékiyapi na, waŋkál yeyápi čháŋšna, ho hé tuwá yukȟápe hé íŋš-eyá huŋká kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They send it up, and they all pray, and whenever they send it up, whoever catches it will also do a huŋká ceremony."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená húŋku naháŋ kȟúŋšitku kiŋ lená waŋží tuwá kaȟníǧapi na, hé wičhíŋčala kiŋ lé tȟokátakiya wíyaksapapi na, táku waúŋpsekhiyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So her mother and grandmother choose one of them, and they advise that girl about things in the future, and she will teach things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku ečhúŋ kte kiŋ hená iyúhaȟčiŋ uŋspékhiyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She will teacher her how to do what she will have to do."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lol’íȟ’aŋ naháŋ, wakšú kte na, wóska kte naháŋ, wakábla kte naíŋš, wapȟátiŋ kte na, thípi hená kayéǧiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She will cook, and do beadwork, and embroider things, and prepare meat, and butcher animals, and sew tipis."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4089> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš tókhel tȟahá kpaŋyíŋ na, tókhel tȟakȟáŋ hená kazá na uŋ, wakáyeǧiŋ kte héči, hená iyúhaȟčiŋ uŋspé kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4089;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4089> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or she’ll learn how to dress a hide and how she should sow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4089;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Háŋpa naíŋš wičhá tȟaháyake káǧiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She should make moccasins or men’s clothing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená iyúha uŋspé kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She should learn all those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel oyáte étkiya wówauŋšila na úŋšiič’ila kte čha, lená hená iyúhaȟčiŋ uŋspékhiyapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way she should have mercy towards the people and humble herself, so they teach her all those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋn hinápȟe háŋtaŋhaŋš, wáčhiŋhiŋ waŋ iyákičičaškapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If she comes out, they fasten a plume on her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé waníyetu tóna yuhá ú kte na, akhé uŋgnáš huŋká kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, akhé waŋží k’úpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she comes with it for several years, and again maybe she’ll plan to have a huŋká ceremony, they’ll give one to her again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuwéni otúyačhiŋ wíyaka kiŋ lená pȟégnake šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nobody wears a feather in the hair for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha héčhel lená wičhíŋčala kiŋháŋ, waúŋspepi naháŋ, wókaȟniǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in that way when she is a girl, they are educated, and they have an understanding of things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená winúȟčala naíŋš wičháȟčala lená iyótaŋȟčiŋ úŋšiwičhalakapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They should have particular compassion towards these old women and old men."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel hená ečéla waúŋspepi čha héčhel ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they just learn those things so they do things like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená átaya oyáte kiŋ yumímeya éwičhagnakapi na, hená wólwičhakhiyapi na, wíȟpeyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So all the people there put them in a circle, and they fed them, and they gave things away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na uŋgná šúŋkawakȟáŋ óta wičháyuhapi háŋtaŋhaŋš šúŋkawakȟáŋ kȟó kaȟáb iyéwičhayapi čha hená tuwá okíhi háŋtaŋhaŋš owíčhayuspiŋ naháŋ wóilagwičhaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And maybe if they had a lot of horses, they would drive them there so if someone could overcome them, [that person] took them and used them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha táku Lakȟóta étkiya waéčhuŋpi kiŋ lená líla othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was hard to do what the Lakota did."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn otúyačhiŋ ináuŋpiškaŋyaŋpi čhaŋkhé, wašíču wičhóuŋ kiŋ ognáyaŋ uŋk’úŋpi čha, átaya leháŋn wičhíŋčala kiŋ otúyačhiŋ heyókȟa sékse igluzápi na, wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays we fool around with it for no reason, and so we live according to white traditions, so nowadays girls dress up like heyókȟa for no reason, and they dance around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kawíyakpakpayela mniȟúha očháže iyúha kȟoyákapi na nagwág iyéya wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They put on all shiny types of fabrics and they kick around while dancing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwéni eháŋni héčhel wačhí šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nobody dances in the old way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn héčhuŋ-s’e wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays they dance just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená tuwéni ȟčiŋ okáȟniǧe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nobody at all understands those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená oyáte kiŋháŋ, leháŋn hená okáȟniǧapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, líla wičhóuŋ tȟókeča na, eháŋni líla wanáȟ’uŋkapi, wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays if the people don’t understand these things, the lifestyle is different, and the kids listened in the old days."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn waŋná wikȟóškalaka kiŋ lená ičháǧapi na, tȟáŋkake kiŋ lená ablézapi na, ablés úŋpi naháŋ, uŋgnáš čhiŋčá kȟoškálakapi wičhíŋčala waŋží theȟílapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hiyúpi na, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé, wičhíŋčala kiŋ lé, lápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4108;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4108> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And back then these young women grew up, and these adults understood that, and they lived understanding it, and maybe if the young boys loved a girl, they came and this woman, this girl, they went to her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4108;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋšna húŋku na atkúku kiŋ núphiŋ iwóglakapi naháŋ ečhél iyókičhiphipi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hokšíla kiŋ lé wičhíŋčala kiŋ lé itȟánuŋgya wičhákičhič’upi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They talked to both her mother and father whenever and, if they like each other, then they were given to each other on both sides."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋšna slolkíčhiyapi šni éyaš takómni húŋku na atkúkupi kiŋ héčhel čhíŋpi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They didn’t get to know each other whenever but that’s why her mother and their fathers wanted it that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáš wičhíŋčala kiŋ hokšíla kiŋ waȟtélašni séče k’éyaš takómni hiŋgnáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe the girl hated the boy but she surely got married."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš hetáŋ táku wówauŋšila na táku wašté etáŋ úŋ kta héči, héhaŋ hená héčhel iwíčhakičiyukčaŋpi čha, héčhuŋpi čha, otúyačhiŋ tuwéni huŋká šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But from then if she planned to live with goodness and compassion, then back then they decided it for them, so they did it so nobody did a huŋká ceremony for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋkápi kiŋ lé takómni Tȟuŋkášila étkiya wíyukčaŋpi čha, tuwá huŋká naháŋ, waŋná tȟoká tȟaŋkál yaŋké háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé ohókila."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those who became Huŋká were definitely thinking about Creator, so someone does a huŋká ceremony, and then if someone has their first period they have respect for her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ hetáŋ wakȟáŋyeža ičháǧapi na, táku etáŋhaŋš hená wakȟáŋyeža ewíčhakiyapi, sacred, eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because for then the children grow up, and that right there is why they are called “wakȟáŋyeža”, they’re called sacred."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ wakȟáŋyeža ewíčhakiyapi kiŋ lená íŋš-eyá wakȟáŋpi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4115;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s why those kids that they call “wakȟáŋyeža” are really sacred, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4115;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wakȟáŋyeža hená makȟá etáŋ ičháǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those kids grow up from the land."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuwéni otúyačhiŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nobody does things for no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé leháŋn wašíču kiŋ hiyúpi na, hená iwíčhačupi na, žaŋžáŋ ogná éwičhaglepi na, ičháȟwičhayapi čha héčhapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays white people have come, and they take them, and they’re a kind of kid that is put in a glass and grown."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená iŋšé wakȟáŋyaŋ hená Tȟuŋkášila wakȟáŋyeža wičhák’u čha hé uŋ héčhel ičháǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Creator just gave them children in a sacred way so they should grow like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená waŋná ičháǧapi háŋtaŋhaŋš hokšíoúŋpapi eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then if they grow they are called infants."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená čikčík’alapi čha hé uŋ heyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So those ones are little so that’s why they call them that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hetáŋ ičháȟ áyapi čháŋšna hená wakȟáŋyeža ewíčhakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So from there whenever they keep growing, they are called children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená táku iyápi naháŋ, mánipi na, sloháŋpi, lená íŋš-eyá hená uŋspé úŋpi čha háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená wakȟáŋyeža ewíčhakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they say something, and they walk and crawl, if they keep learning those things, they’re called children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená tuwá aíwičhašikčhiŋkčhiŋ čháŋšna, wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ khužápi čha, tuwéni hená íšikčhiŋ owíčhakhuwa šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever someone loses their patience with them, the children got sick, so nobody went getting angry with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Úŋšikapi, hená wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were helpless, those children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha leháŋn éyaš otúyačhiŋ iȟpéwičhayapi naíŋš, tuktéktel éš iȟpéwičhayapi, wičháktepila na, iȟpéwičhayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays they throw them away for no reason, or sometimes they just throw them away, they kill them, and throw them away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená oyáte kiŋ lená uŋ uŋkákižapi éyaš, slol’úŋyaŋpi šni čha, iníhaŋšni héčhel uŋk’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "We the people suffer because of those things, but we don’t know, so we live indifferently like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lé huŋká kiŋ lé toháŋn okíhilaka wakȟáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this huŋká ceremony is as sacred as sacred is."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená wakȟáŋyaŋ uŋkíčhaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we grow up in a sacred way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn hená otúyačhiŋ inápiškaŋyaŋpi čha waŋná Lakȟóta kiŋ sóta áyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays they fool around with it for no discernable reason so now Lakota people are getting dirty."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na eháŋni šúŋkawakȟáŋ waŋ čhéyiŋ na, eyá škhé, “wóilag’uŋyayapi yuŋkȟáŋ, oyáte kiŋháŋ waŋží uŋyáktepi na, uŋyálutapi čha, letáŋ tȟokátakiya šúŋkawakȟáŋ waníčapi kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And a long time ago a horse cried, and it’s said that it said, “they use us, and so the people will kill one of us, and eat one of us, so from then on there will be no more horses.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ leháŋn iyéčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nowadays it’s like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená táku eyápi kiŋ wakȟáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So what they said was sacred."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuwéni hená inápiškaŋye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nobody played around with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha íŋš-eyá toháŋn lená wičhíŋčala kiŋ slolyá ičháǧapi na, ečhél wíŋyaŋpi eháŋtaŋhaŋš, waŋná čhiŋčá yukȟíŋ na, íŋš-eyá čhiŋčá hená héčhečapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if the girls grew up knowing these things too, until they’re women, then now there would be children, and the children would be like that, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋkápi kte háŋtaŋhaŋ, íŋš-eyá héčhuŋ-s’e ópȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4137> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they were planning to become huŋká, then in that exact way they would join in."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4137;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn hená waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4138> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays these things are gone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4138;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená é čha leháŋn hená lečhá ičháǧe kiŋ lená uŋspépi wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4139> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it is those things that nowadays I want those who are growing up to learn."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4139;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíču óhaŋ úŋpi éyaš, takómni lená uŋspépi háŋtaŋhaŋš, uŋgnáš kaéktaheyela s’e witkótkokapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4140> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They live among white people, but surely if they learn those things, maybe they’ll be crazy in a slightly more moderate way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4140;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé uŋ lená eyášna obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4141> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s why I often tell these things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4141;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wičhíŋčala kiŋ lé lená oyákiŋ naháŋ, oyáte óhaŋ lená wówapi kiŋ lená yawápi kta héčhel líla wóphila tȟáŋka héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4142> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And this girl will tell these things, and they will read these writings among the people so thank you very much for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4142;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni waphíya wičháša waŋ él mahí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago a medicine man came to me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Joe Eagle Elk ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "His name was Joe Eagle Elk."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ omákiyakiŋ na čhaŋšáša kiŋ lená tákuwe Lakȟóta kiŋ úŋpi kiŋ slolyé šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he told me something and he said that he didn’t know why Lakota people use kinnikinnick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iháŋmniŋ na, iháŋbla yuŋkȟáŋ, čhaŋšáša kiŋ lená Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ wóilagyapi kiŋ lé š’agyáhaŋ wóilagyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I dream, and I had a dream, and so it’s said that Lakota people made good use of strongly making use of kinnikinnick"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋšáša kiŋ lé táku líla óta él aíkȟoyaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said that kinnikinnick is really connected to many things"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čhaŋšáša kiŋ lé čhaŋkú lúta eyápi čha hé ogná Lakȟóta kiŋ mánipi kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so [with] kinnikinnick it was said that many Lakota people walked along what is called the red road."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé čhaŋšáša kiŋháŋ Uŋčí Makȟá etáŋ ičháǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So kinnikinnick grows from Grandmother Earth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋčí Makȟá etáŋ ičháǧiŋ naháŋ čhaŋšáša kiŋ lená hená úŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It grows from Grandmother Earth and they smoke kinnikinnick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waníyetu waŋná líla osní na, iwóblu wahéhaŋ, čhaŋšáša kiŋ lená kaksápi čháŋšna, héčhel pȟá šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now in winter there’s a lot of snow, and around the time when there are blizzards, whenever they break off kinnikinnick, they say that that way it isn’t bitter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha čháŋ kiŋ hená kaksápi naháŋ, há kiŋ kak’óǧapi naháŋ, heháŋn hél iyókogna čhaŋhá kiŋ hél iyóȟlathe waŋží čhoǧíŋ čha ikȟóyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they broke off those branches, and they shaved the bark, and then underneath the bark there is pith stuck between it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé é čha ičúpi na, kak’óǧapi na, pusyápi na, waksáksapi na, lé čhaŋlí ičáhiye čha iwákpaŋpi na, uŋ úŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s that that they take what it is, and that they shave it, and dry it, and cut it into strips, and he mixes this tobacco, and cuts it with a knife, and they smoke with that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé é čha čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ lé él opáǧipi naháŋ úŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it is that that they fill in the pipe and smoke."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé čhaŋlí kiŋ hé toháŋn ičúpi naháŋ, čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ hé él opáǧipi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená tóna akhígle opáǧipi kiŋ hé iyéna wóčhekiye káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they use that tobacco and they stuff it in the pipe, they make prayers as many times as those several times that they stuff that into the pipe."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ taŋyáŋ mánipi na wičhókhuže waŋžíni él hípi kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in that way Lakota people walk well and they won’t come with any sickness."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá wičhózani na wičhóni kiŋ lená úŋ he čhaŋšáša kiŋ hé é epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But I say that it is health and life that kinnikinnick is."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho yuŋkȟáŋ hé tuwéni slolyé šni yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhuŋ-s’e ihámniŋ na, okíyakapi na, ho hé Uŋčí Makȟá etáŋ Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka ektá iyóȟlogya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4176> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nobody knew that, and so he dreamed just in that way, and they told him it, and it’s from Grandmother Earth and Creator."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4176;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋn hé luhá mayáni kiŋháŋ héčhel oúŋ waŋží wašté yakáǧiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4177> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When you walk with that, you will make a good lifestyle like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4177;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka tókhel táku yakíla éyaš óničiyiŋ kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4178> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is said that in that way somehow you will ask for something from Creator and he will help you."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4178;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé héčhuŋ-s’e iŋšé hé waŋná wičháša kiŋ hé eháke okáȟniǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4179> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he finally understood it just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4179;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wówapi waŋ káǧa čha hé é čha ká Osní Makȟóčhe héčhiya čha hé eháke hé él ékihuŋni kta yuŋkȟáŋ, hé héčhuŋ-s’e okíyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4180> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He wrote a book so it’s with that that he would finally arrived there to Alaska, and so they told him that just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4180;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóihaŋble él okíyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4181> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They told him that in a dream."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4181;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé ičú naháŋ abléziŋ kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4182> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he took it and it is said that he would understand it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4182;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho yuŋkȟáŋ hená héčhuŋ-s’e waŋná okíyakapi čha, ho hé eháke wówapi waŋ káǧapi kiŋ él oéhaketa hená él owápi kte, wičhóoyake kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4183> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they told him it just like that then, so at the end of the book they will write that, the story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4183;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé íyohakab hé omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4184> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so afterwards he told me that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4184;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi čhíŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, oyáte kiŋ sáŋm líla wayátkaŋpi na, itómnipi na, él éič’iktuŋwaŋpi šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4185> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He wants Lakota people to live well, and the people drink, and get drunk too much, and he says they shouldn’t get lost in doing that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4185;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyókiphi šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4186> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He says that he’s not happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4186;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kéya omákiyake, “ho čha letáŋ tȟokátakiya nakúŋ él waúŋ šni éyaš, táku kiŋ lená oláke háŋtaŋhaŋš, tókša él waúŋ šni éyaš, óčhičiyiŋ kte k’uŋ,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4187> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He told me, it happened just like this when he told me, “so from now on I won’t be alive, but if I tell you these things, then even if I won’t live, I will help you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4187;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iyéčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4188> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it happened."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4188;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha othéȟike éyaš takómni hená é čha oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4189> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s hard but I will tell those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4189;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na uŋ Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ ksápapi kta čha hená obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4190> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I tell those things so that Lakota people will be wise."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4190;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wahéhaŋyela hé čhaŋšáša kiŋ oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4191> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is all that I have to say about kinnikinnick."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4191;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl eháŋni šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋkapi, naíŋš khiíyaŋkapi, naíŋš hečhékčhe pteákaŋyaŋkapi naháŋ wačhí éwičhothi čháŋšna, nakúŋ lé rodeo yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4220> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago there were horse riders, or racers, or bull riders, and whenever they had a dance campsite, they also had a rodeo."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4220;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟaŋkál waȟpé wakhéya káǧapi naháŋ, ho hél áta oyáte kiŋháŋ ptáyela hél yápi naháŋ, ho hél tónačhaŋšna wačhípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4221> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They made an arbor outside, and all the people went there together, and they often danced for several days there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4221;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na nakúŋ isákhibya rodeo yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And at the same time they had a rodeo."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋna šna pteákaŋyaŋkapi naíŋš, šuŋgwátȟogla akáŋyaŋkapi naíŋš, khiíŋyaŋkapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They rode bulls whenever, or they rode broncos, or they raced."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená iyúha héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did all those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wíȟpeyapi naíŋš héčhekčhe hená oíyokiphiphiya éwičhothi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they had giveaways or in many ways they camped together there happily."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš líla wówaŋyaŋke na líla oíyokiphi yuhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But that was quite a sight and they had a lot of fun."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš toháŋni wiwáŋyaŋg wačhípi hé é tákuni slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But I don’t know anything about the sundances."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená íŋš-eyá heháŋl šna tónačhaŋ wačhípi éyaš, hé é tókhel ečhúŋpi kiŋ héhaŋ slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They also danced for several days too, but I don’t know how they did it back then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš Lakȟóta kiŋ hél ptáyela šna oíyokiphiya šna wičhóthi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Lakota people often camped there together and have fun."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iŋšé hé uŋgnáhaŋšna hél iyúha ptáyela úŋpi naháŋ nakúŋ wólkičhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So maybe they just lived there together and shared food with each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha nakúŋ hená slolwáye čha obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’ve told about those things that I know."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ lená Lakȟól wičhówičhaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4240> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago Lakota people grew up in a Lakota way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4240;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na lená úŋ wówahokuŋkhiye uŋk’úpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4241> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they lived being lectured in regards to those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4241;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na lé wačhékiyapi kiŋ lé iyótaŋȟčiŋ líla iyótaŋkilapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4242> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they held prayer in the highest regards."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4242;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋkhé leháŋn wičhóičhaǧe kiŋ lená slolyápi šni na, hé é táku ipáyeȟ ečhúŋpi na, hená táku wašté ečhúŋpi kéčhiŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4243> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nowadays these generations don’t know, and they do things incorrectly, and they think that they do good things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4243;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho toháŋn Lakȟól’iya lená wačhékiyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš lená wanáǧi kiŋ “spirits” ewíčhakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4244> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they pray in Lakota they call the wanáǧi “spirits.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4244;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wanáǧi kiŋ lená íŋš-eyá makȟá kiŋ lél akáŋ úŋpi čha hená óuŋkiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4245> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "These spirits live on this here earth too so they help us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4245;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha toháŋn wičháša waŋží wičhóni ókignakiŋ na, makȟá mahél iyéyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená wóčhekiye uŋkíčaǧapi héčhel tȟawóniya kiŋ lená makȟá akáŋ úŋpi na, hená óuŋkiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4246> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if a man puts down his life, and they put him in the earth, they pray for us, and in that way their spirits live on earth, and they help us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4246;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha heháŋn lená héčhel wóčhekiye uŋkáǧapi čha, tákuni tóhaŋni uŋkéyapi šni na, héčhetu uŋkéyapi uŋkókihipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4247> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we prayed like that then, so we never said anything, and in that way we couldn’t say anything."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4247;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená íŋš-eyá eháŋni húŋku na atkúkupi na kȟúŋšitkupi na tȟuŋkášitkupi kiŋ lená wóoyake owíčhakiyag awíčhaupi k’éyaš, takómni hená ablézapi šni na, hená naȟ’úŋpi šni čhaŋkhé, líla oíyokišiče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4248> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Way back one’s mother or father or grandmother or grandfather went around telling them stories, but they didn’t notice those things, and they didn’t listen to those things, so they were very happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4248;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋkhé leháŋn uŋk’úŋpi kiŋ lé ská makȟóčhe ektá uŋk’úpi, otȟúŋwahe tȟáŋka waŋ ektá uŋk’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4249> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so nowadays we live on white people’s land, we live in big cities."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4249;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na ektá óhaŋ uŋk’úŋpi čha lé Lakȟól’iya wóčhekiye kiŋ lená othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4250> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And we live around all that so it is difficult to pray in Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4250;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tukténi maníŋn uŋyáŋpi na wačhéuŋkhiyapi kta waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4251> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There’s no place nor way to go into nature and pray."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4251;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená áta oyáte kiŋ thikáȟ áyapi, hená ská oyáte kiŋ na, tukténi maníŋtu waníče šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4252> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now they go around building houses, white people do, and there’s no nature left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4252;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋkhé wamákȟaŋškaŋ kiŋ é kayéš lená maníŋn úŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, lená otȟúŋwahe étkiya aú čhaŋkhé, kahíŋȟpewičhayapi, iyéčhiŋkyaŋke óta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4253> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so even the animales live in nature, and so they’ve come to the city, and so they hit them, a lot of cars do."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4253;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha úŋšišiya hená t’ápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4254> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they die miserably."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4254;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená úŋšišiya wičhóni ékignakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4255> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They lay down its life miserably."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4255;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋkhé toháŋn wóčhekiye uŋkáǧapi hátaŋhaŋš, oíyokišiče na, othéȟike."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4256> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so if they make prayers, it is sad, and difficult."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4256;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená uŋ wóčhekiye wičháuŋkičaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4257> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is why we pray for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4257;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wičhóni ékignakapi kiŋ lená wiyóȟpeyatakiya na wazíyatakiya na wiyóhiyaŋpata na itókaǧa hená wanáǧi kiŋháŋ khiglápi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héktakiya wí hinápȟe héčhiyataŋ, wiyóhiyaŋpataŋhaŋ gliyáhaŋpi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4258> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way if those who lay down their lives, their spirits go back to the west and north and east and south, back to where the sun rises from, the east, then they say they reach up there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4258;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn aíyokpaze, haŋhépi ektá wazíyata naháŋ itókaǧata wanáǧi tȟačháŋku waŋ eyápi čha maȟpíya ektá glakíŋyaŋ ȟpáya čha hé ogná mánipi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4259> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then it became dark, at night they say that the spirits walk on the road lies north and south that lies across the sky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4259;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé ogná šna hená iyúha mánipi na, tókhel hukhúta waéčhuŋk’uŋpi kiŋ lená waŋúŋyaŋkapi čha, takómni wačhéuŋkiyapi šni háŋtaŋhaŋ, hená čhaŋtéšičapi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4260> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they often walk along that, and somehow they see the things we do down here, so if they don’t pray for us, they say they’re sad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4260;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha úŋpi na óuŋkiyapi okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4261> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they live and they can’t help us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4261;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel toháŋn iníuŋkaǧapi na, wačhéuŋkiyapi čháŋšna, hená ektá hípi čháŋšna, hená wanáǧi wówičhauŋkič’upi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4262> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way whenever we have a sweat lodge, and we pray, whenever they come back to here, we feed the spirits."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4262;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel okáblaya tókhiya ománipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4263> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they walk freely in any direction."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4263;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na toháŋn wóokiye uŋlápi hátaŋhaŋš, óuŋkiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4264> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if we ask for peace, they help us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4264;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel uŋkákižapi kte šni na, wičhóni wašté uŋyúhapi kte naháŋ, wičhózani wašté uŋyúhapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4265> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way we won’t suffer, and we will have a happy life, and we will have good health."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4265;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé leháŋn táku waŋ líla iyótaŋȟči iyótaŋuŋlapi kiŋ hé wówaȟwala eyápi na, wówauŋšila eyápi čha henáos takómni waš’ágyahaŋ gluhá naúŋžiŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héčhel táku Tȟuŋkášila uŋkílapi ešáš hená óuŋkiyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4266> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays what we consider to be the most important thing is meekness, and is compassion, so if we definitely stand carry those two things with us in that way they will help us in what we ask of Creator."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4266;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel wóphila uŋkéyapi na, ho akhé takún uŋlápi čha, ešáš akhé óuŋkiyiapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4267> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way we give thanks, and we asking for something, so at least help us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4267;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho tkȟá áyecechola táku uŋlá-haŋpi hátaŋhaŋš, tóhaŋni hená uŋkókihipi kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But if we are asking for something without anything, they won’t help us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé é čha uŋ Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ leháŋn núni s’e wičhóuŋ na, wayátkaŋpi kiŋ líla š’agyáhaŋ íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is because of that that Lakota people run around as if lost living, and drinking strongly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na tákuni él éwačhiŋpi šni na él éič’iktuŋwaŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they don’t think about anything and they forget themselves."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená iyúha hógna ečéla, wayátkaŋ hé ečél uŋ, zaníya úŋpi kta kéčhiŋpi éyaš héčhetu šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of them just like that, just drinking, they think that they are living healthily but it’s not like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená eháŋni wówahokuŋkhiye kiŋ lená uŋk’úpi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s why in the old days they gave us these pieces of advice."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená miyé é wičákȟeyahaŋ glús nawážiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My myself, I really stand holding onto those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel iná é na até na tȟuŋkášila na uŋčíwičhawaye kiŋ lená héčhel wanáǧi oómani káǧapi k’uŋ hená iyókiphiya mánipi kte čhaŋkhé, miyé é makȟá kiŋ lél akáŋ kakíšya waúŋ tkȟá, takómni oyáte kiŋ ówičhawakiya čha, íŋš-eyá héktakiya hená ómakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way my mother and father and grandfather and grandmothers’ spirits will have nicely walked making the journey, and so it’s me who lives suffering on this earth, but I definitely help the people, so they will help me back, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená uŋ wóphila epȟíŋ naháŋ héčhel wičháwagluonihaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4275> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I say thanks using those and in that way I honor them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4275;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hógna ečéla mazáni kte na, hógna ečéla oyáte kiŋ zánipi kta čha uŋ lená ečhámuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4276> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In just that way I will be healthy, and the people should just do those things in order to be healthy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4276;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋkhé toháŋn okíhilaka iyómakiphi šni toháŋn oyáte kiŋháŋ wačhékiye yápi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4277> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so I’m as unhappy as can be when people don’t go to pray."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4277;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ ská owáčhekiye čha ektá wačhékiyapi éyaš, hé tókȟa šni ičhíŋ íŋš-eyá hená Tȟuŋkášila čhékiyapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4278> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also they pray at white churches, but that’s no big deal because they pray to Creator, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4278;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋš-eyá hé wašíčuiyapi čhékiyapi čha, tókȟa šni, ho tkȟá Lakȟól’iya-haŋ wačhékhiyapi háŋtaŋhaŋ, uŋkítȟathitakuyepi kiŋ lená naúŋȟ’uŋpi kta čha óuŋkiyapi kta čha hé uŋ Lakȟól’iya-haŋ wačhéuŋkiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4279> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also they pray in English, so that’s no big deal, but if they pray in Lakota our relatives will hear us so they will help us so that’s why we pray in Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4279;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hógna táku kiŋ lená uŋkókihipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4280> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way we will accomplish things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4280;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha iyótaŋš iyáyapi naháŋ, wayátkaŋpi na pȟežúta šíča ičúpi kiŋ lená ayúštaŋpi naháŋ, oínikaǧe waŋ él thimá iyáyapi na, ikpákhiŋtapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, toháŋn okíhilaka hé wóphila tȟáŋka héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4281> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they really go, and they stop drinking and smoking marijuana, and they go into a sweatlodge, and they dry themselves, then this would be a great cause for celebration."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4281;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hé ogná mánipi háŋtaŋhaŋš, lé čhaŋkú waŋ lúta eyápi kiŋ lé hé ogná maúŋnipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4282> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if they walk in that way, then we will walk along what they call the red road."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4282;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho tkȟá tuwá čhaŋkú waŋ sápa čha ogná iyáya ešáš wayátkiŋ na, thíwičhakte na, wamánuŋ na, táku šíča lená iyúha íŋyaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4283> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But for example someone who walks along the black road drinks, and murders people, and steals, and all these bad things happen."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4283;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená ská wičhóuŋ kiŋ ogná wičhóuŋpi čha hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4284> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of that because they live according to white people’s ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4284;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé ogná otȟápȟapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, uŋkíye uŋkíčhaǧapi kiŋháŋ tȟáŋkake kiŋ lená oíye nawíčhauŋȟ’uŋpi čha, taŋyáŋ uŋk’úŋpi éyaš, leháŋn ičháǧe kiŋ héčhuŋpi šni čha, wókakiže tȟáŋka ikȟóyaka."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they followed along with that, when we grew up ourselves, then we would listen to the parents’ words, so we lived well, but nowadays the people growing up don’t do that, so we are stuck with misery."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4285;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha eyášna uŋ čhaŋtémašiče toháŋn Lakȟóta kiŋ hená iyúha itómnipi na, él éič’iwačhiŋpi šni na, húŋȟ iyótaŋš lečhála ičháǧe kiŋ lená líla húŋȟ owáŋyaŋg waštéštepi éyaš, áta ité kiŋ šló aú sékse ománipi kačégčeg, šabyéla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4286> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So often for that reason I’m sad when all those Lakota people drink, and they don’t care for themselves, and some of the people who are maturing look very good, but they drag themselves around dirtily, like their face was melting off."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4286;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4287> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená eháŋni húŋku na atkúkupi kiŋ thewíčhaȟilapi yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhiya él éič’iktuŋwaŋpi šni čha, úŋpi k’uŋ epȟé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4287;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4287> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in the old days the mother and fathers loved them, and so I say that around here they live not being concerned with themselves"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4287;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha letáŋ tȟokátakiya lená oyáte kiŋháŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héčhel wóphila tȟáŋka héčha kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4288> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So from here on if the people live well, that would be very admirable."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4288;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4289> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So yeah."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4289;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha leháŋn lečhála ičháǧe kiŋ lená táku uŋ wóčhekiye káǧapi naháŋ, uŋ lená wičálapi kte kiŋ hé waŋblí wíyaka waŋ hé é naháŋ, čhaŋnúŋpa waŋ hé é naháŋ, iníkaǧapi kiŋ hé é naháŋ, čhaŋgléška waŋ tȟatúye tópa čha eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays people who are maturing now pray with something, and the things they will trust in are called an eagle feather, and a pipe, and the sweatlodge, and hoops in the four directions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé wičhóni héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is life."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé é naháŋ pȟežíȟota naháŋ, wačháŋǧa naháŋ, ȟaŋté naháŋ lená iyúha naíŋš, Lakȟóta pȟežúta kiŋ lená uŋ wóčhekiye eyášna uŋkáǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And Lakota people often make prayers with white sage, and sweetgrass, and juniper, or herbs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé é waŋblí wíyaka kiŋ lé, eháŋni Lakȟóta kiŋ hená iháŋblapi na húŋȟ wakȟáŋȟ’aŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ ziŋtkála waȟúpakoza eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this eagle feather, old-time Lakota people went on visionquest and some people did sacred things and so birds are called winged-beings."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé waŋblí kiŋ hé iyótaŋȟčiŋ waŋkátuya yawápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So eagles are considered very important."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé é čha wíyaka kiŋ hé ičúpi na, yuhá wačhékiyapi naháŋ, waŋblí kiŋ hé wičháša iyéčhečapi éyaš, héčhuŋpi šni itȟókab, lé ziŋtkála kiŋ lé iníyothi thimá éyayapi na, wačhékiyapi na, pakhíŋtapi na, ho yuhá glinápȟapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hó heháŋn wíyaka kiŋ hená yužúŋpi naháŋ, siŋtúpi kiŋ hená ičúpi na, hená wóilagyapi naháŋ, nakúŋ ȟupáhu kiŋ hená."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s that, the wings that they take, and they pray with them, and the eagle is like the human, but before they do that, they bring them inside the sweatlodge, and they cry, and they dry it off, and if they leave with it, then they pull out the feathers, and they take the tail feathers, and they make use of them, and also the wings."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na wáčhiŋhiŋ kiŋ hená nakúŋ wóilagyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they make use of the plume, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená iyóhila Lakȟóta kiŋ táku uŋ wóilagyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people used all of them for something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé hená ohókilapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they respect them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn otúyačhiŋ húŋȟ wičháuŋpi na, wičháktepi čháŋ, sniyáŋ wičháuŋpapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays they use some of them for no reason, and whenever they kill them, they lay them down in a cold way [in a freezer]."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ heháŋn čhaŋnúŋpa kiŋ lé makȟá etáŋ, Uŋčí Makȟá etáŋ hí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then the pipe comes from the earth, Grandmother Earth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha he íŋyaŋ kiŋ hé ká wiyóhiyaŋpatakiya íŋyaŋ šá oók’e čha héčhiyataŋhaŋ ičúpi na, čhaŋnúŋpa káǧapi naháŋ, hená uŋ úŋpapi naháŋ, hé pséȟtiŋ kiŋ ičúpi naháŋ, našléče šni háŋni, kaksápi na, kaǧápapi naháŋ, pusyápi na, yuówotȟaŋ khuwápi na ečhél púze."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they take a rock from over there in the west at red stone quarry, and they make a pipe, and they smoke using those, and they take an ash tree, and before it cracks they break off something, and they peel it, and they dry it, and they straighten it out until it’s dry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé iyókogna kiŋ hél ogná, eháŋni tókhel léčhuŋpi kiŋ slolwáye šni, éyaš hená čhoǧíŋ waŋ čhokáŋ ikȟóyaka čha, hená ǧuyápi čháŋ, oȟlóka čha, hé čhaŋnúŋpa káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in the middle of that there, I don’t knowhow they used to do that in the old days, but whenever they burn that pit, that’s stuck in the center, there’s a hole that they make a pipe from that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé é iyúha opáǧipi naháŋ, Tȟuŋkášila wóokiye kilápi naíŋš, wóphila ekíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they fill it all with tobacco, and they ask Creator for peace, or they give thanks to Creator."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé uŋ hená wíyokihipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4335> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way people are useful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4335;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ hé ičhúhaŋ lená uŋgnáš iyónikiphišni naíŋš, táku iníčakiže háŋtaŋhaŋš, lená pȟežíȟota kiŋ lé é naíŋš, wačháŋǧa kiŋ lé é naíŋš, ȟaŋté kiŋ lená zilyáyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4336> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And meanwhile maybe if they’re sad, or if they suffer from something, [that person] will burn medicine, or sweetgrass, or juniper."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4336;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Zilyáyiŋ na uŋ wačhéyakiyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4337> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They’ll burn it and pray with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4337;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel eháŋni otákuye kiŋ lená hípi na óuŋkiyapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4338> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way the relatives from way back will come and help us."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4338;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená táku uŋlápi k’uŋ hená ečhél héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4339> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They do what we asked of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4339;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho uŋkíčiyusupi kta čha uŋ hená čha, Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ tóhaŋni otúyačhiŋ makȟá kiŋ lél akáŋ úŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they will make things right for us, so that’s why Lakota people never lived on this Earth for just no reason at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4340;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku ktépi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená iyáyapi na, čhaŋlí waékignakapi na, awáčhekiyapi na, ho hená yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they kill something, then they leave, and they set up tobacco, and they pray over it, and they eat it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4341;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋlí kiŋ lé čhaŋšáša kiŋ hé etáŋ úŋ čha, hé uŋ Uŋčí Makȟá etáŋ hiyú na, Tȟuŋkášila waŋkáta maȟpíya ektá yaŋké kiŋ ektá étkiya šóta kiŋ lé izíte háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hená uŋ wóokiye čha hé uŋ, hená héčhel wačhékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the tobacco comes from kinnikinnick, so that comes from Grandmother Earth, and if the smoke rises up towards where Creator sits in heaven, then for that reason there’s peace, so that’s why the people pray like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4342;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha táku kiŋ lená otúyačhiŋšni éyaš húŋȟ otúyačhiŋ wóilagyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s not done in vain but they use some of it for a specific reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4343;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn hé čhaŋgléška waŋ ikȟóyaka čha hé pȟežúta čhaŋgléška eyápi ho čha hé čhaŋgléška kiŋ miméla čha, pȟahíŋ lulyápi na, ohómni óskapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then there’s a wheel with a certain quality that’s called a medicine wheel so that wheel is round so they dye the quills red, and they decorate around it with porcupine quills."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4344;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhaŋíčhipaweǧa waŋ čhokáŋ ikȟóyake čha hé íŋš-eyá lé wašíču wačhékiyapi kiŋ hé čhaŋíčhipaweǧa waŋ uŋ wačhékiyapi kiŋ lé íŋš-eyá iyéčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And a cross is stuck in the middle so it is like the cross that white people pray, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4345;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš uŋkíye hé čhaŋíčhipaweǧa kiŋ wiyóȟpeyata na wazíyata na wiyóhiyaŋpa na itókaǧa ho na čhokáŋ wíyaka waŋ ikȟóyaka čha hé uŋ Uŋčí Makȟá naháŋ Tȟuŋkášila Até Wakȟáŋ Tȟáŋka maȟpíya ektá hená uŋ wóčhekiye uŋkáǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they pray up to Grandfather and Father Creator in Heaven by sticking a feather in the middle of a cross that goes to the west and north and east and south."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4346;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená otúyačhiŋ wóilag’uŋyaŋpi šni čha, Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ lená lená wičhóuŋ kiŋ miméyela čha okáwiŋȟ wačhékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4347> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So we don’t use those things for just any reason, so Lakota people pray around in a circle because the people’s way of life is circular."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4347;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé itȟó wiyóȟpeyatakiya na hetáŋ wazíyatakiya na wiyóhiyaŋpatakiya na itókaǧatakiya okáwiŋȟ héčhel yíŋ na héčhel héktakiya wiyóȟpeyatakiya khihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4348> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I suppose that it goes around from the west and north and east and south like that, and in that way it arrives back to the west."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4348;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na thípi, thiíkčeya othípi kiŋ, lená nakúŋ miméyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4349> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And a house, a tipi that they lived in, those are circular, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4349;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha tóhaŋni tákuni oblótȟuŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4350> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nobody ever lived in a square way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4350;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhel hé iníyothi kiŋ hená nakúŋ miméla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4351> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So for that reason the sweat lodge is circular, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4351;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ tóhaŋni oblótȟuŋyaŋ thípi šni kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4352> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they say that Lakota people never lived in a square way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4352;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhetu wičhóuŋ kiŋ lé okáblaya okáwiŋȟya hiyáyapi na ečhél glihúŋnipi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4353> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they would pass on by in a circle without any obstructuion and they would come back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4353;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé é čha uŋ táku kiŋ iyúha miméyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4354> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Using that all the things were circular."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4354;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš nakúŋ ziŋtkála kiŋ hená hoȟpí tȟáwapi hená nakúŋ čhaŋgléška."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4355> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or the birds’ nests are in a hoop, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4355;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Miméyela wičhóthi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4356> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They live in a circle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4356;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš táku óta čhaŋgléška hé Lakȟóta wóilagyapi, hená tóhuŋweni waŋžíni oblótȟuŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4357> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or Lakota people made use of all those types of hoops, none of those were ever squares."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4357;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé uŋ hená ohókilapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4358> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So for that reason they respected them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4358;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ hená ablésya úŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, líla taŋyáŋ úŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If Lakota people lived knowing those things, then they will live good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho, henákeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So, that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókheškhe pȟéta káǧapi kiŋ hé é čha oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4384;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ll tell how it is that they make fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4384;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟéta iléyapi kiŋ hé wáǧačhaŋ há iyókogna haȟúŋta s’e swaká čha hená é čháŋ, čhaŋpúŋpuŋ čha ičúpi na, yuptá égnakapi na, lé čhaŋhá kiŋ héčheča áta ohómni égnakapi na, lé wahíŋ héčheča uŋ íčhiyapȟapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4385;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4385> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever inner cottonwood bark that is split at the edge like threads is lit on fire, it’s rotted wood that they take, and they lay it down torn apart, and they lay the bark down around it in the same way, and they strike flint just like that against each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4385;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na kaíleyapi čháŋšna, ilá čha, kitáŋla ilé háŋtaŋhaŋ, čhaŋsákala naháŋ sáŋm čháŋ tȟaŋkíŋkiŋyaŋ akšú-haŋpi na, hé pȟéta kiŋ líla tȟáŋka háŋtaŋhaŋš, čháŋ tȟáŋka čha hená yuwóslaslal églepi háŋtaŋhaŋ, líla pȟéta kiŋ tȟáŋka ilé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4386;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4386> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever they ignite it, it burns, so if it burns a little, they go laying twigs and large logs on it, and if that fire is big, if they set that wood upright, then the fire will burn really big."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4386;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4387> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhuŋ-s’e pȟéta kiŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4387;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4387> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they make fire just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4387;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋn pȟéta iléyapi kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená héčhuŋ-s’e ečhúŋpi naíŋš, uŋgnáš maníŋn tuktél háŋtaŋhaŋš, lé pȟežíšaša čha hená buffalo grass ečíyapi čha héčheča hená ičúpi naháŋ, ptáya égnakapi naháŋ, lé tȟatȟúŋkče púza čha áta ohómni égnakapi na, iléyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, héčhel ilé čha hená é čha uŋ čhethípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4388;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4388> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they plan on lighting a fire, they do it just like that, or maybe if they’re somewhere in the wilderness, they take that sort of buffalo grass, it’s called buffalo grass, and they lay it all together, and they lay dried buffalo chips all around it, and if they light that it burns just like that, and those are the things with which they make fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4388;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ maníŋn thípi éyaš, hená tuwéni tóhuŋweni oyáke šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4389;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4389> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They also lived in the wild, but they never talked about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4389;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš Lakȟóta tȟókeča kiŋ hená tȟogyé pȟéta káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4390;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4390> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But other Native peoples light their fires differently."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4390;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš uŋkíye hógna ečéla ečhúŋk’uŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4391;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4391> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But we did it only in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4391;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé ho heháŋn táku čháŋ uŋ wípȟe naíŋš, táku tȟušú thípi tȟušú naíŋš, wahíŋkpe kiŋ káǧapi kiŋ tókhel weksúya héči lé oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then I will tell about how I remember them making weapons or tipi poles or arrows with wood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟokéya wahíŋkpe káǧapi kiŋ hé, lé čhaŋsákala čha willow naíŋš, uŋgnáš čhaŋpáhi načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "First for the arrows that they made, they took willow twigs or maybe wood that they picked up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená ičúpi naháŋ, owótȟaŋla kiŋ hená ičúpi na, yuówotȟaŋ khuwápi na, pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they took them, they took them all straight, and they went along straightening them, and they dried them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋpi na, tȟakȟáŋ čha ičúpi naháŋ, yuspáyapi naháŋ, lé wíyaka kiŋ hé yusléčapi naháŋ, siŋté ektá iyápehaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that, and they took willow, and they moistened it, and they stripped a feather, and they wrapped it around a tail."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé iháŋke ektá wíyaka iyápehaŋpi čha, hél iháŋke él waškítapi na, hél ogná tȟakȟáŋ kiŋ lená yuspáyapi na, iyápemnipi na, hená lé uŋgnáš waŋží čhaŋší naíŋš, táku tȟašáke lolóbyapi héčheča iyúŋpi čháŋšna, šéče na, sáka čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they wrapped the feather around at the end, so there at the end, they cut a notch, and they moistened the sinew there, and they wrapped it around, and maybe whenever they applied pine gum or tender hooves, it was dry and stiff."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel naglá šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way it wouldn’t get uncoiled."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená él iyápemnipi naháŋ itȟánuŋgya wíyaka kiŋ hená iyápemnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they wrapped those things around it and on both sides the wrapped feathers around it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn lé čháŋ kitáŋla tȟáŋka kiŋ ečhíyataŋhaŋ čha hé iyúŋpi na, čhokáŋ wasléčapi naháŋ, lé wahíŋ kiŋ hé iyókogna iyéyapi na heháŋn, toháŋn iyéyapi naháŋ, hél waškítapi čha, hógna íŋš-eyá hé tȟakȟáŋ iyápemnipi naíŋš, iyéčhel iyáskabyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they applied a little of it on the big end of the wood, and they split it down the middle, and they stuck the flint in the middle, and then they stuck it in, and there cut in a groove, so they wrapped sinew around that too, or they stuck it on it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čháŋšna hená é čha tuwá wayúphike háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená owótȟaŋla ikȟóyagya čha, uŋ waŋtáŋyeya kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if someone was really skilled at it, then fasten it straight, and for that reason they said that they were a good shot."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená wayé yápi na, hená uŋ wamákȟaškaŋ wičháktepi na, tȟaló kiŋ aglípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they went hunting, and they killed animals with those things, and they came back with meat."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn íyokhiheya hél íŋš eháŋni íŋyaŋ kapémnipi eyápi čha hená íŋš íŋyaŋ čha lé íŋyaŋ šlušlúta čha húŋȟ sápiŋ naíŋš húŋȟ ská."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then next in the old days here was called a war club so those were smoothe stones and some were black and some were white."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená íŋyaŋ kiŋ ičúpi naháŋ, tókheškhe čhokáŋyaŋ yuȟlókapi naháŋ, čháŋ ihúpayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they took those rocks, and they made a hole in the middle of them some way, and they use them as a handle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na íŋyaŋ waŋ čhokáŋ yuȟlókapi čha, hél opázaŋpi na, hetáŋ lená táku tȟakȟáŋ é čha hená ičúpi naháŋ, hená íŋyaŋ kiŋ opémni ičúpi naháŋ, khútakiya lé čháŋ kiŋ ogná iyáskabyapi čháŋšna, hé líla sutá čha, hená uŋ kašlókapi šni čha, héčhel káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they made a hole in the middle of a stone, so they push it into it, and from there it’s sinew that they take, and they take it wrapping it around the stone, and whenever they fix it at the bottom, then it’s really hard, so they didn’t knock it loose with those, so they made it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš húŋȟ tȟahá čha íŋyaŋ kiŋ hél aópemniyaŋ akáyeǧepi naháŋ, sutáya káǧapi čháŋšna, hená íŋyaŋ kapémnipi kiŋ uŋ naíč’ižiŋpi na, okíčhize čháŋ hená úŋpi, wičháša kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4412> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or some people sewed wrapping around the stone with hide, and whenever they made it hard, they defended themselves with those warclubs, and whenever there was a battle, they used them, the men did."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4412;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟóka kiŋ kaȟpá wičháyaŋkapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4413> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said that they’d knock them into a sitting position."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4413;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hená héčhel íŋyaŋ kapémnipi eyá čhažéyatapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4414> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they named them “whirling rocks.” [warclubs]"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4414;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ hetáŋ táku isáŋm káǧapi kiŋ hé očháže iyúhaȟčiŋ čha húŋȟ pšitȟó ihúpa káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4415> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they made all more sorts of things from that so some made them with beaded handles."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4415;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iŋšé hená wópazo uŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they just made those for show."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4416;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ wahíŋkpe wahíŋkpe eyápi šni, tókhel eyápi, wéksuye šni éyaš, hená íŋš-eyá hé táku wípȟe čha hená káǧapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4417> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they didn’t call arrows arrows, what they called them, I don’t remember, but that’s why they made some sort of weapon, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4417;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íŋš-eyá hé é čha líla ihúpa háŋske na, wahíŋkpe waŋ tȟáŋka čha íŋkpa ektá ikȟóyagyapi čha, hé wahúkeza eyá čhažéyatapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4418> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That thing had a very long handle, and at the end of it they attached a big arrow, so they called that a spear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4418;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš tuwá khuwápi háŋtaŋhaŋš, uŋ čhapȟápi naíŋš hená uŋ íŋš-eyá napíkčeya čhapȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4419> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or if they chased someone they stabbed them with it, or they stab them with those things by hand."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4419;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khutépi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4420> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They don’t shoot them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4420;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé é uŋ hená wamákȟaškaŋ wičháktepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They kill animals with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4421;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená héčhel káǧapi naháŋ heháŋn hél thípi tȟušú káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4422> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they make those things like that and then they make tipi poles there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4422;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená íŋš-eyá kaksápi na, toháŋ čháŋ kiŋ hená naháŋȟčiŋ spáye háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená áta há kiŋ yuȟláyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they chop them off too, and if the wood is still damp, then they peel the bark off with their hands."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4423;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóhaŋni kaskúskupi šni, hé é napíkčeya yuȟláyapi čha, áta há yušlóka-haŋ čha, šlušlúlyela šna áta yuȟlá yuštáŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená yuptáŋyaŋ khuwápi na, púze háŋtaŋhaŋš, héčhel waŋžíni kawíŋže šni čha, héčhel káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4424> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They never peel it off with a sharp object, they peel it off with their bare hands, so they take it all off, so if they finish peeling it, it’s all slippery, then they tip it over and over, and if it’s dry, then in that way not a single one was bent."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4424;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená uŋ thiíkčeya pawóslal iyéyapi čha káǧapi naíŋš, hená toháŋn yuȟpápi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená toháŋn eháŋni iglág wičhómani háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená šúŋka naíŋš šúŋkawakȟáŋ hená itȟánuŋg iyáwičhakaškapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4425> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they made those to put up tipis with, or if they took them down, then if a long time ago they all travelled walking around, they tied them to dogs or horses on both sides."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4425;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha šúŋka kiŋ hená wakȟáŋyeža hená wičháyuslohaŋpi naíŋš, táku wókapȟaŋ hená yuslóhaŋpi na, šúŋkawakȟáŋ kiŋ lená íŋš hená tȟušú kiŋ él iyáwičhakaškapi čha, hená íŋš wakȟáŋyeža naíŋš tuwá húŋkešni eháŋtaŋhaŋš, héktata yaŋkápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4426> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So those dogs pulled those kids along, or they pull along parfleche bags, and they tied the tipi poles to the horses, so if there was a child or someone who was dying, they sat back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4426;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha thiákaȟpe kiŋ hená é čha átaya pagmúpi na, héktataŋ oyáŋke s’e káǧapi čha hé é čha wičháyuslohaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4427> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was the tipi covers that they rolled up, and they made it like a chair in the back so it was that they they dragged along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4427;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iŋšé hená ečhékčhe waéčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4428> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they just did things in those sort of ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4428;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ toháŋn ithíkaǧapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená čháŋ kiŋ wakȟáŋyaŋ kičhúwapi čha, waŋžíni kawéǧe šni líla tȟéhaŋhaŋ yuslóhaŋ ománipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4429> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if they put up a tipi, they treated the wood in a sacred way, so they didn’t break it by walking and pulling it around on the ground for a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4429;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená tuwá thípi kiŋ taŋyáŋ káǧapi šni na, čháŋ hená awáŋglakapi šni háŋtaŋhaŋš, kawéǧa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4430> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if someone didn’t make a tipi well, and if they didn’t look after it, then it’s said they broke them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4430;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋn lé itázipa naháŋ wahíŋkpe káǧapi kiŋ lená iŋšé wičhá tȟawóečhuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then there is a certain procedure for making bows and arrows."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé pséȟtiŋ čha uŋ itázipa káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4460> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they make a bow from an ash tree."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4460;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pséȟtiŋ tȟéča čha ičúpi naháŋ, kaksápi naháŋ, lé alétka waníča čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4461> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They take a young ash tree, and they cut it, and that’s why there’s no branches."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4461;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuktél alétka waníče hétu čha kaksápi na, čháŋ kiŋ lé wažípapi na, yuktáŋpi na, púza áya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4462> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They cut it to where there’s no more branches, and they whittle the wood, and bend it, and it goes along drying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4462;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ečhél pusyápi čha, héčhel oyúspe kiŋ hél héčhena gmigméla na itȟánuŋg wazízipelapi čha hé uŋ, yuktáŋpi okíhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4463> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s how it dries, so in that way the handle there is still round and they shave it on both sides, so that’s why they can bend it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4463;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ičúpi naháŋ lé tȟakȟáŋ čha hená íčhiyugmupi na hená ikȟáŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4464> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they take it and it’s sinew that they twist two of together and they make rope out of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4464;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ wahíŋkpe kiŋ hená íŋš lé, táku, čhaŋšáša hé é čha éyaš tȟókeča čhaŋšáša éyaš, šá šni, zí, čha hená ičúpi naháŋ, wahíŋkpe káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4465> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the arrows are kinnikinnick but they’re a different type of kinnikinnick, but they’re not red, they’re yellow, so they take those, and make arrows out of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4465;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená íŋš-eyá há yuǧápapi naháŋ, yuówotȟaŋ khuwápi na, lé tȟáŋka ečhíyataŋhaŋ wahíŋ kiŋ hé ikȟóyagyapi na heháŋn, uŋmá ečhíyataŋhaŋ, siŋté ečhíyataŋhaŋ, hé wíyaka waŋ yuzápi naháŋ, kak’óǧapi čha, tȟakȟáŋ uŋ iyáskabya aíyapehaŋpi naháŋ, uŋgnáš wazí čhaŋší naíŋš tȟašáke piȟyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4466> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they pull the bark off of those too and they straighten and straighten them and on the big side they stick a piece of flint and then on the other side, the side of the tale, they split a feather and they shave it so using sinew they stick it to it wrapping it around and maybe they apply pine resin or boiled hooves."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4466;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčheča iyútȟaŋtȟaŋpi čha, héčhel naglá šni na, líla sutá kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4467> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They still applied it to it, so in that way it doesn’t unroll itself, and they say it’s really strong."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4467;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhuŋpi na, hená uŋ húŋȟ waŋtáŋyaŋ yeyápi čha, hená íŋš-eyá čháŋ kiŋ owótȟaŋla ȟčiŋ káǧapi čha, tuwéni hená otúyačhiŋ káȟ iyéye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4468> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they do that, and in that way they shot some up using those things, so they made really straight sticks from those, so nobody made them quickly just because."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4468;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená iwáŋyaŋka-haŋpi na ečhél taŋyáŋ wakhútepi kta héčhel hená káǧapi na yuštáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were looking over them until they made and finished them so that they would shoot things correctly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4469;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lé uŋ, wahíŋkpe na itázipa kiŋ lená uŋ, wayé yápi naíŋš toháŋn kičhízapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená él úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4470> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s why, using arrows and bows, they went hunting or if they fought, they would use them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4470;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená eháŋni wičháša kiŋ líla waš’ákapi čha tȟatȟáŋka kiŋ kaísakhibya wičháiŋyaŋkapi na wičháopi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4471> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So a long time ago the men were very strong so they would run next to buffalo and shoot them and hit them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4471;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na wičháopi čháŋ lé hél kȟáŋ tȟáŋka waŋ ȟpáya čha, hé é čha wopsákapi čháŋšna, iyáyapi okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4472> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever they would shoot them, whenever they would sever what was a big artery lying there, they couldn’t move."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4472;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha íŋyaŋkapi našná, loté kiŋ él očháwičhapȟapȟapi čháŋšna, éna t’ápi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4473> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they ran, and usually whenever they would stab them in the throat, they say that they would kill them back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4473;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na héčhel wičhóoyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4474> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And that’s the story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4474;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Henákeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4475> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4475;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kȟaŋsúkhutepi eyápi hé hená kȟáŋta sú čha hená kȟápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4494> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "By plum shooting game they mean plum seeds."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4494;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená kȟáŋta sú kiŋ hená ičúpi naháŋ oštéšteya ǧuyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4495> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they took those and they brun them in many different ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4495;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na hená é čha napé él okígnakapi na kaslóhaŋ yeyápi čháŋšna, tuwá ohíye háŋtaŋhaŋš, tókhetu čha uŋgnáš pšitȟó oyázapi čha, hená uŋ ahíglepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever they put them down and hit them, if someone wins, then they come and bet using maybe some beaded strings."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4496;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená ahíglepi čháŋ winúȟčala čha ptáyela yaŋkápi na hená kȟaŋsúkhutepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So whenever they come and bet the old women sit together and they play the plum shooting game."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4497;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená hé oškáte kiŋ waŋží."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is one of the games."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn hél waŋží paslóhaŋpi eyápi čha hená íŋš lé pséȟtiŋ sakála čha, iŋšé hé toháŋkčakča čha háŋskaska čha, hená lé čháŋ kiŋháŋ lé tȟáŋka ečhíyataŋhaŋ kapȟéstopi čha hé é čha tókheškhe yuówotȟaŋ pusyápi čha, hé é čha sí kiŋ akáŋ ékignakapi naháŋ, woȟtákapi na woslóhaŋ iyéyapi čháŋšna, waŋkátakiya kiyíŋ na tókhiyab šna kaótaŋ glihé čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then there’s sliding-game where they sharpen an ash tree sapling about this long [6 feet] on the thick end of the stick, so it’s that that they dried straight, so it is that that they put on their own foot, and whenever they’d shove it and make it slide, then it’s said it went up and pierced into the ground somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená akíčhiyapi čha hená hé paslóhaŋ iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They have competitions so they push it along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn hél tȟápa kakȟápapi eyápi čha hé íŋš tȟápa kiŋháŋ tȟahá čha kayéǧepi naháŋ, pséȟtiŋ čháŋ čha hená naháŋȟčiŋ tȟéča waŋ héhaŋ ičúpi na, yuktáŋpi na, kiŋ hél aíyopteya ačhéthipi čháŋšna, héčhena yuktáŋyaŋ púze čha, héčhel nasléče šni čha, toháŋn púze háŋtaŋhaŋš, héčhena sagyé s’e púze čha, hená há yuǧápapi naháŋ, hená é čha uŋ tȟápa yukȟáb ičú íŋyaŋkapi čha, hená tȟápa kakȟápapi eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they sew a hide ball that they call the hitting ball, and they took an ash tree branch that was still young, and they bend it, and whenever they heated it straight over the fire, they dried it, and bent it, so it didn’t crack like that, so if it was dry, then it was dry like a cane, so they pulled off the bark, and it was by using that that they ran jerking the ball along, so they call it ball hitting game."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha itȟánuŋg nážiŋpi na akíčhiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they stood on both sides and competed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá lúzahe háŋtaŋhaŋš, áta tȟápa kiŋ ikȟóyagyiŋ na, yupsíl iyéya íŋyaŋkiŋ na, uŋmáčhiyataŋ čháŋ núŋm paslál háŋ čha čhokáŋ iyéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If someone ran fast attached to the ball, and they ran jumping along, and whenever they hit it between the two poles standing vertically."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená ohíyapi čha hé uŋ héčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So those win and that’s why they did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋn akhé čhaŋkáwačhipi eyápi čha hé íŋš čháŋ čha gmigméya paskúpi naháŋ, hená átaya pašlúšlutapi na, ho hé pȟéstoya káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then there’s the spinning top game where they scrape off a piece of wood in a circle, and they polish it, and they made it with a sharp point."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé lé tȟahá čha hé yusléčapi na, iyápehaŋpi na, čháǧa ektá akáŋ kawáčhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they tear a hide, and they wrap it around it, and they make it dance on a drum."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kapsíl iyéyapi našná, áta yusáksakapi čháŋšna, hé čháŋ kiŋ hé kawáčhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They hit it, and make it jump, and usually whenever they hit it repeatedly, then they make that piece of wood dance."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé iŋšé hokšíla wóškate héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s just a game for boys."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhaŋgléška pagmíyaŋpi eyápi čha hé lé čhaŋsákala čha miméya iyákaškapi na, héčhel pusyápi na, čháŋ waŋ toháŋkčakča kaksápi na, hé é čha uŋ pagmíyaŋ íŋyaŋkapi čháŋšna, tuwá hé kaúŋke háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé ohíya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And there’s the hoop rolling game where they tie a circular twig, and they dry it like that, and they cut the piece of wood at such a length [two to three feet], and that’s why whenever they run rolling it along, if someone knocks it over, then they win."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha iŋšé hé hokšíla wóškate čha, hená ečhél káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it is just a game for boys, so they make them like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé eháŋni uŋčíwaye waŋ lé wičhóoyake kiŋ omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Today I will tell a story about something that my grandma told me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ eháŋni wikȟóškalaka waŋží thiwáhe él yuhápi čháŋšna, héčhel awáŋkiglakapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so whenever a young woman had a family in the old days it was said that they watched over her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ taŋyáŋ héčhel hiŋgnátȟuŋkhiyapi čhíŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it was said that they wanted her to have a good marriage."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhel kpaǧáŋpi šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was said that they weren’t willing to part."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4529;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel ečhúŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋ, aŋpétu waŋží él kȟoškálaka waŋží wikȟóškalaka kiŋ lé waštélakiŋ naíŋš, iyókiphi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hiyóu kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4530> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so if they did it like, that then one day a young man likes a young woman, or if he is pleased with her, then it was said he came for her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4530;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ šúŋkawakȟáŋ waŋží héčhel akáŋyaŋkiŋ na waŋží héčhel kašká yús aú kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so in that way he rode a horse and in that way he came bringing another one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4531;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé šúŋkawakȟáŋ kiŋ hé thiwáhe él yuhá hí na, húŋku na atkúku kiŋ owíčhakiyake na, wikȟóškalaka kiŋ hé čhuŋwíŋtku kiŋ hé wičhákila kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4532> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that horse comes bringing the family, and he talks to the mother and father, and it was said that he asks them for their daughter."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4532;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé šúŋkawakȟáŋ kiŋ hé akáŋyaŋkekhiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4533> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it was said that he made her ride the horse."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4533;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ šúŋkawakȟáŋ waŋ akábya ahí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4534> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He came with the extra hourse."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4534;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé thiwáhe kiŋ él wičhák’u kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4535> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said that he gave it to the family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4535;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čháŋ lé akáŋyaŋkekhiyiŋ na kašká yús héčhel aglá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4536> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He made her ride the horse whenever and it was said that he brought her back there by leading the horse along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4536;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé waŋná thiwáhe tȟáwapi ektá héčhel waŋná kičhí úŋ kta čha héčhel akhí kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4537> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then she would live with their family like that so that’s how it was said that he arrived back with her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4537;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhí naháŋ ho hé íyohakab hél wóečhuŋ yaŋká kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He arrived back with her and then afterwards it was said that there was an event."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4538;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš hená héhaŋ wimáčhiŋčala čha, taŋyékel táku kiŋ lená owákaȟniǧe šni na, awábleze šni čha, heháŋl wičhóoyake kiŋ hé é wagnúni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4539> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But back then I was a girl, so I didn’t understand those things that well, and I wasn’t aware of them, so I’ve lost that story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4539;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋyela oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is all I will tell."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4540;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héhaŋ táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé wináwizitkȟaŋ hú kiŋ hé eháŋni Lakȟóta kiŋ pȟežútayapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I’ll talk about old time Lakota people used to use cocklebur as medicine back in the day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ táku hé waŋ líla owášte kiŋ hé ažúŋtka wóyazaŋ kiŋ hé ihéyapi okíhipi šni, ihéyapi oglúspapi, na ihéyapi okíhipi šni kiŋ hé uŋ lé pȟežúta kiŋháŋ húta kiŋháŋ apé kiŋháŋ háŋskeya átaya itȟánuŋg léčhel apé kiŋháŋ čikčík’ala aíčhiyupteya háŋskeya ikȟóyaka čha, čhokáŋ táku wítka s’eléčheča pȟepȟé ikȟóyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that thing, being really good for healing kidney disease, they can’t pass that kidney sickness, they hold it in, and since they can’t pass it, on both sides of the long leaves of the bottom of this medicine it has long small leaves opposite of each other, so in the middle it has something prickly like an egg."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé oíyeyapi okíhipi, pȟežúta kiŋ lé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They find it there, the medicine."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋgnáhaŋšna mayá aglágla ičháǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sometimes it grows along river banks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé yužúŋpi ehátaŋhaŋš hutkȟáŋ líla háŋskaska."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they pull it up the roots are really long."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hutkȟáŋ kiŋ hé zizí s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s like the roots are yellow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé líla háŋskeya yužúŋpi hátaŋhaŋš, ho hé waksáksapi na, kaskúskupi naháŋ, toháŋhaŋ waksáksapi na, ho hé é čha mní uŋ piȟyápi na, mní waŋná taŋyáŋ píǧa-haŋ hená ȟeyáb ičúpi na, heháŋl waŋná mní kiŋ lé kasnípi naháŋ, ho t’ečá háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho wakšíča ogná tuwé kiŋ lé k’úpi eháŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hé lé ihéye šni naíŋš, ažúŋtka yazáŋ he uŋ akísni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they pull those long ones out, then they’ll cut them up, and peel them off, and they cut them up to a certain length, and it’s that that they boil with water, and they remove them well boiled (from the water), and then they cool off the water, and if it’s lukewarm, then they give it to whoever that person is in a bowl, so they recover from not being able to urinate, or having kidney pain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhelya pȟežúta kiŋ lé ilágyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they make use of this medicine in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wináwizitkȟaŋ ečíyapi Lakȟótiya, wináwizitkȟaŋ pȟežúta kiŋ lé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so in Lakota they call it “wináwizitkȟaŋ,” the medicine, “wináwizitkȟaŋ.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tukté él yukȟé háŋtaŋhaŋš, uŋgná čhaŋpȟá naíŋš kȟaŋthúhu ožú eyá háŋskaska-ke héčheča-ke s’e, hú kiŋháŋ tȟaŋíŋyaŋ-hiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if there’s some of it somewhere, maybe it is easy to see, being long like some chokeberry or plum bushes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho yuŋkȟáŋ lé pȟežúta hé é čha uŋ ažúŋtka wičhókhuže kiŋ lé iyókihi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s this medicine that is effective in treating kidney sickness."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyášna asnípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "People often recovered."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ akísnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They recovered on account of that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ aŋpétu waŋ él wičháša waŋ íŋš lé pȟežúta kiŋ lé akáŋtaŋhaŋ čhaŋwáȟpe naháŋ, táku eyá wítka s’e gmigméla čha pȟepȟé kiŋ hená ée, hená é ilágyapi šni yuŋkȟáŋ, lená é čha áta pahí kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one day a man gathered leaves on this medicine, and it was these that were prickly, and round like an egg, they don’t make any use of those."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na yuhá čhaŋkú okhížata waŋ él nážiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it’s said that he stood with them at a fork in the road."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hél ogná wičhómani čha wičháša hená éna owíčhayuspiŋ kta čha slolyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said that people travelled there so he knew that he would get ahold of people back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčheča kta waŋná iyéčhiŋkyaŋke waŋ í na kaslóhaŋ hinážiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And and it’s said that he would be like that, then a car came up and parked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha okíyaka kéye, “lená pȟahíŋ wítka čha, wíyopȟeya yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said that he talked to them, and he said, “these are porcupine eggs so they’re on sale.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš tóna igláwa kiŋháŋ oyákapi šni éyaš héčhuŋ-s’e wičhóoyake kiŋ lé oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they didn’t say how much it costs, but they tell this story just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná héčhel inážiŋ áyiŋ na haŋkéya líla wičhótapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then it’s said that they would go up and stop and finally there was a big crowd."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4595> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hená átaya wičákȟelapi na hená iyúha tónana áta opȟétȟuŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4595;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4595> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said that they all thought that he was telling the truth and each one of them bought several."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4595;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho yuŋkȟáŋ lé wičháša waŋ slolyá čha iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4596;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4596> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then it’s said that a man who knew him went there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4596;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4597> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku tókȟa s’eléčheča čha, íŋš-eyá él inážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, hé wičháša kiŋháŋ héčhel wičhášašni yuŋkȟáŋ, héčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4597;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4597> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like something was going on, so he stopped there too, and so that man was tricky like that, and so that’s how he was."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4597;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4598> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wináwizitkȟaŋ eyá táku ikȟóyaka lená čha áta óta pahí na, wašíču kiŋ lená wičhágnayaŋ čha, lé áta opȟétȟuŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4598;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4598> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He collected a lot of things that stick to cocklebur, and he tricked these white people, so it’s said that they all bought them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4598;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4599> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená tókhi wítka hená ogná etáŋ pȟahíŋ hená ikpákpi kta kéčhiŋpi načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4599;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4599> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So maybe they thought that porcupines would hatch out of those eggs."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4599;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4600> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíču kiŋháŋ húŋȟ táku kiŋ lená héčhetu kéčhiŋpi na, wičákȟelapi na, opȟétȟuŋpi éyaš, hé ikpákpi kta kéčhiŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4600;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4600> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of the white people thought those things like that, and they thought he was telling the truth, and they bought them, but it’s said that they thought that they would hatch."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4600;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4601> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu šni škȟá hená wičhágnayaŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4601;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4601> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it didn’t happen like that but it’s said that he tricked them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4601;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4603> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé lé obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4603;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4603> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’ve told it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4603;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lé táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé hú kiŋ hé eháŋni oyáte kiŋháŋ – wíŋyaŋ kiŋ é čha – lená hupȟéstola hú kiŋ lé ok’ápi naháŋ, hé táku waŋ hé tuktógna kéyapi éyaš, lílaȟčiŋ owákaȟniǧe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "What I am telling is, that stem, in old times people – it was women – dug up the stem of soapweed, and they said something in some sort of way, but I didn’t understand it at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hupȟéstola hú waŋží ok’ápi eháŋtaŋhaŋš, húte kiŋ hé oȟlóǧeča háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé táku kȟápi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then if they dug up a soapweed stem, if the base of it was hollow inside, then they say it meant something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená ilágyapi šni kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they say that they didn’t make use of those."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš hé táku ȟča héči slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4633> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But I don’t know what that was."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4633;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš hupȟéstola hú kiŋ lé héčheča šni hená yužúŋpi naháŋ, hutkȟáŋ kiŋ hená kaskúpi naháŋ, héčhel piȟyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4634> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they pulled up those soapweed that weren’t like that, and they peeled off the root, and it’s said that they boiled it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4634;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Piȟyápi, na uŋ héčhel natá kiŋháŋ glužážapi háŋtaŋhaŋ, pȟehíŋ háŋskaskapi naíŋš, pȟehíŋ waštéšte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4635> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They boiled it, and in that way if they washed their hair, then the hair was long, or the hair was good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4635;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-s’e oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4636> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They told it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4636;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na ičínuŋpa kiŋ hé hupȟéstola hú kiŋ lé táku waŋ líla héčhel owášte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4637> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And soapweed stem is really good for a second thing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4637;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá thezí yazáŋ hátaŋhaŋš, ho hé íŋš-eyá hú kiŋ hé yužúŋpi naháŋ, kaskúpi naháŋ, hé hená waksáksapi na, hé waŋží héčhel mní ičáhi piȟyápi na, iyásni háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho heháŋl wakšíča ogná ožúla."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4638> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If someone has a stomach ache, then they harvest the root ou,t and they peel it, and they cut it up, and they boil it mixing one of them with water, and if it cools off."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4638;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel k’úpi háŋtaŋhaŋš ho hé yatké háŋtaŋhaŋš ho hé wáŋčagna kakpíya kiŋ lé héčhel natȟáka kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4639> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then if they give it to them in a full bowl, if they drink it, they say that that stops diarrhea immediately."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4639;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho owénuŋpkiya hupȟéstola hú kiŋ lé ilágyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4640> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they use soapweed root in two different ways."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4640;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-s'e eháŋni uŋčíwaye kiŋ lená omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4641> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My grandma told me it just like that a long time ago."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4641;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé é čha lé obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4642> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I told that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4642;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4679> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lé íŋš wičhóoyake kiŋ lé, čháŋ él táku eyá skaská čha ičháǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4679;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4679> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this story, some white things grow on trees."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4679;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4680> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená eháŋni oyáte kiŋ wóyuteyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4680;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4680> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the old people used those things as food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4680;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4681> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Lakȟótiya čhaŋnákpa ečíyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4681;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4681> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they call them “čhaŋnákpa” in Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4681;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4682> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíčuya mushrooms eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4682;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4682> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They call them “mushrooms” in English."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4682;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4683> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hená táku kiŋ akhípi na, líla taŋyáŋ yužážapi na, mní ičáhi héčhel piȟyápi naháŋ, él wašíŋ ognákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4683;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4683> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they got back with those things, and they cleaned them off well, and they boiled it like that mixing it with water, and they put it on bacon."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4683;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho íŋš lolóbyapi čháŋ, líla waháŋpi wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4684;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4684> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So whenever they cook it tender, then it’s a really good soup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4684;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel iŋšé eháŋni wičhóuŋ kiŋ lená táku kiŋ lená yútapi na ilágyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4685;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4685> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the old ways of life like that, they ate those things and they made use of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4685;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ tókhi uŋgná héhaŋ oyáte kiŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4686;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4686> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way back then maybe the people used it well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4686;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni oyáte kiŋháŋ wíŋyaŋ kiŋ tȟaŋčháŋ čikčík’alapi na, pȟehíŋ kiŋ líla sabsápapi naháŋ, tuwéni iŋšé eháŋni ištámaza úŋ šni s’eléčheča na, wičháša kiŋ íŋš-eyá iyéčhečapi. ,"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4687;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4687> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The people of long agowomen’s bodies were very small, and their hair was very black, and it seems like nobody just wore glasses in the old days, and the men were like that, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4687;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená tȟaŋčháŋ čikčík’alapi na, waš’ákapi čha, hé eháŋni oyákapi na, hená wičháša kiŋháŋ tȟáȟča waŋží héčhel ktépi eháŋtaŋhaŋš, nakúŋ toháŋ makȟá tȟéhaŋ éyaš, héčhel k’íŋpi na, kúpi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4688;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4688> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Their bodies were little, and strong, so they used to tell that, and if those men killed a deer like that, then it was a long time as long as the land, but in that way they say that they carried it, and were bringing it back"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4688;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho leháŋl tuwá héčhuŋ-wačhiŋ kta kéčhiŋ éyaš okíhi kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4689;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4689> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays someone may think of doing that but they won’t be able to."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4689;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ičhíŋ eháŋni oyáte kiŋhaŋ wóyute eyá yútapi kiŋ hená aŋpétu kiŋ lé leháŋl wótapi kiŋ kičhí íčhitȟokeča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4690;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4690> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because in the old days some foods that the people ate was different from foods people eat nowadays."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4690;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni líla blihéčapi na, waš’ákapi éyaš, leháŋl oyáte kiŋ héčhečapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4691;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4691> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the old days they were really active, and strong, but nowadays the people aren’t like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4691;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl tȟawóyute kiŋ tȟoktȟókeča čha líla čhepčhépapi na húŋkapišni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4692;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4692> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays the food is different so they are really fat and weak."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4692;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé, ȟé ektá wazízi ožú kiŋ hé héčhiya čhaŋhúta kiŋ uŋgnáš ikȟáŋkȟaŋyela táku zí čha aíyaskape."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the thing that I want to talk about, in the mountain, around there at the pine groves, something yellow is stuck to the tree trucks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hená eháŋni paȟláyapi na hená čhéǧa ogná paȟláyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so long ago they scraped those things off and they scrapped them off into a kettle"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená ognákapi na, čháŋ yuhá khípi na, čhethípi na, ho hé ogná mní ičáhiya piȟyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They put them in there, and they took some wood, and made a fire, and they mixed them in with boiling water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel iŋšé íŋš-eyá eháŋni Lakȟóta kiŋ čhaŋšíŋ ič’íčaǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So just in that way old-time Lakota people made themselves chewing gum."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋšíŋ kiŋ lé uŋgná íŋš yatȟápi tȟaŋčháŋpi él táku ókiya načhéče lakȟáš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe them themselves chewing this chewing gum must have helped something in their bodies."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni oyáte kiŋ líla hí waštéštepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Old-time people had really good teeth."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé é čha iŋšé obláka wačhíŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is just what i wanted to talk about."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé, eháŋni oyáte kiŋháŋ, wíŋyaŋ kiŋháŋ, eháŋni wáǧačhaŋ hé é čha há kiŋ paȟláyapi naháŋ, hená é čha uŋ na mní é čha uŋ na wagmíza ikčéka hená uŋ wanášlogyapi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4753> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then what I will tell about, a long time ago the people, women, a long time ago they would peel off what was cottonwood, and it was using that and it was using water and using Native corn, they made hominy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4753;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé čhaȟóta kiŋ hé é čha uŋ mní kiŋ piȟyápi na, lená wagmíza kiŋháŋ ognákapi háŋtaŋhaŋ, íŋš-eyá há kiŋ hená naȟláȟlaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4754> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was by using ash that they boiled water, and if they placed the corn in that, then the skin would fall off on its own, too."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4754;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé nazéyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hé wanášlogyapi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4755> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they strained that, then they made hominy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4755;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋl ptektépi háŋtaŋhaŋš, tȟasíha ho hená íŋš wašlókapi na, hená kak’óǧapi na, hená yužážapi na, pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4756> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they butchered buffalo, then they cut off the hoof, and they scrapped those off, and they cleaned it, and they dried it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4756;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená wanášlogyapi kiŋháŋ ičáhiya héčhel piȟyápi čháŋ, ho hé líla iháŋkeya waháŋpi wašté kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4757> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So whenever they boiled that by mixing it with the hominy, it’s said that that was the best soup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4757;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhuŋ šna eháŋni wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lená waháŋpi káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4758> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So women in the old days often made soup like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4758;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš leháŋl hená waŋná waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4759> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays there isn’t any of that left."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4759;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ tuwá Lakȟóta wíŋyaŋ waŋží leháŋl hená ečhúŋ-šipi háŋtaŋhaŋ, uŋgná slolyíŋ kte šni tókheškhe káǧapi héči."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4760> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And nowadays if someone asks a Lakota woman to do those things, maybe she doesn’t know how they made it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4760;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé hená waŋná Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ gnúni uŋkáyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4761;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4761> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now Lakota people are just in the process of losing a lot of traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4761;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4762> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho líla lé táku kiŋháŋ mahétuya owákaȟniǧe šni yuŋkȟáŋ iŋšé eháŋni uŋčíwaye waŋ táku kiŋ lená ečhúŋpi lená omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4762;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4762> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I don’t have a very deep understanding of this thing and so my grandmother told me about doing those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4762;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4763> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héhaŋ matȟéča na, hená tókheškhe aŋpétu leháŋl íŋše táku omákiyake kiŋ hená waŋžígži wéksuye čha, hé lé wičhóoyake kiŋ obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4763;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4763> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So back then I was young, and nowadays I remember those things that she told me, so I tell the stories."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4763;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé Lakȟóta pȟežúta lé poíphiye eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4802> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then what I will talk about, they call this Lakota medicine ragweed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4802;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé pȟežúta kiŋháŋ tóhaŋni miyé miíšta uŋ waŋbláke šni éyaš, oyákapi ečhíyataŋhaŋ, wanáȟča kiŋháŋ kitáŋla héčhel tȟosáŋ kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4803> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that medicine, I myself never saw it with my eyes, but according to what they told about it, they say that it’s a flower that’s a bit light blue."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4803;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ hú kiŋháŋ makȟáta iwáŋkata toháŋhaŋ-ke yuŋkȟáŋ, tákula gmigméla s’eléčheča swéla s’eléčheča apé s’e ikȟóyaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4804> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the stalk is about yea high off the ground, and so the leaves stick to it like little balls, like it’s packed tight."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4804;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4805> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé uŋ islólyapi kte, hé uŋ oyákapi okíhipi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4805;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4805> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they would know it like that, that’s why it’s said that they’re able to talk about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4805;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4806> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša otówas’iŋ lé táku kiŋ slolyápi šni tkȟá, wičháša čónala lená ilágyapi čha hená slolyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4806;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4806> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so not everyone knows this thing, but few people make use of these so they know them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4806;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4807> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé tȟawóopȟe waŋ yuŋkȟáŋ kéyapi toháŋl pȟežúta kiŋ hé ok’ápi kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, ok’á kiŋ hétu načhéče, iŋšé tuktétu čha čhaŋlí él okálapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4807;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4807> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there is a custom and so they say that if they’re about to dig up that medicine, it’s just there where it might be dug up, it’s said that they sprinkle tobacco there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4807;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4808> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na ičúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4808;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4808> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s said they take it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4808;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4809> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na hé hutkȟáŋ kiŋháŋ íŋš-eyá kak’óǧapi naháŋ, waksáksapi na, pusyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4809;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4809> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they shave off the roots too, and it’s said that they cut them up, and they dry them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4809;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4810> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho púziŋ na, ohákab lé tuwá tukté él pó háŋtaŋhaŋš, lé piȟyíŋ na hé tókhi yatkáŋ uŋgná oyákapi nawáȟ’uŋ šni tkȟá, tókhi uŋ glužážapi naíŋš, takúŋn opútkaŋ na, él aíyustag tókhi glúzapi načhéče eháŋtaŋhaŋš, hé líla wašté kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4810;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4810> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was dry, and afterwards if someone who has a swollen bodypart somewhere, they boil it, and I haven’t heard about them talking about them maybe drinking it, but they might wash themselves with it, or they might soak something, and if they might take it applying it on it, they say that it’s really good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4810;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4811> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pó kiŋ hé ahúkhul iyáya kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4811;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4811> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say that the swelling goes down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4811;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé lé poíphiye čha, hená pȟežúta kiŋ eháŋni, Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ hé pȟežúta ilágyapi kiŋ hé waŋží."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4812;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This is ragweed, so these old medicines, this is one medicine that Lakota people make use of."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4812;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4813> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4813;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4813> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4813;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé ičáȟpe hú eyápi, Lakȟótiya."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4850> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now I will talk about what they call ičáȟpe hú (purple corneflower), in Lakota."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4850;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená wanáȟča kiŋháŋ šamná."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4851> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those are pink flowers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4851;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš wanáȟča eyá zizí čha ičháǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4852> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But some grow with yellow flowers."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4852;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčheča-ke s’eléčheča éyaš, lená čík’ala na, hú kiŋ hé makȟáta háŋska ičháǧe šni éyaš, wanáȟča kiŋ lená šamná s’eléčheča."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4853> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It is like this being kind of like that, but these are small, and that stalk doesn’t grow tall from the ground,but it’s like these flowers are pink."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4853;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4854> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčheča owáŋyaŋke na, pahá hepíya ičháǧe háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé é čha na čhokáŋ ǧí."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4854;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4854> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it looks like that, and if it grows on the side of a hill, than it is that and it’s brown in the middle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4854;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé é čha ok’ápi na, ho hé hutkȟáŋ kiŋháŋ kak’óǧapi na, pusyápi eháŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hé íŋš mahél kitáŋla ȟoȟóte s’eléčheča, hutkȟáŋ kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4855;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4855> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it’s that that they dig up, and so they scrape off a layer of root, and if they dry it, then it’s as if they’re a bit grey on the inside, the roots."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4855;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš hená é čha íŋš-eyá yuksáksapi na pusyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4856> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But it is those things too that they cut and dry."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4856;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé tuktél yazáŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hé uŋgnáš hí yazáŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋ, hé iyógnakapi kte, pusyákel, háŋtaŋhaŋ hé ówičhakiye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4857> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they hurt somewhere, so maybe if their teeth hurt, then they would hold that in their mouth, the dry stuff, then it helps them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4857;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na uŋmáčhetkiya íŋš-eyáš tukté él tȟaŋčháŋ mahél yazáŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋ, ho hé íŋš mní ičáhi piȟyápi naháŋ, hé íŋš wíyatke ogná yatkáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if they have a pain somewhere on the other side of their body too, then they boil that itself mixed with water, and they drink it using a cup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé núŋpakiya héčhuŋ-s’e ilágyapi, lená ičáȟpe hú kiŋ, na lé wíyokihi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they make use of it two times just like that, those purple corneflowers, then it’ll be helpful."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakȟóta kiŋ eháŋni lená makȟátaŋhaŋ pȟežúta kiŋ héčhuŋ-s’e ilágyapi na uŋ tókhečapi kiŋ lená asníič’iyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people from a long time ago made use of medicines from the land just like that and in that way they cured themselves of what was wrong with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋyela hé oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all I have to tell."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl táku waŋží oblákiŋ kta hé eháŋni Lakȟóta oyáte kiŋ wičhóuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then I’ll tell you something of Lakota people’s way of life a long time ago"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé thiwáhe él húŋkupi naháŋ atkúkupi naháŋ tȟuŋkášitkupi naháŋ kȟúŋšitkupi na wakȟáŋyeža hél ičháǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In families, mothers and fathers and grandfathers and grandmothers and children grew up there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená takúkičhiyapi lená líla kičhíyuonihaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those relatives honored each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tuwá wičhíŋčala waŋží ičháȟyapi naháŋ, hiŋgnátȟuŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, wičhíŋčala kiŋ lé hiŋgnáku kiŋ hé tȟakóš eyápi kta škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so if some people raised a girl, and she got married, they would call the girl’s husband a son-in-law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé yusútapi, hé wówahečhuŋ héčha škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They certified that, he was a type of relative."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ wičháwoȟa kiŋ eyápi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé wówičakȟe šni škhé, hé íȟaŋhaŋ tȟakóšyapi, uŋgná héčhuŋ-s’e wičhóiye kiŋ hé ekíyapi kta škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if they called him a wičháwoȟa, that wasn’t true, they had him as a son-in-law casually, maybe they would call him just like that with that word."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl wičháwoȟa kiŋ lé tȟuŋkáŋku na kȟúŋku kiŋ lená wičhákaǧapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then his father-in-law and mother-in-law would designate him as a wičháwoȟa."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na kaǧíšni čhažéwičhayatiŋ kte šni, takúwičhaya héči hél ognáyaŋ čhéwičhakiyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he wouldn’t call them disrespectfully by their names, if he was related to them, he would address them by the proper kinship term."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wókaǧi héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That was a sort of respect."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé lé wókičhičaǧi, wičhóiye wičhóȟ’aŋ čha lená thiwáhe él gluhápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That was respectful avoidance within family, they had traditional words in those families."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháwoȟa kiŋ lé, wičháwoȟa eyápi kiŋ, hé íȟaŋhaŋ tȟakóšyapi čha kȟápi škhé na, mitȟákoš eyápi kiŋ lé itéšniya héčhel wówahečhuŋ héčha čha eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this wičháwoȟa, they called him wičháwoȟa, they called him a son-in-law casually so it’s said they addressed him, and they said that that was the sort of family term that they definitely used, calling him a son-in-law."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itéšniya tȟakóšyapi hél ognáyaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That was definitely in accordance with the son-in-law there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟakóškupi kiŋ, lé tȟakóšwičhayapi kiŋ lená tȟawíču kiŋ hé ób wičhówe hená ée, héčhel él hóyewičhaye okíhi ówehaŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4877> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so their son-in-law, their son-in-law with his wife, instead he can call out to her brothers and sisters jokingly like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4877;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ówehaŋhaŋ ób wókičhiyaka okíhipi naháŋ, tȟawíču kiŋ hé tȟuŋwíŋču na lekšítku na húŋku na atkúku, kȟúŋšitku, tȟuŋkášitku kiŋ lená wičháglaǧi kta héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4878> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He can talk with them in a joking way and he has to respectfully avoid his wife’s aunts and uncles and mother and father, grandmother, grandfather."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4878;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená tákuni héčhetu šni ewíčhakiyiŋ kte šni naíŋš tuktél yaŋkápi k’uŋ wičhítȟokab kiŋ iyáyiŋ kte šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4879> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He can’t say anything to them in any way, or he shouldn’t go in front of where they sit."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4879;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš úŋšiwičhala kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4880> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or he should feel compassion for them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4880;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4881> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋ-s’e thiwáhe eháŋni lená kičhíčaǧipi wičhóȟ’aŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4881;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4881> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way, in the old days, that was the tradition of families respecting each other."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4881;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na leháŋl iŋšé wičhóičhaǧe na thiwáhe úŋpi lená Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ, hená taŋyáŋ wičhóuŋ hená nasól áye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And nowadays, there are family lines and families, the Lakota tradition is disappearing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na leháŋl wókaǧi kiŋ hé yuhápi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And nowadays they don’t have that respect for relatives."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhažékičhiyatapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they call each other by their names."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni thiwáhe él tuwá él wičhái čháŋna šna, wówičhak’upi, lená é kayéš čhékičhiya, hé ečíya, “hél íyutakiŋ na wakȟálapi yatkáŋ yé, šič’éši,” eyíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In old style families, whenever someone came up to them, they gave them food, they even called them by the kinship term, saying, “please sit down and have some coffee, cousin.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé šič’éšitku kiŋ hé wóta-hiŋ na, iglúštaŋ háŋtaŋhaŋ, ho heháŋl íŋš ehákela, “lé ikíkču wó, haŋkáši, wakšíča kiŋ, philámayaye ló,” eyíŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that cousin was eating, and if he finished, then finally he would say, “take it back, cousin, the plate, thank you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená wókaǧi wičhóiye héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So those were the words of respect among family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhažé yukȟáŋpi éyaš hená čhažékičhiyatapi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And there were names but they didn’t call each other by their names."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku ikíčhiyuŋǧapi yuŋkȟáŋ, takúkičhiyapi héči, hél ognáyaŋ héčhel eyápi na heháŋl, wíkičhiyuŋǧapi, táku slolyápi šni naíŋš, táku slolyápi čhíŋpi naíŋš, héčhetu hená ikíčhiyuŋǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They ask each other something, and so if they are relatives, they said it like that in that way, and then they ask each other questions, what they didn’t know, or what they wanted to know, or they asked each others questions in that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hená wókaǧi thiwáhe él eháŋni hé líla awáŋglakapi na hé líla gluhá úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they were aware of that family avoidance in families a long time ago and they lived with that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho oyáte eháŋni wičhóuŋ kiŋ líla wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the old people’s tradition was really good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl héčhetu šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nowadays it’s not like that"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋkhé tȟéča kiŋ, lená Lakȟótapi hé é čha Lakȟóta wičháčhaže yuhápi éyaš, wašíčuya úŋpi na, Lakȟóta wičhóiye hé éktuŋžapi na, Lakȟóta wičhóȟ’aŋ hé nakúŋ éktuŋš áyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the young people, those who are Lakota, so they have Lakota names, but they live in a white way, and they’ve forgotten Lakota words, and they also keep forgetting Lakota traditions."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na Lakȟóta-iyá hé kiksúyapi wačhíŋpi khéš, iyé wačhíŋpi khéš, okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they try to remember the Lakota language, but whenever they try that, they can’t."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tkȟá húŋȟ naȟ’úŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But some understand it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naȟ’úŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, wašíčuya waáyuptapi kta."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they understood, then they would respond in English."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho iŋšé Lakȟóta wičhóiye kiŋ na wičhóȟ’aŋ na wičhóuŋ kiŋ hená líla wašté."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But Lakota words and traditions and ways of life are really good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená uŋšé tȟáŋka kiŋ lená čhiŋčá na tȟakóžakpaku kiŋ lená owíčhakiyakapi iyé-kapiŋ šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So some grown people aren’t tired of talking about those things with their children and grandchildren."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owíčhakiyaka-haŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, watóhaŋl ihúŋnipi háŋtaŋhaŋ, lená él éwačhiŋpi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4899;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4899> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they are talking to them about it, if they reach some age, they will think about them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4899;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wahéhaŋl ihúŋnipi háŋtaŋhaŋ, lená kiksúyapi kte na, lená wašté kiŋ ablézapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4900> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they reach that age, they will remember these things, and they will realize those good things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4900;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé ogná úŋpi kte na héčhel éwačhiŋpi kte kiŋ hé líla wašté kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4901> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They will live through it and it will be good them thinking about it that way."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4901;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4902> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4902;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4902> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4902;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ eháŋni Iktómi kákhena yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a while ago Iktómi was going somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋgnáhelaka tuktél lowáŋpi na wačhípi čha nawíčhaȟ’uŋ kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all of a sudden he heard some people singing and dancing somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pahá ektá iyáhaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ ečhél hukhúta uŋmáčhiyataŋ átaya šiyó wačhípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He reached the top of a hill and so down on the other side prairie chickens were really dancing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4943;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átayaš šiyó kiŋ miméya nážiŋpi na, átaya wačhípi čhaŋké, anáǧoptaŋ nážiŋ-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, lé šiyó bloká kiŋ iyáyapi na, wíŋyela kiŋ aówičhakawiŋǧapi na, “mambú” eyá čháŋšna, wíŋyaŋ akíš’api, “mišáŋ” eyá wačhípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4944> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The prairie chickens really stood in a circle, and they really danced, and so he stood listening, and so the male chickens left, and they encircled the females, and whenever they said, “mambú,” the women danced yelling, “my vagina!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4944;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké étkiya yá-hiŋ na hukhúta ihúŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4945> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was going towards there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4945;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha, “wáŋ, misúŋ na tȟaŋkší, táku wayáčhipi huŋwó?” eyá kéye, Iktó é čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4946> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he arrived down there so he said, “well, my little brother and sister, what dance are you all doing?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4946;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “wáŋ, lé šiyó waúŋčhipi yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4947> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one said, “well, we’re dancing the prairie chicken dance.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4947;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “áta ipáyeȟ ečhánuŋpe ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4948> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “you’re really doing it wrong.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4948;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Átaya yumímeya inážiŋpi naháŋ ištógmus wačhí po,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4949> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“They need to just stop in a circle and dance with their eyes closed,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4949;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké átaya ohómni miméya énažiŋ naháŋke, kaíhaŋkeya inážiŋ naháŋke, lowáŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4950> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they stood around in a circle, and then he stood near the end, and then he sang."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4950;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heyá kéye, Iktó, “ištógmus wačhí po! Yatúŋwaŋpi kiŋ ištá nišášapi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4951> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And Iktó said, “dance with your eyes closed! If you open your eyes then you’ll have styes.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4951;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá lowáŋ čhaŋké, hená iyúha áta ištógmus wačhípi kéye č’éyaš, uŋgnáhelaka waŋží tuŋwáŋ hiŋglá yuŋkȟáŋ, áta Iktómi é čha aglágla kat’á awíčhau čhaŋké, eyá kéye, “wáŋ, tuŋwáŋ po, Iktó kat’á uŋkáupe ló,” čhaŋké, iyúha tuŋwáŋpi na, kiŋyáŋ éyayapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4952> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He sang that and so all of them danced with their eyes closed but all of the sudden one of them opened their eyes and so it was Iktómi that was knocking them all out in a row and so it said, “hey, hopen your eyes, Iktó is knocking us out,” and so they all opened their eyes and they flew away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4952;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ áta hená iyúha ištášašapi kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4953> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they all had red eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4953;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋtaŋ šiyó kiŋháŋ ištášašapi kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4954> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They say from then on that prairie chickens had red eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4954;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé Iktó tóna wičhákte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4955> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That Iktó killed them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4955;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé wičháyuha na, wičhák’iŋ na, yá-hiŋ na, áta čháŋ oíyohaŋzi owášteča-ka kaȟmí čha, ektá wičháyuha íyutakiŋ na, áta čhethí naháŋ, lé šiyóla k’uŋ hená é čha wičháyušla na, pasláslal éwičhagle kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4956> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he had them, and put them over his shoulder, and he went along, and he sat down with them at a nice shaded tree place at the bend in the river, and he made a fire, and it was those prairie chickens that he plucked, and he drove them into the ground."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4956;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhowíčhak’iŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4957> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He roasted them in the ashes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4957;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké líla ótapi čha, átaya ačhéwičhathi čha, átaya hená iyúha síla kiŋ tȟaŋíŋyaŋ čhowíčhak’iŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4958> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there was a lot of them so he put coals on all of them so all their little feet were showing while he cooked them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4958;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oíyohaŋziya Iktó yaŋkíŋ naháŋke, Iktó waŋyáŋg yaŋkíŋ na, “huŋhé, yuphíyaš wayé waí,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4959> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó sat in the shade, and then Iktó sat looking and he said, “gosh, I hunted really well.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4959;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋn čhaŋ núŋm íčhikakiskiza-ke, tȟaté čháŋšna kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4960> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of the sudden, two trees were sort of rubbing together squeaking, whenever it was windy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4960;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4961> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Misúŋ, owáŋži yaŋká po,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4961;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4961> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Little brothers, stay still,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4961;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4962> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Owáŋži yaŋká po, héčhuŋpi šni yo, winíčhowepi.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4962;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4962> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Stay still, don’t do that, you’re relatives.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4962;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4963> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tȟaté kiŋ akísni čha hé uŋ kakískize šni čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4963;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4963> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the wind calmed down and for that reason they didn’t rub together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4963;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋšna wóglag yaŋká-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4964;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4964> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he sat there talking aloud."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4964;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋšna akhé tȟaté hiyú čha, lé čháŋ kiŋ lenáos íčhikakiskiza čha, “misúŋ, héčhuŋpi šni yo, hená héčhetu šni yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4965;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4965> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the wind came again, so those two trees rubbed together again so he said, “little brothers, don’t do that, that’s not good to do.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4965;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋn šugmáyetu waŋ hiyáhiŋ na glakíŋyaŋ hiyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4966;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4966> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of a sudden a coyote appeared at the top of the hill and it was passing straight by."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4966;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké ektá étuŋwiŋ na, “hééééé, tȟahénakiya yaú kiló, lél wačhówak’iŋ kiŋ uŋgnáš hé yaú kiló, akȟóketkiya iyáya yo,” eyá čhaŋké, šuŋgmáyetu kiŋ hená čha iyúkčaŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4967;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4967> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he looked at it and he said, “heeeey, don’t you dare come over here, don’t come to what I’m cooking, get away from here,” and so it was the coyote that was thinking about those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4967;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho lé wóyute káǧa héči iŋtȟó ektá éwaŋblakiŋ kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4968;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4968> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “I guess I should go over there and look at what food he made.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4968;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4969> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyíŋ naháŋke yá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4969;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4969> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that and then he went there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4969;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4970> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Étkiya iyáya yuŋkȟáŋ, “hé lél khiyéla ú šni yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4970;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4970> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He left towards him and so he said, “don’t come any closer to here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4970;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4971> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟčeháŋn tȟaté hiyú na, lé čháŋ kiŋ íčhikakiskiza čhaŋké, “waŋ iyóčhičiphi šni waŋ, héčhuŋpi šni yo,” na lé čháŋ kiŋ hé é čha alí na, napé kiŋ khušéya iyékiya kéye, lé kakískise kiŋ hé él."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4971;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4971> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All of a sudden the wind blew, and the trees started to squeak against each other and so, “hey, I’m not happy with you at all, don’t do that,” and he climbed up that tree, and he put his hand in to block it, the squeeking going on there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4971;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ičhúŋhaŋ tȟaté kiŋ ayúštaŋ čha, napé kiŋ čhokáŋ ikȟóyakiŋ na, hé čháŋ kiŋ iyókognayaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4972;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4972> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in the meantime the wind stopped, so he hand was stuck in the middle, and it was in between the trees."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4972;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké šuŋgmáyetu kiŋ hé é čha étkiya yá čhaŋké, “hééééé, él étuŋwe šni, él ú šni yo, hél iyúha wačhówak’iŋ čha, hená uŋgnáš tȟebmáyakiye kiló,” eyá čhaŋké, waŋkálkatakiya šiyó hená áta sí tȟaŋíŋyaŋ ȟpáyapi čhaŋké, hé áta yaŋkíŋ na, íphiič’iya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4973;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4973> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the coyote went towards it and so he said, “heeeey, don’t look at that, don’t get close, I cooked all of that so don’t you dare eating my food,” and so all those prairie chickens laid clearly with their feet showing, and so he really sat down, and filled himself with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4973;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Íphiič’iya čhaŋké Iktó é čha, “waŋ, theȟíya omáyakiȟ’aŋ yeló, henáš waglútiŋ kte k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4974;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4974> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He filled himself with them and so Iktó said, “hey, you’re acting bad toward me, I should eat those things.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4974;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4975> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha éyaš síla kiŋ hená ečéla héktaktakiya wičhápaslatiŋ na, uŋmá kiŋ tȟebyíŋ na, héčhena iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4975;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4975> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he planted just the feet back in the ground, and he ate the rest, and then he left"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4975;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4976> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “tókša, waȟtéšni inít’e ló, tókša očhíyuspe kiŋháŋ, tókša míš-eyá héčhuŋ-s’e ičhíȟ’aŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4976;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4976> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “see you later, piece of trash, when I surely catch you, I’ll certainly cook you too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4976;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4977> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čhaŋké lé šuŋgmáyetu kiŋ hé hóyekhiye kiŋ ho héhaŋ tȟaté hiyú na, čháŋ kiŋ hená kakhínuŋkȟaŋ iyáya čha, héčhiyataŋ hiŋȟpáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4977;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4977> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the coyote he called to, then the wind blew and the trees separated, so he fell from there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4977;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4978> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi hiŋȟpáya na, čhaŋké, “wáŋ, lél wačhówak’iŋla k’uŋ theȟíya omáyakiȟ’aŋ yeló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4978;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4978> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi fell down, and so, “well, you treated me bad with my cooked food."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4978;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waȟtéšni inít’e ló, tókša očhíyuspe kiŋhá,ŋ tákučhiyiŋ kte ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4979;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4979> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Piece of trash, when I get you, I’ll use you for something,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4979;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyíŋ naháŋke yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4980> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said it and then he went along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4980;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ ečhél šuŋgmáyetu kiŋ hé é čha íphiič’iyiŋ na, okásniyaŋ háŋ čha, ektá óhaŋzi waŋ él ištíŋma-haŋ čhaŋké, Iktómi ektá ihúŋni naháŋke éyaš, áta kat’é šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4981> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was going along until he saw the coyote that had filled himself, and he was sleeping in the cover of where there was a breeze, and so Iktó went up to him, but he didn’t knock him out at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4981;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ayúta nážiŋ naháŋke, “wáŋ, lé tókȟa wéč’uŋ kta huŋwó?” eyá-haŋ čhaŋké, áta uŋgnáhelaka makhú kiŋ él naȟtákiŋ na, héčhena iyáyekiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4982> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He stood looking him, and then he said, “well, how will I wear you?” and so all of a sudden he kicked him in the chest, and then he ran off."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4982;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyáyekiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4983> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s said he ran off."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4983;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “wáŋ, theȟíya waéčhanuŋ weló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4984> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó said, “gosh, you act really badly.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4984;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋke yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4985> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then he went along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4985;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ uŋžíŋžiŋtka eyá ptáyela háŋ čha él ihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4986> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was walking along and so he came up to some rosebushes that were crowded together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4986;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ločhíŋ čhaŋké, lé uŋžíŋžiŋtkala k’uŋ hená é čha yušpí naháŋke, eyá kéye, “wáŋ, lená misúŋ, táku eníčiyapi so,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “uŋžíŋžiŋtka emáčiyapi k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4987> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was hungry, and so he picked rosebuds, and then he said, “well, little brothers of mine, what are you all called,” and then it said, “my name is rosebush.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4987;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yútapi čha uŋzé oyášpuyapi emáčiyapi k’uŋ eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4988> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He ate them so he said that I’m called itchy butt."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4988;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “úŋ, lenáš wátiŋ naš uŋzé omáyašpuye-ka,” eyíŋ naháŋke, lé uŋžíŋžitka k’uŋ hená é čha yútiŋ na yúl yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, uŋgnáhelaka uŋzé oyášpuya čha, héčhena áta uŋzé oglúk’eȟ yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4989> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “ah, I eat these things here and my butt itches,” and then he ate what were the rosbuds, and he went along eating them, and so all of a sudden his butt itched, so then he went along scratching inside his butt."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4989;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yá yuŋkȟáŋ, akhé lé omníča eyá ptáyela háŋ čha waŋyáŋka čhaŋké, ičú na, “wáŋ, lél wóyutela eyá wašté yeló, lená níš táku eníčyapi he?”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4990> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went along, and so he saw some beans crowded together, and so he took them, and he said, “well, some of this food here is good, what are you all called?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4990;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “yútapi čha úŋkčepi emáčiyapi k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4991> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it said, “they eat them so I’m called farters.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4991;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “lenáš wátiŋ na úŋwakče-ka,” eyíŋ naháŋke yúta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4992> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “I eat you and I fart,” and then he ate them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4992;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ áta úŋkče na nité kiŋ napsípsil iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4993> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he farted and his bum started to jump around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4993;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Máni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4994> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He walked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4994;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel napsípsil iyáya máni naháŋke čhaŋké, “wáŋ, owáŋži yaŋká po, wáŋ waŋná wičáčhilape ló,” eyé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4995> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He walked with it jumping around and then he said, “gosh, sit still, I believe you all now.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4995;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš iníhaŋšni uŋzé oyášpuya čhaŋké, uŋzé oglúk’eȟ yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, lé tȟaŋmáhel wašíŋ waŋ zizípela čha thezí kiŋ aówiŋ ikȟóyaka yuŋkȟáŋ, hé é čha gluslúta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4996> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he kept itching his butt not paying any attention and so he went along scratching inside his butt and so he pulled out his own layer of fat that lined along his stomach."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4996;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “huŋhuŋhé, theȟíya owáȟ’aŋ yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4997> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “oh my gosh, I’ve acted badly.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4997;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Áta lé tókȟamuŋ kta huŋwó?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4998;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4998> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“What in the world will I do?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4998;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋ lé éčhuȟčiš pȟewágnakiŋ kte ló.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p4999> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well at the very least I’ll wear this on my head.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=4999;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla okȟáta čha, lé tȟačhéžiŋgžiŋgča kiŋ gluslútiŋ na, hé é čha pȟégnakiŋ na, yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5000> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was really hot, so he pulled out his own stomach fat, and it was that that he laid around his head, and he went walking along."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5000;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ wičhóthi čha él ihúŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5001> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went along and so he arrived at camp."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5001;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičhóthi čha él ihúŋni naháŋke, áta tȟáŋkal wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ škátapi čha, pahá akáŋ yaŋká-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5002> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He arrived at camp, and the children were playing outside, so he sat on a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5002;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena naháŋke khútakiya ohómni iyóȟpaya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5003> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then he reached the bottom of a valley around it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5003;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša waŋ čhiŋčá, hokšíla waŋ, kičhíla thí kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5004> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a man lived there with just his son, a boy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5004;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla kiŋ lé líla wičháša wašté čha, čhaŋké ektá í kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The boy was very good-looking, and so he went up to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5005;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ektá í na, waŋwíčhayaŋka-haŋ kéye éyaš khiyéla yé šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5006> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went up to him and he was looking at them but he didn’t go getting close."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5006;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé wičháša kiŋ lé tokhíyotȟaŋ wayé iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this man left off somewhere to hunt."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5007;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟéhaŋ glí šni čhaŋké hokšíla kiŋ lé išnála yaŋká čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he didn’t come back after a while and the boy sat alone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5008;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Atkúku kiŋ lé yá yuŋkȟáŋ héčhena glí šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5009> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The father left and so he still hadn’t come back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5009;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša kiŋ glí naháŋke, čhiŋčá kiŋ él úŋ šni čha, líla čhaŋtéšiča kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the man came back, and then his son wasn’t there, so he was really sad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5010;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé heȟáka waŋ k’íŋ na glí kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5011> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was carrying a elk over his should."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5011;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wapȟátiŋ na, wéyotȟa čha ičú naháŋ, égnakiŋ na, heyá kéye, “ešá hokšíla iníčhaǧe šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5012> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he came back so he butchered it, and he took a bloodclot, and laid it down, and he said, “I wish you would grow up to be a boy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5012;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hokšíla mitȟáwa wagnúni čha heháŋn ičínuŋpani."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I lost my boy so never again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5013;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mičhíŋča waníče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5014> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I don’t have children."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5014;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na mitȟáwiču kȟó waníče yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5015> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And I don’t have a wife,” he said"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5015;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha oíyokišiče yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5016> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “so that’s said.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5016;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čhaŋtémašiče yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5017;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5017> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "so he said, “I’m sad.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5017;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhi óhaŋ úŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5018;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5018> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He lived there among them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5018;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aglágla ománi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5019;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5019> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went by."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5019;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5020> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé tȟahá waŋ yubláya égnakiŋ na, lé wéyotȟa kiŋ lé akáŋn égnaka yuŋkȟáŋ, hokšíla bébela waŋ wé etáŋ ičháǧa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5020;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5020> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he spread out a hide flat, and he laid that blood clot on it, and so a baby boy grew from the blood."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5020;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké hokšíla kiŋ lé éyaš heháŋyaŋš tókȟaȟ’aŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5021;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5021> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this was a boy but he was still gone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5021;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ lé é čha waŋná ičháǧiŋ na lé líla wakhúl wayúphika kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5022;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5022> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this boy now grew up and he was really skilled at shooting."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5022;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktómi Wéyotȟa Hokšíla kȟíŋ naháŋke, “wáŋ, léčhiya wíŋyaŋ waŋ líla owáŋyaŋg wašté čha úŋ čha ektá waŋyáŋg lá waštéke ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5023;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktómi addressed Blood Clot Boy and then he said, “well, a very beautiful woman lives around here so it would be good of you to go see her.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5023;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé wikȟóškalaka kiŋ hé wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ čha čhuŋwíŋtku."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5024;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that young woman was the daughter of the Chief."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5024;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5025> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké ektá í naháŋke waŋná kȟoškálaka kiŋ okhíya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5025;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5025> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he arrived there and then he courted her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5025;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ hé waštélakiŋ naháŋke eyá kéye, “hó, lé mičhúŋkši lúziŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5026;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that Chief liked him and then he said, “well, you will marry my daughter.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5026;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho éyaš táku núŋm wičháyakhute kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5027;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5027> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“But you must shoot two things,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5027;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha hé óta iyáyapi kiŋháŋ, letáŋ wahíŋkpe uŋ wičháyao kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5028;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5028> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “so when they are passing through, you will shoot them with an arrow from here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5028;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké tȟokéya lé šuŋǧíla čha ópta iyáyiŋ kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5029;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was said that first it was a fox that went passing by."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5029;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5030> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Yakhúte kte yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5030;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5030> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “you must shoot it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5030;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5031> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Na hé é naháŋ čhetáŋ waŋ héčhuŋ-s’e wičháyakte háŋtaŋhaŋš, wičhíŋčala kiŋ lé lúziŋ kte yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5031;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5031> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “if you kill that and you kill a hawk just like that, you will be able to marry the girl.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5031;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋké lé Itkó hená waŋná naȟ’úŋ čhaŋké étkiya yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5032;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5032> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktó then heard that and so he was going along there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5032;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyáyiŋ naháŋke, čhaŋmáhetakiya yápi yuŋkȟáŋ, waŋkátakiya étuŋwiŋ naháŋke, “wáŋ, lél kákhiya waŋkáta čháŋ kiŋ lená kičhíza-haŋpi čha, ektá mníŋ naháŋ, iyówičhawakhi kte šni yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5033;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He left, and then they went into the forest, and so he looked up, and then, “well, I will go where those trees are fighting each other up there, and I’ll forbid them from doing that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5033;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel naháŋke čháŋ kiŋ hená étkiya waŋkátakiya óskapiŋ na, waŋkáta ihúŋni naháŋke, “kȟolá, hiyú na ómakiya yo, theȟíya omátke yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5034;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5034> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like that and then he climbed up to the trees and he arrived up there and then he said, “friend, come and help me, I’m hanging bad up here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5034;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké Weyótȟa Hokšíla waŋkátakiya yíŋ na, waŋkáta iyáhaŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5035;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Blood Clot Boy went up there and he got up there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5035;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5036> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktómi é čha heyá kéye, “iyáskapa yo, iyáskapa yo,” eyíŋ na, iȟát’iŋ na, hiyúič’iya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5036;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5036> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was Iktó that said, “get stuck, get stuck,” and he laughed and he jumped down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5036;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hokšíla kiŋ gličú kta yuŋkȟáŋ, Wéyotȟa Hokšíla ektáni kaíyaskab iháŋn čhaŋké, tókȟani gličú šni kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5037;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the boy was about to get down, when Blood Clot Boy was stuck up there, and so he couldn’t get down at all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5037;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋ Iktómi hokšíla kiŋ lé, Wéyotȟa Hokšíla éič’ičhaǧiŋ naháŋke, wičhóthi étkiya yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5038;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "From there Iktómi transformed himself into the boy, Blood Clot Boy, he was going along to the village."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5038;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Étkiya yá-hiŋ naháŋ, akhé ektá ihúŋni naháŋ, heyá kéye, “wáŋ, lé wikȟóškalaka kiŋ hé uŋ tȟáŋtahaŋ wahí yelo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5039;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5039> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was going to there, and he arrived there again, and he said, “well, I arrived here because of the young woman.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5039;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho čha waŋná miglúwiŋyeya yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5040> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So I’m ready now,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5040;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha waŋná ȟtáyetu kiŋháŋ, héčhiya lé táku kiŋ hená wičháwakhute kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5041> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “so then in the evening I will go shoot them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5041;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké waŋná iglúwiŋyeyapi na, áta wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ thiíkčeya etáŋ tȟaŋkátakiya éyokas’iŋ yaŋkápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then they got ready, and they sat inside the Chief’s tipi peering outside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5042;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná áta šuŋǧíla waŋ ópta hiyáya čhaŋké, khuté éyaš, wošná kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5043;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5043> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then a fox went passing by and so he shot it but he missed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5043;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “wáŋ, tuwá maȟmúŋǧa čha taŋyáŋ waó owákihi šni,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5044> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “well, someone cursed me so I can’t shoot well.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5044;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyíŋ naháŋke, akhé waŋná lé ziŋtkála k’uŋ hé ópta kiŋyáŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, akhé wošná čhaŋké, “wáŋ, lenáš tuwá šil’áwimayukčaŋ čha, waó owákihi šni k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5045> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said it, and then again a bird went flying by, and so he missed again, and so he said, “well, someone’s thinking badly about me, so I can’t shoot well.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5045;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké waléhaŋn lé Wéyotȟa Hokšíla iglúšpu na, yíŋ naháŋ, akhé waŋná wičhóthi kiŋ ektá él ihúŋni na, heyá kéye, “wičháša waŋ hé thimá yaŋké kiŋ hé Iktómi ée yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5046> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so at around that time Blood Clot Boy freed himself, and he went, and he arrived back at the village then, and he said, “the man who is sitting inside is Iktómi.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5046;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Magnáyiŋ na hé hiyú weló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“He tricked me and he came here,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5047;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké wáŋčagna wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ kiŋ hé é na húŋku, wičhíŋčala húŋku kiŋ, henáos áta khuwá iyáyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5048> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all of a sudden the Chief and her mother, the girl’s mother, they all chased him around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5048;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ, “lé Itkó é čha akhé hí čha hé uŋgnáyaŋpe ló,” eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5049> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they said, “it’s Iktó so he game again so he tricked us.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5049;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Kté po” eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5050> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said, “kill him.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5050;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, áta khuwápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5051> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they chased him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5051;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta aíyakapteya khuwápi kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5052> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They really chased him uphill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5052;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó é čha áta themní pakíŋ iyéya istókos íŋyaŋka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was Iktó who went wiping away his sweat running with his arms swinging."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5053;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta íŋyaŋke éyaš, “hé miyé é šni, lé hokšíla kiŋ lé nignáyaŋpe ló,” eyá čhaŋké, waŋná kawíŋȟ iyáyapi na, Wéyotȟa Hokšíla oyúspapi naháŋ, akhé waŋná yuákaǧal otkéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5054;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5054> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He really ran but he said, “it wasn’t me, this boy tricked you all,” and so then they turned around, and they took Blood Clot Boy, and they hung him up again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5054;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké heyá kéye, “tókheškhe eháke táku ehíŋ kta héči,” eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5055;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5055> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they said, “what will you say for the last time.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5055;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho tȟóéyaš tȟokéya walówaŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye, Wéyotȟa Hokšíla hé é čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5056;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, the Blood Clot Boy, he said, “I will sing first.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5056;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5057> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Kȟolá, kȟolá, wí kiŋ lé é kayéš kičhí wéčhize k’uŋ, haúŋ, haúŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5057;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5057> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “friend, friend, I even fought the sun, oh well, oh well.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5057;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5058> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ho, “miglúštaŋ yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5058;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5058> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then he said, “I’m done.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5058;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5059> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Waksá wamásota po,” eyá čhaŋké, áta Lakȟóta kiŋ ókšaŋ iyáyapi na, áta míla gluhápi na, áta wašpá ičúpi khéš, naókhiyutȟa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5059;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5059> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Cut me up to death,” he said, and so the Lakota went around him, and they took their knives, but whenever they cut him up, he healed up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5059;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5060> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha isáŋm áta toháŋyaŋ waŋkátuya tȟaló kiŋ áya čhaŋké, waŋží heyá kéye, “wáŋ, lé Wéyotȟa Hokšíla kiŋ hé é škȟá, wasól wačhíŋ yakhúwape ló, tóhaŋni wayásotapi kte šni yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5060;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5060> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they gathered up the meat that they cut from him, and so one said, “well, this is the Blood Clot boy, but you are going trying to kill him, you all will never kill him.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5060;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5061> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké áta Iktómi hél ohítiya škáŋ k’uŋ héčhel akhé ékhuwapi na, ho waŋná oyúspapi kta yuŋkȟáŋ, heyá kéye, “ho, tȟakóža, héčhetu weló,” eyá íŋyaŋka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5061;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5061> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they chased Iktómi again with him moving terribly hard, and then they were going to catch him, and so he said while running, “grandchildren, that’s alright.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5061;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5062> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Héčhetu weló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5062;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5062> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “that’s alright."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5062;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená héčhekčhe waéčhuŋpi čháŋšna, šilwáčhiŋpi khéš, léčhekčhe otkéyape ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5063;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever people do things in those ways, but whenever they have bad intentions, they hang him up in these ways.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5063;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heyá kéye, “tȟuŋkášila, úŋšimala po,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5064;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5064> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “grandfather, pity me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5064;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na, “tȟakóža, héčhuŋ šni po,” eyé éyaš, waŋná oyúspapi na, íŋš-eyá yuákaǧal otkéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5065;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5065> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said, “grandchildren, don’t do that,” but then they took him, and they hung him spread-eagle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5065;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5066> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuákaǧal otkéyapi naháŋke, “ho níš waŋná Iktó táku ehíŋ kta huŋwó?” eyápi yuŋkȟáŋ, Iktó é čha, “ho míš-eyá walówaŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5066;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5066> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They hung him up spread eagle, and so they said, “so now what do you say Iktó?” and so then it was Iktó that said, “I will want to sing a song, too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5066;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké waŋná Iktó lowáŋkhiyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5067;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5067> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then they had Iktó sing a song."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5067;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké Iktó é čha íŋš-eyá olówaŋ kiŋ hé ahíyaye kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5068;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was Iktó that carried the song with his voice."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5068;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5069> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Kȟolá, kȟolá, wí kiŋ lé é kayéš kičhí wéčhize k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5069;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5069> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Friends, friends, I even fought against the moon,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5069;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5070> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho, wahúŋ wamásota po,” eyá čhaŋké, áta kákhel wahúŋ ičúpi yuŋkȟáŋ, átaya úŋkčekče na héčhena t’á kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5070;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5070> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So, go ahead and end me by cutting me up,” he said, and so they really took him gashing him, and so he really farted and then fainted."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5070;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi kákhena yá-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5076> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi was going to nowhere in particular."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5076;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ áta ȟtayétu ečhíyataŋhaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5077> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was a good deal past evening."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5077;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ȟtayétu owášteča kiŋ na, wiyóȟpeyata áta maȟpíya kiŋ ziyá na, šáyela áta iyóyaŋmya ȟpáya čhaŋké, ektá étuŋwaŋ yá-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, lé wíŋyaŋ núŋm thípi čha él ihúŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5078> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was a pleasant evening, and the sky sat in the west brightened up all yellow and red, and so he went along looking at it, and so he came up to two women’s house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5078;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená tákukičhiyapi kéye, wičhíŋčala kiŋ nuphíŋ, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ nuphíŋ, na nuphíŋ hokšíčala wičháyuhapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5079> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they were relatives, those two girls, those two women, and they had two boys."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5079;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké étkiya yá-hiŋ na ektá ihúŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5080> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was going towards there and it’s said that he arrived there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5080;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lol’íȟ’aŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5081> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were cooking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5081;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lol’íȟ’aŋpi naháŋke, heyá kéye, “aháŋ, má yuphíya yahí kštó,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5082> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were cooking and then she said, “careful, come carefully.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5082;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋmá, “thimá hiyú we, wóuŋnič’upi kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5083> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the other said, “come on inside, we’ll give you something to eat.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5083;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “ho lé iŋšé hé wóyag waú weló,” eyá kéye, Iktómi é čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5084> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, Iktómi said, “oh well I just came to talk.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5084;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké uŋma, “háŋ, táku oyág yahí he?” heyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “ká átaya wiyóȟpeyatakiya iyóyaŋmya šayéla ȟpáye kiŋ héčhiya, kȟáŋta ožú čha hé áta iyóyaŋmyela ȟpáye ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5085> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the other one said, “okay, you came to talk about something?” and so he said, “over there where the sun sets in the west lighting it up red, there are plum bushes so they lay giving off that color.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5085;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha iŋšé uŋgná wóšpi lápi kte séča, čha hé uŋ waú.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5086> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So maybe you two should pick them, so I came for that reason.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5086;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Oháŋ, héčhuŋk’uŋpi uŋkókihipi éyaš tuwéni hokší awáŋyaŋke šni k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5087> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She said, “okay, we can do that but nobody will watch the baby.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5087;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké Iktó é čha, “ho iyáya po, tókša ób maŋkíŋ kte, iyáyiŋ na wóšpi po,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5088> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was Iktó that said, “ go along, I will surely stay with them, go along and pick them.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5088;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5089> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké úŋš’uŋmakeči waŋná wóšpi iyáyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5089;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5089> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they left one as dumb as the other to pick berries."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5089;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Étkiya wóšpi iyáyapi na, tȟéhaŋ glípi šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5090> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They left to go picking berries and they didn’t come back after a long time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5090;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná ȟtaíyokpaze eháŋn, glihúŋnipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5091> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then when it got to be dark in the evening, they arrived back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5091;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋke kúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5092> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they were coming back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5092;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké éyaš ičhúŋhaŋ lol’íȟ’aŋ-ke kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5093> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But meanwhile he was somewhat cooking."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5093;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé hokšíčala kiŋ hená é čha nuphíŋ wičhákte na, iyóȟpewičhaya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5094> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was those two boys that he killed, and cooked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5094;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyóȟpewičhayiŋ naháŋke, lolóbya wičhágle."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5095> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He cooked them and then he laid them down all tender."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5095;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké lé húŋkupi kiŋ glihúŋnipi čha, heyá kéye, “ho lé tȟáȟča waŋ lél iyáya čha, wakté na, lé átaya čhéǧa tȟáŋka kiŋ ogná iyóȟpewaye ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5096> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so their mothers came back so he said, “a deer went, so I killed it, and I cooked it in this big pot.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5096;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho čha taŋyáŋ ločhíŋ yaglípi čha, wayátapi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “so you two came back pretty hungry, so you two will want to eat.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5097;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké iŋšé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ nuphíŋ líla wíyuškiŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5098> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so those two women were very happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5098;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋpi éyaš, úŋš’uŋmakeči paŋȟyá áta kȟáŋta kiŋ iyúha yušpípi na, glípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5099> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that, but with both of them being so dumb they really picked all those berries, and came back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5099;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké waŋná íyutakapi na, wótapi kta yuŋkȟáŋ, lé Iktómi é čha khinápȟiŋ naháŋke, eyá kéye, “é, waŋwíčhayaŋka po, wíŋyaŋ núŋm čhiŋčá wičháglutapi,” eyá čhaŋké, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ nuphíŋ čhéya iyáyapi na, khuwá éyayapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5100> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then they were about to sit down, and eat, when it was Iktómi that came back out, and then he said, “hey, look at them, the two women are eating their children,” and so both the women left crying, and they chased after him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5100;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khuwá éyayapi čhaŋké, átaya íŋyaŋkiŋ naháŋke, lé wašúŋoȟloka waŋ ektá mahél iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5101> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They chased him, and so he really ran, and then he went into a hole in the ground."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5101;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mahél iyáyiŋ na, áta iglúšpašpa na, iglúȟlaȟlatiŋ na, áta wé eyála s’e glinápȟiŋ na, eyá kéye, “tókȟa huwó?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5102> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He went inside and he tore at himself and scratched at himself and he left all bloody and he said, “what’s the matter.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5102;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tȟakóža, tókȟa huwó?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ é čha, “lé Iktómi lél hiyú na hokší glul’úŋkhiyapi kštó,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5103> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “what’s the matter, grandchildren,” and so the women, one said, “Iktómi came in and he made us eat our own children.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5103;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “hél mahél iyáye,” heyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “wáŋ, hé é čha áta makhíziŋ na átaya léčhel iháŋgmaye ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5104> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she said, “he went inside,” and so he said, “ah, it was him that I fought and he beat me up.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5104;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iyé čha héčhe iíč’iuŋ naháŋke, iyáyekiyiŋ na, akhé oȟlóka waŋ héčhiya mahél iyáyiŋ naháŋ, iȟát’iŋ na, heyá kéye, “áta lená wíŋyaŋ kiŋ hokší glútapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5105> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He did that to himself, and he ran away, and he went into a hole again, and he laughed, and he said, “those women ate their own kids."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5105;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókša oyáte kiŋ nawíčhaȟ’uŋpi kte ló,” eyá čhaŋké, héčhena, “ííííí, šíčelaȟ,” eyápi na, áta lé oȟlóka kiŋ itȟánuŋgya pȟeží paót’iŋzapi na, iléyapi čha, akhé uŋmáčhiyataŋ glinápȟiŋ na, akhé átaya iyáyekiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The people will surely hear about them,” and so then they said, “eeeeeey, he’s alwful,” and they stuffed the hole with grass on both sides and they lit it on fire so he came out again on the other side and he ran away again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5106;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš líla lúzahaŋ čha oyúspapi okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5107> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he was really fast so they couldn’t catch him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5107;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ekta ihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ, átaya táku ok’ó-kiŋ na, átaya táku iwóglakapi čha, yá-hiŋ na, ektá ihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ, héya kéye, “wáŋ, lé táku iwóyaglakapi huŋwó?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5109> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He arrived there and so there was an uproar and they really talked about something so he was going along and he arrived and so he said, “well, what are you all talking about?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5109;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “háŋ, lé Íya waŋ lél hí čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5110> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they told him, “yeah, an Íya came here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5110;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lél wakȟáŋheža úŋpi kiŋ hená húŋȟ tókȟaȟ’aŋ-haŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, Íya waŋ thiyóhaŋ hiyú na, átaya waíhaŋgye kštó,” eyá okíyakapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5111> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Some of the children that live here were disappearing, and so an Íya came among the houses, and he really destroyed stuff.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5111;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “wáŋ, tókša owále kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5112> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so, “gosh, I will surely look for him.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5112;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Na étkiya mníŋ naháŋ, ektá waí na, Íya iyéwaye kiŋ tókša očhíčiyakapi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5113> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “and I will go towards him, and arrive, and I will tell you all upon me finding Íya.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5113;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké yá-hiŋ na, pahá aínaŋm yá yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhelya hé é čha wíphiič’iye laȟčakiŋ na, ištíŋma-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5114> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was going, and he went on the other side of the hill, and so he was really full of food like that, and he was sleeping."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5114;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ištíŋma-haŋ čhaŋké, aíyokas’iŋ naháŋke, yuȟíča kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5115;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5115> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was sleeping, and so he looked at him, and then he woke him up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5115;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “misúŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5116> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he said, “younger brother.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5116;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókheškhe lél yaȟpáya-haŋ he?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5117> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “how come you’re lying here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5117;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “ho hé lél iŋšé wičhóthi čha kaísakhibya waúŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5118> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “well, I’m just living next to the village here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5118;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Lél wóyute óta čha,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ eyá kéye, “misúŋ, owíčhota él lá čháŋna šna táku kȟoyákipȟa he?” eyá kéye čhaŋké, “táku kaȟláȟlapi čha hé kȟowákipȟe,” yuŋkȟáŋ, “háŋ, míš-eyáš,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5119> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “there’s a lot of food here,” and so he said, “little brother, whenever you go to the village, what are you afraid of?” and so he said, “I’m afraid of rattles,” and then he said, “yeah, me too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5119;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Míš-eyáš átaya táku ȟláȟla kȟowákipȟe yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5120> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “I’m also scared of things that rattle.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5120;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “na nakúŋ táku kȟoyákipȟa he?” yuŋkȟáŋ hé, “lé išnáthipi tȟa-čhégnake kiŋ hená kȟowákipȟe k’uŋ,” eyá čhaŋké, “oháŋ, míš-eyá hemáčheča yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5121> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “what else are you afraid of?” and so he said, “you know I’m afraid of women’s sanitary napkins,” and so he said, “okay, I’m like that, too.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5121;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho ištíŋma yo, tókȟa šni yeló, tókša awáŋčhiyaŋkiŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5122> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Go to sleep, don’t worry, I will definitely look after you,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5122;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyíŋ naháŋke isákhib íyutake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5123> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that and then he sat next to him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5123;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha lé Íya hé héktakiya ištíŋma čhaŋké, naȟmá iyáyiŋ na, lé wičhóthi él šilwóyaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5124> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this Íya went back to sleep back there, and so he left secretly, and he gossiped in camp."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5124;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wáŋ, Íya lé pahá akȟótaŋhaŋ ȟpáya čha, hé táku ȟláȟla na, čháŋčheǧa kabúpi kiŋ lená kȟokípȟa kéye ló."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5125> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “this Íya that is lying on the other side of the hill said that he was scared of rattles and the beating of drums."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5125;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé é na táku waŋ iyótaŋȟčiŋ kȟokípȟe kiŋ hé išnáthi tȟa-čhégnake čha kȟokípȟa kéye ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5126> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Those and something he’s really afraid of is sanitary napkins.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5126;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho hé é čha lená héčhel ayálowaŋpi na, átaya čháŋčheǧa ayákabupi na, táku yakaȟláȟlapi kiŋháŋ, áptaŋyiŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5127> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“So when you sing over him with those in that way and you beat drums and you shake rattles, he will die.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5127;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké waŋná ektá ihúŋnipi naháŋke, áta táku kaȟláȟlapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5128> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then they arrived there, and then they really shook their rattles."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5128;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čheȟ ákaȟlaȟlapi naíŋš, čháŋčheǧa akábupi na, lé wíŋyaŋ tȟa-čhégnake é čha kȟó ektá aípi čhaŋké, áta yukšáŋkšaŋ íŋyaŋkiŋ na, sniyáŋt’a kéye, Íya kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5129> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They rattled kettles and they beat drums, and the women brought sanitary napkins too, and so he ran around in a zigzag motion and he fainted, Íya did."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5129;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké áta ektá ihúŋnipi na, áta lé wíkȟaŋ hená istó na hú na natá kiŋ na tȟahú él ohómni iyákaškapi na, lé wihúŋpaspa čha uŋ, áta makȟá ektá okátaŋpi na, wíkȟaŋ čha uŋ aíyakaškapi čha, iyáya okíhi šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5130> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they arrived there, and they tied up his arms and legs and head and neck with ropes, and there were stakes, so they nailed them into the ground, and they tied the ropes around them, so he couldn’t leave."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5130;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha kat’ápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5131> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they killed him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5131;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kat’ápi kta yuŋkȟáŋ, hé Íya kiŋ é čha eyá kéye, “wáŋ, eháuŋ Iktómi mayágnaye ló,” eyá kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5132> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Right when they were about to kill him, Íya said, “hey Iktómi, you darn tricked me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5132;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókša toháŋn átačhiye kiŋ ečhél čhičáǧiŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5133> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“I’ll surely fix you up when I run into you.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5133;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš ičhúŋhaŋ kat’ápi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5134> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But in the meantime they killed him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5134;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋ Iktó ȟeyáb iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5135> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktó left away from there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5135;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hetáŋ akhé iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5136> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He left away from there again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5136;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni Lakȟóta wičhóuŋ kiŋ héhaŋ, pahá waŋ Zuzéča Pahá eyápi čha hél zuzéča waŋ líla tȟáŋka úŋ škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5145> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Back when there were old-time Lakota, a really big snake called the Black Snake lived on a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5145;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tuwéni ikhíyela yé šni kéyapi čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5146> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they say that nobody went near it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5146;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá él yá čháŋšna, tókȟaȟ’aŋ čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5147> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever someone went there, they disappeared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5147;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé kȟoškálaka núŋm étkiya yápi naháŋke ektá ípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5148> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so two young men went there and then they arrived there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5148;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Uŋmá kiŋháŋ wičálašni éyaš, íŋš uŋmá kiŋ thimá yíŋ kta kéya čhaŋké, iyókhišni éyaš, takómni thimá yíŋ kte ȟčiŋ čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5149> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "One of them didn’t refuse, but the other was going to go inside, and so he prevented him, but he still really wanted to go."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5149;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kaíyuzeya khinážiŋ kéye, uŋmá kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5150> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He stood a bit of a ways off, the other one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5150;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hiyúič’iyiŋ na héčhena thimá iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5151> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he jumped down and then he went inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5151;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Átaya buyéla hí na, átaya makȟá kiŋ nahúŋhuŋza kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5152> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A really big noise came and the ground really shook."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5152;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké héčhena uŋmá kiŋháŋ kaíyuzeya khinážiŋ na, ektá étuŋwaŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, líla waštémna thimá tȟaŋkátakiya lé wašúŋ etáŋ hinápȟa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5153> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then the other one was standing a ways off, and he saw there, and so a good smell came out from inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5153;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5154> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ektá étuŋwaŋ nážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ átaya zuzéča waŋ íčat’a hinápȟa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5154;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5154> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he stood looking there and then the snake came out really wildely."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5154;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5155> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hinápȟiŋ naháŋke héktakiya thimá gliyúŋkela kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5155;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5155> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It came out and then it lied down back inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5155;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5156> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "K’éyaš zuzéča kiŋ lé hé yukȟáŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5156;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5156> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the snake had horns."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5156;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla ištá tȟaŋkíŋkiŋyaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5157;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5157> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It had really big eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5157;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5158> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké lé táku ečhíŋ ektá étuŋwaŋ nážiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5158;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5158> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he stood looking at it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5158;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ átaya thimá héktakiya khigníŋ naháŋke, átaya p’ó hinápȟiŋ na, íyohakab zuzéča waŋ hinápȟa yuŋkȟáŋ, lé tȟaháŋšitku hé é čha waŋná haŋké zuzéča čhaŋké, pȟáiyuksa zuzéča šni, héčhena wičháša, na tȟaŋčháŋ kiŋ waŋná átaya zuzéča áya čhaŋké, eyá kéye, “tȟaháŋši, theȟíya oyáȟ’aŋ yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5159;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5159> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then it went back inside, and then a really bad fog came out, and afterwards a snake came out, and so it was his cousin that was now part snake, and so he wasn’t a snake from the waist up, he was still a man, and his body now had become that of a snake, and so he said, “cousin, you’re doing bad,”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5159;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5160> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “háŋ, eháŋni héčhamuŋ kte šni tkȟá yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5160;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5160> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “yeah, I shouldn’t have done that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5160;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhéya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5161> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5161;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ištámniǧaǧa ȟpáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5162> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He laid there with tears running down his face."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5162;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Éyaš yakhí kiŋháŋ, ináwaye na até owíčhakiyaka yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5163> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“But when you return, tell my mother and father,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5163;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Héčhel eyášna waníyetu waŋží čha,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5164> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“In that way often it will be once a winter,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5164;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókša wómakahipi kte ló,” “wómakahipi háŋtaŋhaŋ, tȟaŋkál wahímuŋkiŋ kte na waŋmáyaŋkapi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5165> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“They’ll definitely bring me food,” he said, “if they bring me food, I will come outside and they will see me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5165;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“K’éyaš iwáya owákihi kte šni čha waŋmáyaŋkapi kta héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5166> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“But I won’t be able to speak so they have to see me."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5166;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóyute ahímakiglepi háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hená wátiŋ kta čha aúpi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5167> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If they bring me food here, then I will eat it so they will bring it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5167;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋké héčhena tȟaŋháŋšitku kiŋ šuŋk’ákaŋ iyéič’iyiŋ na, héčhena čhéya glá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5168> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his cousin got on his horse, and went back crying."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5168;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena wičhóthi ektá khí na oyáka čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5169> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he got back and he told about it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5169;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ektá éhuŋnipi éyaš, waŋná kȟoškálaka kiŋ héčhena átaya zuzéča čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5170> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They arrived there taking him, but then the young man was completely a snake."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5170;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟá kiŋ kȟó áta čha zuzéča waŋ, áta íčat’a ahíyokas’iŋ hiyúŋkiŋ na, ištámniǧaǧa ȟpáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5171> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He looked lying down with his head being completely that of a snake, and he laid with tears rolling down his face."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5171;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké héčhegla húŋku na atkúku kiŋ wašíhiglapi na, átaya wíȟpeyapi na, ektá táku tȟawóyuha kiŋ hená aípi na, iléyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5172> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so all of a sudden his mother and father mourned about him, and they held a giveaway ceremony, and they came with his possessions, and they lit them on fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5172;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhuŋpi naháŋke, toháŋn hél ópta wičhómani čháŋšna, lé thitákuye kiŋ hená wóyute ékiglepi čháŋšna, ékiglepi na, ȟeyáb iyáyapi čháŋšna, hinápȟiŋ na, hená tókȟaȟ’aŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5173> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They did that, and then whenever they travelled through, whenever his relatives placed down his stuff, whenever they placed it down, and went away, he came out, and those things disappeared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5173;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké waníyetu óta héčhuŋ-haŋpi éyaš haŋkéya hinápȟe šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5174> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were doing that for many years but finally he didn’t come out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5174;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hél hé Zuzéča Pahá eyá čhažéyatapi kéyapi leháŋn lé aŋpétu kiŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5175> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So today they call it Snake Butte."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5175;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni wičhóoyake kiŋ wíŋyaŋ waŋ maȟpíya ektá yaŋká škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5207> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In an old story, a woman sits up in the heavens."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5207;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé maȟpíya tȟoyá yuŋké kiŋ héčhiya wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé yaŋká škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5208> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She sits there where the sky lays blue."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5208;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha eyášna wawópta ománi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5209> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she often went around digging things up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5209;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thíŋpsila k’á ománi na, čháŋšna lé wakȟáŋyeža ihákab šna ománipi čha, hená ókiyapi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5210> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She walked around digging up turnips, and often they children would walk behind here, so they helped her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5210;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋží waslóslolkiyeka čha, ihákab ú na, iyúŋǧa-haŋ kéye, “tákuwe čha lená lužúŋ he?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5211> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one of them was very curious to know things, so he went behind her, and asked her, “why is it that you pull those up?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5211;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čha, “ektá éyokas’iŋ šni ye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5212> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “don’t peak at it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5212;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nihíŋȟpayiŋ kte kštó,” eyá škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5213> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“You will fall.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5213;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Oȟlóka hetáŋ nihíŋȟpaye kiŋ líla tȟéhaŋ nihíŋȟpayiŋ kte kštó, héčhuŋ šni,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5214> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“When you fall from the hole you’ll fall for a long time, don’t do it,” she said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5214;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ léčhel iníhaŋšni lé thíŋpsila yužúŋpi čha, oȟlóka čha ektá šna éyokas’iŋ-haŋ škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5215> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boys pulled up the turnips paying no attention like that, so there was a hole so one was looking in it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5215;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tókheškhe éyokas’iŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, pašlúl iyéyiŋ naháŋ, oȟlóka kiŋ ogná hiŋȟpáya škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5216> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so somehow he was looking in it, and so it was slippery, and he fell through the hole."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5216;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké hiŋȟpáya čhaŋké, ayúta úŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, awáŋyaŋg khuwápi yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel ú na, héčhena áta iléȟya ú na, iyátakunišni na, etáŋ iléȟleȟya yaŋká škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5217> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he fell, and so they were looking at him, and so they watched him closely, and so he was coming like this, and then he came sparkling, and he vanished into thin air, and he sat shining from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5217;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hokšíla kiŋ hé wičháȟpi čha, hé maȟpíya ektáni héčhena yaŋká škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5218> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the boy is a star, so he sits there in the sky back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5218;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená iŋšé eháŋni wičhóoyake héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5219> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this is just the old story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5219;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iktómi ečíyapi kiŋ lé uŋgnáye šna wičháša na tókhi wablúška načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5222> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The one they call Iktómi is a trick man and he might be a bug."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5222;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyášna wičháša ič’íčaǧiŋ na uŋgnáš wamákȟaškaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5223> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He often transforms into a man and maybe he’s an animal."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5223;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na iyé tókhel ič’íčaǧiŋ kta héči héčhuŋ-s’e ič’íčaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5224> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "However he wants to turn himself into it, he turns himself into it just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5224;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na lé toháŋn wičháša háŋtaŋhaŋš, wičhášala čha líla hú čikčík’a na istó kȟó čikčík’ala."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5225> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if he is a man, he is a small man with small legs and small eyes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5225;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Líla niǧé tȟáŋka na natá tȟáŋka kéyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5226> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He has a really big stomach and he has a big head."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5226;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha pȟé él akáŋn hé yukȟé s’e pȟestóstoyela akáwiŋšwiŋšya háŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So on his head there are these sharp pointed things bending over."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5227;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku pȟé él akáŋn ičháǧa čha hená."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Something grows on his head."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5228;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha héhaŋ hé wablúška kéčhaŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5229> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I think he’s a bug."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5229;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hé toháŋn iyáyiŋ na, Lakȟóta óhaŋ iyáye čháŋšna, Lakȟóta kiŋ wičhágnayiŋ naíŋš, líla ówakȟaŋkȟaŋ naháŋ, uŋgná takúŋn ič’íčhaǧiŋ na, thiyóhaŋ iyáye háŋtaŋhaŋš, wičákȟa."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5230> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So whenever he leaves, and he goes among Lakota people, he tricks Lakota people, or he jokes around, and maybe he’ll turn into something, and if he goes in the community, he talks honestly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5230;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičálapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5231> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They believe him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5231;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wičálapi toháŋn takún waŋná ówakȟaŋkȟaŋ na, waéčhuŋ kte háŋtaŋhaŋš čha, hená oyáte kiŋ wičhágnayiŋ naháŋ, iglútȟokeča na, tóhuŋweni tákuni wašté ečhúŋ šni éyaš, hená iyúha Iktómi waéčhuŋ kiŋ tóhaŋni tuwéni slolyé šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5232> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They believe him when he jokes around, and when he’s about to do something, he tricks them, and he disguises himself, and he never does anything good, but nobody knows all those things that Iktómi does."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5232;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš wičálapi na, iŋšé waŋná wayúižena čháŋna šna héhaŋ, iyáyekiyiŋ na, oíglake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5233> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they believe him, and whenever he just causes trouble, he runs away, and reveals who he is."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5233;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Khéš akhé takún ipáyeȟ ečhúŋ čha, oyáte kiŋ toháŋn thiyóhaŋ hiyú čhaŋké, kte-wáčhiŋpi khéš, okíhipi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5234> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But whenever he did something wrong, he went among the people, and so they tried to kill him, but they couldn’t."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5234;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé táku wablúška načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5235> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he might be some sort of."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5235;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha oȟlóka naíŋš táku k’éyaš ektá mahél iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5236> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he goes inside holes or whatever."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5236;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku k’éyaš ič’íčaǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5237> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He transformed into whatever."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5237;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé isáŋm tákuni slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5238> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I don’t know anything more than that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5238;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé wahéhaŋyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5239> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5239;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lé iŋšé oyáte tȟókeča tȟáwa, tȟawóoyake héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5268> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This story is  just from a different nation."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5268;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé wíŋyaŋ waŋ waŋkáta maȟpíya ektá yaŋká čha hé é čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5269> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there is a woman who’s sitting up in the sky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5269;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé šiná waŋ káǧa škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5270> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This woman makes blankets."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5270;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šiná waŋ súŋ škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5271> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She waves a blanket."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5271;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha toháŋn súŋ áyiŋ našná, toháŋ ékignaka čha, šuŋȟpála waŋ lé šiná kiŋ haȟúŋta kiŋ yaȟtákiŋ našná, yaglá íŋyaŋkiŋ našná, yaglá iȟpéya čha, akhé phiyá káǧa škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5272> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she is weaving, and usually she sets it down, so a puppy bites the thread of the blanket, and usually he runs around uncoiling it, and usually it throws it unravelling it, so she makes it well again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5272;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Phiyá súŋ-haŋ škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5273> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was weaving it well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5273;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé oyákapi na, toháŋn šúŋka kiŋ lé áta yuglá ayúštaŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, na wíŋyaŋ kiŋ hé šiná waŋ súŋ kiŋ lé yuštáŋ háŋtaŋhaŋš, hé heháŋyela wičhóuŋ kiŋ lé iháŋke kta kéyapi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5274> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they say that, and if the dog stops unravelling it, if the woman finishes weaving the blanket, then they say that it will be the end of human life."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5274;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha táku waŋží oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5292> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I will tell something."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5292;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ uŋčíwaye waŋží hé é čha waníyetu óta ni yuŋkȟáŋ, aŋpétu waŋ él uŋkáyuštaŋpi na, iyáya éyaš, héčhena wičhóiye kiŋ lená aŋpétu waŋžígži wéksuye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it was one of my grandmothers who lived to be very old, and so one day she left us, and she went, but I still remember her words one day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5293;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel aŋpétu kiŋ lé él wóoyaka waŋží oyág-mašipi yuŋkȟáŋ hé weksúye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In that way they asked me to tell a story today and so I remember it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5294;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktómi kiŋ lená wičhášapišni škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5295> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Iktómis are really bad."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5295;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ Iktómi kiŋ lé ločhíŋ čha, héčhel aŋpétu waŋ él olówaŋ wówapi eyá k’íŋ na, héčhel yá yuŋkȟáŋ, maǧáksiča optáya waŋží héčhel átawičhaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5296> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this one Iktómi was hungry, so one day he was carrying around some songs, and he went like that, and so he ran into a flock of ducks."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5296;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičhágnaye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5297> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he tricked them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5297;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Iyúha hiyú po naháŋ iyúha miméya inážiŋ yíŋ na, čhičílowaŋpi kta čha wačhí po,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5298> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Come here y’all and stand in a circle everyone, and I will sing to you so dance,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5298;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Naháŋ tuwá yatúŋwaŋ kiŋ ištá nižákapi kte ló,” eyá wičhágnayaŋ čha, héčhel lowáŋ čha, áta wačhípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5299> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He tricked them saying, “and when someone opens their eye, they’ll pop out,” so they sung like that, so they all danced."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5299;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ táku waŋ yuhá čha ičú na, héčhel waŋná tóna áta wičhákat’a."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5300> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he had one so he took it and then like that he killed several of them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5300;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahéhaŋl waŋží tuŋwáŋ čha, hé oyáka kéye, “tuŋwáŋ po, Iktómi waŋná húŋȟ uŋkát’api,” eyá čha, tuŋwáŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhuŋ čha, iyáyekiyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5301;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5301> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At about that time one of them opened its eyes, so he said, “open your eyes, Iktómi has killed some of us,” so they opened their eyes, and so he had done that, so they fled."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5301;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5302> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na wičhákat’e uŋ hená wičhágnayiŋ na, wičhákat’e hená iwíčhaču na, uŋmá hená napȟápi čha, héčhel lená wičháyuha na, héčhena khútakiya líla čhaŋtéwašteya yá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5302;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5302> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he tricked them in having killed them, and he took those that he killed, and the others fled, so he took them like that, and he went down really happy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5302;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhiya čhethí na, áta čhowíčhak’iŋ eyápi čha héčhuŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5303;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5303> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There he built a fire, and he cooked them in it so he did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5303;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5304> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na awíyuškiŋ kaȟyá čháŋ, núŋm íčhikakiziŋ na, yuŋkȟáŋ kakíza-haŋ čhaŋké, héčhel heyá kéye, “héčhuŋpi šni yo, winíčhowepi škȟá yéčhizapi kte ȟčiŋ yeló,” eyíŋ na, héčhel iyáhiŋ na, yuléhaŋ iwíčhaču-wačhíŋ čha, héčhel sí kiŋ anáǧipiŋ na, gličú okíhi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5304;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5304> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And while he was happy about it, two trees rubbed against each other, and so it was squeaking, and so he said, “don’t do that, you are relatives but don’t try to fight each other,” and he went up them like that, and he tried to pull them apart, so his foot got stuck, and he couldn’t come down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5304;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5305> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhiya waŋkáta yaŋké kiŋ waléhaŋl, šuŋgmáyetu kiŋ, – íŋš-eyá wičhášapišni škhé eháŋni – na hél hé íŋš-eyá ločhíŋ čha, aglágla ú-haŋ hé waŋyáŋka čha, lé él hí na, ómnamna yuŋkȟáŋ, hé maǧáksiča kiŋ lená é čha čhowíčhak’iŋ čha waŋyáŋka čha, héčhel yaslútiŋ na, hél áta wótiŋ na, wíphiič’iyiŋ na, héčhel omášte čha, él amášteič’iya ȟpáya-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5305;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5305> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So at around the time when he was sitting up there, a coyote came, – he was also mean back then – and he was hungry too, so he saw him coming going by, so he came up to him, and he smelled it repeatedly, and so he saw the ducks that there were that were cooking, so he pulled them out with his teeth, and he ate it all, and he was full, and like that it got nice out, so he laid down sunbathing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5305;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5306> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena gličú kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5306;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5306> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He came back like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5306;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná lé anáǧipe waŋ hé tókheškhe ečhúŋ na, kaǧáŋ čha, kiyúǧaŋ čha, héčhel hiŋȟpáyaič’iyiŋ na, gličú na, waŋyáŋke éyaš, eháŋni iyúha tȟebyíŋ na, héčhena iyáyekiya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5307;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5307> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the one who was stuck did something, and the wind came, so he opened them up, so he himself fell down, and got back, and he saw him, but he’d eaten all of it long ago, and he didn’t run away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5307;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5308> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ho lé akhé hél wóiyukčaŋ waŋ káǧe kiŋ hé čhéǧa waŋ áta mní okáštaŋ na piȟyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5308;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5308> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So again he had an idea of filling a kettle full of water and he boiled it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5308;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5309> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé iyéye háŋtaŋhaŋš, hél oíȟpeyiŋ na, ho hé yútiŋ kta čha héčhuŋ na, olé éyaš, iyéye šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5309;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5309> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "If he found it he would throw it onto him, and eat him, so he did that, and he looked for it, but he didn’t find it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5309;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋyela Iktómi wičhóoyake hé heháŋyela iháŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5310> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is the end of this Iktómi story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5310;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé tókhetu."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5311> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s how it goes."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5311;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela hé uŋčíwaye kiŋ lé omákiyake."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5312> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "My grandmother told me that one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5312;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋl wičhóoyake waŋží ptéčela čha oblákiŋ kta yuŋkȟáŋ lé ohúŋkakaŋ héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5315> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then there’s a small story so I’ll tell it and so it’s a fable."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5315;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wakȟáŋheža kȟúŋšitku kiŋháŋ ób yaŋkíŋ na, waŋná iyúŋkapi kte itȟókab, héčhel keyá kéye, “tȟakóža, hiyú pe na, lél miméya híyutaka pe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5316> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the grandma sits with kids, and then before they would go to sleep, she said, “grandchilden, come here, and sit here in a circle around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5316;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Huŋčhíčikakaŋpi kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5317> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I will tell y’all an old story.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5317;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyá kéye, “toháŋl wičhóoyake kiŋ lé očhíčiyakapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, éblaštaŋ čha, ‘háŋ,’ eyá pe” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5318> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “if I tell you all this story, I finish, so say ‘yes.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5318;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé táku uŋ hé wičháši héči slolwáye šni éyaš, hé ogná, “háŋ,” eyápi eháŋtaŋhaŋš, ho patȟáke šni owíčhakiyakiŋ kta héčhetu čha, kȟá kéčhaŋmi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5319> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I don’t know why she asked that of them but, if they said, “yes,” she would tell them, so she wouldn’t stop in that way, so I think it means that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5319;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyá kéye, “omníča na pȟeží na pȟéta, hená yámni kȟolákičhiyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5320> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “there were three friends who were beans, grass, and fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5320;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho yuŋkȟáŋ hená ptáya ománi yápi kta kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5321> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they would go walking along together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5321;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ yápi yuŋkȟáŋ wakpála waŋ ȟpáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5322> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were talking and so a stream was lying there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5322;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ mní kiŋ šmá čha tókheškhe iyúweǧapi kta héči he óhuta él nážiŋpi na iwóglakapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5323> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the water was deep so they stood there talking about how they would cross it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5323;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ pȟeží kiŋ lé heyá kéye, ‘tóktu éyaš miyé maháŋska čha, iŋtȟó wakpála kiŋ lél ópta imúŋkiŋ kte ló,’ eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5324> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the grass said, ‘whatever happens I myself am long, so I guess I’ll lay across the river."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5324;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "‘Kiŋháŋ waŋží tȟógtȟog ogná alí imáyalalapi kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5325> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "‘Then you all will go walking on me one-by-one."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5325;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho tókša kȟowákataŋ ilúweǧapi kiŋ tókša wékta na óčhipȟapi kte ló,’ eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So I’ll sit up them having crossed the river and I will join you all.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5326;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, ‘oháŋ,’ eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5327> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they said, ‘okay.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5327;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "‘Héčhel wašté yeló,’ eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5328> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said, ‘it’s good that way.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5328;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho waŋná pȟeží hé áta wakpála ópta iyúŋka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5329> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then the grass laid across the river."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5329;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho omníča íŋš tȟokéya iyáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5330> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The bean didn’t go first."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5330;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pȟéta hé é čha tȟokáheya yá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5331> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Because it was fire that went first."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5331;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná alí na, čhokáŋgnaŋya yé kiŋ waléhaŋl, pȟéta áta pȟeží kiŋ lé okséya čha, kičhí mahíyayiŋ na, ókaȟ iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5332> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he walked on him, and at the time when he went across the middle, the fire burned the grass, so he fell, and he floated away."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5332;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Chaŋké omníča nážiŋ-hiŋ na, wóiȟakalaka nážiŋ-hiŋ na, iȟát’a-hiŋ na, iȟát’a-hiŋ na, haŋkéya čhokáŋyaŋ nabláza kéye.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5333> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the bean was standing there, and he stood there finding it kind of funny, and he was laughing, and he was laughing, and eventually he burst open.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5333;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋyela owíhaŋke kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5334> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5334;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wawíyopȟeya ománi waŋ héčheča ká Mission, South Dakota étkiya glá yuŋkȟáŋ wičhíŋčala núŋm máni glápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5359> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A sort of traveling salesman was coming back to Mission, South Dakota when two young girls were walking back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5359;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Háŋ tȟéhaŋ éyaš, máni glápi čhaŋké, inážiŋ naháŋ, heyá kéye, “očhígnakapi naháŋ Mission ektá akhíȟpečhiyapi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5360> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It had been nighttime for a while, but they were walking back, and so he stopped and said, “I’ll give you two a lift and drop you off there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5360;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čhaŋké, “oháŋ,” eyápi na, nuŋphíŋ mahél íyutakapi khéš, ókowaŋžila iȟát’api kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5361> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said that and so they said, “okay,” and both got in, but they were laughing the whole time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5361;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké owóglag yaŋkíŋ na, waŋná Mission kiŋ khiyéla glápi yuŋkȟáŋ, uŋmá heyá kéye, “lél uŋglíyačupi kte,” ho eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5362> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he sat talking, and then they were nearing Mission, and so one of them said, “we will get out here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5362;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “tókša ektá ȟčiŋ éȟpečhiyapi kte k’uŋ,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “hiyá, lél uŋglíyačupi kte k’uŋ.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5363> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “surely I’ll drop you two off further on the way,” and so she said, “no, we’ll get out right here.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5363;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho eyá čha čhaŋkú él inážiŋ čhaŋké nuŋphíŋ gličúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5364> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he stopped on the road and so both of them got out."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5364;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nuŋphíŋ gličúpi naháŋke, iyóškokpa étkiya íŋyaŋg iyáyapi čhaŋké, awíčhayuta yuŋkȟáŋ, nuŋphíŋ heȟáka héčhapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5365> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They both got out, and so they left running towards a ditch, and so he looked at them, and so it’s said that both of them were elk."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5365;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké áta yuš’íŋyeyapi čha, gníŋ na, héčhena Mission ektá khihúŋni naháŋke, oyáke k’éyaš, tuwéni wičákȟela šni, hená iyúha čhet’úŋglapi čha, iyópteya Mission kiŋ khigníŋ, na otȟúŋwahe kiŋ isáŋm khiglá yuŋkȟáŋ, akhé hená é čha glápi čha, iníhaŋšni owíčhagnaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5366> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they really scared him, and so he we going back, and then he got back to Mission, and then he told it, but nobody believed him, they all doubted him, so he left back through Mission, and he left back to the town further away from there, and so again it was them that were going along, so he picked them up again without any fear."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5366;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé iŋšé, “otúyačhiŋ héčheča,” kéčhiŋ na, owíčhagnakiŋ naháŋ, toháŋn glá yuŋkȟáŋ, iȟát’api čha, sí ektá awíčhayuta yuŋkȟáŋ, sí kiŋ okhížatapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5367> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again he just thought, “it’s no problem,” and he picked them up, and he was going back, and so they laughed, so he looked at their feet, and so they were forked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5367;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Napé kiŋ awíčhayuta yuŋkȟáŋ, okhížatapi na, ištá tȟaŋkíŋkiŋyaŋpi na, phuté kiŋháŋ sapsápapi čhaŋké, áta inážiŋ naháŋke, tȟaŋgság t’á kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5368> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He looked at their hands and so they were forked and their eyes were bit and their noses were black and so he stopped and then he was scared half to death."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5368;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na, “gličú po, lená wičháša heníčhapi šni yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5369> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “get out, you are not human!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5369;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Lená wičháša akáŋtu heníčhapi šni yeló,” naháŋke, áta hetáŋni kawíŋǧiŋ na, héktakiya Mission ektá khihúŋni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5370> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“You are not human beings,” and so he turned around, and he arrived back in Mission."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5370;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tȟaŋság t’á kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5371> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was scared half to death."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5371;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké Lakȟóta kiŋ okíyakapi naháŋke eyášna hógna šna héčheča škȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5372> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so Lakota people told him it and so it was often like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5372;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tákuwe hél ogná haŋómayani he?” eyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said, “where were you travelling at night like that?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5373;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Čha hená heȟáka čha, eyášna iglútȟokečapi našná, héčhuŋpe ló,” eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5374> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said, “so it is elks that they turn into, and so they do that.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5374;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá okíyakapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5375> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They said that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5375;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha ičínuŋpani hé wašíču kiŋ hé hé ogná tóhuŋweni haŋíyopta šna wawíyopȟeya hiyáye šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5376> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s said that white travelling salesman never went through there at night again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5376;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni atéwaye kiŋ kȟoškálaka k’uŋ héhaŋ čha, tȟéčaka čha héhaŋ, líla enágna ománi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5393;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5393> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago when my father was a young man, he was young, so back then he walked around sometime."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5393;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ léčhel oyákapi na, hél wičháša waŋ tȟawíču kičhí thí kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5394> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they told it like this, and a man lived with his wife."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5394;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wičháša kiŋ tókhi okó waŋží naíŋš, uŋgnáš isáŋmya šna tókhi iyáyiŋ našná, glí kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5395;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5395> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the man left for maybe a week, and possibly even longer, and usually he came back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5395;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋšna wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé líla tȟéhaŋhaŋ išnála yaŋká čha, watóhaŋn wičháša waŋ ektá šna waŋyáŋg í kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5396> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever she was there alone for long periods of time, sometimes a man came to see her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5396;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké éyaš slolkíye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5397> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he didn’t know that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5397;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé wičháša yuhá škáŋ slolyé šni čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5398> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He didn’t know that this woman was messing around with this guy."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5398;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé iyáyiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5399> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was planning to leave again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5399;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Toháŋn iyáyiŋ kta čha líla iyáyekhiya ináȟni éyaš, uŋgnáhaŋšna ȟ’aŋhíya šna škáŋ-haŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5400> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I was going to leave so she hurried him to leave but every now and then he usually got ready slowely."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5400;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké iŋšé lol’íȟ’aŋ na, wakȟáŋyaŋ wók’u na, ohítiya škáŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5401> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she just cooked and fed him sacred food and he worked hard."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5401;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ čha waŋná iyáye šni háŋni, léčhel pahá ečhíyataŋhaŋ, ahíyokas’iŋ hinážiŋ kéye, tȟawíčhaša, čha wíŋyaŋ kiŋ lé ináȟni hiŋgnáku kiŋ iyáyekhiyiŋ kte ȟčiŋ naháŋke, waŋná kítaŋȟčiŋ iyáya čhaŋké, ektá étuŋwaŋ nážiŋ-haŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, yíŋ na, héčhena waŋná pahá aínaŋm iyáya čhaŋké, héčhena uŋmá wičháša kiŋ lé pahá ečhíyataŋhaŋ, ahíyokas’iŋ ȟpáya-haŋ čha, étkiya šiná koskóza čhaŋké, waŋná šúŋkawakȟáŋ kiŋ iyéič’iyiŋ na, étkiya ú-hiŋ na, ektá hihúŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5402> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then before he left, he stopped peeking from the other side of the hill, her boyfriend, and so this woman really wanted to have her husband leave and then he barely left and so he stood watching him and so he was going and then he went to the other side of the hill and so this other man laid looking from the other side of the hill so she waved a blanket at him and so then he mounted his horse and was coming towards her and he arrived."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5402;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “má, lé lol’íwaȟ’aŋ čha tȟóéyaš tȟokéya wayátiŋ kte,” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5403> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she said, “well, I’ve cooked so you will eat first.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5403;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Waŋná iyáye kštó,” eyá čhaŋké, thimá hiyú na, waŋná wól íyutakiŋ naháŋke, ožáŋglepi etáŋ tȟaŋkátakiya éyokas’iŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel uŋgnáhelaka héktakiya šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋka waŋ ú čhaŋké, héya kéye, “kú weló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5404> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Now he’s left,” she said, and so he came inside, and then he sat down to eat, and then he peered out from the window, and so suddenly a rider was coming back like that, and so he said, “he’s coming!”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5404;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Kú weló,” eyíŋ na, héčhena áta paŋȟyá khináŋpȟa kéye čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5405> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“He’s coming,” he said and then he left back out in a mad rush."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5405;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta toháŋn okíhilaka íŋyaŋkiŋ naháŋke, thilázatakiya našlóg khigníŋ kta yuŋkȟáŋ, slolyé šni čha, hél ohómni čhaŋkáškapi čhaŋké, áta yuhékta iȟpéye éyaš, inážiŋ na, sloháŋ-haŋ ȟpáyiŋ na, čhuŋkáške kiŋ iyóȟlathe iyáyiŋ na, toháŋn okíhilaka íŋyaŋkiŋ na, héčhena áta hél mayá kaksáksapi waŋ čha áta íŋyaŋkiŋ na, héčhena héčhi ohíŋȟpaya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5406> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He ran as hard as he could, and then he was going to rush to the back of the house, so he didn’t know that there was a fence around there, and so he threw it back, but he stopped, and slid, and he went under the fence, and he was running as fast as he could, and then there was a steep cliff, so he ran and he fell off of it there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5406;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena oníyaŋ katȟáŋkal hiyúya čha, tókȟa kiktá šni ȟpáya yuŋkȟáŋ, wíŋyaŋ kiŋ é čha ektá étuŋwiŋ na, “ma éya tákuni šni kštó, gliyáhaŋ yé éyaš, toníkheča šni he?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “háŋ, tomákheča šni yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5407> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then his breath was knocked out of him, so he lay there not waking up, and so it was the woman that saw him, and she said, “goodness, it’s nothing, come back up, but are you alright?” and so he said, “yeah, nothing’s the matter.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5407;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čhaŋké, “ho čha hiyú we,” éyaš, “tȟóhiŋyaŋka yo,” eyá čhaŋké, “tákuwe?"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5408> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said it and so she said, “so come here,” but he said, “wait a minute,” and so he said, “why?"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5408;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éna úŋ he?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “iyáya he?” yuŋkȟáŋ, “tákuni šni kštó, hé iŋšé theȟmúǧa čha, ožáglepi él alí hiyáya čha, hé waŋlákiŋ naháŋ, nayápȟe kštó,” eyá čha, “wáŋ, theȟíya mičíkte tkȟá waŋ,” eyíŋ na, “ičínuŋpani ožáŋglepi kiŋ hená yaglúžaža kiŋ héčhel tákuniš héčhel awákhipȟa kte šni škȟá."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5409> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Is he right there?” and so he said, “did he leave?” and so she said, “it’s nothing, it was just a fly that was crawling across the window, so you didn’t see him, and you ran away,” so he said, “I almost killed myself so bad,” and he said, “nothing bad would have happened to me with you having cleaned the windows a second time."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5409;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kat’émayaye k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You’re the one who made me fall down.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5410;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhegla iglúštaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5411> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5411;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl akhé waŋží oblákiŋ kta yuŋkȟáŋ, hé kȟoškálaka waŋ tóhaŋni tȟawíčutȟuŋ šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5448> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then I’ll tell you another one, and so a man had never been married."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5448;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš wičháša lená eháŋn t’at’á ewíčhakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5449> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the men back then called him disabled."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5449;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "T’at’á eyá čhažéwičhayatapi yuŋkȟáŋ hé é čha, kȟoškálaka kiŋ lé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5450> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They called him disabled, and so it was him, this young man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5450;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ owítaya waŋ él wítayapi yuŋkȟáŋ, wikȟóškalaka waŋ líla wíŋyaŋ wašté čha čhiŋčá yuŋkȟáŋ, kéye yuŋkȟáŋ, hé wikȟóškalaka kiŋ wičháša waŋží kičhí úŋ kta čha, wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ lé tuwá atéyiŋ kta čha, olépi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5451> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they gathered in a meeting together, and so a very pretty young woman had a son, and so that young woman would live with a man, so somebody would be the child’s father, so they chose him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5451;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná átaya wičháša kiŋ wítayapi na miméya íyutag áyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5452> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then all the men gathered, and they went sitting in a circle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5452;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wakȟáŋyežala kiŋ lé héčhel aglágla yeyápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5453> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they passed the child around like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5453;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená iyúha wičháša hé ičúpi na, yuhá yaŋkápi našná, akhé isákhib yaŋké hé k’úpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho héčhel yá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5454> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they all took it, and they had him sitting down, and usually if they gave him to the person next to them, he would go."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5454;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé wakȟáyeža kiŋ hé tuwá aíheye háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hé atéyiŋ kta čha hé uŋ, héčhuŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5455> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if that child peed on somebody, he would be the father, so that’s why they did it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5455;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ lé héčhel aglágla yeyápi yuŋkȟáŋ, kȟáŋšnišniyela t’at’á wičháša waŋ hé aíheye kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5456> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they passed the child around like that, and so unexpectedly he peed on the disabled man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5456;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé lé wíŋyaŋ, wikȟóškalaka wíŋyaŋ wašté, ho hé waŋná kičhí úŋ kta čha, uŋmápi kiŋ hená čhiŋčá t’at’á čha, kitáŋla iwáȟtelapišni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5457> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this woman, the pretty youg woman, he would live with her so the others so they hated the disabled man for that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5457;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wikȟóškalaka waŋ wíŋyaŋ wašté čha yúziŋ kta hé uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5458> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He would be marrying the pretty young woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5458;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyela owíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5459> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5459;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wičhóoyake kiŋháŋ eháŋni Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ igláka ománipi na, tuktélšna kaȟmí waŋží él čháŋ na, mní ikȟáŋyela eyášna, éthipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5498> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This story, old-time Lakota people were walking moving, and sometimes whenever there was a riverbed, they often camped by the water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5498;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ etáŋ kȟoškálaka waŋží héčhel zuyá iyáye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a young man left on the warpath from it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5499;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóna zuyá iyáyapi na etáŋ waŋží glí šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Several left on the warpath and one of them didn’t come back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5500;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel oyákapi na, glí šni kiŋ lé wayáka ičúpi, héčhuŋ-s’e oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they talked like that, and they took the one who didn’t come back as a prisoner, they said it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5501;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wikȟóškalaka kiŋ lé kȟoškálaka kiŋ lé hé tȟawíčhaša."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so this young woman had this young man as a husband."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5502;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel iyókiphi šni na, wí hináŋpȟe šni háŋni, héčhel šuŋk’ák’iŋ iyákaškiŋ na, kȟoškálaka waŋ kašká yuskhíyiŋ na, kičhí iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she was said about that, and before it was dawn, she fastened her saddle, and she got a man to lead a horse for her, and she left with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5503;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ȟé waŋ líla waŋkátuya čha hé ektá wazízi ožú čha inážiŋpi na, khútakiya étuŋwaŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, áta tȟóka kiŋ yumímeya wičhóthi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And it was very deep in the mountain in a grove of pines that they stopped, and they looked down, and so they saw an enemy village in a circle."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5504;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel iwáŋyaŋkapi kiŋháŋ, tuktétu čha wayáka ičúpi kiŋ hé slolyápi s’eléčheča kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it was at the point where they were examining it, that they felt like they knew the taken man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5505;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha waŋná hiyóȟpayapi na ečhétkiya úpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5506> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then they descended from the hill and they were coming towards it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5506;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ thípi waŋ él ihúŋnipi na, uŋmá gličú na, héčhel okáǧeǧe kiŋ tókhi lená okó načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5507> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they arrived to the tipi and one of them got off the hourse and there might have been a hole in the seems."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5507;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha etáŋ éyokas’iŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, héčheča kta kȟoškálaka waŋ hé thimá héčhel kašká nážiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5508> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he peeked inside, and so it was like that that the young man was inside standing all tied up."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5508;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na othímahe hiyú kiŋ él isákhib wičháša waŋ awáŋyaŋg yaŋká kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5509> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And a man sat near the tipi entrance on lookout."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5509;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš ištíŋma kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But he was sleeping."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5510;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha héčhel míla yuhápi čha, nážiŋ kiŋ aíyopteya thiíkčeya kiŋ lé héčhel waȟléčapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5511> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So like that they took their knives, so they cut open the tipi matching with the body of the man standing there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5511;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waȟléčapi na, kašká nážiŋ kiŋ lená nakúŋ áta owápsapsakapi na, yutȟáŋkal ikíkčupi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5512> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They cut through, and they cut loose the young man standing there as prisoner, and they took him outside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5512;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho ak’íŋ iyákaška aípi k’uŋ hé akáŋl íyutakiŋ na, héčhiyataŋ kičhí napȟápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5513> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they sat down fastening him to the sattle, and from there they left with him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5513;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta naúŋg kúpi naháŋ pahá waŋ él khútakiya étuŋwaŋ nážiŋpi héčhiya glihúŋnipi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5514> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were galloping back and they reached a hilltop standing there looking back down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5514;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na opčélyela héčhel khútakiya étuŋwaŋ nážiŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, wičháša waŋ ú na, hé kȟoškálaka waŋ etáŋ yutȟókȟaŋl ičúpi kiŋ hé éyokas’iŋ na, héčhena áta tȟóka iyá éyapaha kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5515> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they were standing, and looking down there like that for a while, and so a man was coming, and he peered in at the young man that they removed from there, and he called out in their language."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5515;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aglágla hiyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5516> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They went passing by there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5516;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta hená ahínapȟapi na ečhétketkiya íŋyaŋg aúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5517> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They really started to come into sight and they ran towards it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5517;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5518> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ kȟoškálaka waŋ wayáka ičúpi hé tókȟaȟ’aŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5518;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5518> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the man that they took captive had disappeared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5518;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta lená tȟóka kiŋháŋ táku iyá wókičhiyakapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5519;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5519> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "All those people in that band talked to each other in their language."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5519;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Šúŋkawakȟáŋ akáŋyaŋkapi lená kaškáška wičhákiglepi čha, hé akáŋ iyéič’iyapi na, áta natáŋ ahíyupi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5520;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5520> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They got on their tied up horses, so they jumped on, and they came charging."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5520;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5521> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wahéhaŋl lená átaya khiglékiyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5521;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5521> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "At around this time they ran away quickly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5521;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ahíthipi waŋ hé ečhétkiya khiglékiyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They ran away towards where they were camped."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5522;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Áta naúŋg glápi na, glápi na ečhél, khihúŋnipi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They really galloped on the way back, until they arrived back home."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5523;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ akhíhuŋnipi čha, áta tȟaóyate kiŋháŋ héčhel gluháha čhéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they arrived back, so the people really hugged him and cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5524;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na heháŋl wičhóoyake kiŋ lé heháŋl héčhuŋ-s’e oyákapi nawáȟ’uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then I’ve heard them telling the story just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5525;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Isáŋm tókhetu héči slolwáye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I don’t know if there’s more to it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5526;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš aŋpétu leháŋl tȟóka kiŋ hé kiksúya úŋpi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays it’s said that the enemy still remembers it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5527;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhi wičhóičhaǧe hená kákhel okíčhiyag aúpi kiŋ uŋ leháŋl leháŋhiŋniya wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ hé kiksúyapi héčhuŋ-s’e oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Maybe those generations passed it along up to today as a tradition that they remember through telling it just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5528;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel eháŋni oyáte kiŋháŋ igláka ománipi k’uŋ héhaŋ, tukté él éwičhothi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5557> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When the old-time people were moving camp, they camped along there somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5557;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel wíŋyaŋ waŋ etáŋ héčhel yuwáčhiŋkȟopi čha tókȟaȟ’aŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5558> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they made a woman pout like that so she disappeared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5558;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš tuwéni olé šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5559> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nobody found her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5559;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5560> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókša héčhel héktakiya khí kta iyúkčaŋpi na, olépi šni éyaš, éna thípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5560;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5560> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They thought that she would definitely come back there, and they didn’t look for her, but they lived back there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5560;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel tókhi wí waŋží sáŋm yá wahéčhetuya tókȟaȟ’aŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5561> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she had been missing for around maybe more than a month."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5561;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé táku tȟáwa hená kič’íŋ na maníŋtakiya yá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5562> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she carried her own belongings on her back and was going in the forest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5562;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhel maníŋtakiya yíŋ na pahá akáŋl íyutaka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5563> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was going in the forest like that and she sat on a hill."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5563;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ léčhel šuŋgmáyetu waŋ watóhaŋ héčhel hinážiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5564> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so a coyote stopped at a distance from here like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5564;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé hinážiŋ na, ayúta nážiŋ-hiŋ na, héčhena khiglá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It stopped and stood staring at her and then it left back to where it came from."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5565;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lé wíŋyaŋ kiŋ nážiŋ iyáyiŋ na ihákab yá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5566> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the woman got up and went following it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5566;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel gníŋ na, pahá makȟóšiča s’eléčheča waŋ égna iyáya yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhel hél oȟlóka waŋ háŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, hél mahél khiglá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5567> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so she was going back like that, and she left through what felt like a hill in the Badlands, a hole was there like that, and so it went back inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5567;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héhaŋ lé oȟlóka kiŋ nakúŋ wičhóiye waŋ él yukȟé éyaš, wéksuye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5568> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So there was a word for this hole, but I don’t remember it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5568;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš hél mahél šuŋgmáyetu kiŋ lé hél thimá khiglá čha, ihákab thumá iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5569> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But the coyote arrived back inside the hole, so she went following it inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5569;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ šuŋgmáyetu kiŋ hé ečéla šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5570> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so that coyote wasn’t alone."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5570;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tóna áta hél ptáya thípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5571> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Several lived there together."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5571;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš tákuni wóhitikapi naíŋš, yaȟtákapi naíŋš, tákuni šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5572> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But none of them were violent, or bit her, or nothing."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5572;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hél ób thí kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5573> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So she lived there with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5573;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hél šna ištíŋmiŋ na, híhaŋni kiktá čha, lená tókhiya iyáyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5574> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She often fell asleep there, and woke up in the morning, so they left somewhere."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5574;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Našná watóhaŋl šna aglípi čháŋna šna, héčhel tȟaló yapȟá aglípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5575> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And usually whenever they arrived back with something, they arrived back with meat in their mouths."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5575;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ tókhi itȟókab iȟpékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5576> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And maybe they would throw some in front of her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5576;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čháŋna šna lé míla waŋ yuhá čha, héčhel wakábla na, hená pusyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5577> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever she had a knife, she prepared the meat like that, and then dried it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5577;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pusyá-haŋ uŋ waŋná líla óta yuhá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5578> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She had a lot upon drying it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5578;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ tȟéhaŋ ób úŋ kiŋ uŋ waŋná iyé nawíčhaȟ’uŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5579> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And after a long while of living with tem she understood their language."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5579;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná líla pápa óta káǧa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5580> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then she made a lot of jerky."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5580;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wóžuha waŋ áta héčhel ožúya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5581> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She filled a whole sack like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5581;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋží tókhi iyáya yuŋkȟáŋ, glí naháŋke, hél heyá kéye, “uŋčí, híŋhaŋni kiŋ iglúwiŋyeya yo, uŋkániyapi kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5582> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so maybe one left, and so it came back, and it said, “grandmother, get ready for tomorrow, we will take you somewhere.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5582;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Pahá kiŋ lél akȟótaŋhaŋ héčhi nitȟáoyate kiŋ hená ahíwičhothipi yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5583> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Your people came and made a camp over there on the far side of this hill,” it said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5583;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho čha ektá uŋkániyapi kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5584> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It said, “so we will bring you to there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5584;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé híŋhaŋni él tókhi waŋná wačhíkȟo hé čhaŋlákisni načhéče úŋ na, wí waŋží sáŋm yá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5585> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that morning maybe she recovered from her pouting, and she was going around for more than a month."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5585;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel waŋná iglúwiŋyeya naháŋ, pápa ožútȟuŋ hé kič’íŋ na, waŋná sagyékitȟuŋ na, waŋná ób iyáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5586> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Now in that way she was ready, and she carried a bag that she filled with jerky, and then she used a can, and she went with them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5586;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yíŋ na, waŋží tȟokéya yíŋ na, hé pahá akáŋl héčhel inážiŋ na, khútakiya étuŋwaŋ nážiŋ čha, iyáhiŋ na, ečhétkiya yíŋ na, isákhib inážiŋ yuŋkȟáŋ, áta khúta héčhel tȟaóyate kiŋ yumímeya héčhel ahíthipi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5587> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was going, and one was going first, and it stopped on the hill like that, and it stood looking down, so she reached the top of the hill, and was going there, and she stood next to it, and so the people were camped in a circle down there like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5587;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé éthipi waŋ hé etáŋ tókȟaȟ’aŋ hé ipáyeȟ héčhel éthipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5588> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They were camped just there upon here disappearance when they were camped there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5588;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ipáyeȟ éthipi éyaš, héčhenaš ikȟáŋyela, oúŋye kiŋ hél ikȟáŋyela éthipi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5589> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were camped just there, but they were still close, they were close to where they were camped."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5589;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha lená ománipi čha slolyápi čha, ektá paháta aípi čha, hó hetáŋ išnála wakíč’iŋ na, wičhóthi kiŋ ečhétkiya héčhel glá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5590> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they know that they were walking, so they arrived at the hill, and she carried her own belongings on her own from there, and she was going back towards the village like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5590;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Gníŋ na, waŋná kȟaŋyéla khihúŋni yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhel átaya wíŋyaŋ hená áta našlóg ahíyupi na, pȟóskiski oyúspapi na, gluháha čhéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5591> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She was going back, and then she arrived close, and so all the women came up to her, and they hugged her, and cried."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5591;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eháŋni oyáte kiŋháŋ tuwá tókȟaȟ’aŋ čháŋna šna, héčhel héktakiya khí čháŋšna, íŋš héktakiya akhé waŋglákapi čha, héčhel gluháha čhéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5592> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "A long time ago whenever someone in the band went missing, whenever they came back, they saw them coming back, so they hugged them and cried like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5592;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhuŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5593> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they did that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5593;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl heháŋyaŋ owíhaŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5594> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5594;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé tȟóka kiŋháŋ, Psáloka kiŋháŋ, haŋíyokpaziŋ na, mniózaŋzaŋ čha héčhel Lakȟóta wičhóthi kiŋ ečhétkiya šuŋgmánuŋ aúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5611> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well then I will tell you something, the enemies, Crow people, came at night in the rain towards a Lakota village in order to steal some horses."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5611;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná Lakȟóta kiŋ slolyápi čha, wíčhokaŋ sáŋm hiyáye heháŋni, iglúiŋyeyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5612> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then the Lakota people knew, so when it was afternoon, they got ready."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5612;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋsakala naksáksapi na, thimá ékiglepi na, šúŋka hé kašká thimá ékiglepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5613> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They broke off twigs, and they put them inside, and they tied up the dogs inside."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5613;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ héčhel iyúha ečháŋni héčhel wótapi na waŋna éyuŋkapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5614> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And in that way they all ate early and then they rested there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5614;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčheča kte k’uŋ waŋná šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋka waŋ ú kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5615> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so when it was like that then the horseman was coming."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5615;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ú čha ótȟaŋiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5616> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was obvious that he was coming."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5616;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ ú na héčhena lé thípi kiŋ lél isákhib hinážiŋ čha ótȟaŋiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5617> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was coming and then it was obvious that he stoped next to a tipi."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5617;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel kȟoškálaka waŋ hé thípi kiŋ hél thumá yaŋké kiŋ hé mázawakȟáŋ waŋ yuhá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5618> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The young man that sat inside the tipi there had a gun."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5618;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho eháŋni wašíču ób héčhel kȟolákičhiyapi hená tákuku waháŋ yuhápi hená gloípi čha, íŋš-eyá ičhíč’uya mázawakȟáŋ iyópȟeyapi naíŋš, táku wičhák’upi čha, íŋš-eyá oštáŋ takúŋl héčhel wičhák’upi keye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5619> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "In the old times they went with the hides that they had to the white people that they were friends with, so in return they traded them guns, or gave them things, so they received something in return."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5619;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé é čha uŋ mázawakȟáŋ kiŋ lená yuhápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5620> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It’s like that that they had guns."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5620;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ sú kiŋ okšú na, tuktél hinážiŋ kiŋ aíyopteya apáha na, héčhel utȟá yuŋkȟáŋ, ho tȟóka waŋ hé lazátakiya hiŋȟpáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5621> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he loaded in bullets, and he aimed where he stopped, and he shot like that, and so then the man from the other tribe fell back."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5621;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho kat’íyeya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5622> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well he shot him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5622;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha lé ináŋpȟapi na, waŋyáŋkapi yuŋkȟáŋ, waŋyáŋkapi na, uŋmá hená áta owíčhakiyakapi čha, ahíhuŋni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5623> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they came out, and they saw him, and so they saw him, and they told the others, so they came here."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5623;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋží héčhel lé Psáloka héčha čha oyáka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5624> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said that he was a Crow."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5624;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Oígluze tȟáwa ečhíyataŋhaŋ, héčhel Psáloka héčhel tȟawókȟoyake hécha čha kȟoyáka kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5625> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Judging from what he wore, it was Crow regalia that he wore."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5625;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ táku waŋ él héčhel ikázopi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5626> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there were marks like that on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5626;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tób héčhel ikázopi na, ičízaptaŋ kiŋ hé glakíŋyaŋ ikázo kte éyaš, hé ikázo šni yuŋkȟáŋ, hé é čha hé haŋhépi kiŋháŋ šúŋkawakȟáŋ waŋží ičú kiŋháŋ, ho hé glakíŋyaŋ iglázo kta čha, héčhuŋ éyaš, manúŋ šni háŋni, héčhel kat’íyeyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5627> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so there were four marks, and he would mark the fifth one across it, but he didn’t mark it, and so it was him that would steal the horse tonight, and make his own mark, so he did that, but before he stole it, they shot him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5627;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel Lakȟóta hená átaya, wičháša, ho hená ahí na, héčhel wókȟoyake tȟáwa hená waŋžígži khípi na, héčhel hená ičúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5628> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So in that way all the Lakota people, the men, they came, and they took his regalia, and they took it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5628;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená yuhápi kta čha ičúpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5629> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They would have them so they took them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5629;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé íŋš-eyá akhé tȟóka, Psáloka kiŋ, aŋpétu leháŋl wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ hé šikíglapi načhéče."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5630> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So again that man from another band, the Crow, they resent that act to this day."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5630;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho héčhel hé kiksúyapi škhé."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5631> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They remember it like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5631;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Heháŋyaŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5632> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5632;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Leháŋl wičhóoyake waŋží oblákiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5646> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Today I will tell a story."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5646;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ eháŋni oyáte kiŋháŋ taŋyáŋ úŋpi uŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5647> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so in the old days the people lived good."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5647;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuwá tȟawíčutȟuŋ na, thiwáhe yaŋká čháŋšna, líla héčhel thekíčhiȟilapi na, taŋyáŋ úŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, wičháša kiŋ lé tȟawíču kiŋ uŋgnáhelaka tókȟaȟ’aŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5648> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Whenever a man married a woman, and had a family, they loved each other like that, and they lived well, and so once a man’s wife disappeared."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5648;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héčhel ikígni naháŋ éyaš iyékiye šni kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5649> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he looked for her like that but he didn’t find her."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5649;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ikígni na olé éyaš iyékiye šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5650> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He looked for her and he looked for her but he didn’t find her"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5650;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná nat’úŋgya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5651> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so then he was hesitating."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5651;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tókhiya iyáye kiŋháŋ, hé tóhaŋni héčhuŋ šni yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhuŋ čhaŋké, iyókiphi šni na, héčhel akhé olé kta iyúkčaŋ na, mázawakȟáŋ waŋ ikíkču kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5652;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5652> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "She had never done something like going somewhere, and so she did that, and so he wasn’t happy, and I thought he would look for her again like that, and he took a gun of his."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5652;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena yá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5653;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5653> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was going around."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5653;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yá yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel maníŋl šuŋk’ákaŋyaŋka núm yápi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5654;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5654> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He was going along and so they were riding in the wild like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5654;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tȟawíču kiŋ hé uŋmá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5655;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5655> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so one of them was his wife."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5655;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na uŋmá héčhel wičháša kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5656;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5656> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And the other was a man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5656;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ héčhel líla čhaŋzéka uŋ héčhel wičháša kiŋ lé kat’íyeya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5657;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5657> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so being really angry he shot the man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5657;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋl tȟawíču kiŋ kat’íyeya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5658;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5658> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then he shot his wife."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5658;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5659> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé čhaŋzéka uŋ ho hé hél táku tȟawíču ečhúŋ kiŋ hé waŋglákiŋ na, iyókiphi šni kiŋ uŋ, wičhóȟ’aŋ kiŋ léčhuŋ kéye.he saw what his wife had done, and being unhappy about it, he did this deed."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5659;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5659> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then being angry"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5659;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5660> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋyela hé oyákapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5660;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5660> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "That’s all they tell."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5660;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé wičhóoyake kiŋ wakȟáŋyeža kiŋ lé ówehaŋhaŋ wóyakapi héčha čha, lé hokšíla tȟokápȟa kiŋ é čha oyákiŋ na, wíŋyaŋ waŋ é na wičháša waŋ kičhíča kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5699;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5699> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "This kid who was my oldest son tells this funny story, and so a woman was with a man."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5699;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5700> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha yuŋkȟáŋ waŋná wóglaka-haŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ yaŋkáhelaka, “wamákȟaŋ yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5700;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5700> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were talking and so all of the sudden he says, “I’m holy.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5700;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5701> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wamákȟaŋ čha wakíŋyaŋ owákihi yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5701;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5701> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “I’m holy so I can fly.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5701;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5702> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Wakíyaŋ owákihi yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5702;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5702> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“I can fly,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5702;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5703> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha, “waŋmáyaŋka yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5703;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5703> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he said, “watch me.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5703;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké lé mayá kaksáksapi čha, kičhí héčhiya í na, átaya waŋná kiŋyáŋ iyáyiŋ kta čha, iyópsiča yuŋkȟáŋ, kiŋyáŋ okíhi šni čha, áta hukhúta oníya katȟáŋkal hiyúya gliȟpáya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5704> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he arrived there with her at a jagged cliff, and he was going to fly away, so he jumped off it, and so he couldn’t fly, so he lost his breath way falling way down there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5704;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké tȟawíču kiŋ ektá étuŋwiŋ naháŋke, “toníktuka he?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5705> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so his wife looked at him and she said, “how are you?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5705;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Toníkȟa šni he?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “iníla yaŋká yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5706> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Are you okay?” and so he said, “be quiet.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5706;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Léčhiya wakȟáŋyaŋ muŋké,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5707> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“I’m lying here in a sacred way.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5707;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lé otȟúŋwahe tȟáŋka čha héčhiya ektá Lakȟóta kȟoškálaka núŋm úŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5723> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "There was a big city so two young Lakota men lived there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5723;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ tákuni lé Lakȟól wičhóȟ’aŋ hená slolyápi šni čhaŋké uŋmá áta makhú yazáŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5724> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they didn’t know any Lakota traditions and so one of them had bad chest pain."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5724;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Makhú yazáŋ na, thezí kȟó yazáŋ čhaŋké, otȟúŋwahe étkiya yá-haŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5725> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He had bad chest pain, and he also had stomach pain, and so they were going to the city."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5725;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ heyá kéye, “tókheškhe líla omáphi-šni k’uŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5726> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “how am I so sick?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5726;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Líla thezí mayázaŋ na makhú kȟó mayázaŋ,” čha yuŋkȟáŋ, “waŋ lél Lakȟóta wičháȟčala waŋ thí čha él úŋyiŋ kte na, uŋkíyuŋǧiŋ kte ho na, takún iyóničihi yuhá séče,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5727> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “I have bad stomach pain and also chest pain,” and so the other said, “well, you and I will go here to where an older Lakota man lives, and we will ask him about it, and maybe he has something helpful.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5727;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké aíyakapteya yá-haŋpi naháŋke waŋná lé wičháȟčala waŋ hél thí čha ektá ípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5728> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were going uphill and they arrived at the old man’s house."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5728;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čhaŋké, “háu, tókȟa huŋwó?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5729> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “hello, what’s the matter?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5729;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókheškhe tákehapi na yaúpi huŋwó,” eyá čhaŋké, “hiyá, lé thezí yazáŋ na makhú kȟó yazáŋ,” kéya čha, “uŋgná takún iyókihi čha yak’ú oyákihi séče ló,” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, heyá kéye, “waŋ khéya čhaŋté čha yáte háŋtaŋhaŋš, ečhél iníyayiŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5730> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“What did you say and you came?” he said and so he responded, “no, this one’s got stomach pains and chest pains,” so he said, “maybe there is something to help so maybe you can give it to him,” and so he said, “well, if you eat a turtle’s heart, you will get better.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5730;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké, “tuktél hé čha waŋžígži uŋkóyuspapi kta he?“ eyá yuŋkȟáŋ heyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5731> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “where would we get some?” and so he said that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5731;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho héhaŋ waŋží olúspapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho yaktépi naháŋ, yapȟátapi na, čhaŋté kiŋ hé iȟ’áŋ šni héčhena yátiŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5732> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“He said, “if you catch one, you will kill it, and butcher it, and eat the still uncooked heart.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5732;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Nayápčiŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5733> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “you’ll swallow it.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5733;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ki ečhél iníyayiŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5734> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“You’ll get better,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5734;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čhaŋké, waŋná glináŋpȟapi na, čhaŋkú ogná máni glá-haŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ, léčhel čhaŋkú kiŋ glakíŋyaŋ khéya waŋ hiyáya čhaŋké, heyá kéye, “ho lé waŋží hiyáya čha, uŋkóyuspiŋ kte,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5735> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said it, and so then they came back out, and they were going back walking on the road, and so a turtle was crossing the road, and so he said, “this one is going passing by so we need to catch it,”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5735;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké oyúspapi naháŋke akhípi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5736> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they caught it and then they got back with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5736;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhípi naháŋke čha, “waŋ lé tókheškhe uŋktépi kte kiŋháŋ, uŋkókiyakapi éyaščhiŋ čhéǧa tȟáŋka uŋníčapi čha, tukténi tȟaŋkál čheúŋthipi uŋkókihipi šni čha, tókheškhe ečhúŋk’uŋpi kta he?” yuŋkȟáŋ uŋmá kiŋ é čha, “waŋ, microwave waŋ uŋyúhapi čha, héčhi mahél iyéyaye kiŋ oȟ’áŋkȟoya t’á iyáyiŋ kte,” eyá čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5737> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They got back with it, and so he said, “well, if we kill this somehow, he told us that, but of course we don’t have a big bucket, so we can’t make a big fire somewhere, so how will we do it?” and so it was the other that said, “well, we have a microwave, so it will die quickly with you having put it in there.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5737;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá čhaŋké, “oháŋ, čha héčhuŋk’uŋpi kte,” naháŋke lé khéyala k’uŋ héčhena ní k’éyaš, héčhena lé microwave kiŋ héčhiya pathímahel iyéyapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5738> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said it and so, “okay, so let’s do that,” and then this turtle was still alive, but they still shoved it into the microwave."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5738;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na thiyópa ečhél iyéyapi čhaŋké, áta mahél nak’éȟk’eǧe éyaš, thiyúŋmata íyutakapi na, TV waŋyáŋg yaŋká-haŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5739> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they closed the door, and so it really scratched with its feet inside, but they sat down in another room, and they sat watching TV."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5739;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ léčhel tuwá katóto čha, thiyópa yuǧáŋpi éyaš, tuwéni šni čhaŋké, “tuwá lé hí séče éyaš,” eyápi na, yaŋká-haŋpi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5740> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so someone knocked like that, so they opened the door, but there wasn’t anybody there, and so they said, “maybe somebody came then,” and they were sitting down."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5740;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Akhé thilázata thiyópa ektá tuwá katóto čha, ektá éwaŋyaŋkapi éyaš, tuwéni šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5741> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Again someone knocked at the back door, so they looked over there, but there wasn’t anybody there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5741;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké olól’iȟ’aŋ thimá anáǧoptaŋ nážiŋpi yuŋkȟáŋ akhé katóto kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5742> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they were standing listening in the kitchen and so someone knocked again."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5742;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čhaŋké katóto kiŋ é čha owé otȟápȟapi yuŋkȟáŋ, lé microwave etáŋ čha ú čhaŋké, “waŋ, lé khéya waŋ lél mahél iyéuŋyaŋpi k’uŋ hé é čha nak’éȟk’eǧe séča waŋ,” eyápi yuŋkȟáŋ, thiyópa kiŋ yuǧáŋ ičúpi yuŋkȟáŋ, ečhél lé khéyala k’uŋ hé é čha khéya há kiŋ é čha alókiksohiŋ na, hukáičhičawiŋȟ lé thiyópa kiŋ él apútȟag ahíyokas’iŋ hinážiŋ na, “mitákuye oyás’iŋ,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5743> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was the knocking sound that they followed, and so it was from the microwave that it came, and so they said, “well, it’s that turtle that we put inside that might be scratching,” and so they opened the door, and so they pulled the door open, and so it was that turtle that was carrying its turtle shell, and it crossed its legs, and was standing there leaning on the door and peering out, and it said, “all my relatives.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5743;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókheškhe eháŋni ȟčiŋ luǧáŋpi šni, líla okȟáta škȟá,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5744> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“You two didn’t open up for a long time, it was really hot in there,” it said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5744;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Mitákuye oyás’iŋ.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5745> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“All my relatives.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5745;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lé íŋš wičhóoyake kiŋháŋ, wičháša waŋ akíčhita ópȟa kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5777> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this story, a man joined the military."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5777;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ waníyetu yámni akíčhita kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5778> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And he was a soldier for three years."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5778;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na waŋná wikčémna šákpe sáŋm záptaŋ hinážiŋ kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5779;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5779> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he was sixty-five years old then."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5779;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ wóokiye ič’íla kta čha, waŋná yíŋ kta héčhel iglúwiŋyeya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5780> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he was confident in having a pension, so then he was ready to go there for that reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5780;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ hé iyáksapapi kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5781> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they instructed him on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5781;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho lé yaí kiŋháŋ, tȟokáheya wičhóiye waŋží iníyuŋǧapi kta čha, ‘ho hé waníyetu tóna akíčhita oyápȟa he?’ eyápi kiŋháŋ, ‘three,’ eyá yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5782> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “when you arrive, they will ask you a phrase first off so when they say, ‘how many years were you in the army?’ say, ‘three.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5782;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "‘Hé waníyetu yámni yeló,’ eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5783> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, ‘for three years.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5783;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho na heháŋl íyokhihe kiŋ hé íŋš, ‘waníyetu tonánikheča huŋwó?’ eyápi kta čha ho hé ‘sixty-five,’ eyá yo."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5784> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then they will say the following, ‘how old are you?’ so say, ‘sixty-five.’"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5784;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "‘Waŋná waníyetu henámakeča,’ eyá kéye.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5785> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, ‘I’m that age.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5785;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tó” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5786> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Alright” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5786;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tókša hé epȟíŋ kte ló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5787> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“I will surely say that,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5787;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waŋná yíŋ na, ektá í yuŋkȟáŋ, wašíču waŋ hé waŋná wóiyuŋǧe waŋ k’ú kiŋ hé tȟokáheya tuwá hé waŋná akíčhita ópȟa kiŋ hé waníyetu tónakeča ópȟa kiŋ hé iyúŋǧiŋ kte s’eléčheča yuŋkȟáŋ, tȟokáheya héčhel, “waníyetu tonánikeča huŋwó?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5788> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Then he was going, and he got there, and so it was like there would be a white man that asked him how long it was that he was in the army that being the first question that he gave."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5788;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ, “waŋná waníyetu yámni henámakeča yeló,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5789> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so he said, “I’m three years old.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5789;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Three,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5790> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Three,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5790;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl, “waníyetu tóna akíčhita oyápȟa huŋwó?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “sixty-five” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5791> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then he said, “how many years did you serve for?” and so he said, “sixty-five.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5791;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé uŋmáčhetkiya eyá iyúŋǧa čha, “sixty-five” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, lílaȟčiŋ ayúta naháŋke, hé eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5792;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5792> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So he asked him the other way around, so he said, “sixty-five,” and so he stared deep at him, saying that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5792;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5793> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wašíču kiŋ, “who’s crazy, you or me?” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5793;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5793> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The white man said, “who’s crazy, you or me?”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5793;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5794> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Tuwá witkótkoka huŋwó, niyé naíŋš tókȟa miyé he?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “both” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5794;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5794> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Who’s crazy, you or me?” he said, and so he said, “both.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5794;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5795> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Ho hé nakúŋ wóiyuŋǧe waŋ eyé kiŋ hé, ‘tukté uŋmá yačhíŋ huŋwó, hayápi naíŋš mázaska?’ ehátaŋhaŋš, ‘both’ eyá yo,” héya kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5795;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5795> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He said, “if he says the question, ‘which do you want, clothes or money?’ say, ‘both.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5795;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho tókhiŋš héyiŋ kte s’eléčheča yuŋkȟáŋ, ipáyeȟ wíyuŋǧa čha, “who’s crazy, you or me?” eyá yuŋkȟáŋ, “both,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5796;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5796> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Well then it seemed like he said that, and so he asked wrongly, “who’s crazy, you or me?” and he said, “both.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5796;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5820> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho eháŋni oyáte kiŋháŋ lílaȟčiŋ héčhel wašíčuiyápi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5820;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5820> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the old-time people didn’t know English in the slightest."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5820;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ átayela wašíčuiya okíhipi šni čha, wičháša itȟáŋčhaŋ waŋ wašíču waŋ kičhí wóglakiŋ kta čha, lé haŋkéke slolyá čha iyékičiska čhíŋ naháŋke, “ho hiyú wo, iyémiyečiska yo, wašíču kiŋ lé kičhí wówaglakiŋ kta čha,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5821;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5821> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so they really couldn’t speak English, so a Chief would talk with a white man, so he knew parts of it, so he wanted him to translate for him, and so he said, “come here, translate for me, I’d like to talk with this white man.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5821;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho hé šúŋkwakȟáŋ waŋ gnúni čha, hé é čha uŋ wíyuŋǧa čhíŋ naháŋke, heyá kéye, “ho omíčiyaka yo, tȟakóža, ‘owákpamni kiŋ lé tȟoká íyutaka héhaŋ, šúŋkawakȟáŋ waŋ híŋša čha wagnúni yelo,’”  eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5822;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5822> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "He lost his horse, so it was that that he wanted to ask about, and so he said, “talk for me, grandson, he said, ‘back where the first agency was located, I lost my red horse.’”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5822;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Hé omíčiyaka yo,” eyá kéye."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5823;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "“Say that for me,” he said."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5823;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ iyéska kiŋ heyá kéye, “when the first agency sit down he lost a red holy dog.”"@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5824> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so the translator said, “when the first agency sit down he lost a red holy dog.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5824;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé wašíčuiya iyékičiska kiŋ hé iŋšé hé wóiȟaka héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5825> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was funny that he translated it into English like that for him."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5825;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Eyá ognáye ȟčiŋ yuíyeska kiŋ hé é čha lé obláke wóiȟaka héčha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5826> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was funny him translating it as accurately as possible."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5826;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tuktógna ipáyeȟ eyíŋ kte s’eléčheča yuŋkȟáŋ, héčhuŋ-s’e iwáyuphiya okíčiyaka čha lé obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was like he said it wrong somehow, and so I said it as he said it for him just like that as precisely as possible."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5827;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5840> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho lé tȟahá kpaŋyáŋpi kiŋ lé é čha leháŋn lečhála wičhóičhaǧe kiŋ lená tȟahá kiŋ hé yuzíl okátaŋpi na, átaya lé iyéčhiŋkyaŋke wígli sápa kap’óžela héčha čha ičúpi na, átaya uŋ slayápi naháŋ, kaȟlóg iyáye šni háŋtaŋhaŋš, akhé iyúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5840;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5840> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nowadays they pin down the hide stretched out with them tanning hides, and they take what’s like black light weight motor oil, and they grease it with it, and if it doesn’t penetrate, then they apply it again"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5840;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5841> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na ho hé kaȟlóg iyáya háŋtaŋhaŋš, lé haíyužaža héčha čha, ektá haípažaža oíȟpeyapi na, ičáhi yužážapi na, yuškíčapi naháŋ, ho hená heháŋn yuȟúŋtapi čháŋšna, líla yuphíya šna yuȟúŋtapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5841;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5841> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And if it penetrates, then it’s like a washing machine that they throw it in with soap, and they wash it mixed up, and they wring it out, and so whenever they soften it by rubbing it, they soften it really well."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5841;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5842> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha íŋš hé lečhála wóečhuŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5842;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5842> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So that is the modern way of doing it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5842;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5843> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na hená lé pȟežíkakse kiŋ lená héčhašniyaŋ, hená lé haíyotke kiŋ léčha čha yugmúŋpi na, mázaȟota héčha čha yugmúŋpi na, okáȟtagya lé otkéyapi čháŋšna, héčhel ečhúŋ hená yuȟúŋtapi čháŋšna, pȟaŋpȟáŋyela hináŋpȟe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5843;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5843> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And this being done with a sickle, they twist it with a clothesline, and they twist it with aluminum, and whenever they hang it loosely, whenever they soften it by rubbing it like that, it comes out soft and tender."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5843;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5844> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na eháŋni hená táku kiŋ waníča čha tuwéni hená héčhuŋ-he šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5844;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5844> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And way back there weren’t those things so nobody did that"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5844;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš leháŋn hená táku kiŋ iyúhaȟčiŋ yukȟé čha."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5845> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But nowadays there are all those things."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5845;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé leháŋn táku ečhúpi kiŋ oȟ’áŋkȟokȟoya waéčhuŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5846> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They do those things really quickly nowadays."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5846;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iŋšé lená lečhála Lakȟóta kiŋháŋ aǧúyapiblu naháŋ wínakapo na wígli kiŋ lená wičhák’upi k’uŋ héhaŋ, lená aǧúyapi kiŋ kaȟ wáyuphikapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5858> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "When they gave Lakota people just flour and baking powder and grease, then they were really good at making bread."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5858;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha héhaŋ iŋšé wašíču eyá wašíču hiŋšmá ewíčhakiyapi čha hená aǧúyapi káǧapi čha, hená uŋspéwičhakhiyapi čha hé uŋ, hená héčhel káǧapi éyaš, isáŋm iyé iyáyapi naháŋ, wígli uŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5859> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So way back some white men were called “hairy white men” so they made bread, so they taught them about it, so that’s why they make it like, that but they went one step further, and they make frybread."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5859;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé tȟokéya aǧúyapi káǧapi kiŋ hé wašíču hiŋšmá kiŋ lená aǧúyapi paskápi na, maswíčheuŋpe šóka čha ektá mahél iyéyapi na, íyakaȟpe tȟúŋpi na, ačhéthipi háŋtaŋhaŋš, lé aǧúyapi kiŋ napóǧe."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5860> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So the hairy white people kneaded the bread that they made first of all, and they put it in what was a thick frying pan, and they applied the lid, and if they make a fire on it, the bread rises."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5860;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na itȟánuŋg ǧiyéla špáŋ čháŋšna, yuksáksa ičú yútapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5861> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And whenever it is cooked brown on both sides, they eat it by taking it and breaking it off with the hands."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5861;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho éyaš lé Lakȟóta kiŋ iyáyapi na lé wígli uŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5862> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people went and made frybread."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5862;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Aǧúyapiblu tókhi napéyožula šákpe akhígle oyágnakiŋ kte naháŋ, akhé wínakapo kiŋháŋ tókhi napéyožulašniyaŋ iyókhiseyela iyáču na, él oyákala kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5863> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You will put about six handfulls of flour in it, and again you take about less than a handful, and you throw it on it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5863;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naháŋ asáŋpi blú kiŋ hé napéyožula naháŋ napépȟiŋkpa mniskúya oyákala kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5864> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And throw on it a handfull of powdered milk and a pinch of salt."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5864;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho naháŋ čhaŋháŋpi kiŋ líla čónala íŋš ičáhiyayiŋ kte, napépȟiŋkpa núŋm wahénakeča oyákala kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5865> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And then you will mix in a very little bit of sugar, you’ll throw on it about two pinches of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5865;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhena áta iíčahiyayiŋ kte naháŋ mní sníšniyakel."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5866> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "You’ll still keep mixing it and with lukewarm water."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5866;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Mní kiŋ kitáŋla akȟálya-ke s’e, líla kȟáte šni éyaš, mní etáŋ iwáštela kȟalyáyiŋ kte na, él oyákaštaŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5867> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "The water being lightly heated up, it isn’t very hot, but you will heat some water up easily, and you’ll put it on top of it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5867;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Héčhanuŋ na, ičáhiyayiŋ na, toháŋn lé aǧúyapiblu kiŋ sáŋm šóka áye hátaŋhaŋš, yapát’iŋziŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5868> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Do that, and mix it up, and if the flour gets thicker, then knead it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5868;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Napé uŋ yapát’iŋziŋ na, ho luksíŋ na, aǧúyapi ipáblaye uŋ yapáblayiŋ naháŋ, míla uŋ wayáksaksa na, lé wígli kiŋ lé kȟal’ílutȟiŋ na, kȟáte háŋtaŋhaŋš, ektá oíȟpeyayiŋ naháŋ, uŋmáčhiyataŋ waŋná ǧí háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho luptáŋyiŋ naháŋ, ǧí áye háŋtaŋhaŋš, itȟánuŋgya ákhilehaŋyaŋ yuphíya napóǧiŋ na, špáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5869> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Knead it with the hands, and then cut it, and you flatten it with a rolling pin, and cut it up with a knife, and you check the oil’s temperature, and if it is hot, then you throw it on there, and if both sides are brown, then you flip it over, and if it gets brown, then it rises exactly the same on both sides and it is cooked."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5869;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená héčhuŋ-s’e aǧúyapi, wígli uŋ káǧapi, káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5870> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they make bread, frybread, just like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5870;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Naíŋš nakúŋ waŋží tȟaŋkál čhethípi héčhel yakáǧiŋ kte."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5871> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Or they’ll also make it outside on the fire."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5871;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Nakúŋ waŋží čha hé aǧúyapi čhok’íŋ káǧapi eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5872> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Also there is one that they call “baked bread.”"@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5872;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé íŋš-eyá aǧúyapi kiŋ yapáska naháŋ, lé maswíčheuŋpe héčheča ektá iwáštegla wígli iyákatȟaŋtȟaŋ na, oyágnakiŋ na, yapáblaye hátaŋhaŋš – napé uŋ yapáblaye háŋtaŋhaŋš – na íyakaȟpe yatȟúŋ kiŋ hé napóǧiŋ naháŋ, uŋmáčhiyataŋhaŋ ǧí kiŋ ho akhé luptáyiŋ na, íyakaȟpe yatȟúŋ yaglé na, iwáštegla wígli él oyágnakiŋ kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, yuphíya itȟánuŋgya ǧiyéla špáŋ."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5873> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So you also knead the dough, and it’s a skillet that you gently rub all over with grease, and you put it there, and if you kneaded it – if you kneaded it with your hands – and if it rises with a lid on, and you flip it over with it being brown on both sides, and you put the lid on it, and you’re about to gently put oil on it, then it cooks until being brown on both sides."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5873;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená čhok’íŋ aǧúyapi eyá čhažéyatapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5874> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they call that baked bread."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5874;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená Lakȟóta kiŋ káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5875> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lakota people make that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5875;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Kštó."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5876> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yup."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5876;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Yuŋkȟáŋ lé čháŋ wazíȟaŋte tȟáŋka héčheča hená eyášna kaksápi na, toháŋn Waníkiya Tȟúŋpi Aŋpétu čháŋšna, hená owáčhekiye él églepi na, wóšpipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5882> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And so it was like a big evergreen tree that they often cut down, and whenever it was Christmas, they set it up in a church, and they take presents."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5882;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha lé owáčhekiye kiŋ lé Lakȟóta owáčhekiye čha, oyáte kiŋ hél wačhékiye yápi na, tuwé k’éyaš hél yápi naháŋ, wačhékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5883> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So this church was a Lakota people’s church, so the people went to pray there, and anyone went there, and they prayed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5883;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Táku oyáte k’éyaš."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5884> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Any kind of people."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5884;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hená hípi na, toháŋn čháŋ kiŋ lé waŋná kaksápi kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, ȟé ektá yápi naháŋ, čhaŋlí wapȟáȟta na čhaŋlí héčhiya églepi čháŋšna, hé čháŋ kiŋ hé kaȟníǧapi na, ohómni čhaŋlí hená égnakapi na, wačhékiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5885> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they arrived there, and if they were about to cut down the tree, then they went to the mountains, and whenever they laid tobacco bundles and tobacco there, they chose that tree, and they laid tobacco around it, and they prayed."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5885;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Na čhaŋnúŋpa yuhá wačhékiyapi naháŋ, hokšíla waŋží naíŋš wičhíŋčala waŋží kičhí iyáyapi na, kahúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5886> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "And they prayed with the pipe, and they went knicking it with a boy or a girl."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5886;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená wakȟáŋ wičhálapi čha, hená iyáyapi naháŋ, čháŋ kiŋ hé kahúŋpi háŋtaŋhaŋš, ho hé íyohakab čháŋ kiŋ lé kaúŋkapi na, makȟá ektá iyápȟašniyaŋ iwáŋkab yúzapi na, akhíyuha aglíyačupi čha, hél íyohakab lé húte kiŋ hé é čha ohómni čhaŋlí wapȟáȟta iyápemni égnakapi na, wačhékiyapi na, ačháŋnuŋpapi na, ho hé čháŋ kiŋ hé thiyáta aglípi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5887> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They consider them sacred, so they went with them, and if they knick the tree, then they fell the tree afterwards, and they take it along making sure it doesn’t touch the earth, and they go back carrying it together, so afterwards it is around the base that they lay down ties of tobacco, and they pray, and they smoke over it, and then they come back to the building with it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5887;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owáčhekiye ektá glípi na, pawóslal iyéyapi háŋtaŋhaŋš, hél táku ǧéǧeǧeya otkéyapi čha, hená uŋ aȟ’áyetȟuŋpi čha hená é čha oyáte kiŋ hená iyóhila, wičháša waŋží hiyúpi naíŋš, wíŋyaŋ na wakȟáŋyeža hená waŋžígži glohípi na, hená wačhékiyapi na, čháŋ kiŋ hél iyákaškapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5888> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They arrive back at the church, and if they put it up, they put things up dangling so those things are decorations, so it is those things that all the people, one man comes, or a woman or a child bringing them, and they pray, and they tie them to it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5888;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čháŋšna hé ómakȟa kiŋ hé áta yíŋ na ečhél, Ómakȟa Tȟéča héčhi isáŋm yá héhaŋ, čháŋ kiŋ hetáŋ čha hená waȟ’áyetȟuŋpi kiŋ hená ikíkčupi na, tuwá tókhel waštélake héči, yušpúpi naháŋ, ho akhé tȟokáta ómakȟa héčhiya akhé hená ikȟóyagyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5889> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So whenever the season goes, until it is past New Year’s day, and then it is from the tree that they take the decorations, and if somebody likes them somehow, they take them, and they will attach them to it again the next year."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5889;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha hená iŋšé húŋȟ wóphila eyápi na, húŋȟ wólakȟota čhíŋpi naíŋš, húŋȟ hená khúžapi čha, akísnipi čhíŋpi naíŋš, táku ikákižapi čha, hená uŋ hená héčhel íŋš-eyá čháŋ kiŋ hél táku iyákaškapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5890> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So some people say thanks, and some people want peace, or some people are sick, so they want to get better, or they suffer from something, so they also put something on the tree for that reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5890;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha wašíču kiŋ lé Christmas eyápi kiŋ lé Lakȟóta kiŋ waníče éyaš, Waníkiya Tȟúŋpi Aŋpétu eyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5891> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So Lakota people don’t have what white people call Christmas, but they call it The Savior’s Birthday."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5891;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hél wíyuškiŋyaŋ lená wóphila eyápi naíŋš, eyá Lakȟóta kiŋ lé ptesáŋ waŋ tȟúŋpi čha wíyuškiŋpi kiŋ héčhuŋ-s’e."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5892> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they say thanks happily, or it’s just like Lakota people’s birth of White Buffalo Calf Woman."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5892;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená wičhóni kta naháŋ, wičhózani kta na, wówauŋšila kta uŋ wočhékiye káǧapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5893> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They pray that they will have a life, and they will have health, and they will be compassionate."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5893;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha hé é Waníkiya Tȟúŋpi Aŋpétu eyápi čha hé čháŋ kiŋ hé él églepi kiŋ hél tuwá wačhékiyiŋ na, táku oótkeyiŋ naíŋš, uŋgnáš tuwá takún k’úpi kte háŋtaŋhaŋš, hená čhaŋté iyágleya hená hé ečhúŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5894> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s that that they call The Savior’s Birthday, so someone prays with them laying that stuff at the tree, and they hand something on it, or maybe if they’re about to give someone something, they do that wholeheartedly."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5894;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha tuwéni hená otúyačhiŋ héčhuŋpi šni."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5895> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So nobody does that for just no reason."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5895;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha lená wakȟáŋyaŋ gluónihaŋpi íŋš-eyá hená wašíču kiŋ étkiya škáŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5896> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they also act towards white people treating them with reverential respect."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5896;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hená yuwákȟaŋ él héčhiya čháŋ kiŋ hé églepi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5897> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They set up the tree blessing it."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5897;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho čha čháŋ kiŋ hé toháŋn yuúŋkapi hátaŋhaŋš, áyapi naháŋ, iníyothi héčhi isákhib aípi čha, héčhi iníkaǧapi na, hé čháŋ kiŋ hé uŋ íŋyaŋ kiŋ hená aíleyapi naháŋ, iníkaǧapi na, wačhékiyapi na, wóphila eyápi naháŋ, ho hé heháŋyela iháŋke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5898> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So if they pull down the tree, they go taking it along, and they take it next to a sweadlodge, and they hold a purification ceremony, and they use the tree for the fire for the stones, and they have a purification ceremony, and they pray, and they give thanks, and that is all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5898;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho heháŋl wičhóoyake waŋží oblákiŋ kte kiŋ hé čhekpa ewíčhakiyapi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5935> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So then I will tell a story having to do with what they call twins."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5935;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Lená eháŋni wíŋyaŋ na eháŋni wičháša čha akhé héktakiya oyáte wičhóuŋ kiŋ él wičháhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5936> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "It was those old-time women and old-time men that came back to where the people lived."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5936;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Thiwáhe waŋ él čhekpá kiŋ igláȟniǧapi načhéče hél taŋyáŋ úŋpi kta čha na, taŋyáŋ wičhákhuwapi kta čha, él wičháhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5937> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "They would live maybe choosing themselves a family, so they treated them well, so they got there."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5937;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Hé uŋ etáŋhaŋ, wakȟáŋyežapi éyaš waŋžígži táku héčhel eháŋni wičhóiye naíŋš eháŋni wičhóȟ’aŋ lená slolyápi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5938> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "For that reason, they were kids but some of them knew old language or old traditions like that."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5938;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Čha aŋpétu waŋží iyápi na, takún héčhel eyápi naíŋš, ečhúŋpi čháŋna šna, héčheya eyá wičháyuhapi kiŋ lená iníhaŋpi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5939> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So they speak one day, and whenever they say those things, or they do them, they really surprised the people that had them."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5939;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Éyaš lená eháŋni oyáte čha, wičháša na wíŋyaŋ čha, thiwáhe kiŋ él wičháhipi."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5940> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "But they were old time people, so they were men and woman, so they came back to the family."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5940;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ho iŋšé hé é čha obláke."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5941> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "So it’s just that that I have to say."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5941;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tákuni él iháŋskeya epȟíŋ kte šni éyaš wahéhaŋyela."@lkt <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
<urn:561:lakota-corpus:ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687:p5942> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "I won’t talk on it for a long time but that is about all."@en <https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmuGhcKes74mQIETrURfoRPcBiZdW-D9/view#sha256=ad67a8ae67b63268b7c3e3635070b986eb0c4ea1d800a5edcac6a6793cda1687;paragraph=5942;profile=word-explicit-plain-break-italic> .
